window.__CH=window.__CH||{};window.__CH["fl17"]={"id": "fl17", "title": "Reflow 与轨迹直线化", "focus": "迭代 reflow：用上一轮 ODE 的耦合重新训练，证明每次 reflow 降低传输成本；分析收敛性与不动点（直线流）。", "claims": ["\\text{reflow: }(X_0,X_1)\\sim\\text{由上一轮 ODE 诱导的耦合}", "W_2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)\\ \\text{随 reflow 次数单调不增}", "\\text{不动点：}v(x,t)=x_1-x_0\\ \\text{（直线流）}"], "topics": ["Reflow 的动机", "耦合的重构", "传输成本的单调性", "收敛性", "不动点", "与 OT 的关系", "迭代次数", "数值稳定性", "反例：过度 reflow 导致模式丢失", "与蒸馏的对照", "与 Flow Maps 的接口", "与少步生成的接口", "代码：reflow 迭代", "代码：传输成本的测量", "与 Flow Maps 章的接口", "本章推导链：reflow 拉直轨迹"], "html": "<h3 id=\"fl17--h-Reflow-的动机\">Reflow 的动机<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-Reflow-的动机\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用第三部已固定的记号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1\\in\\mathcal{P}_2(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 为端点测度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{P}_2(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上具有有限二阶矩的 Borel 概率测度全体，配以二次 Wasserstein 距离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T&gt;0$</span> 固定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(v_t)_{t\\in[0,T]}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上速度场族，满足：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t:\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为 Borel 可测且局部 Lipschitz；对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto v_t(x)$</span> 连续；并存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{t\\in[0,T]}|v_t(x)|\\le C(1+|x|)$</span>。在这些条件下，ODE</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\phi_t(x)=v_t(\\phi_t(x)),\\qquad \\phi_0(x)=x$$</div>\n<p>对每个初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 存在唯一全局解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t(x)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\phi_t)_{t\\in[0,T]}$</span> 构成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上的流（flow），每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t$</span> 是同胚。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t:=(\\phi_t)_\\#\\mu_0$</span> 为推前测度，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 满足连续性方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t\\mu_t+\\nabla\\cdot(\\mu_t v_t)=0$</span>（在分布意义下）。</p>\n<p>本节的核心对象是<strong>由上一轮 ODE 诱导的耦合</strong>。给定上述流与端点测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_T=\\mu_1$</span>，则称该 ODE 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 传输到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span>。一般地我们只要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_T$</span> 逼近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span>；本节的动机部分假定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_T=\\mu_1$</span> 精确成立，以便定义耦合，逼近情形留待“传输成本的单调性”节处理。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 1（流诱导耦合）</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\phi_t)$</span> 为上述 ODE 的流且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_T=\\mu_1$</span>。定义随机变量对</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(X_0,X_1):=\\big(x,\\ \\phi_T(x)\\big),\\qquad x\\sim\\mu_0 .$$</div>\n<p>其联合律记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_{v}\\in\\mathcal{P}_2(\\mathbb{R}^d\\times\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，称为流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\phi_t)$</span> 诱导的耦合。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_v$</span> 的两个边缘分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_v$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 的一个传输方案。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 2（传输成本）</strong>：对任意耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma\\in\\mathcal{P}_2(\\mathbb{R}^d\\times\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，定义二次传输成本</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{C}(\\gamma):=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d\\times\\mathbb{R}^d}|x_1-x_0|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\gamma(x_0,x_1).$$</div>\n<p>相应地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)=\\inf_{\\gamma\\in\\Pi(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)}\\mathcal{C}(\\gamma)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span> 为边缘固定的耦合全体。显然 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}(\\gamma_v)\\ge W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span>，等号当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_v$</span> 为最优耦合。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A（本节全局假设）</strong>：\n(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1\\in\\mathcal{P}_2(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 关于 Lebesgue 测度绝对连续（记密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_0$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 任意。\n(A2) 速度场族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(v_t)$</span> 满足上述可测性、局部 Lipschitz 与线性增长条件，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_T=\\mu_1$</span>。\n(A3) 映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\mapsto\\phi_T(x)$</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mu_0;\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int|x|^2\\mathrm{d}\\mu_0&lt;\\infty$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int|\\phi_T(x)|^2\\mathrm{d}\\mu_0&lt;\\infty$</span> 同时成立；后者由 (A2) 的线性增长与 Gronwall 估计保证。</p>\n<p>在 (A1)–(A3) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_v$</span> 是良定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{P}_2$</span> 元素，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}(\\gamma_v)&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-动机一-ODE-轨迹的弯曲造成非最优传输\">动机一：ODE 轨迹的弯曲造成非最优传输<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-动机一-ODE-轨迹的弯曲造成非最优传输\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>流诱导耦合一般不是最优的。原因在于 ODE 轨迹 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t(x)$</span> 是弯曲的曲线，而二次传输成本只度量端点位移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|x_1-x_0|^2$</span>，不惩罚中途的绕行。一个极端的例子能说明问题。</p>\n<p><strong>例 1（绕行流）</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\delta_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=\\delta_1$</span>。考虑速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t(x)=2\\pi\\cos(2\\pi t)$</span>（与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 无关）。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t(0)=\\sin(2\\pi t)$</span>，特别地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_1(0)=\\sin(2\\pi)=0$</span>，不满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_T=\\mu_1$</span>。改用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t(x)=2\\pi\\cos(2\\pi t)+\\mathbb{1}_{t&gt;1/2}\\cdot 2$</span> 之类的分段场可以修正端点，但轨迹在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 内往返多次。端点位移仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，成本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}(\\gamma_v)=1=W_2^2(\\delta_0,\\delta_1)$</span>，此例中绕行不增加端点成本，因为端点固定。</p>\n<p>真正使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}(\\gamma_v)&gt;W_2^2$</span> 的是<strong>多对一的端点匹配</strong>：不同初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x,x'$</span> 的轨迹在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 汇聚到同一区域，导致端点映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_T$</span> 不是最优传输映射。例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\mathcal{N}(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=\\mathcal{N}(0,1)$</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_T(x)=-x$</span>（一个反射流），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_v$</span> 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 配到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-x$</span>，成本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int|x-(-x)|^2\\mathrm{d}\\mu_0=4\\int x^2\\mathrm{d}\\mu_0=4$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)=0$</span>（同一测度取恒等耦合）。这里 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_T$</span> 是保测度的非恒等映射，诱导耦合远非最优。</p>\n<p>上例揭示：<strong>流的质量守恒性质（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_T=\\mu_1$</span>）与耦合的最优性是两个独立的要求</strong>。一个能把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 正确传输到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 的 ODE，其诱导耦合可以任意地差。Reflow 的动机正是：既然耦合由流决定，我们就可以用当前流诱导的耦合作为下一轮训练的目标配对，迫使新一轮的流去拟合这些配对，从而在保持边缘不变的前提下改进耦合质量。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-动机二-直线化作为可操作的目标\">动机二：直线化作为可操作的目标<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-动机二-直线化作为可操作的目标\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_v$</span> 为当前流诱导的耦合。若我们训练一个新的速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t$</span>，使其诱导的耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_u$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}(\\gamma_u)&lt;\\mathcal{C}(\\gamma_v)$</span>，则传输成本下降。最理想的情形是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_u$</span> 为最优耦合，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}(\\gamma_u)=W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span>，且对应的流是<strong>直线流</strong>：轨迹为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto(1-t)x_0+t x_1$</span>，速度场为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t(x)=x_1-x_0$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=(1-t)x_0+tx_1$</span> 处取值）。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 3（直线流）</strong>：称速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 关于耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 为直线流，若对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span>-几乎处处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_1)$</span>，ODE 的解满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\phi_t(x_0)=(1-t)x_0+t x_1,\\qquad t\\in[0,T],\\quad T=1.$$</div>\n<p>等价地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t\\big((1-t)x_0+tx_1\\big)=x_1-x_0$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span>-a.e. 成立。</p>\n<p>直线流的诱导耦合恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 本身，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_1(x_0)=x_1$</span>。因此若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 最优，直线流的传输成本达到下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2$</span>。这给出 reflow 的几何图像：<strong>每一轮 reflow 试图把当前弯曲的轨迹替换为以当前耦合为端点的直线轨迹</strong>，从而在耦合层面逼近最优。</p>\n<p>这里必须区分两个层次的目标，否则会犯“把目标值相等当成梯度相等”的错误：\n- <strong>耦合层面</strong>：新一轮诱导耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_u$</span> 的成本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}(\\gamma_u)$</span> 不大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}(\\gamma_v)$</span>。这是可证伪的、可用样本估计的量。\n- <strong>速度场层面</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_v$</span> 支撑的轨迹上等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1-x_0$</span>。这是训练时的回归目标，它<strong>不</strong>蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_u=\\gamma_v$</span>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t$</span> 在支撑之外的取值会影响流的全局行为，进而改变诱导耦合。</p>\n<p>动机二的全部内容就是：把“降低 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}$</span>”转化为“回归直线速度”这一可执行的监督信号，而两者之间的定量联系（单调性）是后续节的主定理。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-动机三-为什么迭代而非一次到位\">动机三：为什么迭代而非一次到位<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-动机三-为什么迭代而非一次到位\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>一个自然的疑问是：既然最优耦合给出直线流，为何不直接解静态 OT 问题取最优耦合，再回归直线速度？答案是：静态 OT 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 较大时计算代价高（例如需要求解大规模线性规划或熵正则近似），而 reflow 只依赖<strong>采样</strong>：从当前 ODE 采样得到配对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,\\phi_T(x))$</span>，再对这些配对做回归。每次迭代的代价是一次 ODE 数值积分加一次回归，与维度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 的关系是多项式而非组合爆炸。</p>\n<p>更本质地，reflow 提供了一条<strong>从任意可行流出发、单调改进耦合质量</strong>的路径。它不要求初始流接近最优；初始流可以是任何满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_T=\\mu_1$</span> 的 ODE（例如由连续归一化流训练得到）。每次 reflow 是一个“用当前流生成配对、再拟合直线”的算子，其不动点恰为直线流。这条路径的存在性（迭代良定义）与收敛性（成本单调不增、极限为不动点）是本章的主线，而本节的动机只负责说明：<strong>该路径的每一步都有明确的几何意义，且目标泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}$</span> 是可测量的</strong>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-一个可检验的恒等式\">一个可检验的恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-一个可检验的恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>为使动机可操作，我们给出成本与速度场之间的一个恒等式，它在后续“传输成本的单调性”节会被反复使用。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1（成本—速度恒等式）</strong>：在假设 (A1)–(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_v$</span> 为流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\phi_t)$</span> 诱导的耦合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{C}(\\gamma_v)=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d\\times\\mathbb{R}^d}\\Big|\\int_0^1 v_t(\\phi_t(x_0))\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\Big|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\gamma_v(x_0,x_1).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 ODE 定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_1(x_0)-\\phi_0(x_0)=\\int_0^1 v_t(\\phi_t(x_0))\\,\\mathrm{d}t$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_0(x_0)=x_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_1(x_0)=x_1$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_v$</span>-a.e. 下成立（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_v$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim\\mu_0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1=\\phi_1(x_0)$</span> 生成）。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$|x_1-x_0|^2=\\Big|\\int_0^1 v_t(\\phi_t(x_0))\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\Big|^2 .$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_v$</span> 积分即得。被积函数关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_1)$</span> 可测（<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 可测、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t$</span> 连续），且由 (A2) 的线性增长与 (A3) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 可积性，积分有限，Fubini 与积分的交换合法。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该恒等式说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}(\\gamma_v)$</span> 完全由速度场沿轨迹的路径积分决定。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 沿每条轨迹的路径积分恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1-x_0$</span>（即轨迹是直线），则成本等于端点位移平方；若轨迹弯曲，路径积分仍等于端点位移（因为端点固定），但<strong>不同轨迹的端点位移分布</strong>决定了成本。这正是 reflow 要改变的：它改变的是端点配对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span>，而非单条轨迹的端点位移。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-动机的形式化陈述\">动机的形式化陈述<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-动机的形式化陈述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>将上述讨论压缩为一个待证命题的动机版本，作为后续节的入口。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 2（动机性陈述，完整证明见“传输成本的单调性”节）</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_v$</span> 为当前流诱导耦合，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 为以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_v$</span> 为配对目标、以直线速度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1-x_0$</span> 为回归目标的流（其存在性与构造见“耦合的重构”节）。则在假设 (A1)–(A3) 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 的适定性条件下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{C}(\\gamma_u)\\le\\mathcal{C}(\\gamma_v).$$</div>\n<p>等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_v$</span> 已是直线流的诱导耦合（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_v$</span> 的支撑落在直线轨迹上）。</p>\n<p>本节的动机到此为止：它把“为何要 reflow”归结为三个可分离的观察——(i) 流诱导耦合一般非最优，例 1 给出显式差距；(ii) 直线流是成本下界的达成者，故以直线速度为回归目标是合理的几何目标；(iii) 迭代只依赖采样，代价可控。命题 2 的严格证明、等号条件的刻画、以及“等号当且仅当”中“仅当”方向的证明，均属于后续节的内容，本节不越界展开。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>流诱导耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_v$</span> 由 ODE 端点映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_T$</span> 与初值测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 生成，其传输成本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}(\\gamma_v)$</span> 一般严格大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span>；反射流与绕行流给出显式差距，说明“正确传输边缘”与“耦合最优”是两个独立要求。</li>\n<li>直线流以耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 的端点为轨迹端点，其诱导耦合即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 本身；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 最优时直线流达到成本下界，因此“回归直线速度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1-x_0$</span>”是把耦合改进转化为可执行监督信号的几何桥梁。</li>\n<li>成本—速度恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}(\\gamma_v)=\\int|\\int_0^1 v_t(\\phi_t(x_0))\\mathrm{d}t|^2\\mathrm{d}\\gamma_v$</span> 把成本写成沿轨迹的路径积分，表明 reflow 改变的是端点配对而非单条轨迹的端点位移；迭代 reflow 的单调性、收敛性与不动点刻画留待后续节严格证明。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-动机四-耦合的支撑与直线化的可测性\">动机四：耦合的支撑与直线化的可测性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-动机四-耦合的支撑与直线化的可测性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1 把成本写成路径积分，但未说明 reflow 的回归目标在测度论上是否良定义。直线速度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1-x_0$</span> 是耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_v$</span> 上的函数，而速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t$</span> 需在整个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上有定义，不能只在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_v$</span> 的支撑上给定。这一节的动机必须交代：<strong>回归目标的可测性与延拓方式决定了 reflow 算子的良定义性</strong>，否则后续单调性证明无从谈起。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 4（直线速度场）</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma\\in\\mathcal{P}_2(\\mathbb{R}^d\\times\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 的直线速度场为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$u_t^{\\gamma}(x):=\\mathbb{E}_{\\gamma}\\big[x_1-x_0\\ \\big|\\ (1-t)x_0+tx_1=x\\big],\\qquad t\\in[0,1],$$</div>\n<p>其中条件期望在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 经映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_1)\\mapsto(1-t)x_0+tx_1$</span> 推前所得测度下取。若该推前测度在点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 处奇异（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 不在直线轨迹的像上），则约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t^\\gamma(x)=0$</span>。</p>\n<p>这个定义与“在支撑上取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1-x_0$</span>”的区别在于：后者只在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span>-a.e. 的轨迹上有值，而前者通过条件期望给出全空间定义，并且在每条直线轨迹上取常值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1-x_0$</span>。条件期望的存在性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma\\in\\mathcal{P}_2$</span> 与 Radon–Nikodym 定理保证；可测性由正则条件期望的 Borel 选择性保证。约定奇异点取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 是为了让 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t^\\gamma$</span> 在全空间 Borel 可测，代价是在轨迹像之外引入人为取值，但这些点对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 的演化无影响（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 的支撑落在轨迹像上）。</p>\n<p><strong>引理 1（直线速度场的适定性）</strong>：在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma\\in\\mathcal{P}_2(\\mathbb{R}^d\\times\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，直线速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(u_t^\\gamma)_{t\\in[0,1]}$</span> 满足：(i) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t^\\gamma$</span> 为 Borel 可测；(ii) 存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_\\gamma&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t|u_t^\\gamma(x)|\\le C_\\gamma(1+|x|)$</span>；(iii) 以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u^\\gamma$</span> 为速度场的 ODE 以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 为诱导耦合。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：(i) 条件期望关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(t,x)$</span> 联合可测是正则条件期望的标准性质；约定奇异点取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 不破坏可测性。(ii) 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma\\in\\mathcal{P}_2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_\\gamma|x_1-x_0|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_\\gamma|x_1-x_0|\\le(\\mathbb{E}_\\gamma|x_1-x_0|^2)^{1/2}&lt;\\infty$</span>；条件期望的绝对值不超过无条件期望的绝对值，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|u_t^\\gamma(x)|\\le\\mathbb{E}_\\gamma|x_1-x_0|$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立，再由约定延拓到全空间得线性增长界（常数取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_\\gamma|x_1-x_0|$</span> 即可，无需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1+|x|$</span> 因子，因为界是全局常数）。(iii) 沿直线轨迹 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-t)x_0+tx_1$</span>，速度场取值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1-x_0$</span>，故 ODE 的解恰为该直线，端点映射为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\mapsto x_1$</span>，诱导耦合为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>引理 1 的意义是：<strong>任意耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 都能生成一个以它为诱导耦合的直线流</strong>。这把 reflow 的第一步（“用当前流生成配对”）与第二步（“以配对为端点拟合直线流”）在测度论上闭合了。注意 (iii) 中“以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 为诱导耦合”是精确等式，不是近似；这是因为直线速度场在轨迹像上取常值，ODE 解严格是直线。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-动机五-从速度场到耦合的算子及其复合\">动机五：从速度场到耦合的算子及其复合<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-动机五-从速度场到耦合的算子及其复合\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>现在可以把 reflow 写成两个算子的复合，并说明为何迭代是自然的。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 5（流算子与直线化算子）</strong>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathfrak{F}$</span> 为“速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mapsto$</span> 诱导耦合”的算子：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathfrak{F}(v)=\\gamma_v$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathfrak{L}$</span> 为“耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mapsto$</span> 直线速度场”的算子：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathfrak{L}(\\gamma)=u^\\gamma$</span>。一次 reflow 迭代为复合</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{R}:=\\mathfrak{L}\\circ\\mathfrak{F},\\qquad v\\ \\mapsto\\ \\gamma_v\\ \\mapsto\\ u^{\\gamma_v}.$$</div>\n<p>第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮 reflow 的速度场记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}$</span>，约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(0)}$</span> 为初始流，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k+1)}=\\mathcal{R}(v^{(k)})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(k)}:=\\mathfrak{F}(v^{(k)})$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（复合的良定义性与成本的恒等表达）</strong>：在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对任意满足假设的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}(v)$</span> 良定义且满足假设；并且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{C}\\big(\\mathfrak{F}(\\mathcal{R}(v))\\big)=\\mathcal{C}\\big(\\mathfrak{L}(\\mathfrak{F}(v))\\big)=\\mathcal{C}(\\gamma_v).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：良定义性由引理 1 给出（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}(v)=u^{\\gamma_v}$</span> 满足可测、局部 Lipschitz、线性增长）。第二个等号是引理 1(iii)：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathfrak{F}(\\mathfrak{L}(\\gamma))=\\gamma$</span> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma\\in\\mathcal{P}_2$</span> 成立，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma=\\gamma_v$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 3 是一个<strong>恒等式而非不等式</strong>：一次 reflow 后，新流的诱导耦合的成本<strong>恰好等于</strong>旧流的诱导耦合的成本。这看似与“reflow 降低成本”矛盾，实则不然——命题 3 说的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}(\\gamma^{(k+1)})=\\mathcal{C}(\\gamma^{(k)})$</span> 在<strong>精确直线化</strong>下成立，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(k+1)}=\\gamma^{(k)}$</span>。成本下降发生在<strong>近似直线化</strong>（即回归目标只在一部分轨迹上精确、或训练不完美）时，或者发生在下一轮用新流重新采样得到<strong>新的</strong>耦合时。这一区分是后续“传输成本的单调性”节的核心，本节的动机只负责指出：<strong>精确 reflow 是不动点映射，成本的严格下降来自采样与回归的近似性</strong>。</p>\n<p>为看清这一点，考虑一个具体的两步例子。</p>\n<p><strong>例 2（一次精确 reflow 的不动点性）</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\delta_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=\\delta_1$</span>，初始流取例 1 的绕行流（端点正确）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(0)}=\\delta_{(0,1)}$</span>，成本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。直线化算子给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u^{\\gamma^{(0)}}_t(x)=1$</span>（在轨迹像 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 上），新流的诱导耦合仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{(0,1)}$</span>，成本仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。此例中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2(\\delta_0,\\delta_1)=1$</span>，初始流已最优，reflow 不改变成本。这说明命题 3 的恒等性与“成本已在下界”是相容的。</p>\n<p><strong>例 3（非最优耦合的一次精确 reflow）</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\mu_1=\\mathcal{N}(0,1)$</span>，初始流为反射流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_1(x)=-x$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(0)}$</span> 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 配到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-x$</span>，成本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$4$</span>。直线化给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u^{\\gamma^{(0)}}_t(x)=-2x$</span>（在轨迹像上，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1-x_0=-2x_0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=-x$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span>；沿轨迹 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=(1-2t)x_0$</span>，速度恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-2x_0$</span>）。新流的诱导耦合仍是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(0)}$</span>（引理 1(iii)），成本仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$4$</span>。<strong>精确 reflow 不降低成本</strong>，因为新流的诱导耦合与原耦合相同。成本下降只能来自：新一轮采样时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 的样本经新流传输后与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 的样本重新配对，产生<strong>不同于</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(0)}$</span> 的耦合。这正说明 reflow 的“降低”必须通过<strong>耦合的重构</strong>（下一节）来实现，而非通过精确直线化本身。</p>\n<p>例 3 是本节最重要的动机性观察：它把“为何 reflow 能降低成本”从“直线化”转移到了“重新配对”。精确直线化保持耦合不变，因此保持成本不变；只有当新流在<strong>训练分布之外</strong>的行为改变了端点映射，才会产生新耦合。这一点在后续“耦合的重构”节会被形式化为：reflow 的成本下降依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathfrak{F}(\\mathcal{R}(v))\\neq\\gamma_v$</span> 的可能性，而这一可能性由回归的有限精度与采样噪声提供。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-动机六-为何目标泛函选二次成本\">动机六：为何目标泛函选二次成本<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-动机六-为何目标泛函选二次成本\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后交代一个建模选择：为何用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}(\\gamma)=\\int|x_1-x_0|^2\\mathrm{d}\\gamma$</span> 而非其他泛函。理由有三，均可检验。</p>\n<p>其一，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}$</span> 的下确界恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{P}_2$</span> 上的度量，具有三角不等式与弱收敛的变分刻画。选 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}$</span> 使“成本单调不增”直接翻译为“<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 意义下的传输效率改进”，与本章 canonical claim 一致。</p>\n<p>其二，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}$</span> 对耦合是线性的，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}(\\gamma_v)$</span> 可由样本均值无偏估计：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 个样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0^{(i)},x_1^{(i)})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{n}\\sum_i|x_1^{(i)}-x_0^{(i)}|^2$</span> 依大数律收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}(\\gamma_v)$</span>（需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_v\\in\\mathcal{P}_2$</span>，已由 (A3) 保证）。这使“传输成本的测量”节有可运行的估计量。</p>\n<p>其三，二次成本与直线速度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1-x_0$</span> 的回归目标在代数上匹配：最小化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_\\gamma|x_1-x_0-u_t(x_t)|^2$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t$</span> 的解正是条件期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_\\gamma[x_1-x_0|x_t]$</span>，即定义 4 的直线速度场。若换用其他成本（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span>），回归目标变为条件中位数，直线流的代数结构被破坏。这一匹配是 reflow 用二次成本的内在原因，而非任意选择。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（回归目标的条件期望刻画）</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma\\in\\mathcal{P}_2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=(1-t)x_0+tx_1$</span>。则对任意 Borel 可测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w:\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_\\gamma|w(x_t)|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}_\\gamma\\big|x_1-x_0-w(x_t)\\big|^2=\\mathbb{E}_\\gamma\\big|x_1-x_0-u_t^\\gamma(x_t)\\big|^2+\\mathbb{E}_\\gamma\\big|u_t^\\gamma(x_t)-w(x_t)\\big|^2 .$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=x_1-x_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=x_t$</span>。对给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w(Z)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 的函数，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[Y-w(Z)|Z]=\\mathbb{E}[Y|Z]-w(Z)=u_t^\\gamma(Z)-w(Z)$</span>。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}|Y-w(Z)|^2=\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\mathbb{E}(|Y-w(Z)|^2|Z)\\big]=\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\mathbb{E}(|Y-u_t^\\gamma(Z)|^2|Z)+|u_t^\\gamma(Z)-w(Z)|^2\\big],$$</div>\n<p>其中用了条件方差分解：对给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}(|Y-w|^2|Z)=\\mathbb{E}(|Y-\\mathbb{E}[Y|Z]|^2|Z)+|\\mathbb{E}[Y|Z]-w|^2$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 取期望即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 4 说明：直线速度场是二次回归的唯一最优解（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\gamma)$</span> 意义下），任何偏离它的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 都严格增大回归损失。这为“以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1-x_0$</span> 为回归目标”提供了变分依据，也说明 reflow 的训练目标不是任意选定的，而是由成本泛函的代数结构唯一确定的。</p>\n<p><strong>本节动机的收束</strong></p>\n<p>至此，本节完成了六项动机性论证：(i) 流诱导耦合一般非最优（例 1）；(ii) 直线流是成本下界的达成者（定义 3）；(iii) 迭代只依赖采样，代价可控；(iv) 直线速度场在全空间良定义且精确诱导原耦合（引理 1）；(v) 精确 reflow 是恒等映射，成本下降必须来自耦合重构（命题 3、例 3）；(vi) 二次成本与直线速度的回归目标在变分上唯一匹配（命题 4）。这六项共同构成后续节的入口：耦合的重构将说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathfrak{F}(\\mathcal{R}(v))\\neq\\gamma_v$</span> 如何发生，传输成本的单调性将证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}(\\gamma^{(k)})$</span> 单调不增，收敛性与不动点将刻画极限为直线流。本节不越界证明这些结论，只把动机固定在可检验的数学对象上。</p>\n<h3 id=\"fl17--h-耦合的重构\">耦合的重构<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-耦合的重构\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用第 17.1 节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1\\in\\mathcal{P}_2(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 为端点分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T&gt;0$</span> 为时间上限，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}:[0,T]\\times\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮 reflow 前的速度场，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi^{(k)}_t$</span> 为其诱导的流映射（flow map），满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t\\phi^{(k)}_t=v^{(k)}(t,\\phi^{(k)}_t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi^{(k)}_0=\\mathrm{id}$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu^{(k)}_t:=(\\phi^{(k)}_t)_\\#\\mu_0$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮 ODE 在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的边缘分布。第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮诱导的耦合为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\pi^{(k)}:=(\\mathrm{id},\\phi^{(k)}_T)_\\#\\mu_0\\in\\mathcal{P}_2(\\mathbb{R}^d\\times\\mathbb{R}^d),$$</div>\n<p>其第一、第二边缘分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu^{(k)}_T$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu^{(k)}_T=\\mu_1$</span> 时称第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮为<strong>可行轮</strong>（feasible round）；否则称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu^{(k)}_T$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮的<strong>端点残差分布</strong>。</p>\n<p>本节引入的新符号如下，先定义后使用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Gamma(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{P}_2(\\mathbb{R}^d\\times\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 中第一边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>、第二边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 的耦合全体，即传输计划集合。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$c(x,y):=\\|x-y\\|^2$</span>：二次传输成本。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}(\\pi):=\\int c\\,\\mathrm{d}\\pi$</span>：耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 的传输成本。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi^{(k)}\\subseteq\\Gamma(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span>：第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮重构所用的可行耦合族（定义见 17.2.1）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{(k)}:\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>：第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮的重构映射，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}=(\\mathrm{id},\\tau^{(k)})_\\#\\mu_0$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k+1)}$</span>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 通过条件期望重构的速度场（定义见 17.2.2）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节的正则性假设（H1）–（H4）在整个推导中固定，不再逐条重复：</p>\n<p>（H1）<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1\\in\\mathcal{P}_2(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，即具有有限二阶矩。</p>\n<p>（H2）对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}\\in L^2([0,T];W^{1,\\infty}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(\\mathbb{R}^d;\\mathbb{R}^d))$</span>，且存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_k&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|v^{(k)}(t,x)-v^{(k)}(t,y)\\|\\le L_k\\|x-y\\|$</span> 对 a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x,y$</span> 成立；这保证流映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi^{(k)}_t$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 是全局定义的双 Lipschitz 同胚，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu^{(k)}_t$</span> 良定义且属于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{P}_2$</span>。</p>\n<p>（H3）<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi^{(k)}_T$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 下平方可积：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|\\phi^{(k)}_T(x)\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_0(x)&lt;\\infty$</span>；由（H1）（H2）自动成立。</p>\n<p>（H4）重构映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{(k)}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{(k)}\\in L^2(\\mu_0;\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{(k)}_\\#\\mu_0=\\mu_1$</span>；这是可行轮的定义性要求，若不可行则在 17.2.1 中显式放宽。</p>\n<p><strong>本节与相邻概念的区别</strong>须先澄清：耦合的重构（coupling reconstruction）不是重采样（resampling），不是对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 的近似，也不是对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 的简单截断。它是把一个<strong>由上一轮 ODE 诱导的、第二边缘未必等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 的耦合</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span>，替换为一个<strong>第二边缘严格等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 的可行耦合</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k+1)}\\in\\Gamma(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span>，且替换规则必须使新耦合在某种意义下“更直”。这与 17.1 节所述 reflow 的动机（拉直轨迹以降低传输成本）严格对应：动机节只陈述了目标，本节给出重构算子及其可测性、边缘保持性与成本单调性的代数结构。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-17-2-1-可行耦合族与重构算子\">17.2.1 可行耦合族与重构算子<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-17-2-1-可行耦合族与重构算子\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 17.2.1（可行耦合族）</strong> 设第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮的端点残差分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu^{(k)}:=\\mu^{(k)}_T$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu^{(k)}=\\mu_1$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi^{(k)}:=\\Gamma(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu^{(k)}\\neq\\mu_1$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi^{(k)}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Gamma(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span> 中满足下述<strong>残差桥接条件</strong>的子集：存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi\\in\\Gamma(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho\\in\\Gamma(\\nu^{(k)},\\mu_1)$</span>，使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 的第二边缘经由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 分解，即对任意有界 Borel <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int f(y)\\,\\mathrm{d}\\pi(x,y)=\\int\\!\\!\\int f(y')\\,\\mathrm{d}\\rho(y,y')\\,\\mathrm{d}\\pi^{(k)}(x,y).$$</div>\n<p>直观上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 把上一轮的端点残差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu^{(k)}$</span> 搬运到目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 则是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 的复合。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi^{(k)}$</span> 非空：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 与任一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho\\in\\Gamma(\\nu^{(k)},\\mu_1)$</span>（例如独立耦合，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu^{(k)},\\mu_1\\in\\mathcal{P}_2$</span> 故存在），复合即得。此定义与 17.6 节 OT 关系的接口一致：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu^{(k)}=\\mu_1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi^{(k)}$</span> 退化为全部可行耦合，与经典 OT 计划集相同。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 17.2.2（重构算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}$</span>）</strong> 给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi^{(k)}$</span>，重构算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}$</span> 作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 的输出为一个可行耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k+1)}\\in\\Pi^{(k)}$</span>，定义为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\pi^{(k+1)}:=\\arg\\min_{\\pi\\in\\Pi^{(k)}}\\ \\mathcal{C}(\\pi)+\\lambda\\,\\mathcal{D}(\\pi\\|\\pi^{(k)}),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{D}(\\pi\\|\\pi^{(k)})$</span> 为相对熵（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 绝对连续，否则取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\ge 0$</span> 为<strong>重构温度</strong>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}$</span> 退化为在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi^{(k)}$</span> 上的纯 OT 投影；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k+1)}$</span> 趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi^{(k)}$</span> 上的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span>-投影。本节主定理只用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=0$</span> 的情形，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda&gt;0$</span> 的情形在 17.8 节数值稳定性中讨论。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 17.2.3（重构算子的良定义性与边缘保持）</strong> 在（H1）–（H4）下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}(\\pi^{(k)})$</span> 存在且唯一（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=0$</span> 时），且其第一、第二边缘分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 存在性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi^{(k)}$</span> 非空（定义 17.2.1 已证），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi^{(k)}$</span> 上下半连续且下方有界（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}\\ge 0$</span>），由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{P}_2$</span> 的紧性（Prokhorov 定理加二阶矩一致可积）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}$</span> 的弱下半连续性，极小元存在。唯一性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 严格凸（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x-y\\|^2$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,y)$</span> 严格凸），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi^{(k)}$</span> 为凸集（边缘约束线性），故极小元唯一。边缘保持由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi^{(k)}\\subseteq\\Gamma(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span> 的定义直接给出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 17.2.4（重构映射的表示）</strong> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu^{(k)}=\\mu_1$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k+1)}$</span> 的第二边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span>，故存在 Borel 映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{(k+1)}:\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k+1)}=(\\mathrm{id},\\tau^{(k+1)})_\\#\\mu_0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{(k+1)}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>-a.e. 确定的。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k+1)}\\in\\Gamma(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-紧性，存在正则条件概率测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k+1)}(\\cdot|x)$</span>；因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}$</span> 严格凸且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi^{(k)}$</span> 凸，极小元必为确定性耦合（否则对两个确定性耦合取凸组合可降低 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}$</span>，矛盾）。确定性耦合即由某个 Borel 映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{(k+1)}$</span> 诱导。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论是 17.5 节不动点论证的入口：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{(k+1)}=\\phi^{(k)}_T$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>-a.e. 意义下成立，则称第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮为<strong>自洽轮</strong>，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k+1)}=\\pi^{(k)}$</span>，重构算子有不动点。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-17-2-2-速度场的条件期望重构\">17.2.2 速度场的条件期望重构<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-17-2-2-速度场的条件期望重构\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 17.2.5（重构速度场）</strong> 给定可行耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k+1)}=(\\mathrm{id},\\tau^{(k+1)})_\\#\\mu_0$</span>，定义第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k+1$</span> 轮的速度场为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v^{(k+1)}(t,x):=\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi^{(k+1)}}\\!\\left[\\frac{\\tau^{(k+1)}(X_0)-X_0}{T}\\,\\Big|\\,X_t=x\\right],$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_t)$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k+1)}$</span> 与第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi^{(k)}_t$</span> 联合诱导：<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t:=\\phi^{(k)}_t(X_0)$</span>。等价地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k+1)}(t,\\cdot)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k+1)}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi^{(k)}_t$</span> 下的前推测度关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu^{(k)}_t$</span> 的 Radon–Nikodym 条件期望。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 17.2.6（重构速度场的可测性与平方可积性）</strong> 在（H1）–（H4）下，对 a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k+1)}(t,\\cdot)$</span> 为 Borel 可测且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|v^{(k+1)}(t,x)\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu^{(k)}_t(x)&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 可测性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_t)\\mapsto(\\tau^{(k+1)}(X_0)-X_0)/T$</span> 为 Borel 可测（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{(k+1)}$</span> Borel），条件期望关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(X_t)$</span> 可测，由测度论条件期望的存在性定理给出。平方可积性：由 Jensen 不等式与（H3），</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int\\|v^{(k+1)}(t,x)\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu^{(k)}_t(x)\\le\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi^{(k+1)}}\\!\\left[\\left\\|\\frac{\\tau^{(k+1)}(X_0)-X_0}{T}\\right\\|^2\\right]\\le\\frac{2}{T^2}\\left(\\mathbb{E}\\|\\tau^{(k+1)}(X_0)\\|^2+\\mathbb{E}\\|X_0\\|^2\\right)&lt;\\infty,$$</div>\n<p>其中第一个不等号为条件 Jensen，第二个为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|a-b\\|^2\\le 2\\|a\\|^2+2\\|b\\|^2$</span>，有限性由（H1）（H3）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>关键恒等式（重构的矩匹配）</strong> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int v^{(k+1)}(t,x)\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu^{(k)}_t(x)=\\frac{1}{T}\\left(\\int y\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_1(y)-\\int x\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_0(x)\\right).$$</div>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由定义 17.2.5 与 Fubini（被积函数关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k+1)}$</span> 可积，因（H3）），</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int v^{(k+1)}(t,x)\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu^{(k)}_t(x)=\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi^{(k+1)}}\\!\\left[\\frac{\\tau^{(k+1)}(X_0)-X_0}{T}\\right]=\\frac{1}{T}\\left(\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_1}[Y]-\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_0}[X]\\right),$$</div>\n<p>其中第二个等号用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{(k+1)}_\\#\\mu_0=\\mu_1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此恒等式是可检验推论：它断言重构速度场的空间平均恰为端点均值之差除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{(k+1)}$</span> 的具体形状无关。数值上可在 17.14 节代码中直接 assert。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-17-2-3-重构与直线化的代数关系\">17.2.3 重构与直线化的代数关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-17-2-3-重构与直线化的代数关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节的核心代数事实是：重构算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}$</span> 把“上一轮 ODE 诱导的耦合”替换为“可行耦合”，而可行耦合的传输成本是直线流成本的精确下界。这为 17.3 节传输成本单调性提供代数骨架。</p>\n<p><strong>引理 17.2.7（直线流成本恒等式）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi\\in\\Gamma(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span> 为任一可行耦合，定义直线速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\pi(t,x):=\\mathbb{E}_\\pi[Y-X\\,|\\,X_t=x]$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t:=X+t(Y-X)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\pi$</span> 诱导的流在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 时把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 推到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span>，且其传输成本满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{C}(\\pi)=\\int_0^T\\int\\|u_\\pi(t,x)\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_t(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}t,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t:=(X+t(Y-X))_\\#\\pi$</span> 为直线插值边缘。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 直线插值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=X+t(Y-X)$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t X_t=Y-X$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\pi(t,X_t)=\\mathbb{E}_\\pi[Y-X\\,|\\,X_t]$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的速度场。由条件期望的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 投影性质，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|Y-X\\|^2=\\mathbb{E}\\|u_\\pi(t,X_t)\\|^2+\\mathbb{E}\\|(Y-X)-u_\\pi(t,X_t)\\|^2$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 积分并用 Fubini（被积函数非负可积）得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{C}(\\pi)=\\int\\|Y-X\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\pi=\\int_0^T\\int\\|u_\\pi(t,x)\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_t(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}t+\\text{残差},$$</div>\n<p>残差非负。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 为确定性耦合（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi=(\\mathrm{id},\\tau)_\\#\\mu_0$</span>）时残差为零，恒等式成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此引理与 17.6 节 OT 关系直接接口：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 取 OT 计划时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}(\\pi)=W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\pi$</span> 即 Benamou–Brenier 意义下的最优速度场。本节只用其确定性耦合情形。</p>\n<p><strong>定理 17.2.8（重构的直线化下界）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k+1)}=\\mathcal{R}(\\pi^{(k)})$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=0$</span> 的重构输出，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k+1)}$</span> 为确定性耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathrm{id},\\tau^{(k+1)})_\\#\\mu_0$</span>。则第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k+1$</span> 轮速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k+1)}$</span> 的传输成本满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^T\\int\\|v^{(k+1)}(t,x)\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu^{(k)}_t(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\ \\le\\ \\mathcal{C}(\\pi^{(k+1)}),$$</div>\n<p>等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{(k+1)}(X_0)-X_0$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(X_t)$</span> 可测对 a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立，即轨迹为直线。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由定义 17.2.5，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k+1)}(t,x)=\\mathbb{E}[(Y-X)/T\\,|\\,X_t=x]$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\tau^{(k+1)}(X_0)$</span>。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，条件 Jensen 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|v^{(k+1)}(t,x)\\|^2\\le\\mathbb{E}[\\|(Y-X)/T\\|^2\\,|\\,X_t=x]$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu^{(k)}_t$</span> 积分并用 Fubini（非负可积），</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int\\|v^{(k+1)}(t,x)\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu^{(k)}_t(x)\\le\\frac{1}{T^2}\\mathbb{E}\\|Y-X\\|^2=\\frac{1}{T^2}\\mathcal{C}(\\pi^{(k+1)}).$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 积分得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\int\\|v^{(k+1)}\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu^{(k)}_t\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\le\\mathcal{C}(\\pi^{(k+1)})$</span>。等号条件由 Jensen 等号条件（随机变量关于条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数可测）给出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此定理是本节主结果，它把“重构”与“直线化”的代数关系写成不等式：重构速度场的能量不超过重构耦合的传输成本，等号当且仅当重构轨迹为直线。17.3 节将把它与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}(\\pi^{(k)})$</span> 比较，得到传输成本的单调性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-17-2-4-具体例子-一维高斯情形\">17.2.4 具体例子：一维高斯情形<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-17-2-4-具体例子-一维高斯情形\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\mathcal{N}(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=\\mathcal{N}(m,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>。设第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮速度场为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}(t,x)=a^{(k)}(t)x+b^{(k)}(t)$</span>，其流为线性映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi^{(k)}_t(x)=A^{(k)}_t x+B^{(k)}_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A^{(k)}_0=1,B^{(k)}_0=0$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu^{(k)}_T=\\mathcal{N}(B^{(k)}_T,A^{(k)2}_T)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>可行轮重构</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B^{(k)}_T=m$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A^{(k)}_T=1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu^{(k)}=\\mu_1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi^{(k)}=\\Gamma(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span>。一维二次 OT 计划为确定性映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{(k+1)}(x)=x+m$</span>（因两分布同方差，OT 映射为平移）。重构速度场由定义 17.2.5，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v^{(k+1)}(t,x)=\\mathbb{E}\\!\\left[\\frac{(X_0+m)-X_0}{1}\\,\\Big|\\,X_t=x\\right]=m,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=\\phi^{(k)}_t(X_0)$</span>。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi^{(k)}_t$</span> 为双 Lipschitz 同胚，条件期望退化为常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k+1)}(t,x)\\equiv m$</span>，其流为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi^{(k+1)}_t(x)=x+tm$</span>，轨迹为直线，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}(\\pi^{(k+1)})=\\int m^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_0=m^2$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1\\int\\|v^{(k+1)}\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu^{(k)}_t\\,\\mathrm{d}t=m^2$</span>，定理 17.2.8 等号成立。</p>\n<p><strong>非可行轮</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B^{(k)}_T=m+\\delta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A^{(k)}_T=1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu^{(k)}=\\mathcal{N}(m+\\delta,1)\\neq\\mu_1$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu^{(k)}$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 的平移耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho(y,y')=\\delta_{y'=y-\\delta}$</span>，复合得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k+1)}$</span> 的第二边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span>，其重构映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{(k+1)}(x)=x+m$</span>（因复合后平移量恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span>）。重构速度场仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 无关。这说明重构算子“抹去”了上一轮的端点误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span>，把耦合替换为精确可行耦合；代价是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}(\\pi^{(k+1)})=m^2$</span> 可能大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}(\\pi^{(k)})$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}(\\pi^{(k)})$</span> 较小时），此现象在 17.3 节单调性定理的假设中将被排除（要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 本身可行或残差可控）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-17-2-5-重构算子的函子性\">17.2.5 重构算子的函子性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-17-2-5-重构算子的函子性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 17.2.9（重构与流的交换）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi^{(k)}_t$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮流映射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k+1)}=\\mathcal{R}(\\pi^{(k)})$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(\\phi^{(k)}_t,\\mathrm{id})_\\#\\pi^{(k+1)}=(\\phi^{(k)}_t,\\tau^{(k+1)})_\\#\\mu_0$$</div>\n<p>为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu^{(k)}_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 的耦合，且其关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu^{(k)}_t$</span> 的条件期望恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k+1)}(t,\\cdot)$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k+1)}=(\\mathrm{id},\\tau^{(k+1)})_\\#\\mu_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\phi^{(k)}_t)_\\#\\mu_0=\\mu^{(k)}_t$</span>，前推测度的第一边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu^{(k)}_t$</span>，第二边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span>。条件期望由定义 17.2.5 直接给出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明重构算子与流映射可交换：先在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 重构耦合，再推到时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，等价于在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi^{(k)}_t$</span> 搬运 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 后与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 耦合。这是 17.4 节收敛性证明中“逐时刻比较”的技术基础。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-17-2-6-重构算子的谱刻画\">17.2.6 重构算子的谱刻画<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-17-2-6-重构算子的谱刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上节把重构算子写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi^{(k)}$</span> 上的极小元。为在 17.4 节收敛性证明中逐时刻比较，需要一个不依赖极小元具体形状的谱刻画：把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}$</span> 视为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{P}_2(\\mathbb{R}^d\\times\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 上的非线性算子，并给出其在确定性耦合子集上的压缩估计。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 17.2.10（确定性耦合子空间）</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}:=\\{(\\mathrm{id},\\tau)_\\#\\mu_0:\\tau\\in L^2(\\mu_0;\\mathbb{R}^d)\\}\\subseteq\\mathcal{P}_2(\\mathbb{R}^d\\times\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，即由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 诱导的确定性耦合全体。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mu_0;\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\mapsto(\\mathrm{id},\\tau)_\\#\\mu_0$</span> 建立双射（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>-a.e. 意义下），故可在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}$</span> 上定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mu_0)$</span> 范数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\pi_\\tau-\\pi_\\sigma\\|_{\\mathcal{S}}:=\\|\\tau-\\sigma\\|_{L^2(\\mu_0)}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>引理 17.2.11（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}$</span> 上的成本展开）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_\\tau,\\pi_\\sigma\\in\\mathcal{S}$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{C}(\\pi_\\tau)-\\mathcal{C}(\\pi_\\sigma)=2\\int\\langle \\tau(x)-\\sigma(x),\\,\\sigma(x)-x\\rangle\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_0(x)+\\|\\tau-\\sigma\\|_{L^2(\\mu_0)}^2.$$</div>\n<p><em>证明</em> 直接展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tau(x)-x\\|^2-\\|\\sigma(x)-x\\|^2$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\tau-x\\|^2-\\|\\sigma-x\\|^2=\\|(\\tau-\\sigma)+(\\sigma-x)\\|^2-\\|\\sigma-x\\|^2=2\\langle\\tau-\\sigma,\\sigma-x\\rangle+\\|\\tau-\\sigma\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 积分，各项可积由（H1）（H3）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau,\\sigma\\in L^2(\\mu_0)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此展开是标准的 Hilbert 空间二次型恒等式，它把成本差分解为“一阶项”与“二阶项”。一阶项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 为 OT 映射时消失（因 OT 映射满足变分不等式），这正是 17.3 节单调性证明的关键。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 17.2.12（重构在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}$</span> 上的非扩张性）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}\\in\\mathcal{S}$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 可行（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu^{(k)}=\\mu_1$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k+1)}=\\mathcal{R}(\\pi^{(k)})$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=0$</span> 重构输出且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k+1)}\\in\\mathcal{S}$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k+1)}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi^{(k)}=\\Gamma(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span> 上的 OT 计划，则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_\\sigma\\in\\mathcal{S}\\cap\\Gamma(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\pi^{(k+1)}-\\pi_\\sigma\\|_{\\mathcal{S}}\\ \\le\\ \\|\\pi^{(k)}-\\pi_\\sigma\\|_{\\mathcal{S}}.$$</div>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由引理 17.2.11，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=\\tau^{(k)}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=\\tau^{(k+1)}$</span>（OT 映射），</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{C}(\\pi^{(k)})-\\mathcal{C}(\\pi^{(k+1)})=2\\int\\langle\\tau^{(k)}-\\tau^{(k+1)},\\tau^{(k+1)}-x\\rangle\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_0+\\|\\tau^{(k)}-\\tau^{(k+1)}\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>OT 映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{(k+1)}$</span> 满足变分不等式：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma\\in L^2(\\mu_0)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathrm{id},\\sigma)_\\#\\mu_0=\\mu_1$</span>，有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\langle\\sigma-\\tau^{(k+1)},\\tau^{(k+1)}-x\\rangle\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_0\\ge 0$</span>（这是 OT 计划最优性的第一变分条件，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}$</span> 的凸性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi^{(k)}$</span> 的凸性给出）。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=\\tau^{(k)}$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 可行故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{(k)}\\in\\Pi^{(k)}$</span> 的确定性表示），得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int\\langle\\tau^{(k)}-\\tau^{(k+1)},\\tau^{(k+1)}-x\\rangle\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_0\\ \\ge\\ 0.$$</div>\n<p>代入展开式得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}(\\pi^{(k)})-\\mathcal{C}(\\pi^{(k+1)})\\ge\\|\\tau^{(k)}-\\tau^{(k+1)}\\|^2$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tau^{(k)}-\\tau^{(k+1)}\\|^2\\le\\mathcal{C}(\\pi^{(k)})-\\mathcal{C}(\\pi^{(k+1)})$</span>。</p>\n<p>另一方面，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_\\sigma\\in\\mathcal{S}\\cap\\Gamma(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span>，由三角不等式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\tau^{(k+1)}-\\sigma\\|_{L^2(\\mu_0)}\\le\\|\\tau^{(k+1)}-\\tau^{(k)}\\|_{L^2(\\mu_0)}+\\|\\tau^{(k)}-\\sigma\\|_{L^2(\\mu_0)}.$$</div>\n<p>结合前式，只需证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tau^{(k+1)}-\\tau^{(k)}\\|\\le\\|\\tau^{(k)}-\\sigma\\|$</span> 对某个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 成立。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=\\tau^{(k)}$</span> 时右端为零，不等式退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tau^{(k+1)}-\\tau^{(k)}\\|\\le 0$</span>，仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{(k+1)}=\\tau^{(k)}$</span> 时成立，此即自洽轮。对一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{(k+1)}$</span> 为 OT 映射及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 可行，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}(\\pi_\\sigma)\\ge\\mathcal{C}(\\pi^{(k+1)})$</span>，再由引理 17.2.11 应用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\sigma,\\tau^{(k+1)})$</span> 得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{C}(\\pi_\\sigma)-\\mathcal{C}(\\pi^{(k+1)})=2\\int\\langle\\sigma-\\tau^{(k+1)},\\tau^{(k+1)}-x\\rangle\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_0+\\|\\sigma-\\tau^{(k+1)}\\|^2\\ \\ge\\ \\|\\sigma-\\tau^{(k+1)}\\|^2,$$</div>\n<p>其中不等号用变分不等式。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tau^{(k+1)}-\\sigma\\|^2\\le\\mathcal{C}(\\pi_\\sigma)-\\mathcal{C}(\\pi^{(k+1)})$</span>。同理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tau^{(k)}-\\sigma\\|^2\\le\\mathcal{C}(\\pi_\\sigma)-\\mathcal{C}(\\pi^{(k)})$</span>。两式相减并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}(\\pi^{(k)})\\ge\\mathcal{C}(\\pi^{(k+1)})$</span>（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 可行与 OT 最优性），得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tau^{(k+1)}-\\sigma\\|^2\\le\\|\\tau^{(k)}-\\sigma\\|^2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题给出重构算子在确定性耦合子空间上的非扩张性：以任一可行确定性耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_\\sigma$</span> 为参照，重构输出到它的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mu_0)$</span> 距离不超过上一轮到它的距离。这是 17.4 节收敛性证明的度量骨架：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 为 OT 映射，则重构序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\tau^{(k)}\\}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mu_0)$</span> 中有界且单调逼近 OT 映射的某个邻域。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 17.2.13（重构序列的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 有界性）</strong> 在命题 17.2.12 的假设下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\|\\tau^{(k)}-\\tau^{\\mathrm{OT}}\\|_{L^2(\\mu_0)}\\}_{k}$</span> 单调不增，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{\\mathrm{OT}}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Gamma(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span> 上的 OT 映射。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=\\tau^{\\mathrm{OT}}$</span> 代入命题 17.2.12。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论与 17.4 节收敛性定理直接接口：单调有界序列在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mu_0)$</span> 中弱收敛，其弱极限由 17.5 节不动点论证识别为直线流映射。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-17-2-7-重构算子与条件期望的交换图\">17.2.7 重构算子与条件期望的交换图<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-17-2-7-重构算子与条件期望的交换图\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>定义 17.2.5 用条件期望定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k+1)}$</span>，而命题 17.2.9 断言重构与流可交换。二者合起来给出一个交换图，它把“耦合层面”的重构与“速度场层面”的条件期望联系起来。此交换图是 17.4 节收敛性证明中“能量比较”的技术入口。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 17.2.14（交换图的代数形式）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k+1)}=(\\mathrm{id},\\tau^{(k+1)})_\\#\\mu_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi^{(k)}_t$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮流映射。定义两个算子：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{E}_t:L^2(\\pi^{(k+1)};\\mathbb{R}^d)\\to L^2(\\mu^{(k)}_t;\\mathbb{R}^d),\\quad \\mathcal{E}_t[F](x):=\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi^{(k+1)}}[F(X_0,Y)\\,|\\,\\phi^{(k)}_t(X_0)=x],$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{P}_t:L^2(\\mu_0;\\mathbb{R}^d)\\to L^2(\\mu^{(k)}_t;\\mathbb{R}^d),\\quad \\mathcal{P}_t[f](x):=f((\\phi^{(k)}_t)^{-1}(x)).$$</div>\n<p>则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k+1)}(t,\\cdot)=\\mathcal{E}_t[(Y-X_0)/T]$</span>，且对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in L^2(\\mu_0)$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int\\langle v^{(k+1)}(t,x),\\,\\mathcal{P}_t[f](x)\\rangle\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu^{(k)}_t(x)=\\frac{1}{T}\\int\\langle\\tau^{(k+1)}(x_0)-x_0,\\,f(x_0)\\rangle\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_0(x_0).$$</div>\n<p><em>证明</em> 第一式由定义 17.2.5 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_t$</span> 的定义直接给出。第二式：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_t$</span> 为条件期望，其对偶作用满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int\\langle\\mathcal{E}_t[F],\\,g\\rangle\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu^{(k)}_t=\\int\\langle F,\\,g\\circ\\phi^{(k)}_t\\rangle\\,\\mathrm{d}\\pi^{(k+1)}$$</div>\n<p>对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\in L^2(\\mu^{(k)}_t)$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F(X_0,Y)=(Y-X_0)/T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g=\\mathcal{P}_t[f]=f\\circ(\\phi^{(k)}_t)^{-1}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\circ\\phi^{(k)}_t=f$</span>，右端为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{T}\\int\\langle\\tau^{(k+1)}(x_0)-x_0,f(x_0)\\rangle\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_0(x_0)$</span>。左端即所证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的实质是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k+1)}(t,\\cdot)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu^{(k)}_t$</span> 下的配对，等于重构映射的位移在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 下与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的配对。它把“时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的速度场能量”翻译为“时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 的位移能量”，是定理 17.2.8 的逐时刻版本。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 17.2.15（逐时刻能量恒等式）</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x_0)=\\tau^{(k+1)}(x_0)-x_0$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int\\|v^{(k+1)}(t,x)\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu^{(k)}_t(x)\\ \\le\\ \\frac{1}{T^2}\\int\\|\\tau^{(k+1)}(x_0)-x_0\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_0(x_0)=\\frac{1}{T^2}\\mathcal{C}(\\pi^{(k+1)}),$$</div>\n<p>等号当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{(k+1)}(X_0)-X_0$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(\\phi^{(k)}_t(X_0))$</span> 可测。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 在命题 17.2.14 中取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=\\tau^{(k+1)}-\\mathrm{id}$</span>，左端为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\langle v^{(k+1)},\\mathcal{P}_t[\\tau^{(k+1)}-\\mathrm{id}]\\rangle\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu^{(k)}_t$</span>。由 Cauchy–Schwarz 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mathcal{P}_t[f]\\|_{L^2(\\mu^{(k)}_t)}=\\|f\\|_{L^2(\\mu_0)}$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{P}_t$</span> 为等距），</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int\\|v^{(k+1)}\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu^{(k)}_t\\ \\ge\\ \\frac{\\left(\\int\\langle v^{(k+1)},\\mathcal{P}_t[\\tau^{(k+1)}-\\mathrm{id}]\\rangle\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu^{(k)}_t\\right)^2}{\\|\\mathcal{P}_t[\\tau^{(k+1)}-\\mathrm{id}]\\|^2}=\\frac{\\left(\\frac{1}{T}\\mathcal{C}(\\pi^{(k+1)})\\right)^2}{\\mathcal{C}(\\pi^{(k+1)})}=\\frac{1}{T^2}\\mathcal{C}(\\pi^{(k+1)}).$$</div>\n<p>方向与定理 17.2.8 一致（能量不超过成本），此处 Cauchy–Schwarz 给出的是下界，需改用条件 Jensen 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|v^{(k+1)}\\|^2\\le\\frac{1}{T^2}\\mathcal{C}(\\pi^{(k+1)})$</span>，等号条件同定理 17.2.8。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论把定理 17.2.8 的“对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 积分”拆成“逐时刻”，为 17.4 节收敛性证明中“对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 比较 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu^{(k)}_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu^{(k+1)}_t$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 距离”提供逐点估计。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-17-2-8-重构算子的迭代复合\">17.2.8 重构算子的迭代复合<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-17-2-8-重构算子的迭代复合\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节最后给出重构算子迭代复合的代数性质，它是 17.3 节单调性定理与 17.4 节收敛性定理的共同前提。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 17.2.16（reflow 迭代序列）</strong> 给定初始速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(0)}$</span> 与初始耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(0)}:=(\\mathrm{id},\\phi^{(0)}_T)_\\#\\mu_0$</span>，定义 reflow 迭代序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\pi^{(k)}\\}_{k\\ge 0}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{v^{(k)}\\}_{k\\ge 0}$</span> 为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\pi^{(k+1)}:=\\mathcal{R}(\\pi^{(k)}),\\qquad v^{(k+1)}:=\\text{由 }\\pi^{(k+1)}\\text{ 按定义 17.2.5 重构}.$$</div>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}\\in\\Gamma(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span> 对某个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 成立时，称迭代在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮<strong>进入可行域</strong>；此后所有轮均为可行轮。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 17.2.17（迭代复合的结合律）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=0$</span> 重构算子，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi^{(k)}$</span> 由定义 17.2.1 给出。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\ge 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}(\\pi^{(k)})$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span>，不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k-1)},\\dots,\\pi^{(0)}$</span>；即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}$</span> 是 Markov 型算子（无记忆）。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 定义 17.2.1 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi^{(k)}$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu^{(k)}=\\mu^{(k)}_T$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 确定，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu^{(k)}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 的第二边缘；定义 17.2.2 中极小化只涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi^{(k)}$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}(\\pi^{(k)})$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\pi^{(k)},\\mu_1)$</span> 的函数。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题看似平凡，但它排除了“迭代历史影响重构”的可能性，使 17.4 节收敛性证明可以只追踪单步误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\pi^{(k+1)}-\\pi^{(k)}\\|$</span> 而不追踪整个历史。这与 17.10 节反例节中“过度 reflow 导致模式丢失”的讨论直接相关：无记忆性意味着模式丢失只能来自单步重构的几何性质，不能来自历史累积。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 17.2.18（单步误差的可加性）</strong> 在命题 17.2.17 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\ge 0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\pi^{(k+1)}-\\pi^{(k)}\\|_{\\mathcal{S}}\\ \\le\\ \\|\\pi^{(k)}-\\pi^{(k-1)}\\|_{\\mathcal{S}}+\\|\\pi^{(k-1)}-\\pi^{(k)}\\|_{\\mathcal{S}},$$</div>\n<p>其中右端第二项由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}$</span> 的单步作用给出。特别地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}$</span> 上为压缩（压缩因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho&lt;1$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\pi^{(k)}\\}$</span> 为 Cauchy 序列。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 三角不等式给出第一式。压缩性：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mathcal{R}(\\pi)-\\mathcal{R}(\\sigma)\\|_{\\mathcal{S}}\\le\\rho\\|\\pi-\\sigma\\|_{\\mathcal{S}}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\pi^{(k+1)}-\\pi^{(k)}\\|_{\\mathcal{S}}\\le\\rho\\|\\pi^{(k)}-\\pi^{(k-1)}\\|_{\\mathcal{S}}$</span>，迭代得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\pi^{(k+m)}-\\pi^{(k)}\\|_{\\mathcal{S}}\\le\\frac{\\rho^k}{1-\\rho}\\|\\pi^{(1)}-\\pi^{(0)}\\|_{\\mathcal{S}}\\to 0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>压缩因子的具体估计依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span> 的几何（例如强对数凹性给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho&lt;1$</span>），此估计在 17.4 节收敛性定理中作为假设（H5）显式列出，其失效情形在 17.10 节反例节处理。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>本节定义了可行耦合族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi^{(k)}$</span> 与重构算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}$</span>，证明其在（H1）–（H4）下良定义、唯一且保持边缘；当上一轮可行时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}$</span> 退化为 OT 投影，当不可行时通过残差桥接 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 复合得到精确可行耦合。</li>\n<li>重构速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k+1)}$</span> 由条件期望给出，满足矩匹配恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int v^{(k+1)}\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu^{(k)}_t=(\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_1}Y-\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_0}X)/T$</span>，且其能量不超过重构耦合的传输成本（定理 17.2.8），等号当且仅当重构轨迹为直线。</li>\n<li>重构算子与流映射可交换（命题 17.2.9），一维高斯例子验证了恒等式与等号条件；非可行轮例子显示重构会抹去端点误差，但可能增大瞬时成本，此边界情形留待 17.3 节单调性假设与 17.10 节反例节处理。</li>\n<li>本节在确定性耦合子空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}$</span> 上给出成本展开（引理 17.2.11）与重构算子的非扩张性（命题 17.2.12），并由此得重构序列到 OT 映射的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mu_0)$</span> 距离单调不增（推论 17.2.13），为 17.4 节收敛性提供度量骨架。</li>\n<li>交换图命题 17.2.14 把耦合层面的重构与速度场层面的条件期望联系起来，逐时刻能量恒等式（推论 17.2.15）把定理 17.2.8 的积分估计拆为逐点估计，是 17.4 节逐时刻比较的技术入口。</li>\n<li>reflow 迭代序列（定义 17.2.16）的重构算子为 Markov 型（命题 17.2.17），单步误差可加（推论 17.2.18）；压缩因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho&lt;1$</span> 作为（H5）在 17.4 节显式列出，其失效情形留待 17.10 节反例节。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"fl17--h-传输成本的单调性\">传输成本的单调性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-传输成本的单调性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前两节已建立的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1\\in\\mathcal{P}_2(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 为端点分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\in\\mathbb{N}$</span> 为离散时间步数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h=1/T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k=kh$</span>。第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span> 轮 reflow 的耦合记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(r)}\\in\\mathcal{P}_2(\\mathbb{R}^d\\times\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，其边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span>，由第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r-1$</span> 轮 ODE 的速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(r-1)}(x,t)$</span> 诱导：从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\sim\\mu_0$</span> 出发求解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot x=v^{(r-1)}(x,t)$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=\\Phi^{(r-1)}_{1}(X_0)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(r)}=\\mathrm{Law}(X_0,X_1)$</span>。第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span> 轮速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(r)}$</span> 由条件流匹配目标在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(r)}$</span> 上训练得到。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{(r)}_{s,t}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(r)}$</span> 诱导的流映射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{(r)}_{t}:=\\Phi^{(r)}_{0,t}$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节引入的新符号：对任意耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma\\in\\mathcal{P}_2(\\mathbb{R}^d\\times\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，定义其<strong>传输成本泛函</strong></p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{C}(\\gamma):=\\mathbb{E}_{\\gamma}\\big[\\,\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2\\,\\big].$$</div>\n<p>显然 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}(\\gamma)\\ge W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span>，等号当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 为最优耦合。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_r:=\\mathcal{C}(\\gamma^{(r)})$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 (A1)</strong>（端点正则性）<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1\\in\\mathcal{P}_2(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|x\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_0&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|x\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_1&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 (A2)</strong>（速度场正则性）对每轮 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(r)}:\\mathbb{R}^d\\times[0,1]\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 满足：(i) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\mapsto v^{(r)}(x,t)$</span> 全局 Lipschitz，Lipschitz 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_r$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 一致；(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto v^{(r)}(x,t)$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 连续；(iii) 增长界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|v^{(r)}(x,t)\\|\\le C_r(1+\\|x\\|)$</span>。这三条保证流映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{(r)}_{s,t}$</span> 存在唯一且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{(r)}_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上的同胚。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 (A3)</strong>（训练精确性）第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span> 轮的条件流匹配回归达到总体最优：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(r)}$</span>-几乎处处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_1)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v^{(r)}(x_t,t)=\\mathbb{E}\\big[X_1-X_0\\,\\big|\\,X_t=x_t\\big],\\qquad x_t=(1-t)x_0+t x_1,$$</div>\n<p>其中条件期望在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(r)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的联合测度下取。此即条件流匹配的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 投影解，是本章后续所有单调性论证的分析前提；若训练欠拟合，单调性不成立（见第 10 节）。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 (A4)</strong>（可积性）对每轮 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\gamma^{(r)}}\\big[\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2\\big]&lt;\\infty$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\|v^{(r)}(X_t,t)\\|^2\\big]&lt;\\infty$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的 Lebesgue 测度几乎处处成立。</p>\n<p>下面固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r\\ge 1$</span>，比较 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_{r+1}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_r$</span>。核心机制是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(r+1)}$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(r)}$</span> 的流诱导，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(r)}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(r)}$</span> 上的条件期望；条件期望是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 投影，投影不增范数——这正是单调性的分析内核。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-条件期望的投影恒等式\">条件期望的投影恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-条件期望的投影恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（投影恒等式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(r)}$</span>-几乎处处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_1)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=(1-t)x_0+tx_1$</span>，有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}_{\\gamma^{(r)}}\\Big[\\big\\|(X_1-X_0)-v^{(r)}(X_t,t)\\big\\|^2\\Big]\n=\\mathcal{C}_r-\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\|v^{(r)}(X_t,t)\\|^2\\big].$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 (A3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(r)}(x_t,t)=\\mathbb{E}[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x_t]$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D=X_1-X_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V=v^{(r)}(X_t,t)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V=\\mathbb{E}[D\\mid X_t]$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(X_t)$</span> 上的条件期望。由条件期望的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 投影性质（对平方可积变量，条件期望是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(X_t)$</span>-可测子空间的正交投影），有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\|D-V\\|^2\\big]=\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\|D\\|^2\\big]-\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\|V\\|^2\\big].$$</div>\n<p>这里用了正交分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D=V+(D-V)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[(D-V)V]=0$</span>：因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(X_t)$</span>-可测，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[(D-V)V]=\\mathbb{E}\\big[V\\,\\mathbb{E}[D-V\\mid X_t]\\big]=\\mathbb{E}[V\\cdot 0]=0$</span>。可积性由 (A4) 保证，交换期望与条件期望合法。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 1 说明：条件流匹配的回归残差恰好等于“耦合成本减去速度场能量”。这是纯代数恒等式，不依赖任何动力学。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-流诱导耦合的成本上界\">流诱导耦合的成本上界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-流诱导耦合的成本上界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（流耦合成本不超过回归残差加端点偏差）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(r+1)}=\\mathrm{Law}(X_0,\\Phi^{(r)}_1(X_0))$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\sim\\mu_0$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{C}_{r+1}=\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_0}\\big[\\|\\Phi^{(r)}_1(X_0)-X_0\\|^2\\big]\n\\le \\mathcal{C}_r-\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\|v^{(r)}(X_t,t)\\|^2\\big]+\\mathcal{E}_{\\mathrm{disc}}^{(r)},$$</div>\n<p>其中离散化误差项</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{E}_{\\mathrm{disc}}^{(r)}:=\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_0}\\Big[\\big\\|\\Phi^{(r)}_1(X_0)-X_0-\\textstyle\\int_0^1 v^{(r)}(X_s,s)\\,\\mathrm{d}s\\big\\|^2\\Big]$$</div>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\to0$</span> 时趋于零，且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(r)}$</span> 沿直线常值时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_{\\mathrm{disc}}^{(r)}=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由流映射定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{(r)}_1(X_0)-X_0=\\int_0^1 v^{(r)}(\\Phi^{(r)}_s(X_0),s)\\,\\mathrm{d}s$</span>（微积分基本定理，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\mapsto\\Phi^{(r)}_s(X_0)$</span> 绝对连续，由 (A2)(iii) 增长界保证可积）。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{C}_{r+1}=\\mathbb{E}\\Big[\\big\\|\\textstyle\\int_0^1 v^{(r)}(\\Phi^{(r)}_s(X_0),s)\\,\\mathrm{d}s\\big\\|^2\\Big].$$</div>\n<p>另一方面，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(r)}$</span> 的样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span>，沿直线路径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0=\\int_0^1 (X_1-X_0)\\,\\mathrm{d}t$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{C}_r=\\mathbb{E}_{\\gamma^{(r)}}\\Big[\\big\\|\\textstyle\\int_0^1 (X_1-X_0)\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\big\\|^2\\Big].$$</div>\n<p>将两式相减并插入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(r)}(X_t,t)$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{C}_{r+1}-\\mathcal{C}_r\n=\\mathbb{E}\\Big[\\big\\|\\textstyle\\int_0^1 v^{(r)}(\\Phi^{(r)}_s(X_0),s)\\,\\mathrm{d}s\\big\\|^2\\Big]\n-\\mathbb{E}_{\\gamma^{(r)}}\\Big[\\big\\|\\textstyle\\int_0^1 (X_1-X_0)\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\big\\|^2\\Big].$$</div>\n<p>用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|a\\|^2-\\|b\\|^2=\\|a-b\\|^2+2\\langle a-b,b\\rangle$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a=\\int_0^1 v^{(r)}(\\Phi^{(r)}_s(X_0),s)\\mathrm{d}s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b=\\int_0^1(X_1-X_0)\\mathrm{d}t$</span>。关键观察：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(r)}$</span> 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 的边缘是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\gamma^{(r)}}[b]=\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_0}[\\Phi^{(r)}_1(X_0)-X_0]$</span> 仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(r)}$</span> 精确诱导该流时成立——这正是 reflow 耦合的定义。更直接地，将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_{r+1}$</span> 写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\gamma^{(r)}}[\\|\\Phi^{(r)}_1(X_0)-X_0\\|^2]$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(r)}$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>），并与命题 1 的残差比较：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{C}_{r+1}-\\big(\\mathcal{C}_r-\\mathbb{E}\\|v^{(r)}(X_t,t)\\|^2\\big)\n=\\mathbb{E}_{\\gamma^{(r)}}\\Big[\\|\\Phi^{(r)}_1(X_0)-X_0\\|^2-\\|(X_1-X_0)-v^{(r)}(X_t,t)\\|^2\\Big].$$</div>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(r)}$</span> 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{(r)}_1(X_0)-X_0=\\int_0^1 v^{(r)}(\\Phi^{(r)}_s(X_0),s)\\mathrm{d}s$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_1-X_0)-v^{(r)}(X_t,t)=\\int_0^1\\big[(X_1-X_0)-v^{(r)}(X_t,t)\\big]\\mathrm{d}t$</span>（被积函数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 无关）。两者之差即离散化误差与回归残差沿路径的差异；由三角不等式与 (A2) 的 Lipschitz 性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Phi^{(r)}_s(X_0)-x_s\\|$</span> 被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_r$</span>-控制的路径偏差界住，从而上式不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_{\\mathrm{disc}}^{(r)}$</span> 加上交叉项。交叉项的期望由命题 1 的正交性消去（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[(D-V)V]=0$</span>），剩余项恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_{\\mathrm{disc}}^{(r)}$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(r)}$</span> 沿直线常值（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(r)}(x,t)=x_1-x_0$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(r)}$</span>-a.e. 样本成立）时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{(r)}_s(X_0)=X_0+s(X_1-X_0)$</span>，路径积分等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span>，离散化误差为零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 2 的实质是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_{r+1}\\le\\mathcal{C}_r-\\mathbb{E}\\|v^{(r)}\\|^2+\\mathcal{E}_{\\mathrm{disc}}^{(r)}$</span>。在连续时间极限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\to0$</span>（或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span>）下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_{\\mathrm{disc}}^{(r)}\\to0$</span>，于是成本严格下降，下降量等于速度场能量。这给出单调性的定量形式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-主定理-传输成本的单调不增\">主定理：传输成本的单调不增<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-主定理-传输成本的单调不增\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 3（单调性）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，若离散化误差满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_{\\mathrm{disc}}^{(r)}\\le \\mathbb{E}\\|v^{(r)}(X_t,t)\\|^2$</span> 对每轮 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span> 成立（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 足够大或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(r)}$</span> 足够光滑时成立），则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{C}_{r+1}\\le\\mathcal{C}_r,\\qquad r=0,1,2,\\dots$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\mathcal{C}_r\\}_{r\\ge0}$</span> 单调不增，从而收敛到某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_\\infty\\ge W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_{r+1}\\le\\mathcal{C}_r-\\mathbb{E}\\|v^{(r)}\\|^2+\\mathcal{E}_{\\mathrm{disc}}^{(r)}\\le\\mathcal{C}_r$</span>。单调有下界的实数列收敛，下界由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_r\\ge W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span>（对任意耦合，二次成本的期望不小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2$</span>）给出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong> 条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_{\\mathrm{disc}}^{(r)}\\le\\mathbb{E}\\|v^{(r)}\\|^2$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 大时自动满足：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_{\\mathrm{disc}}^{(r)}=O(h^2)$</span>（一阶 Euler 型路径积分的局部截断误差平方），而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|v^{(r)}\\|^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 无关。故对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 充分大即可。这是本节把“单调性”陈述为关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span> 的命题、而非关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 的命题的技术原因。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 4（严格下降的判据）</strong> 在定理 3 条件下，若第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span> 轮速度场非退化，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\gamma^{(r)}}\\|v^{(r)}(X_t,t)\\|^2&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_{\\mathrm{disc}}^{(r)}&lt;\\mathbb{E}\\|v^{(r)}\\|^2$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_{r+1}&lt;\\mathcal{C}_r$</span> 严格。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 直接由命题 2 的严格不等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 4 的几何含义：只要当前速度场在耦合测度下具有非零能量，reflow 就严格降低二次传输成本。速度场能量为零当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(r)}\\equiv0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(r)}$</span>-a.e. 上，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=X_0$</span> a.s.，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\mu_1$</span> 且成本已为零，无下降空间。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-与最优传输下界的差距\">与最优传输下界的差距<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-与最优传输下界的差距\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>单调性只保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_r$</span> 收敛，不保证收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2$</span>。定义<strong>次优间隙</strong></p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta_r:=\\mathcal{C}_r-W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)\\ge0.$$</div>\n<p>定理 3 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_{r+1}\\le\\Delta_r-\\mathbb{E}\\|v^{(r)}\\|^2+\\mathcal{E}_{\\mathrm{disc}}^{(r)}$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_r$</span> 不趋于零，则存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_r\\ge\\epsilon$</span> 对无穷多 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span> 成立，此时速度场能量必须趋于零（否则成本会跌破下界，矛盾）。速度场能量趋于零意味着 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(r)}\\to0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\gamma^{(r)})$</span> 中，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0\\to0$</span>——这要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 在耦合意义下越来越接近，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_r\\ge\\epsilon$</span> 矛盾（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_r\\ge W_2^2+\\epsilon$</span> 需要端点间有非零位移）。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_r\\to0$</span> 是定理 3 的必然推论，但收敛速率依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|v^{(r)}\\|^2$</span> 的衰减，本节不展开速率估计（留待第 4 节收敛性）。</p>\n<p><strong>恒等式（成本分解）</strong> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span>，由命题 1 与命题 2 的合并，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{C}_r=\\underbrace{\\mathbb{E}_{\\gamma^{(r)}}\\big[\\|(X_1-X_0)-v^{(r)}(X_t,t)\\|^2\\big]}_{\\text{回归残差}}+\\underbrace{\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\|v^{(r)}(X_t,t)\\|^2\\big]}_{\\text{速度能量}}.$$</div>\n<p>此恒等式对每轮 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span> 成立，是 reflow 迭代的分析记账本：残差项度量当前速度场对耦合的拟合程度，能量项度量耦合本身的位移幅度。reflow 的每一步把“能量”重新分配到下一轮的残差中，而总成本按命题 2 递减。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-具体例子-一维高斯端点\">具体例子：一维高斯端点<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-具体例子-一维高斯端点\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\mathcal{N}(0,\\sigma_0^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=\\mathcal{N}(m,\\sigma_1^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>。最优耦合为 comonotone 耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=m+\\frac{\\sigma_1}{\\sigma_0}(X_0-\\mathbb{E}X_0)$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0,\\sigma_1&gt;0$</span>），此时</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)=m^2+(\\sigma_1-\\sigma_0)^2.$$</div>\n<p>若初始耦合为独立耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(0)}=\\mu_0\\otimes\\mu_1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_0=\\mathbb{E}[(X_1-X_0)^2]=m^2+\\sigma_0^2+\\sigma_1^2$</span>。条件流匹配在独立耦合上的最优速度场为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(0)}(x,t)=\\mathbb{E}[X_1]-\\mathbb{E}[X_0]=m$</span>（常数，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\perp X_1$</span> 时条件期望不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>）。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|v^{(0)}\\|^2=m^2$</span>，命题 2 给 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_1\\le m^2+\\sigma_0^2+\\sigma_1^2-m^2=\\sigma_0^2+\\sigma_1^2$</span>（离散化误差为零，因常速度场沿直线）。实际 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_1=\\mathbb{E}[(\\Phi^{(0)}_1(X_0)-X_0)^2]=\\mathbb{E}[m^2]=m^2$</span>？不——<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{(0)}_1(X_0)=X_0+m$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_1=\\mathbb{E}[m^2]=m^2$</span>。但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0^2+\\sigma_1^2\\ge m^2$</span> 不一定成立；检查：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_1=m^2$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2=m^2+(\\sigma_1-\\sigma_0)^2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_1-W_2^2=(\\sigma_1-\\sigma_0)^2-(\\sigma_1-\\sigma_0)^2=0$</span>？这不对：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_1=m^2$</span> 小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_1\\ne\\sigma_0$</span>，违反 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}\\ge W_2^2$</span>。错误在于：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{(0)}_1(X_0)=X_0+m$</span> 的边缘是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(m,\\sigma_0^2)$</span>，不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=\\mathcal{N}(m,\\sigma_1^2)$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0\\ne\\sigma_1$</span>。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(1)}$</span> 的边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1$</span> 不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span>，reflow 耦合的定义要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1\\sim\\mu_1$</span>——这是本节的关键约束：reflow 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1$</span> 必须从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 采样，而非由流映射产生。正确的 reflow 构造是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\sim\\mu_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1\\sim\\mu_1$</span> 独立，然后以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(0)}$</span> 训练 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(0)}$</span>，再以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(0)}$</span> 的流映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{(0)}_1$</span> 作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 得到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde X_1=\\Phi^{(0)}_1(X_0)$</span>，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde X_1$</span> 的边缘一般不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span>；reflow 的耦合是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,\\tilde X_1)$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span>。本节符号表中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(r+1)}=\\mathrm{Law}(X_0,\\Phi^{(r)}_1(X_0))$</span> 已明确这一点，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_{r+1}$</span> 的下界不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span> 而是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\nu^{(r+1)})$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu^{(r+1)}=(\\Phi^{(r)}_1)_\\#\\mu_0$</span> 是流映射推前。定理 3 的单调性对此推前分布成立，但下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu^{(r+1)}=\\mu_1$</span> 时适用。这是 reflow 与精确 OT 的接口（第 6 节展开）。本例中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu^{(1)}=\\mathcal{N}(m,\\sigma_0^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_1=m^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\nu^{(1)})=m^2$</span>，等号成立——第一轮 reflow 即达该推前分布的最优。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>本例说明：单调性的正确陈述必须区分“端点分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span>”与“流映射推前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu^{(r)}$</span>”；本节定理 3 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_r$</span> 是耦合成本，其单调性不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu^{(r)}=\\mu_1$</span>，但收敛下界依赖之。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import torch\n\ndef reflow_cost_monotone_check(d=2, n=4096, rounds=5, T=32, seed=0):\n    torch.manual_seed(seed)\n    mu0 = torch.randn(n, d)\n    mu1 = torch.randn(n, d) * 0.5 + 1.0\n    # 初始独立耦合\n    X0, X1 = mu0.clone(), mu1.clone()\n    costs = []\n    for r in range(rounds):\n        # 条件流匹配：线性插值路径上的最小二乘速度\n        t = torch.rand(n, 1)\n        Xt = (1 - t) * X0 + t * X1\n        target = X1 - X0\n        # 闭式最优速度（总体回归，用样本均值近似条件期望的线性部分）\n        # 对高斯情形，E[target|Xt] 是 Xt 的仿射函数；此处用最小二乘拟合\n        A = torch.cat([Xt, torch.ones(n, 1)], dim=1)\n        coef = torch.linalg.lstsq(A, target).solution  # (d+1, d)\n        def v(x, tt):\n            return torch.cat([x, torch.ones(x.shape[0], 1)], dim=1) @ coef\n        # 用 Euler 离散化流映射\n        x = X0.clone()\n        h = 1.0 / T\n        for k in range(T):\n            x = x + h * v(x, k * h)\n        X1_new = x\n        cost = ((X1_new - X0) ** 2).sum(dim=1).mean().item()\n        costs.append(cost)\n        # 下一轮耦合：保留 X0，用流映射输出作为新的 X1\n        X1 = X1_new\n    print(&quot;costs:&quot;, [round(c, 6) for c in costs])\n    assert len(costs) == rounds\n    assert all(costs[i+1] &lt;= costs[i] + 1e-5 for i in range(rounds - 1)), &quot;monotonicity violated&quot;\n    print(&quot;shape X0:&quot;, X0.shape, &quot;expected: (4096, 2)&quot;)\n    print(&quot;monotone check passed&quot;)\n    return costs\n\ncosts = reflow_cost_monotone_check()\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>上述代码在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$n=4096$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=32$</span> 下验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_{r+1}\\le\\mathcal{C}_r$</span>（允许 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-5}$</span> 的数值容差），并打印成本序列。断言检查单调性与形状，失败即抛出。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>定义耦合成本泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}(\\gamma)=\\mathbb{E}_\\gamma\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2$</span>，并证明条件流匹配的投影恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|D-V\\|^2=\\mathcal{C}-\\mathbb{E}\\|V\\|^2$</span>，这是单调性的代数内核。</li>\n<li>主定理 3 证明：在速度场正则、训练精确、离散化误差受控的条件下，reflow 迭代使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_r$</span> 单调不增并收敛；严格下降当且仅当速度场能量非零。</li>\n<li>单调性的下界是流映射推前分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu^{(r)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 之间的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2$</span>，而非原始端点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span>；与精确 OT 的差距由次优间隙 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_r$</span> 刻画，其收敛速率留待第 4 节。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-单调性的定量形式-能量下界与下降速率\">单调性的定量形式：能量下界与下降速率<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-单调性的定量形式-能量下界与下降速率\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>定理 3 只给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_{r+1}\\le\\mathcal{C}_r$</span> 的定性结论。为后续第 4 节收敛性分析提供可检验的输入，本节给出下降量的定量下界。核心观察是：命题 2 中的速度能量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|v^{(r)}\\|^2$</span> 与次优间隙 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_r$</span> 之间存在可显式写出的联系，从而把“成本下降”转化为“间隙收缩”。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（能量—间隙不等式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu^{(r+1)}=(\\Phi^{(r)}_1)_\\#\\mu_0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_{\\mathrm{disc}}^{(r)}=0$</span>（速度场沿耦合路径常值，或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span> 极限）。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_r^{\\mathrm{push}}:=\\mathcal{C}_r-W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\nu^{(r+1)})$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}_{\\gamma^{(r)}}\\big[\\|v^{(r)}(X_t,t)\\|^2\\big]\\ \\ge\\ \\Delta_r^{\\mathrm{push}}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|v^{(r)}(X_t,t)\\|^2=\\mathcal{C}_r-\\mathbb{E}\\|(X_1-X_0)-v^{(r)}(X_t,t)\\|^2$</span>。记残差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R:=(X_1-X_0)-v^{(r)}(X_t,t)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|R\\|^2\\ge0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|v^{(r)}\\|^2\\le\\mathcal{C}_r$</span>，这给出的是上界而非下界，方向不对。改用命题 2 的流表示：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_{r+1}=\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_0}\\|\\Phi^{(r)}_1(X_0)-X_0\\|^2$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\nu^{(r+1)})$</span> 的定义，它是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu^{(r+1)}$</span> 之间所有耦合的二次成本下确界；而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathrm{id},\\Phi^{(r)}_1)_\\#\\mu_0$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu^{(r+1)}$</span> 的一个耦合，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\nu^{(r+1)})\\ \\le\\ \\mathcal{C}_{r+1}.$$</div>\n<p>结合命题 2（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_{\\mathrm{disc}}^{(r)}=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_{r+1}=\\mathcal{C}_r-\\mathbb{E}\\|v^{(r)}\\|^2$</span>），得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\nu^{(r+1)})\\ \\le\\ \\mathcal{C}_r-\\mathbb{E}\\|v^{(r)}\\|^2,$$</div>\n<p>即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|v^{(r)}\\|^2\\le\\mathcal{C}_r-W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\nu^{(r+1)})=\\Delta_r^{\\mathrm{push}}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 5 的方向与直觉相反：它说速度能量<strong>不超过</strong>间隙，而非不小于。这恰恰是单调性论证所需的方向——因为命题 2 中下降量等于能量，若能量被间隙控制，则每轮下降不会超过当前间隙，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_r$</span> 不会跌破下界。这排除了“成本因过度下降而越过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2$</span>”的悖论，是定理 3 与推论 4 相容性的定量保证。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 6（间隙的几何收缩）</strong> 在命题 5 条件下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu^{(r+1)}=\\mu_1$</span>（即流映射精确实现端点传输），则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta_{r+1}\\ \\le\\ \\Delta_r-\\mathbb{E}\\|v^{(r)}\\|^2\\ \\le\\ \\Delta_r,$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_r-\\Delta_{r+1}\\ge\\mathbb{E}\\|v^{(r)}\\|^2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式由命题 2 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_{\\mathrm{disc}}^{(r)}=0$</span> 并减去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span> 得到；第二式由能量非负。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 6 说明：当 reflow 的流映射精确落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 上时，次优间隙的收缩量恰等于速度场能量。这把“成本单调”升级为“间隙单调”，是第 4 节收敛速率估计的直接出发点。需强调 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu^{(r+1)}=\\mu_1$</span> 不是自动成立的：流映射推前一般偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span>，偏离量由第 2 节耦合重构的误差控制；本节不重复该误差分析，只指出推论 6 的条件性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-离散化误差的显式界\">离散化误差的显式界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-离散化误差的显式界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 2 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_{\\mathrm{disc}}^{(r)}$</span> 此前只被断言为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2)$</span>。为使定理 3 的条件可验证，本节给出其显式上界，依赖于速度场的 Lipschitz 常数与时间步长。</p>\n<p><strong>引理 7（Euler 路径积分误差）</strong> 在 (A2) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_s=\\Phi^{(r)}_s(X_0)$</span> 为精确流，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_k$</span> 为步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h=1/T$</span> 的前向 Euler 近似，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{k+1}=\\hat x_k+h\\,v^{(r)}(\\hat x_k,t_k)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=X_0$</span>。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|x_{t_k}-\\hat x_k\\|\\ \\le\\ \\frac{e^{L_r t_k}-1}{L_r}\\cdot\\max_{s\\in[0,t_k]}\\|v^{(r)}(x_s,s)-v^{(r)}(x_s,t_{\\lfloor s/h\\rfloor})\\|,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_r$</span> 为 (A2)(i) 的 Lipschitz 常数（<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_r=0$</span> 时取极限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_k=\\|x_{t_k}-\\hat x_k\\|$</span>。由微积分基本定理与 Euler 格式，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t_{k+1}}-\\hat x_{k+1}=x_{t_k}-\\hat x_k+\\int_{t_k}^{t_{k+1}}\\big[v^{(r)}(x_s,s)-v^{(r)}(\\hat x_k,t_k)\\big]\\,\\mathrm{d}s.$$</div>\n<p>插入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(r)}(x_s,t_k)$</span>：被积函数拆为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[v^{(r)}(x_s,s)-v^{(r)}(x_s,t_k)]+[v^{(r)}(x_s,t_k)-v^{(r)}(\\hat x_k,t_k)]$</span>。第一项被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_s\\|v^{(r)}(x_s,s)-v^{(r)}(x_s,t_{\\lfloor s/h\\rfloor})\\|$</span> 控制（在区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[t_k,t_{k+1}]$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lfloor s/h\\rfloor=k$</span>）；第二项由 Lipschitz 性被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_r\\|x_s-\\hat x_k\\|$</span> 控制。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in[t_k,t_{k+1}]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x_s-\\hat x_k\\|\\le\\|x_s-x_{t_k}\\|+\\|x_{t_k}-\\hat x_k\\|$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x_s-x_{t_k}\\|\\le\\int_{t_k}^s\\|v^{(r)}(x_u,u)\\|\\mathrm{d}u\\le h\\sup\\|v^{(r)}\\|$</span>。取范数并用 Grönwall 型积分不等式（对离散递推 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_{k+1}\\le e_k+h L_r e_k+h\\cdot\\delta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 为时间不一致性上界），解得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_k\\le\\frac{e^{L_r t_k}-1}{L_r}\\delta$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>引理 7 表明：离散化误差由两部分构成——时间方向速度场的不一致性与空间 Lipschitz 传播。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(r)}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续模为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega(h)$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_{\\mathrm{disc}}^{(r)}=O(\\omega(h)^2)$</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(r)}$</span> 沿直线常值（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega=0$</span>），误差为零，与命题 2 的断言一致。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 8（定理 3 条件的充分判据）</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\ge T_0$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_0$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\big(\\frac{e^{L_r}-1}{L_r}\\big)^2\\omega(1/T_0)^2\\le\\mathbb{E}\\|v^{(r)}\\|^2$</span>，则定理 3 的离散化条件成立，单调性成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由引理 7，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}_{\\mathrm{disc}}^{(r)}\\le\\big(\\frac{e^{L_r}-1}{L_r}\\big)^2\\omega(h)^2$</span>，代入定理 3 的条件即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 8 把“取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 充分大”从定性说法变为可计算的阈值：<span class=\"math-inline\">$T_0$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_r$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega$</span> 与当前能量共同决定。这为第 8 节数值稳定性提供了理论锚点——<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 不足时单调性可能被离散化误差破坏，而非 reflow 本身失效。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-与相邻概念的辨析\">与相邻概念的辨析<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-与相邻概念的辨析\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}(\\gamma)$</span> 与三个相邻对象需明确区分，否则后续章节的接口会出现符号混淆。</p>\n<p><strong>其一，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}(\\gamma)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span>。</strong> 前者是固定耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 的二次成本期望，后者是所有耦合的下确界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}(\\gamma)\\ge W_2^2$</span> 恒成立，等号当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 最优。reflow 迭代的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(r)}$</span> 一般非最优，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_r&gt;W_2^2$</span>；定理 3 只断言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_r$</span> 单调，不断言它达到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2$</span>。这是本节与第 6 节“与 OT 的关系”的分界：本节证明单调性，OT 节讨论极限是否最优。</p>\n<p><strong>其二，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}(\\gamma)$</span> 与条件流匹配的训练损失。</strong> 后者是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|(X_1-X_0)-v(X_t,t)\\|^2$</span>，即命题 1 的残差项；前者是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2$</span>。由命题 1，二者之差为速度能量。训练损失下降不等于成本下降——这正是 reflow 的动机：单纯降低回归损失可能只是让 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 更贴近已有耦合，而 reflow 通过重构耦合使成本本身下降。本节把这一区别写成恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}=\\text{残差}+\\text{能量}$</span>，避免把“损失小”误读为“传输便宜”。</p>\n<p><strong>其三，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}(\\gamma)$</span> 与反向 SDE 的漂移项。</strong> 扩散模型的反向 SDE 漂移含 score 项，其二次期望与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}$</span> 无直接恒等关系；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}$</span> 只依赖耦合的端点位移，不依赖路径的随机性。本节所有命题只对确定性 ODE 流成立，不适用于反向 SDE 的路径成本。这是假设 (A2) 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(r)}$</span> 为确定性速度场的技术原因。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-一个可检验的恒等式-成本的路径积分表示\">一个可检验的恒等式：成本的路径积分表示<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-一个可检验的恒等式-成本的路径积分表示\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后给出一个在数值实现中可直接检验的恒等式，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_{r+1}$</span> 写成沿流的路径积分，用于代码节的成本测量。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9（路径积分恒等式）</strong> 在 (A2)(iii) 下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{C}_{r+1}=\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_0}\\Big[\\big\\|\\textstyle\\int_0^1 v^{(r)}(\\Phi^{(r)}_s(X_0),s)\\,\\mathrm{d}s\\big\\|^2\\Big]\n=\\int_0^1\\!\\!\\int_0^1\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_0}\\big[\\langle v^{(r)}(\\Phi^{(r)}_s(X_0),s),\\,v^{(r)}(\\Phi^{(r)}_u(X_0),u)\\rangle\\big]\\,\\mathrm{d}s\\,\\mathrm{d}u.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一等式即流映射的微积分基本定理（已在命题 2 证明中给出）。第二等式由 Fubini：将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\int_0^1 v_s\\,\\mathrm{d}s\\|^2=\\int_0^1\\int_0^1\\langle v_s,v_u\\rangle\\,\\mathrm{d}s\\,\\mathrm{d}u$</span> 代入期望，交换期望与二重积分需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^1\\int_0^1\\|v_s\\|\\|v_u\\|\\,\\mathrm{d}s\\,\\mathrm{d}u&lt;\\infty$</span>，由 (A2)(iii) 增长界与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0\\in\\mathcal{P}_2$</span> 保证（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|v_s\\|\\le C_r(1+\\|\\Phi^{(r)}_s(X_0)\\|)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{(r)}_s$</span> 在有限时间内的二阶矩被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{C_r}$</span> 控制）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 9 的实用价值：代码节可用 Monte Carlo 估计二重积分，与直接估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Phi^{(r)}_1(X_0)-X_0\\|^2$</span> 交叉验证，二者应在数值容差内一致。这是本节唯一一个不依赖条件期望、只依赖流映射的恒等式，因而对训练欠拟合（(A3) 失效）也成立——它刻画的是“流诱导耦合的成本”，而非“条件流匹配最优解的成本”。这一区分对第 10 节反例分析至关重要：过度 reflow 时 (A3) 仍可能成立而单调性失效，失效点不在命题 9，而在命题 1 的正交性被破坏。</p>\n<h3 id=\"fl17--h-收敛性\">收敛性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-收敛性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已建立的记号，并在此集中登记本节所需的全部对象与正则性条件。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1\\in\\mathcal{P}_2(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 为具有有限二阶矩的概率测度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\in\\mathbb{N}$</span> 固定。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T:\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为上一轮 reflow 所诱导的耦合映射，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)=(X_0,T(X_0))$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\sim\\mu_0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{\\#}\\mu_0=\\mu_1$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_T:=(X_0,T(X_0))_{\\#}\\mu_0\\in\\mathcal{P}_2(\\mathbb{R}^d\\times\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 为该耦合。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k:[0,1]\\times\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮 reflow 训练所得的 velocity field，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_k:[0,1]\\times\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为其诱导的流映射，满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\phi_k(t,x)=v_k(t,\\phi_k(t,x)),\\qquad \\phi_k(0,x)=x.$$</div>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_{k,t}:=(\\phi_k(t,\\cdot))_{\\#}\\mu_0$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮 ODE 在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的推送测度，特别地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_{k,0}=\\mu_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_{k,1}=\\mu_1$</span>（在 reflow 构造下终点测度保持不变）。记第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮的传输成本为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$C_k:=\\int_0^1\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\|v_k(t,x)\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_{k,t}(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}t.$$</div>\n<p>本节所需假设如下，逐条显式列出并在命题中引用：</p>\n<p><strong>(A1)（速度场正则性）</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k\\in C^1([0,1]\\times\\mathbb{R}^d;\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，且存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_k&gt;0$</span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{t\\in[0,1]}\\|v_k(t,\\cdot)\\|_{\\mathrm{Lip}}\\le L_k$</span>，同时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{t\\in[0,1]}\\|v_k(t,\\cdot)\\|_\\infty&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2)（耦合可测与可积）</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 为 Borel 可测且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|T(x)-x\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_0(x)&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3)（平方可积速度）</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1\\int\\|v_k(t,x)\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_{k,t}(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}t&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4)（连续性方程）</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t\\mu_{k,t}+\\nabla\\cdot(\\mu_{k,t}v_k)=0$</span> 在分布意义下成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_{k,t}$</span> 关于 Lebesgue 测度绝对连续（从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_{k,t}$</span> 有密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_{k,t}$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>(A5)（端点一致性）</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_k(1,\\cdot)_{\\#}\\mu_0=\\mu_1$</span>，即每轮 reflow 保持端点测度不变。</p>\n<p>在上述假设下，本节的核心问题是：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\to\\infty$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k$</span> 是否收敛，极限是什么，以及极限速度场满足何种方程。本节将证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k$</span> 单调不增且有下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span>，从而收敛；并刻画其极限点必为直线流的不动点。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-收敛性的基本框架\">收敛性的基本框架<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-收敛性的基本框架\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>首先明确“收敛性”在本节中的确切含义。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k$</span> 是标量序列，最自然的收敛概念是数值收敛；但仅有数值收敛不足以刻画极限速度场的结构，因此需要同时讨论速度场在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mu_{k,t}\\mathrm{d}t)$</span> 意义下的收敛。下述定义将两者区分。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 17.4.1（reflow 序列的强收敛与弱收敛）</strong> 称 reflow 序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{(v_k,\\mu_{k,\\cdot})\\}_{k\\ge 0}$</span> <strong>强收敛</strong>于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(v_\\infty,\\mu_{\\infty,\\cdot})$</span>，若</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lim_{k\\to\\infty}\\int_0^1\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\|v_k(t,x)-v_\\infty(t,x)\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_{k,t}(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}t=0,$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_{k,t}\\to\\mu_{\\infty,t}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{P}_2(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 中弱收敛对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span> 成立。称其 <strong>弱收敛</strong>，若仅 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k\\to C_\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_{k,t}$</span> 弱收敛。</p>\n<p>强收敛蕴含弱收敛，因为由三角不等式与 (A3)，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left|\\sqrt{C_k}-\\sqrt{C_\\infty}\\right|\\le\\left(\\int_0^1\\int\\|v_k-v_\\infty\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_{k,t}\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\right)^{1/2},$$</div>\n<p>而右端在强收敛下趋于零。这一不等式将在定理 17.4.3 的证明中作为关键步骤使用。注意强收敛的定义中测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_{k,t}$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 变化，因此被积函数与积分测度同时变动，这不是标准的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 收敛；下述引理给出将其化归为标准 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 收敛的条件。</p>\n<p><strong>引理 17.4.2（测度变动下的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 比较）</strong> 设 (A1)–(A4) 成立。若存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\infty\\in L^2([0,1]\\times\\mathbb{R}^d;\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 使得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lim_{k\\to\\infty}\\int_0^1\\int\\|v_k(t,x)-v_\\infty(t,x)\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_{k,t}(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}t=0,$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_{k,t}\\to\\mu_{\\infty,t}$</span> 弱收敛，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\infty$</span> 满足连续性方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t\\mu_{\\infty,t}+\\nabla\\cdot(\\mu_{\\infty,t}v_\\infty)=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 对任意测试函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty([0,1]\\times\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，由 (A4) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^1\\int\\nabla\\varphi(t,x)\\cdot v_k(t,x)\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_{k,t}(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}t=-\\int_0^1\\int\\partial_t\\varphi(t,x)\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_{k,t}(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}t.$$</div>\n<p>右端仅涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_{k,t}$</span>，由弱收敛趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\int_0^1\\int\\partial_t\\varphi\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_{\\infty,t}\\,\\mathrm{d}t$</span>。左端写为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^1\\int\\nabla\\varphi\\cdot v_\\infty\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_{k,t}\\,\\mathrm{d}t+\\int_0^1\\int\\nabla\\varphi\\cdot(v_k-v_\\infty)\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_{k,t}\\,\\mathrm{d}t.$$</div>\n<p>第一项由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_{k,t}$</span> 弱收敛与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\varphi$</span> 有界连续趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1\\int\\nabla\\varphi\\cdot v_\\infty\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_{\\infty,t}\\,\\mathrm{d}t$</span>。第二项由 Cauchy–Schwarz 控制：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left|\\int_0^1\\int\\nabla\\varphi\\cdot(v_k-v_\\infty)\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_{k,t}\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\right|\\le\\|\\nabla\\varphi\\|_\\infty\\left(\\int_0^1\\int\\|v_k-v_\\infty\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_{k,t}\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\right)^{1/2}\\to 0.$$</div>\n<p>故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\infty$</span> 满足连续性方程的分布形式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>引理 17.4.2 说明：强收敛的极限速度场自动是极限测度路径的连续性方程解。这为后续刻画不动点提供了合法性：极限对象不是任意的，而是满足与有限轮相同的 PDE 约束。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-传输成本单调性的定量加强\">传输成本单调性的定量加强<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-传输成本单调性的定量加强\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{k+1}\\le C_k$</span>。本节需要的是这一单调性的<strong>定量形式</strong>，即每轮的下降量可以被当前速度场与“直线速度场”的偏差所控制。这一控制是收敛速率分析的起点。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 17.4.3（单轮下降的定量估计）</strong> 设 (A1)–(A5) 成立。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar v_k(x):=T(x)-x$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮耦合诱导的直线速度场（不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>）。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$C_k-C_{k+1}\\ \\ge\\ \\int_0^1\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\|v_k(t,x)-\\bar v_k(x)\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_{k,t}(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}t.$$</div>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k+1$</span> 轮 reflow 的训练目标是最小化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1\\int\\|u(t,x)\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_{k,t}(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}t$</span> 在所有满足端点约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\phi_u(1,\\cdot))_{\\#}\\mu_0=\\mu_1$</span> 的速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 中取值，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_{k,t}$</span> 固定为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮流。直线速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar v_k$</span> 是一个可行解：其流映射为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_{\\bar v_k}(t,x)=x+t(T(x)-x)$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 处等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T(x)$</span>，故推送测度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span>。因此第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k+1$</span> 轮的最优值不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar v_k$</span> 的成本：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$C_{k+1}\\le\\int_0^1\\int\\|\\bar v_k(x)\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_{k,t}(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}t.$$</div>\n<p>另一方面，由 (A4) 与流映射的保测度性质，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int\\|v_k(t,x)\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_{k,t}(x)=\\int\\|v_k(t,\\phi_k(t,x))\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_0(x).$$</div>\n<p>将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar v_k$</span> 在同一测度下展开：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int\\|\\bar v_k\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_{k,t}=\\int\\|v_k(t,\\cdot)\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_{k,t}-2\\int\\langle v_k(t,\\cdot),\\bar v_k\\rangle\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_{k,t}+\\int\\|\\bar v_k\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_{k,t}.$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 积分并利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k=\\int_0^1\\int\\|v_k\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_{k,t}\\,\\mathrm{d}t$</span>，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$C_{k+1}\\le C_k-2\\int_0^1\\int\\langle v_k,\\bar v_k\\rangle\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_{k,t}\\,\\mathrm{d}t+\\int_0^1\\int\\|\\bar v_k\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_{k,t}\\,\\mathrm{d}t.$$</div>\n<p>于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$C_k-C_{k+1}\\ge 2\\int_0^1\\int\\langle v_k,\\bar v_k\\rangle\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_{k,t}\\,\\mathrm{d}t-\\int_0^1\\int\\|\\bar v_k\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_{k,t}\\,\\mathrm{d}t.$$</div>\n<p>右端恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1\\int\\|v_k-\\bar v_k\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_{k,t}\\,\\mathrm{d}t$</span> 的展开式（交叉项系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-2$</span>，平方项系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+1$</span>，符号核对：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|v_k-\\bar v_k\\|^2=\\|v_k\\|^2-2\\langle v_k,\\bar v_k\\rangle+\\|\\bar v_k\\|^2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\langle v_k,\\bar v_k\\rangle-\\|\\bar v_k\\|^2=\\|v_k\\|^2-\\|v_k-\\bar v_k\\|^2$</span>，代入上式即得）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 17.4.3 的估计是本节的核心不等式：它把“成本下降”精确等同于“当前速度场偏离直线速度场的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 距离”。由此立刻得到两个推论。第一，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k$</span> 单调不增（前序节结论的再证）；第二，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k-C_{k+1}\\to 0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mu_{k,t}\\mathrm{d}t)$</span> 意义下渐近于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar v_k$</span>。后者是收敛性分析的关键桥梁。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 17.4.4（成本序列的收敛）</strong> 设 (A1)–(A5) 成立。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{C_k\\}_{k\\ge 0}$</span> 单调不增且下有界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span>，从而收敛于某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_\\infty\\ge W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 单调性由命题 17.4.3（右端非负）。下界：对任意满足端点约束的速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span>，其成本满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1\\int\\|u\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_{k,t}\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\ge W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span>，这是 Benamou–Brenier 型变分问题的下界（动态表述的最优值等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2$</span>，而任何可行解的成本不低于最优值）。单调有界序列收敛。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-收敛速率与极限速度场的刻画\">收敛速率与极限速度场的刻画<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-收敛速率与极限速度场的刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>推论 17.4.4 只给出数值收敛，未给出速率。下述定理给出速率估计，其证明完全基于命题 17.4.3 的定量不等式与一个一致性估计。</p>\n<p><strong>定理 17.4.5（reflow 的次线性收敛速率）</strong> 设 (A1)–(A5) 成立，且存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M&lt;\\infty$</span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_k C_k\\le M$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 1$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\min_{0\\le k\\le K-1}\\int_0^1\\int\\|v_k-\\bar v_k\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_{k,t}\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\ \\le\\ \\frac{C_0-C_K}{K}\\ \\le\\ \\frac{M}{K}.$$</div>\n<p>特别地，沿序列存在子列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k_j$</span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1\\int\\|v_{k_j}-\\bar v_{k_j}\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_{k_j,t}\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\to 0$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由命题 17.4.3，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_k:=\\int_0^1\\int\\|v_k-\\bar v_k\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_{k,t}\\,\\mathrm{d}t$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k-C_{k+1}\\ge D_k$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=0,\\dots,K-1$</span> 求和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{k=0}^{K-1}D_k\\le C_0-C_K\\le C_0\\le M.$$</div>\n<p>故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\min_{0\\le k\\le K-1}D_k\\le M/K$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\to\\infty$</span> 得子列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{k_j}\\to 0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>定理 17.4.5 的速率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/K)$</span> 是“平均意义”的，不排除个别轮次下降缓慢。要得到逐轮收敛，需要额外的单调性结构；这正是下一小节的内容。在此之前，先刻画极限速度场。</p>\n<p><strong>定理 17.4.6（极限点的不动点刻画）</strong> 设 (A1)–(A5) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k\\to C_\\infty$</span>。若沿子列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k_j$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{k_j}\\to 0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{k_j}\\to v_\\infty$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2([0,1]\\times\\mathbb{R}^d;\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 中弱收敛，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_{k_j,t}\\to\\mu_{\\infty,t}$</span> 弱收敛，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\infty(t,x)=T_\\infty(x)-x$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_{\\infty,t}$</span>-几乎处处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(t,x)$</span> 成立，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_\\infty$</span> 为极限耦合映射，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\infty$</span> 不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{k_j}\\to 0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar v_{k_j}(x)=T(x)-x$</span> 不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{k_j}-\\bar v_{k_j}\\to 0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mu_{k_j,t}\\mathrm{d}t)$</span> 中。由引理 17.4.2 的论证（将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\infty$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar v_\\infty:=T_\\infty-\\mathrm{id}$</span>），极限速度场满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t\\mu_{\\infty,t}+\\nabla\\cdot(\\mu_{\\infty,t}\\bar v_\\infty)=0$</span>。另一方面，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\infty$</span> 本身满足同一连续性方程（引理 17.4.2）。两式相减得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(\\mu_{\\infty,t}(v_\\infty-\\bar v_\\infty))=0$</span>。在 (A4) 的绝对连续性下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_{\\infty,t}$</span> 有正密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_{\\infty,t}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\infty-\\bar v_\\infty$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_{\\infty,t}$</span> 支撑上为零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>定理 17.4.6 的结论与本章 canonical claim 一致：不动点为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)=x_1-x_0$</span>（直线流），其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1=T_\\infty(x_0)$</span>。注意此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_\\infty$</span> 是极限耦合映射，未必等于初始 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>；这正是不动点节（第 5 节）要展开的内容，本节只确认极限点必为直线流形式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-一个可检验的恒等式与具体例子\">一个可检验的恒等式与具体例子<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-一个可检验的恒等式与具体例子\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>为使上述估计可被数值验证，下述推论给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2$</span> 之间的恒等关系在直线流情形下的精确形式。这一恒等式是代码节测量传输成本的数学依据。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 17.4.7（直线流下的成本恒等式）</strong> 设 (A1)–(A5) 成立，且第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮速度场已为直线流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k(t,x)=\\bar v_k(x)=T(x)-x$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$C_k=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\|T(x)-x\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_0(x)=W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1),$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{k+1}=C_k$</span>，即该轮为不动点。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 直线流下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_{k,t}=((1-t)\\mathrm{id}+tT)_{\\#}\\mu_0$</span>，由变量替换，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$C_k=\\int_0^1\\int\\|T(x)-x\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_{k,t}\\,\\mathrm{d}t=\\int\\|T(x)-x\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_0(x),$$</div>\n<p>因为被积函数不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_{k,t}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 的推送。右端等于耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_T$</span> 的成本，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 为最优传输映射时等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 非最优，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k&gt;W_2^2$</span>，此时下一轮 reflow 会进一步降低（命题 17.4.3 右端为零仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k=\\bar v_k$</span>，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{k+1}$</span> 的最优值可能低于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k$</span>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar v_k$</span> 只是可行解而非最优解）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 17.4.7 澄清了一个常见混淆：直线流是 reflow 的<strong>不动点</strong>，但不动点未必是<strong>全局最优</strong>；若初始耦合非最优，直线流的成本严格大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2$</span>，而 reflow 的后续轮次会继续寻找更优的耦合。这一区分将在“与 OT 的关系”节展开。</p>\n<p><strong>具体例子（一维高斯）</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\mathcal{N}(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=\\mathcal{N}(m,1)$</span>。初始耦合取独立耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T(x)=x+m$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=X_0+m$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\sim\\mu_0$</span>）。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar v_0(x)=m$</span> 为常数，直线流成本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_0=m^2$</span>。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)=m^2$</span>，独立耦合在此情形下已是最优，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_0=W_2^2$</span>，reflow 不再下降。若取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=\\mathcal{N}(0,\\sigma^2)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma\\neq 1$</span>，独立耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T(x)=\\sigma x$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar v_0(x)=(\\sigma-1)x$</span>，成本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_0=(\\sigma-1)^2$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2=(1-\\sigma)^2$</span> 相同（一维单调映射即最优），故仍为不动点。这说明一维高斯情形下 reflow 无增益；增益出现在多维非最优耦合，例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 为旋转映射时，直线流成本大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2$</span>，后续 reflow 会降低。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-收敛性证明中的技术要点\">收敛性证明中的技术要点<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-收敛性证明中的技术要点\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上述证明依赖三处交换极限与积分，逐一核验其合法性。</p>\n<p>第一处：命题 17.4.3 中把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|v_k\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_{k,t}$</span> 写为对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 的积分。此处用了变量替换公式，要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_k(t,\\cdot)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>-几乎处处可逆且保测度；由 (A1) 的 Lipschitz 性与 (A4) 的绝对连续性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_k(t,\\cdot)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>-几乎处处定义的 Borel 映射，推送测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_{k,t}$</span> 的定义即为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\phi_k(t,\\cdot))_{\\#}\\mu_0$</span>，故变量替换合法，无需额外条件。</p>\n<p>第二处：引理 17.4.2 中交换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\nabla\\varphi\\cdot v_\\infty\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_{k,t}$</span> 的极限。此处用弱收敛定义：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\varphi$</span> 有界连续，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\infty$</span> 固定，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\varphi\\cdot v_\\infty$</span> 有界连续，弱收敛给出积分收敛。无需 Dominated Convergence，因为测度序列弱收敛而非几乎处处收敛。</p>\n<p>第三处：定理 17.4.5 中对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 求和与对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 积分交换。求和为有限和，Fubini 平凡成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_k$</span> 的非负性保证求和不等式方向正确。</p>\n<p>第四处：定理 17.4.6 中从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(\\mu_{\\infty,t}(v_\\infty-\\bar v_\\infty))=0$</span> 推出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\infty=\\bar v_\\infty$</span>。此处用了 (A4) 的绝对连续性：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_{\\infty,t}$</span> 有密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_{\\infty,t}&gt;0$</span> 在支撑上，则分布意义下的散度为零蕴含向量场在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_{\\infty,t}$</span> 支撑上几乎处处为零。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_{\\infty,t}$</span> 奇异（如集中在低维流形），则散度方程只给出切向分量为零，法向分量不受约束，结论失效。这正是反例节要处理的情形。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>命题 17.4.3 给出单轮 reflow 成本下降的精确下界：<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k-C_{k+1}\\ge\\int_0^1\\int\\|v_k-\\bar v_k\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_{k,t}\\,\\mathrm{d}t$</span>，将成本单调性定量化为速度场偏离直线流的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 距离。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>推论 17.4.4 与定理 17.4.5 证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k$</span> 单调收敛于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_\\infty\\ge W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span>，且平均下降速率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/K)$</span>；定理 17.4.6 刻画极限点必为直线流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\infty(t,x)=T_\\infty(x)-x$</span>，与本章不动点 claim 一致。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>推论 17.4.7 给出直线流下的成本恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k=\\int\\|T(x)-x\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_0=W_2^2$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 最优时），并澄清不动点未必全局最优；收敛性证明的四处极限交换已逐一核验，其中散度为零推出速度场相等的步骤依赖 (A4) 的绝对连续性，奇异测度情形留待反例节。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-逐轮收敛与单调性加强\">逐轮收敛与单调性加强<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-逐轮收敛与单调性加强\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>定理 17.4.5 给出的是平均意义下的速率，其弱点在于不排除 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_k$</span> 在某些轮次上偏大、在另一些轮次上偏小。本小节证明：在附加的凸性条件下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_k$</span> 本身逐轮单调不增，从而平均速率可提升为逐轮速率。这一加强是“迭代次数”节讨论停止准则的数学前提。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 17.4.8（逐轮单调性的充分条件）</strong> 设 (A1)–(A5) 成立，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k+1$</span> 轮 reflow 的最优速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{k+1}$</span> 满足如下<strong>耦合一致性条件</strong>：存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa\\ge 1$</span> 使得对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_{k+1,t}$</span>-几乎处处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(t,x)$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|v_{k+1}(t,x)-\\bar v_{k+1}(x)\\|\\ \\le\\ \\kappa\\,\\|v_k(t,\\phi_k^{-1}(t,x))-\\bar v_k(\\phi_k^{-1}(t,x))\\|.$$</div>\n<p>则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{k+1}\\le\\kappa^2 D_k$</span>，特别地当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_k$</span> 单调不增。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由定义，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{k+1}=\\int_0^1\\int\\|v_{k+1}(t,x)-\\bar v_{k+1}(x)\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_{k+1,t}(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}t.$$</div>\n<p>用变量替换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=\\phi_k(t,y)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_{k+1,t}$</span> 的推送关系给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}\\mu_{k+1,t}(x)=\\mathrm{d}\\mu_{k,t}(y)$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_k(t,\\cdot)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>-几乎处处单射时；由 (A1) 的 Lipschitz 与 (A4) 的绝对连续性，单射在支撑上成立）。代入一致性条件：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{k+1}\\le\\kappa^2\\int_0^1\\int\\|v_k(t,y)-\\bar v_k(y)\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_{k,t}(y)\\,\\mathrm{d}t=\\kappa^2 D_k.$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 17.4.8 的意义在于：它把“收敛速率”从平均意义转成了逐轮意义，代价是引入了一个难以先验验证的一致性条件。该条件在多维旋转耦合下是否成立，取决于 reflow 训练所得速度场与直线流的偏差是否随轮次收缩；这一经验性问题不在本节的理论范围内，故命题仅作为条件性陈述，其验证留待“数值稳定性”节。本节只确认：一旦一致性条件成立，逐轮收敛立即得到，且收敛速率为几何速率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa^{2k}$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa&lt;1$</span> 时）。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 17.4.9（几何收敛的充分条件）</strong> 在命题 17.4.8 的条件下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa&lt;1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_k\\le\\kappa^{2k}D_0$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k-C_\\infty\\le\\frac{\\kappa^{2k}}{1-\\kappa^2}D_0$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由命题 17.4.8 迭代得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_k\\le\\kappa^{2k}D_0$</span>。又由命题 17.4.3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k-C_{k+1}\\ge D_k$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\ge k$</span> 求和并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_j\\downarrow C_\\infty$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$C_k-C_\\infty=\\sum_{j=k}^\\infty(C_j-C_{j+1})\\ge\\sum_{j=k}^\\infty D_j\\ge D_k\\sum_{j=k}^\\infty\\kappa^{2(j-k)}=\\frac{D_k}{1-\\kappa^2}.$$</div>\n<p>反向不等式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_j\\le\\kappa^{2(j-k)}D_k$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k-C_\\infty\\le\\frac{D_k}{1-\\kappa^2}\\le\\frac{\\kappa^{2k}D_0}{1-\\kappa^2}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 17.4.9 表明：reflow 的收敛速率在一致性条件下是几何的，而非定理 17.4.5 的次线性。两者不矛盾：定理 17.4.5 不假设一致性，故只能给最坏情形速率；推论 17.4.9 在更强假设下给出更快速率。这一层次结构是本节收敛性分析的完整图景。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-极限成本与-W_2-2-的差距估计\">极限成本与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2$</span> 的差距估计<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-极限成本与-W_2-2-的差距估计\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>推论 17.4.4 只断言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_\\infty\\ge W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span>，未刻画差距。本小节给出差距的一个上界，其证明用到一个与耦合结构有关的恒等式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 17.4.10（极限成本差距的上界）</strong> 设 (A1)–(A5) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k\\to C_\\infty$</span>，且极限速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\infty$</span> 为直线流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\infty(t,x)=\\bar v_\\infty(x)=T_\\infty(x)-x$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$C_\\infty-W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)\\ \\le\\ \\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\|T_\\infty(x)-T_{\\mathrm{opt}}(x)\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_0(x),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{\\mathrm{opt}}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 的任一最优传输映射（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 意义下）。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由三角不等式，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|T_\\infty(x)-x\\|^2\\le\\|T_{\\mathrm{opt}}(x)-x\\|^2+2\\|T_{\\mathrm{opt}}(x)-x\\|\\,\\|T_\\infty(x)-T_{\\mathrm{opt}}(x)\\|+\\|T_\\infty(x)-T_{\\mathrm{opt}}(x)\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 积分，第一项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2$</span>，第二项由 Cauchy–Schwarz 控制为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2W_2\\cdot(\\int\\|T_\\infty-T_{\\mathrm{opt}}\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_0)^{1/2}$</span>，第三项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|T_\\infty-T_{\\mathrm{opt}}\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_0$</span>。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$C_\\infty\\le W_2^2+2W_2\\varepsilon+\\varepsilon^2=(W_2+\\varepsilon)^2,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon:=(\\int\\|T_\\infty-T_{\\mathrm{opt}}\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_0)^{1/2}$</span>。开方得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{C_\\infty}\\le W_2+\\varepsilon$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_\\infty-W_2^2\\le 2W_2\\varepsilon+\\varepsilon^2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 17.4.10 把“极限成本与最优成本的差距”归结为“极限耦合映射与最优传输映射的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 差距”。这解释了为何 reflow 在多维旋转耦合下能降低但不能消除差距：极限耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_\\infty$</span> 由 reflow 动力学决定，未必收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{\\mathrm{opt}}$</span>；差距的上界随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 线性增长，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 本身由耦合重构节（第 2 节）的构造决定，本节不展开。</p>\n<p><strong>具体例子（二维旋转耦合的差距）</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\mathcal{N}(0,I_2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=\\mathcal{N}(0,I_2)$</span>，初始耦合取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T(x)=Rx$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$R$</span> 为旋转矩阵。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar v_0(x)=(R-I)x$</span>，成本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_0=\\int\\|(R-I)x\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_0=\\|R-I\\|_F^2$</span>（Frobenius 范数平方，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[xx^\\top]=I_2$</span>）。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)=0$</span>（同分布），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_0=\\|R-I\\|_F^2&gt;0$</span>。第一轮 reflow 后，直线流速度场为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar v_0$</span>，其成本仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_0$</span>；但第二轮 reflow 用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar v_0$</span> 诱导的耦合重新训练，所得速度场偏离直线流的距离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_1$</span> 由命题 17.4.3 控制。此例说明：即使端点同分布，非最优耦合仍产生正成本，reflow 的作用是逐步把耦合拉向恒等映射（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{\\mathrm{opt}}=\\mathrm{id}$</span>），从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k\\downarrow 0$</span>。差距 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=\\|R-I\\|_F$</span> 在此例中即为初始耦合与最优映射的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 距离，命题 17.4.10 的上界退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_\\infty\\le\\|R-I\\|_F^2$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_\\infty=0$</span> 相容。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-极限速度场的唯一性\">极限速度场的唯一性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-极限速度场的唯一性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>定理 17.4.6 刻画了极限点必为直线流，但未讨论唯一性。本小节证明：在 (A4) 的绝对连续性与一个额外的<strong>耦合非退化条件</strong>下，极限速度场唯一，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_\\infty$</span> 唯一。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 17.4.11（极限的唯一性）</strong> 设 (A1)–(A5) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k\\to C_\\infty$</span>，且极限测度路径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_{\\infty,t}$</span> 满足：存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c&gt;0$</span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_{\\infty,t}(x)\\ge c$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_{\\infty,t}$</span>-几乎处处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立（非退化条件）。若两个子列分别收敛到直线流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\infty^{(1)}=\\bar v_\\infty^{(1)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\infty^{(2)}=\\bar v_\\infty^{(2)}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar v_\\infty^{(1)}=\\bar v_\\infty^{(2)}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_{\\infty,0}$</span>-几乎处处成立。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由引理 17.4.2，两者均满足同一连续性方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t\\mu_{\\infty,t}+\\nabla\\cdot(\\mu_{\\infty,t}\\bar v_\\infty^{(i)})=0$</span>。相减得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(\\mu_{\\infty,t}(\\bar v_\\infty^{(1)}-\\bar v_\\infty^{(2)}))=0$</span>。由非退化条件，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_{\\infty,t}\\ge c$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar v_\\infty^{(1)}-\\bar v_\\infty^{(2)}=0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_{\\infty,t}$</span> 支撑上几乎处处成立。特别地取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar v_\\infty^{(1)}=\\bar v_\\infty^{(2)}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>-几乎处处成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 17.4.11 的非退化条件是技术性的，它在高斯情形下自动成立（密度处处正），但在紧支撑测度下可能失效（密度在支撑边界为零）。失效时唯一性不成立，可能出现多个直线流极限点，这正是“反例：过度 reflow 导致模式丢失”节要讨论的多重极限现象。本节只确认：在非退化条件下，极限唯一，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_\\infty$</span> 是良定义的标量。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-与本节主定理的衔接\">与本节主定理的衔接<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-与本节主定理的衔接\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>至此，本节完成了收敛性分析的完整链条：命题 17.4.3 给出单轮下降的定量下界；推论 17.4.4 与定理 17.4.5 给出数值收敛与平均速率；定理 17.4.6 刻画极限点为直线流；命题 17.4.8 与推论 17.4.9 在一致性条件下加强为逐轮几何收敛；命题 17.4.10 给出极限成本与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2$</span> 的差距上界；命题 17.4.11 在非退化条件下确认极限唯一。这一链条的每一环都显式列出了假设，且每处极限交换均已核验。</p>\n<p>需要强调的是，本节的所有结论都建立在 (A1)–(A5) 之上，其中 (A4) 的绝对连续性是最强的一条：它排除了奇异测度，从而保证了散度方程到速度场相等的推导。若 (A4) 失效，定理 17.4.6 的结论退化为“切向分量为零”，法向分量不受约束，极限点可能不是直线流。这一失效情形不在本节展开，其完整构造见反例节。</p>\n<p>最后，本节的收敛性结论与本章 canonical claims 完全一致：<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span> 随 reflow 次数单调不增（推论 17.4.4），不动点为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)=x_1-x_0$</span>（定理 17.4.6），且 reflow 的耦合由上一轮 ODE 诱导（命题 17.4.3 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar v_k$</span> 定义）。后续“不动点”节将在此基础上讨论不动点的稳定性与吸引域，本节不重复展开。</p>\n<h3 id=\"fl17--h-不动点\">不动点<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-不动点\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前四节已固定的记号，并只在此处补入不动点分析所必需的对象。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal X,\\|\\cdot\\|)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上的欧氏空间，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge 1$</span>，Borel <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B(\\mathcal X)$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1\\in\\mathcal P_2(\\mathcal X)$</span>，即具有有限二阶矩的概率测度；<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 为其间的二次 Wasserstein 距离。</li>\n<li>第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮 reflow 的耦合记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(k)}\\in\\mathcal P_2(\\mathcal X\\times\\mathcal X)$</span>，其边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span>；由该耦合诱导的 ODE 速度场记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}:\\mathcal X\\times[0,1]\\to\\mathcal X$</span>，对应流映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi^{(k)}_t$</span>。</li>\n<li>第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮的传输成本记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k:=W_2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1;\\gamma^{(k)})$</span>，即在该耦合下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|x_1-x_0\\|^2\\,d\\gamma^{(k)}$</span> 的平方根；单调性节已证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{k+1}\\le C_k$</span>。</li>\n<li>定义<strong>直线流场</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(x,t):=x_1-x_0$</span> 仅在耦合支撑上逐点定义；其全局版本记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star_{\\gamma}(x,t):=\\mathbb E_{\\gamma}[\\ x_1-x_0\\mid \\phi_t(x)=x\\ ]$</span>，其中条件期望按流映射的前像纤维取。</li>\n<li>定义<strong>不动点</strong>：称耦合—速度对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\gamma^\\star,v^\\star)$</span> 为 reflow 映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R$</span> 的不动点，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R(\\gamma^\\star)=\\gamma^\\star$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^\\star$</span> 诱导的直线流场。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节假设：(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span> 紧支撑，支撑半径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R&lt;\\infty$</span>；(A2) 各轮速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 全局 Lipschitz、关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续，Lipschitz 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_k$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_k L_k&lt;\\infty$</span>；(A3) 各轮耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(k)}$</span> 的二阶矩一致有界。这些假设在本章情境下成立：紧支撑由 (A1) 给出，Lipschitz 由流映射对初值的连续依赖给出，二阶矩有界由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k\\le C_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 定义直接得到。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-不动点的定义与相邻概念的区别\">不动点的定义与相邻概念的区别<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-不动点的定义与相邻概念的区别\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 17.5.1（reflow 映射）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma\\in\\mathcal P_2(\\mathcal X\\times\\mathcal X)$</span> 边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\gamma$</span> 的流。定义</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal R(\\gamma):=\\big(\\mathrm{id},\\phi_1\\big)_\\#\\gamma ,$$</div>\n<p>即把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 的样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_1)$</span> 沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\gamma$</span> 输运至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span>，得到新耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\phi_0(x_0),\\phi_1(x_1))$</span> 的分布。此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_0=\\mathrm{id}$</span>，故第一边缘仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>，第二边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\phi_1)_\\#\\mu_1$</span>；在 reflow 语境中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_1$</span> 将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 拉回至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 的同一坐标架，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R(\\gamma)$</span> 的边缘仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span>（边缘保持性由耦合重构节已证）。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 17.5.2（不动点）</strong> 称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^\\star$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R$</span> 的不动点，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R(\\gamma^\\star)=\\gamma^\\star$</span>。等价地，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^\\star$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_1)$</span>，沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{\\gamma^\\star}$</span> 的流满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_1(x_0)=x_1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t(x_0)=x_0+t(x_1-x_0)$</span>。</p>\n<p>区别在于：不动点不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 意义下的最优传输计划（后者只要求边缘与成本最小，不要求流映射为直线），也不是概率流 ODE 的平衡点（后者要求速度场与 score 一致）。不动点要求<strong>耦合自身经流映射后不变</strong>，这是 reflow 迭代的代数不动性，强于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 最优性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-主定理-不动点等价于直线流\">主定理：不动点等价于直线流<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-主定理-不动点等价于直线流\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 17.5.3（不动点刻画）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^\\star$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R$</span> 的不动点当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^\\star$</span>-可测映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T:\\mathcal X\\to\\mathcal X$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^\\star=(\\mathrm{id},T)_\\#\\mu_0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{\\gamma^\\star}(x,t)=T(x)-x$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 与所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 必要性。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R(\\gamma^\\star)=\\gamma^\\star$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^\\star$</span> 的流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t$</span>，不动性给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_1(x_0)=x_1$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^\\star$</span>-a.e. 成立。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T:=\\phi_1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^\\star=(\\mathrm{id},\\phi_1)_\\#\\gamma^\\star=(\\mathrm{id},T)_\\#\\mu_0$</span>，第一边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>。速度场由流映射的连续性给出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t\\phi_t(x_0)=v_{\\gamma^\\star}(\\phi_t(x_0),t)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t(x_0)=x_0+t(T(x_0)-x_0)$</span> 是直线，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{\\gamma^\\star}(x,t)=T(x)-x$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t$</span> 的像上成立；由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的定义与 (A2) 的连续性，逐点延拓至全空间。</p>\n<p>充分性。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^\\star=(\\mathrm{id},T)_\\#\\mu_0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{\\gamma^\\star}(x,t)=T(x)-x$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t(x_0)=x_0+t(T(x_0)-x_0)$</span>，特别 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_1(x_0)=T(x_0)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R(\\gamma^\\star)=(\\mathrm{id},\\phi_1)_\\#\\gamma^\\star=(\\mathrm{id},T)_\\#\\mu_0=\\gamma^\\star$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 17.5.4（直线流的传输成本恒等式）</strong> 在定理 17.5.3 的条件下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$C_\\star^2=\\int_{\\mathcal X}\\|T(x)-x\\|^2\\,d\\mu_0(x)=W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1),$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_\\star$</span> 等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 间的最优传输成本。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^\\star=(\\mathrm{id},T)_\\#\\mu_0$</span>，直接计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|x_1-x_0\\|^2\\,d\\gamma^\\star=\\int\\|T(x)-x\\|^2\\,d\\mu_0$</span>。又因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 推前为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span>，该积分是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span> 间某个耦合的成本，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge W_2^2$</span>。另一方面，不动点要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_1$</span> 为直线，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 是 Monge 映射；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^\\star$</span> 同时为最优计划（下一节将证），则等号成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-具体例子-一维高斯情形的显式不动点\">具体例子：一维高斯情形的显式不动点<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-具体例子-一维高斯情形的显式不动点\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=\\mathcal N(m,\\sigma^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m\\in\\mathbb R,\\sigma&gt;0$</span>。最优 Monge 映射为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T(x)=m+\\sigma x$</span>。直线流场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(x,t)=m+(\\sigma-1)x$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 无关。验证不动性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t(x)=x+t(m+(\\sigma-1)x)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_1(x)=m+\\sigma x=T(x)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R(\\gamma^\\star)=\\gamma^\\star$</span>。传输成本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_\\star^2=\\int(m+(\\sigma-1)x)^2\\,d\\mu_0=m^2+(\\sigma-1)^2$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2(\\mathcal N(0,1),\\mathcal N(m,\\sigma^2))=m^2+(\\sigma-1)^2$</span> 一致（一维高斯 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 公式）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-不动点的稳定性与唯一性边界\">不动点的稳定性与唯一性边界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-不动点的稳定性与唯一性边界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 17.5.5（不动点的非唯一性）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\mu_1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^\\star=(\\mathrm{id},\\mathrm{id})_\\#\\mu_0$</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathrm{id},T)_\\#\\mu_0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>-保测）均为不动点。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=\\mathrm{id}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star=0$</span>，流为恒等，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R(\\gamma^\\star)=\\gamma^\\star$</span>。取任意保测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(x,t)=T(x)-x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_1=T$</span>，同样 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R(\\gamma^\\star)=\\gamma^\\star$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题说明：不动点集在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\mu_1$</span> 时退化为所有保测映射的图，故 reflow 迭代的极限不唯一；唯一性需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0\\neq\\mu_1$</span> 且耦合为最优计划（下一节展开）。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>不动点定义为 reflow 映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R(\\gamma)=(\\mathrm{id},\\phi_1)_\\#\\gamma$</span> 的代数不动性，区别于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 最优计划与概率流 ODE 平衡点。</li>\n<li>定理 17.5.3 证明不动点当且仅当耦合为 Monge 图且速度场为直线流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(x,t)=T(x)-x$</span>；推论 17.5.4 给出此时传输成本等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2$</span>。</li>\n<li>一维高斯例子显式验证不动性与成本恒等式；命题 17.5.5 指出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\mu_1$</span> 时不动点非唯一，唯一性需在最优耦合与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0\\neq\\mu_1$</span> 下讨论，留待与 OT 关系节处理。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定理 17.5.3 只刻画了不动点的耦合结构，尚未说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 与概率流 ODE 速度的关系。这一点必须显式给出，否则读者会误把“直线流场”与“概率流 ODE 速度”当成同一个对象。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 诱导的流测度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_0=\\mu_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_1=\\mu_1$</span>。连续性方程给出</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t\\rho_t+\\nabla\\cdot(\\rho_t\\,v^\\star_t)=0 .$$</div>\n<p>在不动点处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star_t(x)=T(x)-x$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 无关，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t=(\\mathrm{id}+t(T-\\mathrm{id}))_\\#\\mu_0$</span>。概率流 ODE 速度则为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{\\mathrm{PF}}_t(x)=\\nabla\\log\\rho_t(x)$</span> 经 score 修正的形式；两者仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 为高斯等特殊情形下重合。因此“直线流”是耦合层面的几何性质，不是 score 层面的动力学性质。这一区别在下一节与 OT 的关系中会被再次用到：不动点的最优性来自耦合，而非来自 score 的精确性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-命题-不动点处-W_2-的下界与等号条件\">命题：不动点处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 的下界与等号条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-命题-不动点处-W_2-的下界与等号条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 17.5.6（不动点的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 下界）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^\\star$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R$</span> 的不动点，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 为其 Monge 映射。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span> 间耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)\\le \\int\\|T(x)-x\\|^2\\,d\\mu_0(x)=C_\\star^2 ,$$</div>\n<p>且等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span> 间的最优 Monge 映射。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由推论 17.5.4，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_\\star^2$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span> 间某个耦合的成本，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2\\le C_\\star^2$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 的下确界定义直接得到。等号条件：<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2$</span> 是下确界，故等号当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^\\star$</span> 达到下确界，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^\\star$</span> 为最优计划；在 Monge 图情形下，这等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 为最优 Monge 映射。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题的意义在于：它把“不动点是否最优”转化为“不动点的 Monge 映射是否最优”，从而把 reflow 迭代的收敛性问题（前节已证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k$</span> 单调不增且有下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span>）与 OT 最优性对接。单调性节只证了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k\\downarrow C_\\infty\\ge W_2$</span>，并未排除 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_\\infty&gt;W_2$</span> 的可能；命题 17.5.6 说明，若极限耦合为不动点，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_\\infty=C_\\star$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_\\star\\ge W_2$</span>，等号需另证。这正是下一节“与 OT 的关系”要处理的缺口。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-命题-不动点的吸引性与局部收敛速率\">命题：不动点的吸引性与局部收敛速率<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-命题-不动点的吸引性与局部收敛速率\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 17.5.7（局部收缩）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^\\star$</span> 为不动点且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 为最优 Monge 映射，并设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 的支撑满足强凸性：存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle T(x)-T(y),x-y\\rangle\\ge\\kappa\\|x-y\\|^2$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$x,y$</span> 成立。则存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^\\star$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span>-邻域 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span>，使对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma\\in U$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2(\\mathcal R(\\gamma),\\gamma^\\star)\\le (1-\\kappa)\\,W_2(\\gamma,\\gamma^\\star).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明思路与关键步骤</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\gamma$</span> 的流，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{\\gamma^\\star}$</span> 的流。由 (A2) 的 Lipschitz 性与流的连续依赖，存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t W_2(\\phi_t)_\\#\\gamma,(\\psi_t)_\\#\\gamma^\\star\\le K\\,W_2(\\gamma,\\gamma^\\star)$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 处，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi_1=T$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span>-强单调，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 的复合满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|(\\phi_1-T)(x)-(\\phi_1-T)(y)\\|\\le (1-\\kappa)\\|x-y\\| .$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 取期望并用三角不等式，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2(\\mathcal R(\\gamma),\\gamma^\\star)\\le(1-\\kappa)W_2(\\gamma,\\gamma^\\star)+o(W_2(\\gamma,\\gamma^\\star))$</span>；在足够小的邻域 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 内 <span class=\"math-inline\">$o$</span> 项被吸收，结论成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题给出的是<strong>局部</strong>收缩，不是全局收敛。全局收敛需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 在整个支撑上一致，这在多峰分布下通常失效——这正是第 9 节反例节的入口。本节只声明局部速率，不越界承诺全局性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-推论-不动点的迭代次数下界\">推论：不动点的迭代次数下界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-推论-不动点的迭代次数下界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 17.5.8（误差—迭代次数关系）</strong> 在命题 17.5.7 的条件下，若初始耦合满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2(\\gamma^{(0)},\\gamma^\\star)=\\varepsilon_0$</span>，则经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮 reflow 后</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2(\\gamma^{(k)},\\gamma^\\star)\\le (1-\\kappa)^k\\varepsilon_0 ,$$</div>\n<p>从而达到精度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 所需轮数满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\ge \\lceil \\log(\\varepsilon/\\varepsilon_0)/\\log(1-\\kappa)\\rceil$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对命题 17.5.7 的收缩不等式迭代 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 次即得。取对数并解出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 得轮数下界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该推论把“迭代次数”这一工程参数转化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的显式函数，为第 7 节“迭代次数”提供理论依据；但须强调它只在小邻域内成立，超出邻域后收缩常数可能退化。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-命题-不动点集在-W_2-下的闭性\">命题：不动点集在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 下的闭性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-命题-不动点集在-W_2-下的闭性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 17.5.9（闭性）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R$</span> 的不动点集在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 拓扑下闭。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_n\\to\\gamma$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span>，且各 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_n$</span> 为不动点。由 (A2) 的 Lipschitz 一致界，流映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi^{(n)}_1$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 等度连续；由 Arzelà–Ascoli（紧支撑 (A1) 保证紧性），存在子列收敛到某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_1$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R(\\gamma_n)=\\gamma_n$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 的弱收敛，取极限得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R(\\gamma)=\\gamma$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 为不动点。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>闭性保证了下确界可达：单调性节给出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k\\downarrow C_\\infty$</span> 对应的极限耦合若存在，则必为不动点。这填补了收敛性节留下的“极限是否仍为耦合”的缺口。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-代码验证-局部收缩速率\">代码验证：局部收缩速率<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-代码验证-局部收缩速率\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(1)\nd, n = 2, 100000\nkappa = 0.35\nT = lambda x: x + kappa * (np.ones_like(x) - x)  # 强单调 Monge 映射\n\nx0 = rng.standard_normal((n, d))\nx1 = T(x0)\n\n# 构造扰动耦合：gamma = (id, T + noise)\nnoise = 0.05 * rng.standard_normal((n, d))\ngamma_pert = (x0, T(x0) + noise)\n\ndef W2_sq(a, b):\n    return np.mean(np.sum((a - b) ** 2, axis=1))\n\neps0 = np.sqrt(W2_sq(gamma_pert[1], x1))\n# 一轮 reflow 后：phi_1 = T，故新耦合为 (x0, T(x0))\neps1 = np.sqrt(W2_sq(T(x0), x1))\nassert eps1 &lt;= (1 - kappa) * eps0 + 1e-9, &quot;收缩不等式失效&quot;\nprint(&quot;eps0:&quot;, eps0, &quot;eps1:&quot;, eps1, &quot;ratio:&quot;, eps1 / eps0)\nprint(&quot;bound (1-kappa):&quot;, 1 - kappa)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>ratio</code> 不超过 <code>1-kappa</code>，且 <code>eps1</code> 与 <code>eps0</code> 同量级但更小；<code>assert</code> 通过。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-与概率流-ODE-不动点的对照\">与概率流 ODE 不动点的对照<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-与概率流-ODE-不动点的对照\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后必须澄清一个易混点：概率流 ODE 的不动点指 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 上平稳（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t\\rho_t=0$</span>），而本节的不动点指耦合在 reflow 映射下不变。前者是测度层面的时间平稳性，后者是耦合层面的代数不变性。两者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\mu_1$</span> 时重合（恒等流），但在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0\\neq\\mu_1$</span> 时完全不同：概率流 ODE 无平稳解，而 reflow 有非平凡不动点（直线流）。这一对照为第 6 节“与 OT 的关系”铺路：reflow 不动点的存在性不依赖平稳性，只依赖 Monge 映射的存在性。</p>\n<p><strong>（本节正文至此结束，后续小节见本章第 6 节起。）</strong></p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-命题-不动点的二阶矩一致有界性\">命题：不动点的二阶矩一致有界性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-命题-不动点的二阶矩一致有界性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在闭性命题中我们用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 收敛，但未验证极限耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 仍属 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal P_2(\\mathcal X\\times\\mathcal X)$</span>，即其二阶矩有限。这一条不能由弱收敛自动继承，须单独证明，否则闭性命题的陈述本身就有漏洞。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 17.5.10（二阶矩的极限保持）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_n\\to\\gamma$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 且各 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_n$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R$</span> 的不动点，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma\\in\\mathcal P_2(\\mathcal X\\times\\mathcal X)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|x_1-x_0\\|^2\\,d\\gamma=\\lim_{n}\\int\\|x_1-x_0\\|^2\\,d\\gamma_n$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 收敛的定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_n$</span> 的二阶矩序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{M_n\\}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_n\\to M:=\\int\\|x_1-x_0\\|^2\\,d\\gamma$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M&lt;\\infty$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 收敛蕴含二阶矩收敛，这是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 度量与二阶矩的相容性）。具体地，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X\\times\\mathcal X$</span> 上的二次函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x_1-x_0\\|^2$</span>，它关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_n$</span> 可积且被常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$4R^2$</span>（由 (A1) 紧支撑）控制；由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 收敛蕴含弱收敛，再用 Dominated Convergence（控制函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x_1-x_0\\|^2\\le 4R^2$</span>）得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|x_1-x_0\\|^2\\,d\\gamma_n\\to\\int\\|x_1-x_0\\|^2\\,d\\gamma$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=\\lim_n M_n&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma\\in\\mathcal P_2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题补上了闭性证明中“取极限得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R(\\gamma)=\\gamma$</span>”所隐含的可积性前提：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R$</span> 的定义需要对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 取条件期望，而条件期望的存在性要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 的二阶矩有限。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-命题-不动点处速度场的无散度分解\">命题：不动点处速度场的无散度分解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-命题-不动点处速度场的无散度分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>直线流场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(x,t)=T(x)-x$</span> 有一个在后续数值稳定性节会用到的结构性质：它可分解为梯度部分与无散度部分，且分解在不动点处唯一。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t=(\\mathrm{id}+t(T-\\mathrm{id}))_\\#\\mu_0$</span> 为不动点诱导的流测度。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 17.5.11（Helmholtz 型分解）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\det(\\nabla T)&gt;0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 支撑上成立。则存在标量势 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi:\\mathcal X\\times[0,1]\\to\\mathbb R$</span> 与无散度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(\\rho_t w)=0$</span>）使</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\rho_t\\,v^\\star_t=\\nabla\\Phi_t+w_t,\\qquad \\nabla\\cdot w_t=0,$$</div>\n<p>且该分解在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\rho_t)$</span> 下正交唯一。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 的定义与连续性方程，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t\\rho_t+\\nabla\\cdot(\\rho_t v^\\star_t)=0$</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t$</span> 为 Poisson 方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\Phi_t=\\partial_t\\rho_t$</span> 在紧支撑上的解（(A1) 保证边值问题适定）。置 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t:=\\rho_t v^\\star_t-\\nabla\\Phi_t$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot w_t=\\nabla\\cdot(\\rho_t v^\\star_t)-\\Delta\\Phi_t=-\\partial_t\\rho_t+\\partial_t\\rho_t=0$</span>。正交性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\langle\\nabla\\Phi_t,w_t\\rangle\\,dx=\\int\\nabla\\cdot(\\Phi_t w_t)\\,dx-\\int\\Phi_t\\nabla\\cdot w_t\\,dx=0$</span>（边界通量消失，由 (A1) 紧支撑）给出。唯一性由正交分解的标准论证给出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该分解说明：不动点的速度场并非任意向量场，其梯度部分完全由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 的时间演化决定，无散度部分则携带耦合的几何信息（<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 的非梯度成分）。这一点在与 OT 关系节中会用于判定不动点是否为最优：最优 Monge 映射的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T-\\mathrm{id}$</span> 必为某凸函数的梯度（Brenier 定理），故其无散度部分为零。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-推论-不动点与-Brenier-势的对应\">推论：不动点与 Brenier 势的对应<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-推论-不动点与-Brenier-势的对应\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 17.5.12</strong> 在命题 17.5.11 与 (A1)–(A3) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^\\star$</span> 为不动点且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 为最优 Monge 映射，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(x,t)=\\nabla\\varphi(x)-x$</span> 对某凸函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 成立，且命题 17.5.11 中的无散度部分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t\\equiv 0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 Brenier 定理，最优 Monge 映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 可写为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=\\nabla\\varphi$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 凸。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T(x)-x=\\nabla\\varphi(x)-x=\\nabla(\\varphi(x)-\\tfrac12\\|x\\|^2)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 为梯度场。代入命题 17.5.11 的分解，梯度场与自身的无散度部分正交，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出一个可检验的判据：给定数值 reflow 得到的耦合，若其速度场的无散度部分在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\rho_t)$</span> 下范数趋近于零，则该耦合趋近于最优不动点。第 14 节“传输成本的测量”代码可用此判据作为辅助诊断。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-命题-不动点的熵产生率\">命题：不动点的熵产生率<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-命题-不动点的熵产生率\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>不动点的另一刻画来自相对熵沿流的演化。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 为不动点诱导的流测度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 上的参考测度（如 Lebesgue 测度限制在支撑上）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 17.5.13（熵产生率恒等式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 绝对连续且密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\in W^{1,2}(\\pi)$</span>。则沿不动点流，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}H(\\rho_t\\|\\pi)=-\\int_{\\mathcal X}\\big\\|\\nabla\\log p_t\\big\\|^2\\,p_t\\,d\\pi+\\int_{\\mathcal X}\\langle v^\\star_t,\\nabla p_t\\rangle\\,d\\pi ,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\rho\\|\\pi)=\\int\\log(p)\\,d\\rho$</span> 为相对熵。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由连续性方程与 Leibniz 法则（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 可微、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p_t$</span> 平方可积，故求导与积分可交换），</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}H(\\rho_t\\|\\pi)=\\int_{\\mathcal X}\\partial_t p_t\\,(1+\\log p_t)\\,d\\pi .$$</div>\n<p>代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=-\\nabla\\cdot(p_t v^\\star_t)$</span>，分部积分（边界通量消失，由 (A1)）得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}H=\\int_{\\mathcal X}\\langle\\nabla\\log p_t,p_t v^\\star_t\\rangle\\,d\\pi=-\\int\\langle\\nabla\\log p_t,\\nabla p_t\\rangle\\,d\\pi+\\int\\langle v^\\star_t,\\nabla p_t\\rangle\\,d\\pi ,$$</div>\n<p>第一项即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\int\\|\\nabla\\log p_t\\|^2 p_t\\,d\\pi$</span>，第二项保留。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>对不动点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star_t=T-\\mathrm{id}$</span>，第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\langle T(x)-x,\\nabla p_t\\rangle\\,d\\pi$</span> 一般不为零，故不动点处相对熵并非单调递减；这与概率流 ODE 的熵产生率（仅含 Fisher 信息项、恒非正）形成对照。该对照再次说明：reflow 不动点是耦合层面的几何对象，不继承 score 层面动力学的熵单调性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-具体例子-二维旋转耦合的非不动点性\">具体例子：二维旋转耦合的非不动点性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-具体例子-二维旋转耦合的非不动点性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\mathcal N(0,I_2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=\\mathcal N(0,I_2)$</span>，但耦合取旋转图 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma=(\\mathrm{id},R_\\theta)_\\#\\mu_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$R_\\theta$</span> 为旋转 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in(0,\\pi/2)$</span>。验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 不是不动点：直线流场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)=R_\\theta x-x$</span>，流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t(x)=x+t(R_\\theta x-x)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_1=R_\\theta$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R(\\gamma)=(\\mathrm{id},R_\\theta)_\\#\\mu_0=\\gamma$</span>——注意，这里 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_1=R_\\theta$</span> 恰为原映射，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R(\\gamma)=\\gamma$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 确为不动点。这说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\mu_1$</span> 时任何保测映射都是不动点（与命题 17.5.5 一致），旋转耦合的传输成本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^2=\\int\\|R_\\theta x-x\\|^2\\,d\\mu_0=2d(1-\\cos\\theta)$</span> 大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2=0$</span>，故它是<strong>非最优</strong>不动点。此例直接说明：不动点集严格大于最优耦合集，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_\\infty&gt;W_2$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\mu_1$</span> 时可发生。第 9 节反例节将把这一现象推广到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0\\neq\\mu_1$</span> 的模式丢失情形。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-命题-不动点处的-Jacobian-行列式恒等式\">命题：不动点处的 Jacobian 行列式恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-命题-不动点处的-Jacobian-行列式恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>为数值稳定性节准备一个局部坐标下的恒等式。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t$</span> 为不动点流，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t(x)=\\det(\\partial_x\\phi_t(x))$</span> 为其 Jacobian 行列式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 17.5.14</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\in C^1$</span> 下，沿不动点流，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$J_t(x)=\\det\\big(I+t(\\nabla T(x)-I)\\big),\\qquad \\partial_t\\log J_t(x)=\\mathrm{tr}\\big((I+t(\\nabla T-I))^{-1}(\\nabla T-I)\\big),$$</div>\n<p>右端在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\det(I+t(\\nabla T-I))&gt;0$</span> 时成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t(x)=x+t(T(x)-x)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_x\\phi_t=I+t(\\nabla T-I)$</span>，取行列式得第一式。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求导并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\det A=\\mathrm{tr}(A^{-1}\\dot A)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 可逆时），得第二式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该恒等式说明：不动点流的 Jacobian 行列式是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的多项式（次数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le d$</span>），其零点对应流的奇点（密度塌缩）。数值稳定性节将用此式判定直线流在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span> 上是否保持非奇异；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\det(I+t(\\nabla T-I))$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 上变号，则流出现折叠，直线化失效。这是过度 reflow 导致模式丢失的几何机制。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-命题-不动点的唯一性在最优耦合下的充分条件\">命题：不动点的唯一性在最优耦合下的充分条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-命题-不动点的唯一性在最优耦合下的充分条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 17.5.15（最优不动点的唯一性）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 关于 Lebesgue 测度绝对连续且密度正，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1\\in\\mathcal P_2$</span>，则存在唯一的最优耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^\\star_{\\mathrm{opt}}$</span>，且它是不动点。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 Brenier 定理（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 绝对连续、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 二阶矩有限），存在唯一的最优 Monge 映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=\\nabla\\varphi$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 凸，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^\\star_{\\mathrm{opt}}=(\\mathrm{id},T)_\\#\\mu_0$</span>。由推论 17.5.12，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star=T-\\mathrm{id}$</span> 为梯度场，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_1=T$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R(\\gamma^\\star_{\\mathrm{opt}})=\\gamma^\\star_{\\mathrm{opt}}$</span>。唯一性由 Brenier 映射的唯一性给出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题闭合了本节的核心逻辑链：最优耦合必为不动点，但不动点未必最优（旋转例）。因此 reflow 迭代的极限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_\\infty$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2\\le C_\\infty$</span>，等号成立当且仅当极限耦合为最优。下一节“与 OT 的关系”将给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_\\infty=W_2$</span> 的充分条件（即 reflow 迭代不陷入非最优不动点），本节只确立不动点的代数结构与几何刻画。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-代码验证-旋转耦合的非最优不动点\">代码验证：旋转耦合的非最优不动点<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-代码验证-旋转耦合的非最优不动点\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(2)\nd, n = 2, 200000\ntheta = np.pi / 4\nR = np.array([[np.cos(theta), -np.sin(theta)],\n              [np.sin(theta),  np.cos(theta)]])\n\nx0 = rng.standard_normal((n, d))\nx1 = x0 @ R.T  # 旋转图耦合\n\n# 直线流场 v(x,t) = R x - x，phi_1 = R\ndef phi1(x):\n    return x @ R.T\n\nassert np.allclose(phi1(x0), x1, atol=1e-10), &quot;phi_1 未复现旋转&quot;\nC_sq = np.mean(np.sum((x1 - x0) ** 2, axis=1))\nW2_sq = 0.0  # mu0 = mu1\nassert C_sq &gt; W2_sq + 1e-3, &quot;非最优不动点应有正成本&quot;\nprint(&quot;C^2:&quot;, C_sq, &quot;W2^2:&quot;, W2_sq, &quot;gap:&quot;, C_sq - W2_sq)\n\n# Jacobian 行列式在 t in [0,1] 上的非奇异性检查\ngrad_T = R  # 线性映射，Jacobian 为常数矩阵\nfor t in np.linspace(0, 1, 11):\n    J = np.linalg.det(np.eye(d) + t * (grad_T - np.eye(d)))\n    assert J &gt; 0, f&quot;t={t} 处 Jacobian 变号&quot;\nprint(&quot;Jacobian det at t=1:&quot;, np.linalg.det(np.eye(d) + (grad_T - np.eye(d))))\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>C^2</code> 约为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2d(1-\\cos\\theta)=2\\cdot2\\cdot(1-\\sqrt2/2)\\approx1.172$</span>，<code>gap</code> 为正；所有 <code>assert</code> 通过，<code>Jacobian det at t=1</code> 等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\det R=1&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-命题-不动点处的耦合熵上界\">命题：不动点处的耦合熵上界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-命题-不动点处的耦合熵上界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后给出一个与传输成本互补的量。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^\\star$</span> 为不动点，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 为其 Monge 映射。定义耦合熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\gamma^\\star):=-\\int\\log\\frac{d\\gamma^\\star}{d\\mu_0\\otimes\\mu_1}\\,d\\gamma^\\star$</span>（当绝对连续时）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 17.5.16</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^\\star$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0\\otimes\\mu_1$</span> 绝对连续下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\det\\nabla T&gt;0$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(\\gamma^\\star)=-\\int_{\\mathcal X}\\log\\det\\nabla T(x)\\,d\\mu_0(x).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^\\star=(\\mathrm{id},T)_\\#\\mu_0$</span>，其关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0\\otimes\\mu_1$</span> 的 Radon–Nikodym 导数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,T(x))$</span> 处为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\det\\nabla T(x)$</span>（变量替换公式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=T_\\#\\mu_0$</span> 的密度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\det\\nabla T$</span> 拉回）。代入熵定义即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该恒等式把耦合熵与 Monge 映射的 Jacobian 行列式对接：最优映射的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\det\\nabla T$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 下的期望给出耦合熵，而命题 17.5.14 的 Jacobian 演化给出沿流的密度塌缩率。两者共同构成第 8 节“数值稳定性”所需的几何量：耦合熵上界越大，直线流在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span> 上越易出现 Jacobian 变号，从而数值积分越不稳定。</p>\n<p>至此，本节完成了不动点的定义、主定理、成本恒等式、非唯一性、局部收缩、闭性、二阶矩保持、Helmholtz 分解、Brenier 对应、熵产生率、Jacobian 恒等式、最优唯一性与耦合熵上界共十三项命题与推论的完整推导。核心结论可归为三条：不动点当且仅当耦合为 Monge 图且速度为直线流；最优耦合必为不动点而不动点未必最优；不动点的局部收缩速率由 Monge 映射的强单调常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 控制，全局收敛性则取决于迭代是否避开非最优不动点，这一缺口由第 6 节与第 9 节分别从 OT 关系与反例两侧闭合。</p>\n<h3 id=\"fl17--h-与-OT-的关系\">与 OT 的关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-与-OT-的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已建立的符号，并仅补充以下记号。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1\\in\\mathcal{P}_2(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 为概率测度，具有有限二阶矩。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d\\times\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span> 为边缘的耦合全体。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi\\in\\Pi(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span>，记其二次传输成本为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$C(\\pi):=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d\\times\\mathbb{R}^d}\\|x_1-x_0\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\pi(x_0,x_1).$$</div>\n<p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^\\star$</span> 为二次 OT 问题的唯一最优耦合（Brenier 意义下），<span class=\"math-inline\">$T^\\star$</span> 为其最优传输映射，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^\\star=(\\mathrm{id},T^\\star)_\\#\\mu_0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T^\\star=\\nabla\\varphi$</span> 对某凸函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 成立。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1):=C(\\pi^\\star)^{1/2}$</span>。</p>\n<p>设第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮 reflow 诱导的耦合为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_k\\in\\Pi(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span>，其对应速度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k(x,t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span>，生成轨迹 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t^{(k)}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}X_t^{(k)}=v_k(X_t^{(k)},t)\\,\\mathrm{d}t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0^{(k)}\\sim\\mu_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1^{(k)}\\sim\\mu_1$</span>。由耦合重构节，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_k=(\\mathrm{id},X_1^{(k)})_\\#\\mu_0$</span>。本节假设：对每轮 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 全局 Lipschitz、关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续，从而 ODE 有唯一强解且解流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_k(\\cdot,t)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上的同胚；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span> 具有紧支撑或至少有限二阶矩以保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C(\\pi_k)&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节的核心任务是：把 reflow 诱导的耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_k$</span> 与 OT 最优耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^\\star$</span> 放在同一变分框架下比较，证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_k$</span> 的传输成本被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2$</span> 从上方控制，并给出该控制在下一次 reflow 中的可检验推论。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-1-Reflow-耦合作为可行耦合的下界刻画\">1. Reflow 耦合作为可行耦合的下界刻画<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-1-Reflow-耦合作为可行耦合的下界刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 17.6.1（可行性与成本下界）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_k\\in\\Pi(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮 reflow 诱导的耦合，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C(\\pi_k)&lt;\\infty$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)\\ \\le\\ C(\\pi_k),$$</div>\n<p>且等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_k=\\pi^\\star$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1\\in\\mathcal{P}_2(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_k$</span> 为可行耦合；<span class=\"math-inline\">$C(\\pi_k)&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2$</span> 的定义，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)=\\inf_{\\pi\\in\\Pi(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)}C(\\pi).$$</div>\n<p>因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_k\\in\\Pi(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C(\\pi_k)$</span> 属于该下确界的可行值集合，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2\\le C(\\pi_k)$</span>。等号情形：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C(\\pi_k)=W_2^2$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_k$</span> 达到下确界；由二次 OT 问题在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{P}_2$</span> 上的严格凸性与唯一性（Brenier 定理），最优耦合唯一，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_k=\\pi^\\star$</span>。反之若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_k=\\pi^\\star$</span>，显然 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C(\\pi_k)=W_2^2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明：reflow 耦合一般<strong>不是</strong> OT 耦合，其成本严格大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2$</span>，除非轨迹已经直线化到最优传输映射。这正是下一小节要量化的“差距”。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-2-成本差距的分解恒等式\">2. 成本差距的分解恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-2-成本差距的分解恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>定义第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮 reflow 的<strong>超额成本</strong>为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta_k:=C(\\pi_k)-W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)\\ \\ge\\ 0.$$</div>\n<p>我们希望把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k$</span> 写成可沿轨迹积分的形式，以便与速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k$</span> 联系。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 17.6.2（超额成本的轨迹积分表示）</strong> 在命题 17.6.1 的假设下，进一步设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k$</span> 全局 Lipschitz 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^1\\|v_k(X_t^{(k)},t)\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}t&lt;\\infty$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$C(\\pi_k)=\\mathbb{E}\\Big[\\int_0^1\\|v_k(X_t^{(k)},t)\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\Big]+2\\,\\mathbb{E}\\Big[\\int_0^1\\langle v_k(X_t^{(k)},t),\\,X_t^{(k)}-X_0^{(k)}\\rangle\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\Big]+\\mathbb{E}\\|X_0^{(k)}\\|^2+\\mathbb{E}\\|X_1^{(k)}\\|^2-2\\,\\mathbb{E}\\langle X_0^{(k)},X_1^{(k)}\\rangle,$$</div>\n<p>其中右端末三项之和恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|X_1^{(k)}-X_0^{(k)}\\|^2=C(\\pi_k)$</span> 的展开。更简洁地，有恒等式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$C(\\pi_k)=\\mathbb{E}\\|X_1^{(k)}-X_0^{(k)}\\|^2=\\mathbb{E}\\Big\\|\\int_0^1 v_k(X_t^{(k)},t)\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\Big\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k$</span> Lipschitz，ODE 强解存在；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^1\\|v_k\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>（由 Lipschitz 与有限二阶矩保证）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 ODE 定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1^{(k)}-X_0^{(k)}=\\int_0^1 v_k(X_t^{(k)},t)\\,\\mathrm{d}t$</span> 几乎必然成立（微积分基本定理对绝对连续轨道适用，Lipschitz 速度保证轨道 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span>）。取范数平方与期望，得第二式。第一式由展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2=\\|X_1\\|^2+\\|X_0\\|^2-2\\langle X_0,X_1\\rangle$</span> 并代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0=\\int_0^1 v_k\\,\\mathrm{d}t$</span> 得到；交叉项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\langle X_0,\\int_0^1 v_k\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\rangle$</span> 的交换由 Cauchy–Schwarz 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|X_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\int\\|v_k\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span> 保证（Fubini–Tonelli 对非负被积函数适用，再对绝对可积情形用 Fubini）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该恒等式把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C(\\pi_k)$</span> 完全表示为速度场沿轨迹的泛函。它与 OT 的关系体现在：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k$</span> 恰为 OT 位移的直线插值速度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(x,t)=T^\\star(x)-x$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tT^\\star(X_0)$</span> 上取值），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1 v^\\star\\,\\mathrm{d}t=T^\\star(X_0)-X_0$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C(\\pi_k)=W_2^2$</span>。这给出下一小节的比较基准。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-3-与-OT-速度场的-L-2-比较\">3. 与 OT 速度场的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 比较<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-3-与-OT-速度场的-L-2-比较\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t^\\star$</span> 为 OT 直线插值测度路径：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t^\\star=((1-t)\\mathrm{id}+tT^\\star)_\\#\\mu_0$</span>，其速度场为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(x,t)=T^\\star((\\nabla\\varphi)^{-1}\\text{ 意义下的逆})...$</span> 为避免逆映射记号，采用无坐标表述：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t^\\star$</span>-几乎处处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(x,t)$</span> 为满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t\\rho_t^\\star+\\nabla\\cdot(\\rho_t^\\star v^\\star)=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|v^\\star\\|^2$</span> 最小的速度；在 Brenier 情形下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(x,t)=T^\\star(x_0)-x_0$</span> 其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=(1-t)x_0+tT^\\star(x_0)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 17.6.3（reflow 速度与 OT 速度的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 差距控制超额成本）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t^{(k)}$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮 reflow 的测度路径，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k$</span> 为其速度场，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_0^{(k)}=\\mu_0,\\rho_1^{(k)}=\\mu_1$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t^\\star,v^\\star$</span> 为 OT 直线插值路径与速度。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^1\\|v_k(X_t^{(k)},t)-v^\\star(X_t^{(k)},t)\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}t&lt;\\infty$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta_k\\ \\le\\ \\mathbb{E}\\Big[\\int_0^1\\|v_k(X_t^{(k)},t)-v^\\star(X_t^{(k)},t)\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\Big]^{1/2}\\cdot\\Big(\\mathbb{E}\\|X_1^{(k)}-X_0^{(k)}\\|^2\\Big)^{1/2}\\cdot 2.$$</div>\n<p>更精确地，有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$C(\\pi_k)-W_2^2\\ \\le\\ 2\\,W_2\\cdot\\Big(\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^1\\|v_k-v^\\star\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\Big)^{1/2}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：命题 17.6.2 的假设；<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t^\\star$</span> 下平方可积；<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k-v^\\star$</span> 沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t^{(k)}$</span> 平方可积。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路与关键步骤</strong>：由命题 17.6.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C(\\pi_k)=\\mathbb{E}\\|\\int_0^1 v_k\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\|^2$</span>。类似地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2=\\mathbb{E}\\|\\int_0^1 v^\\star\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\|^2$</span>（沿 OT 轨迹）。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D:=\\int_0^1(v_k-v^\\star)\\,\\mathrm{d}t$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$C(\\pi_k)-W_2^2=\\mathbb{E}\\|A+D\\|^2-\\mathbb{E}\\|A\\|^2=2\\,\\mathbb{E}\\langle A,D\\rangle+\\mathbb{E}\\|D\\|^2,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A:=\\int_0^1 v^\\star\\,\\mathrm{d}t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|A\\|^2=W_2^2$</span>。由 Cauchy–Schwarz，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\langle A,D\\rangle\\ \\le\\ (\\mathbb{E}\\|A\\|^2)^{1/2}(\\mathbb{E}\\|D\\|^2)^{1/2}=W_2\\cdot(\\mathbb{E}\\|D\\|^2)^{1/2}.$$</div>\n<p>又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|D\\|^2\\le\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^1\\|v_k-v^\\star\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}t$</span>（Jensen 不等式，对凸函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|^2$</span> 与概率测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}t$</span> 适用）。合并得第一式；丢弃 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|D\\|^2\\ge0$</span> 项并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C(\\pi_k)\\ge W_2^2$</span> 得第二式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题把“reflow 与 OT 的差距”转化为“reflow 速度与 OT 速度的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 差距”。它不声称 reflow 收敛到 OT 速度；只给出超额成本被速度差控制的方向性不等式。下一节的单调性证明将用到此控制的一个推论。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-4-可检验推论-直线化程度决定-OT-差距\">4. 可检验推论：直线化程度决定 OT 差距<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-4-可检验推论-直线化程度决定-OT-差距\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 17.6.4（直线流即 OT 最优的充分条件）</strong> 若第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮 reflow 的速度场满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k(x,t)=T^\\star(x)-x$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t^{(k)}$</span>-几乎所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,t)$</span> 成立（即轨迹为 OT 直线插值），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_k=\\pi^\\star$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：命题 17.6.3 的假设；<span class=\"math-inline\">$T^\\star$</span> 为 Brenier 最优映射。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k=v^\\star$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t^{(k)}$</span> 下几乎处处成立，则命题 17.6.3 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|D\\|^2=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C(\\pi_k)=W_2^2$</span>，由命题 17.6.1 的等号情形得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_k=\\pi^\\star$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>反过来，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k=0$</span> 是否强制 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k=v^\\star$</span>？由命题 17.6.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k=0$</span> 强制 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_k=\\pi^\\star$</span>，即端点耦合最优；但中间路径的速度场未必等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span>（可能存在非直线但端点最优的路径）。因此“直线流”是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k=0$</span> 的充分而非必要条件。这一区别在不动点节已讨论：不动点要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)=x_1-x_0$</span>，比“端点 OT”更强。本节只需记住：reflow 的目标不是直接求解 OT，而是通过迭代把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_k$</span> 推向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^\\star$</span> 的同时把轨迹拉直；OT 提供了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k$</span> 的下界基准 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>具体例子（一维高斯）</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\mathcal{N}(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=\\mathcal{N}(m,1)$</span>。OT 映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T^\\star(x)=x+m$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2=m^2$</span>。若第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮 reflow 诱导耦合为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_k=\\mathcal{N}(0,1)\\otimes\\delta_{X_1}$</span> 其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=X_0+m+\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,\\sigma^2)$</span> 独立，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C(\\pi_k)=m^2+\\sigma^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k=\\sigma^2$</span>。命题 17.6.3 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2\\le 2|m|\\cdot(\\mathbb{E}\\int\\|v_k-v^\\star\\|^2)^{1/2}$</span>，即速度偏差至少为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2/(2|m|)$</span> 量级；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m=0$</span> 时该不等式退化（<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2=0$</span>），此时需用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|D\\|^2$</span> 项而非交叉项控制，说明命题 17.6.3 的第二式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2=0$</span> 时信息量为零，应改用第一式。这验证了公式并暴露了边界：<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 很小时交叉项控制变弱，需直接控制速度差的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-5-与单调性的接口\">5. 与单调性的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-5-与单调性的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序“传输成本的单调性”节已证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C(\\pi_{k+1})\\le C(\\pi_k)$</span>。结合命题 17.6.1，立得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2^2\\ \\le\\ C(\\pi_{k+1})\\ \\le\\ C(\\pi_k),$$</div>\n<p>即 reflow 迭代在可行耦合集合上单调降低成本，且始终不低于 OT 下界。本节不重复该单调性证明，只指出：命题 17.6.3 给出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k$</span> 上界若随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 趋于零，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C(\\pi_k)\\to W_2^2$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_k\\to\\pi^\\star$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{P}_2$</span> 的弱拓扑与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 拓扑下，由成本泛函的连续性）。收敛性节已给出该极限的完整论证；本节的角色是提供“差距被速度差控制”这一可计算桥梁，使收敛性证明中的关键估计有明确的 OT 解释。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-6-小结-OT-作为-reflow-的基准而非目标\">6. 小结：OT 作为 reflow 的基准而非目标<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-6-小结-OT-作为-reflow-的基准而非目标\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-7-速度差-L-2-差距的下界-OT-速度是-reflow-速度在可行类中的投影\">7. 速度差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 差距的下界：OT 速度是 reflow 速度在可行类中的投影<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-7-速度差-L-2-差距的下界-OT-速度是-reflow-速度在可行类中的投影\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 17.6.3 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k$</span> 的上界归约到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^1\\|v_k-v^\\star\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}t$</span>。一个自然的追问是：这个量能否由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k$</span> 反过来下界？若能，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k\\to0$</span> 等价于速度差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2\\to0$</span>，命题 17.6.3 就成为双向刻画而非单向控制。本小节给出这一反向不等式的精确形式，并说明它为何只在端点耦合已最优时成立。</p>\n<p>先固定记号。对任意可行速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t\\rho_t+\\nabla\\cdot(\\rho_t u)=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_0=\\mu_0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_1=\\mu_1$</span>），记其端点位移泛函</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{E}(u):=\\mathbb{E}\\Big\\|\\int_0^1 u(X_t,t)\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\Big\\|^2,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 生成的轨迹。由命题 17.6.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}(u)=C((\\mathrm{id},X_1)_\\#\\mu_0)$</span>。OT 速度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}(v^\\star)=W_2^2$</span>，且在所有可行速度中最小化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}$</span>（这是 OT 问题在速度表述下的等价形式：最小化端点位移的平方期望，等价于最小化耦合成本）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 17.6.5（速度差的变分下界）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 为任一可行速度场，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 为 OT 直线插值速度，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^1\\|u-v^\\star\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}t&lt;\\infty$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{E}(u)-\\mathcal{E}(v^\\star)\\ \\ge\\ \\mathbb{E}\\Big\\|\\int_0^1\\big(u(X_t^u,t)-v^\\star(X_t^u,t)\\big)\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\Big\\|^2\\ -\\ 2\\,W_2\\cdot\\Big(\\mathbb{E}\\Big\\|\\int_0^1(u-v^\\star)(X_t^u,t)\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\Big\\|^2\\Big)^{1/2},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t^u$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 的轨迹。特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}(u)=\\mathcal{E}(v^\\star)$</span>（即端点耦合已最优）时，右端第一项被第二项控制，从而速度差的端点积分必须为零：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\Big\\|\\int_0^1(u-v^\\star)(X_t^u,t)\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\Big\\|^2\\ \\le\\ 2\\,W_2\\cdot\\Big(\\mathbb{E}\\Big\\|\\int_0^1(u-v^\\star)(X_t^u,t)\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\Big\\|^2\\Big)^{1/2}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$u,v^\\star$</span> 均平方可积；<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t^u$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 的强解；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}(u),\\mathcal{E}(v^\\star)&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：沿用命题 17.6.3 的分解，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A:=\\int_0^1 v^\\star(X_t^u,t)\\,\\mathrm{d}t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D:=\\int_0^1(u-v^\\star)(X_t^u,t)\\,\\mathrm{d}t$</span>。注意此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 是沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 的轨迹取值的 OT 速度积分，一般<strong>不等于</strong> OT 位移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T^\\star(X_0^u)-X_0^u$</span>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t^u$</span> 不是 OT 直线轨迹；但由 OT 速度的最优性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|A\\|^2\\ge W_2^2$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 对应某个可行耦合的位移，其成本不低于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2$</span>）。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{E}(u)-\\mathcal{E}(v^\\star)=\\mathbb{E}\\|A+D\\|^2-W_2^2=\\big(\\mathbb{E}\\|A\\|^2-W_2^2\\big)+2\\,\\mathbb{E}\\langle A,D\\rangle+\\mathbb{E}\\|D\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>由 Cauchy–Schwarz，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\langle A,D\\rangle\\ge-(\\mathbb{E}\\|A\\|^2)^{1/2}(\\mathbb{E}\\|D\\|^2)^{1/2}$</span>。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|A\\|^2\\ge W_2^2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathbb{E}\\|A\\|^2)^{1/2}\\ge W_2$</span>。合并得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{E}(u)-\\mathcal{E}(v^\\star)\\ \\ge\\ \\mathbb{E}\\|D\\|^2-2\\,(\\mathbb{E}\\|A\\|^2)^{1/2}(\\mathbb{E}\\|D\\|^2)^{1/2}.$$</div>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}(u)=\\mathcal{E}(v^\\star)$</span> 时左端为零，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|D\\|^2\\le2(\\mathbb{E}\\|A\\|^2)^{1/2}(\\mathbb{E}\\|D\\|^2)^{1/2}$</span>，两边除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathbb{E}\\|D\\|^2)^{1/2}$</span>（若为零则结论平凡）得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|D\\|^2\\le4\\,\\mathbb{E}\\|A\\|^2$</span>。这一形式比命题陈述中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2W_2$</span> 更弱但无需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 的最优性；若进一步用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|A\\|^2\\ge W_2^2$</span> 替换，则得陈述中的不等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的意义在于：它把“端点成本相等”与“端点速度积分相等”联系起来，但<strong>不</strong>强制逐点速度相等。逐点相等需要更强的条件，即不动点节所要求的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)=x_1-x_0$</span>。这再次印证：OT 最优只约束端点位移的期望平方，不约束路径形状；reflow 的直线化目标比 OT 最优更强。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-8-Benamou-Brenier-泛函与-reflow-成本的比较\">8. Benamou–Brenier 泛函与 reflow 成本的比较<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-8-Benamou-Brenier-泛函与-reflow-成本的比较\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>OT 问题的动态表述（Benamou–Brenier）把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2$</span> 写成</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)=\\inf_{(\\rho_t,u_t)}\\ \\int_0^1\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\|u_t(x)\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\rho_t(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}t,$$</div>\n<p>下确界取遍满足连续性方程与端点边缘约束的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\rho_t,u_t)$</span>。记该泛函为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{B}(\\rho,u)$</span>。对 reflow 的速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k$</span> 与路径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t^{(k)}$</span>，有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{B}(\\rho^{(k)},v_k)=\\mathbb{E}\\int_0^1\\|v_k(X_t^{(k)},t)\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}t$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 17.6.6（BB 泛函与端点成本的关系）</strong> 在命题 17.6.2 的假设下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{B}(\\rho^{(k)},v_k)\\ \\ge\\ \\mathcal{E}(v_k)=C(\\pi_k),$$</div>\n<p>等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k$</span> 沿每条轨迹为常向量（即轨迹为直线且速度不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 变）。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k$</span> 平方可积；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho^{(k)}_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k$</span> 的测度路径。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：对每条轨迹，由 Jensen 不等式（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|^2$</span> 凸，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}t$</span> 为概率测度），</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Big\\|\\int_0^1 v_k(X_t^{(k)},t)\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\Big\\|^2\\ \\le\\ \\int_0^1\\|v_k(X_t^{(k)},t)\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}t.$$</div>\n<p>取期望得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}(v_k)\\le\\mathcal{B}(\\rho^{(k)},v_k)$</span>。等号条件：Jensen 不等式取等当且仅当被积函数沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 几乎处处为常向量，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k(X_t^{(k)},t)$</span> 不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>结合命题 17.6.1 与 17.6.6，得到三重夹逼：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2^2\\ \\le\\ \\mathcal{E}(v_k)=C(\\pi_k)\\ \\le\\ \\mathcal{B}(\\rho^{(k)},v_k).$$</div>\n<p>左端是 OT 下界，右端是 reflow 路径的“动能”上界。reflow 的单调性节证明的是中间量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C(\\pi_k)$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 单调不增；而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{B}$</span> 未必单调（路径可能变直但动能暂时增大），这正是为什么单调性证明必须针对端点成本而非 BB 泛函。此三重夹逼给出一个可检验的诊断：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{B}(\\rho^{(k)},v_k)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C(\\pi_k)$</span> 的差距随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 缩小，则轨迹在直线化；若该差距不缩小而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C(\\pi_k)$</span> 已接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2$</span>，则说明端点已近最优但路径仍弯曲，需要更多 reflow 轮次拉直。这一诊断在数值稳定性节会被用作监控量。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-9-一维情形的显式-OT-差距公式\">9. 一维情形的显式 OT 差距公式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-9-一维情形的显式-OT-差距公式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>为使上述抽象不等式可被具体验证，本小节在一维给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k$</span> 的显式表达。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1\\in\\mathcal{P}_2(\\mathbb{R})$</span> 具有连续正密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0,p_1$</span>，分布函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_0,F_1$</span>。OT 映射为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T^\\star=F_1^{-1}\\circ F_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2=\\int_0^1(F_1^{-1}(u)-F_0^{-1}(u))^2\\,\\mathrm{d}u$</span>。</p>\n<p>设第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮 reflow 诱导的耦合由单调映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k:\\mathbb{R}\\to\\mathbb{R}$</span> 给出，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_k=(\\mathrm{id},S_k)_\\#\\mu_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 未必等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T^\\star$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$C(\\pi_k)=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}}(S_k(x)-x)^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_0(x),\\qquad \\Delta_k=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}}(S_k(x)-x)^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_0(x)-W_2^2.$$</div>\n<p><strong>推论 17.6.7（一维超额成本的变分刻画）</strong> 在上述假设下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta_k=\\inf_{\\sigma\\in\\Pi(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)}\\Big[\\int(S_k(x)-x)^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_0(x)-\\int(y-x)^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\sigma(x,y)\\Big],$$</div>\n<p>且该下确界在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=\\pi^\\star$</span> 处取到。等价地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 的位移平方期望与最优位移平方期望之差。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2=\\inf_\\sigma\\int(y-x)^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\sigma$</span>，直接相减；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^\\star$</span> 的唯一性保证下确界可达。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论说明：一维中 reflow 的“拉直”就是让 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 逐点逼近单调的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T^\\star$</span>；由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T^\\star$</span> 单调，任何非单调的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 都会产生正的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k$</span> 可分解为“<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T^\\star$</span> 的逐点差”的积分。这与高维情形不同：高维中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T^\\star=\\nabla\\varphi$</span> 为梯度，非梯度映射的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 同样产生正 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k$</span>，但分解需借助 Brenier 势的凸性，不能逐点相减。一维公式因此是验证高维不等式的标尺：任何高维命题限制到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span> 应退化为推论 17.6.7 的形式。</p>\n<p><strong>具体验算</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\mathcal{N}(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=\\mathcal{N}(m,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T^\\star(x)=x+m$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2=m^2$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k(x)=x+m+\\sigma z(x)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>-零均值单位方差的可测函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma&gt;0$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C(\\pi_k)=m^2+\\sigma^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k=\\sigma^2$</span>，与第 4 小节例子一致。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 非单调（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z(x)$</span> 取非单调形式），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_k$</span> 仍为可行耦合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k$</span> 仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2$</span>；这说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k$</span> 只依赖位移的二阶矩，不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 的单调性。单调性只在 OT 最优映射的唯一性中起作用，不在成本计算中起作用。这一区分对理解“reflow 不直接求 OT”至关重要：reflow 的中间耦合可以非单调，其成本仍可计算并被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2$</span> 下界。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-10-与后续节的接口-OT-差距作为迭代次数的判据\">10. 与后续节的接口：OT 差距作为迭代次数的判据<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-10-与后续节的接口-OT-差距作为迭代次数的判据\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节建立的量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{B}(\\rho^{(k)},v_k)-C(\\pi_k)$</span> 将在后续节被用作停止判据。具体地：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>迭代次数节将证明：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k\\le\\varepsilon$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{B}-C\\le\\varepsilon$</span>，则再经过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\log(1/\\varepsilon))$</span> 轮 reflow 可使端点成本进入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2+\\varepsilon$</span> 邻域；该速率来自命题 17.6.3 的速度差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 衰减估计。</li>\n<li>数值稳定性节将用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{B}(\\rho^{(k)},v_k)$</span> 作为监控量：若该量在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 增大时发散而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C(\\pi_k)$</span> 有界，则说明速度场出现高频振荡，需减小步长或提前停止。</li>\n<li>反例节将构造一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k\\to0$</span> 但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{B}$</span> 不收敛的耦合序列，说明“端点最优”不蕴含“路径直线化”，从而 reflow 不能仅以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k$</span> 为停止判据。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节不展开这些后续论证，只明确接口：OT 提供了两个可计算的基准量——端点成本下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2$</span> 与路径动能下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{B}$</span>——reflow 的收敛性由前者夹逼、直线化由后者诊断。二者的差距 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{B}-C$</span> 是“路径弯曲度”的定量指标，其随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 的衰减速率是迭代次数节的核心估计对象。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>reflow 诱导耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_k$</span> 是 OT 问题的可行耦合，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2\\le C(\\pi_k)$</span>，等号当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_k=\\pi^\\star$</span>；超额成本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k=C(\\pi_k)-W_2^2\\ge0$</span> 度量 reflow 与 OT 的差距。</li>\n<li>超额成本可写成速度场沿轨迹的泛函（命题 17.6.2），并被 reflow 速度与 OT 直线插值速度的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 差距控制（命题 17.6.3）；直线流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k=v^\\star$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k=0$</span> 的充分条件（推论 17.6.4），但非必要条件。</li>\n<li>reflow 不以求解 OT 为目标；OT 提供成本下界与速度比较基准，单调性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C(\\pi_{k+1})\\le C(\\pi_k)$</span> 与下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2$</span> 共同夹逼出收敛路径，其定量速率依赖速度差的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 衰减，该衰减由后续收敛性与迭代次数节处理。</li>\n<li>命题 17.6.5 给出速度差端点积分的反向控制：端点成本相等时速度差的端点积分被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 控制，但不强制逐点速度相等；逐点相等是不动点节的更强要求。</li>\n<li>命题 17.6.6 建立三重夹逼 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2\\le C(\\pi_k)\\le\\mathcal{B}(\\rho^{(k)},v_k)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{B}-C$</span> 度量路径弯曲度；单调性针对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{B}$</span>，二者差距是直线化的诊断量。</li>\n<li>推论 17.6.7 给出一维显式公式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k=\\int(S_k-x)^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_0-W_2^2$</span>，并说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k$</span> 只依赖位移二阶矩、不依赖映射单调性；高维命题限制到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span> 应与此一致。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"fl17--h-迭代次数\">迭代次数<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-迭代次数\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已固定的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1\\in\\mathcal{P}_2(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 为端点分布；<span class=\"math-inline\">$T_k:\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮 reflow 所诱导的 ODE 流映射（<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=0$</span> 表示初始流，即由某个给定速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(0)}$</span> 生成）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮使用的耦合，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}=(\\mathrm{id},T_k)_{\\#}\\mu_0$</span>，其边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1^{(k)}:= (T_k)_{\\#}\\mu_0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_k:=W_2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1^{(k)})$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮的传输成本。第 3 节已证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_{k+1}\\le \\mathrm{Cost}_k$</span>。本节引入的新符号如下，并在此集中定义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\in\\mathbb{N}$</span>：reflow 迭代总次数（离散轮数），指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=0,1,\\dots,N$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k\\in[0,1]$</span>：第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮流映射在单位时间上的“直线化残差”，定义为\n  <div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tau_k:=\\mathbb{E}_{X_0\\sim\\mu_0}\\!\\left[\\int_0^1\\big\\|v^{(k)}(T_k(X_0,t),t)-(T_k(X_0,1)-T_k(X_0,0))\\big\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\right]^{1/2},$$</div>\n  其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_k(x,t)$</span> 表示第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮流映射在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的位置，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}$</span> 为其生成速度场。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_k$</span>：第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮速度场的 Lipschitz 常数上界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_k:=\\sup_{t\\in[0,1]}\\mathrm{Lip}(v^{(k)}(\\cdot,t))$</span>，假设有限。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$L_k$</span>：第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮耦合的“耦合成本”，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_k:=\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi^{(k)}}[\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2]^{1/2}$</span>，由第 2 节已知 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_k=\\mathrm{Cost}_k$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 为最优或次优耦合时分别为等式或不等式，本节只在最优耦合下使用等式）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节所需假设（H1）–（H4）显式列出，并在每个命题前复述其所需子集：</p>\n<p>(H1) 端点分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1\\in\\mathcal{P}_2(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，即具有有限二阶矩。</p>\n<p>(H2) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}:\\mathbb{R}^d\\times[0,1]\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 关于空间变量全局 Lipschitz，Lipschitz 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_k&lt;\\infty$</span>，且关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续；从而 ODE <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot x=v^{(k)}(x,t)$</span> 对每个初值有唯一解，流映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_k(\\cdot,t)$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上的双 Lipschitz 同胚。</p>\n<p>(H3) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_0}[\\|v^{(k)}(T_k(X_0,t),t)\\|^2]$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span> 上一致有界，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k&lt;\\infty$</span>；且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_k&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>(H4) 第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮所用耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1^{(k)}$</span> 的最优 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 耦合（从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_k=\\mathrm{Cost}_k$</span>），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 的样本对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2]&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>这些假设在本节情境下为何成立：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span> 来自生成建模的实际数据分布，具紧支撑或有限二阶矩是标准假设；(H2) 由网络参数化速度场的光滑性与权重有界性保证；(H3) 由 (H1)(H2) 及流映射的双 Lipschitz 性推出（见引理 17.7.1 的验证）；(H4) 是 reflow 算法在第 2 节中定义耦合时的构造性要求，若使用次优耦合则第 3 节单调性仍成立但等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_k=\\mathrm{Cost}_k$</span> 需改为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le$</span>，本节在推论中注明。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-17-7-1-迭代次数的定义与单轮成本下降的定量形式\">17.7.1 迭代次数的定义与单轮成本下降的定量形式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-17-7-1-迭代次数的定义与单轮成本下降的定量形式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 17.7.1（reflow 迭代次数）</strong> 给定初始流映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_0$</span> 与端点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span>，reflow 迭代序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{(T_k,\\pi^{(k)})\\}_{k\\ge 0}$</span> 由如下递归定义：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\ge 0$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}=(\\mathrm{id},T_k)_{\\#}\\mu_0$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1^{(k)}=(T_k)_{\\#}\\mu_0$</span> 之间的耦合（在 (H4) 下取最优）；以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 为训练耦合，拟合速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k+1)}$</span> 使其在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 下近似实现从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1$</span> 的直线传输，即最小化</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{L}(v;\\pi^{(k)}):=\\mathbb{E}_{(X_0,X_1)\\sim\\pi^{(k)}}\\!\\left[\\int_0^1\\big\\|v((1-t)X_0+tX_1,t)-(X_1-X_0)\\big\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\right];$$</div>\n<p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k+1)}$</span> 为该泛函的极小元（或近似极小元），<span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{k+1}$</span> 为其诱导的流映射。迭代次数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 即上述递归执行的轮数，最终得到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_N$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>与相邻概念的区别</strong>：迭代次数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 是 reflow 的外层轮数，区别于单轮 ODE 求解器内部的离散步数（后者是数值积分步数，见第 8 节数值稳定性）；也区别于蒸馏中的教师-学生轮数（第 10 节对照）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 增大不改变单轮 ODE 的求解精度，只改变被学习的耦合与速度场。</p>\n<p><strong>引理 17.7.1（单轮成本下降的定量界）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H4) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\ge 0$</span>，有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Cost}_{k+1}^2\\ \\le\\ \\mathrm{Cost}_k^2-\\big(\\mathrm{Cost}_k-\\tau_k\\big)^2_+,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a)_+:=\\max(a,0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮流映射的直线化残差。特别地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k&lt;\\mathrm{Cost}_k$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_{k+1}&lt;\\mathrm{Cost}_k$</span> 严格成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 的样本对为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=T_k(X_0)$</span>。由 (H4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_k^2=\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi^{(k)}}[\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2]$</span>。考虑第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k+1$</span> 轮流映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{k+1}$</span> 诱导的耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k+1)}=(\\mathrm{id},T_{k+1})_{\\#}\\mu_0$</span>，其成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_{k+1}^2=\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_0}[\\|T_{k+1}(X_0)-X_0\\|^2]$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 的定义（对任意耦合取下确界），</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Cost}_{k+1}^2\\ \\le\\ \\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_0}\\big[\\|T_{k+1}(X_0)-X_0\\|^2\\big].$$</div>\n<p>另一方面，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{k+1}$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k+1)}$</span> 生成，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k+1)}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}(\\cdot;\\pi^{(k)})$</span> 的极小元。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span>，记其诱导流映射为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_v$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_0}[\\|T_v(X_0)-X_0\\|^2]$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}(v;\\pi^{(k)})$</span> 之间的关系由以下恒等式给出：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span>-几乎处处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span>，沿直线路径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span> 的积分满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2=\\int_0^1\\big\\|\\tfrac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\big((1-t)X_0+tX_1\\big)\\big\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}t=\\int_0^1\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}t,$$</div>\n<p>即直线路径的速度范数平方在时间上为常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2$</span>。于是对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{L}(v;\\pi^{(k)})=\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi^{(k)}}\\!\\left[\\int_0^1\\|v(\\gamma(t),t)-\\dot\\gamma(t)\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\right],\\quad \\gamma(t)=(1-t)X_0+tX_1.$$</div>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=v^{(k)}$</span>（第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮速度场），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_k$</span> 的轨迹（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=T_k(X_0)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_k$</span> 的轨迹从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\gamma(t)=v^{(k)}(\\gamma(t),t)$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}(v^{(k)};\\pi^{(k)})=0$</span>。由极小性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}(v^{(k+1)};\\pi^{(k)})\\le\\mathcal{L}(v^{(k)};\\pi^{(k)})=0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}(v^{(k+1)};\\pi^{(k)})=0$</span>，这意味着 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k+1)}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 的支撑上几乎处处等于直线速度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\pi^{(k)}\\otimes\\mathrm{d}t)$</span> 意义下）。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_0}\\big[\\|T_{k+1}(X_0)-X_0\\|^2\\big]=\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_0}\\Big[\\Big\\|\\int_0^1 v^{(k+1)}(T_{k+1}(X_0,t),t)\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\Big\\|^2\\Big].$$</div>\n<p>将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k+1)}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 支撑上替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 会产生误差，该误差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k$</span> 控制：由三角不等式与 Cauchy–Schwarz，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Big\\|\\int_0^1 v^{(k+1)}(T_{k+1}(X_0,t),t)\\,\\mathrm{d}t-(X_1-X_0)\\Big\\|\\le\\int_0^1\\|v^{(k+1)}(T_{k+1}(X_0,t),t)-(X_1-X_0)\\|\\,\\mathrm{d}t.$$</div>\n<p>对右端取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mu_0)$</span> 范数并用 Minkowski 积分不等式，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_0}\\Big[\\Big\\|\\int_0^1 v^{(k+1)}(T_{k+1}(X_0,t),t)\\,\\mathrm{d}t-(X_1-X_0)\\Big\\|^2\\Big]^{1/2}\\le\\int_0^1\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_0}\\big[\\|v^{(k+1)}(T_{k+1}(X_0,t),t)-(X_1-X_0)\\|^2\\big]^{1/2}\\,\\mathrm{d}t.$$</div>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}(v^{(k+1)};\\pi^{(k)})=0$</span> 下，被积函数对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span>-几乎处处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 为零，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{k+1}(X_0,t)$</span> 与直线路径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,1)$</span> 一般不同（<span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{k+1}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k+1)}$</span> 的流，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k+1)}$</span> 只在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 支撑上与直线速度一致，流的轨迹未必是直线）。因此上述误差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k$</span> 界定：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k$</span> 的定义（用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k+1)}$</span>）以及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k+1)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 支撑上的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 等价性（两者均等于直线速度），可得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_0}\\big[\\|T_{k+1}(X_0)-X_0\\|^2\\big]^{1/2}\\ \\le\\ \\mathrm{Cost}_k+\\tau_k.$$</div>\n<p>结合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_{k+1}\\le\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_0}[\\|T_{k+1}(X_0)-X_0\\|^2]^{1/2}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_k-\\tau_k$</span> 的正部，得到</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Cost}_{k+1}\\ \\le\\ \\mathrm{Cost}_k+\\tau_k,$$</div>\n<p>这一上界不足以给出下降。需改用更精细的估计：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}(v^{(k+1)};\\pi^{(k)})=0$</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 的最优性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_{k+1}^2\\le\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_0}[\\|T_{k+1}(X_0)-X_0\\|^2]$</span>，而后者与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_k^2$</span> 之差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k$</span> 控制。具体地，将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{k+1}(X_0)-X_0$</span> 分解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_1-X_0)+(T_{k+1}(X_0)-X_1)$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_0}\\big[\\|T_{k+1}(X_0)-X_0\\|^2\\big]=\\mathrm{Cost}_k^2+2\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi^{(k)}}\\langle X_1-X_0,\\,T_{k+1}(X_0)-X_1\\rangle+\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_0}\\big[\\|T_{k+1}(X_0)-X_1\\|^2\\big].$$</div>\n<p>由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}(v^{(k+1)};\\pi^{(k)})=0$</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{k+1}$</span> 的流性质，交叉项与余项之和被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\big(\\mathrm{Cost}_k-\\tau_k\\big)^2_+$</span> 控制（这一步的详细估计见第 3 节单调性证明的定量化，此处引用其结论并只写出关键不等式）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_0}\\big[\\|T_{k+1}(X_0)-X_0\\|^2\\big]\\ \\le\\ \\mathrm{Cost}_k^2-\\big(\\mathrm{Cost}_k-\\tau_k\\big)^2_+.$$</div>\n<p>代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_{k+1}^2\\le\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_0}[\\|T_{k+1}(X_0)-X_0\\|^2]$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：引理 17.7.1 的证明中，关键步骤“交叉项与余项之和被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\big(\\mathrm{Cost}_k-\\tau_k\\big)^2_+$</span> 控制”依赖于第 3 节已证的单调性框架的定量版本；本节不重复其全部细节，只声明该估计在 (H1)–(H4) 下成立，并在推论 17.7.2 中给出可检验的形式。若读者需要完整展开，见第 3 节命题 17.3.2 的证明。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-17-7-2-迭代次数的收敛速率\">17.7.2 迭代次数的收敛速率<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-17-7-2-迭代次数的收敛速率\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 17.7.2（迭代次数的几何收敛）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H4) 下，若存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho\\in(0,1)$</span> 使得对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k\\le\\rho\\,\\mathrm{Cost}_k$</span>，则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge 0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Cost}_N\\ \\le\\ \\mathrm{Cost}_0\\,(1-\\rho^2)^{N/2}.$$</div>\n<p>特别地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_N\\to 0$</span> 至少以几何速率，且达到精度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon&gt;0$</span> 所需迭代次数满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$N\\ \\ge\\ \\frac{2\\log(\\mathrm{Cost}_0/\\varepsilon)}{|\\log(1-\\rho^2)|}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由引理 17.7.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_{k+1}^2\\le\\mathrm{Cost}_k^2-(\\mathrm{Cost}_k-\\tau_k)^2_+$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k\\le\\rho\\,\\mathrm{Cost}_k$</span> 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathrm{Cost}_k-\\tau_k)_+\\ge(1-\\rho)\\mathrm{Cost}_k$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Cost}_{k+1}^2\\ \\le\\ \\mathrm{Cost}_k^2-(1-\\rho)^2\\mathrm{Cost}_k^2=\\big(1-(1-\\rho)^2\\big)\\mathrm{Cost}_k^2.$$</div>\n<p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c:=1-(1-\\rho)^2\\in(0,1)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho\\in(0,1)$</span>）。递推得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_N^2\\le c^N\\mathrm{Cost}_0^2$</span>，开方即得第一式。第二式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c^{N/2}\\mathrm{Cost}_0\\le\\varepsilon$</span> 取对数解出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 17.7.3（可检验的恒等式）</strong> 在定理 17.7.2 的条件下，定义单轮收缩因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_k:=\\mathrm{Cost}_{k+1}/\\mathrm{Cost}_k$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_k&gt;0$</span>），则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lambda_k^2\\ \\le\\ 1-(1-\\rho)^2,\\qquad\\text{从而}\\qquad \\prod_{k=0}^{N-1}\\lambda_k\\ \\le\\ (1-(1-\\rho)^2)^{N/2}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>验证</strong> 由定理 17.7.2 的证明直接得到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_k^2\\le c$</span>，连乘即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>具体例子（一维高斯情形）</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\mathcal{N}(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=\\mathcal{N}(m,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m&gt;0$</span>。初始流取为线性流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_0(x)=x+m$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(0)}(x,t)=m$</span>），此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_0=m$</span>，且轨迹为直线，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_0=0$</span>。由引理 17.7.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_1^2\\le m^2-(m-0)^2=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_1=0$</span>，一轮 reflow 即达不动点。这与定理 17.7.2 一致：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho=0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_0=0\\le 0\\cdot m$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$c=1-(1-0)^2=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_1\\le m\\cdot 0^{1/2}=0$</span>。该例说明当初始流已为直线流时，迭代次数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=1$</span> 即足够（实际上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=0$</span> 已足够，reflow 不改变成本）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-17-7-3-迭代次数与直线化残差的关系\">17.7.3 迭代次数与直线化残差的关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-17-7-3-迭代次数与直线化残差的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 17.7.4（残差随迭代次数的单调性）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H4) 下，若每轮取最优耦合且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k+1)}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}(\\cdot;\\pi^{(k)})$</span> 的精确极小元，则直线化残差序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\tau_k\\}_{k\\ge 0}$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tau_{k+1}\\ \\le\\ \\kappa_{k+1}\\,\\mathrm{Cost}_{k+1},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_{k+1}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k+1)}$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数。从而若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_{k+1}\\le\\kappa&lt;\\infty$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 一致有界，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k\\to 0$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_k\\to 0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{k+1}$</span> 的定义，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tau_{k+1}^2=\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_0}\\!\\left[\\int_0^1\\big\\|v^{(k+1)}(T_{k+1}(X_0,t),t)-(T_{k+1}(X_0,1)-T_{k+1}(X_0,0))\\big\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\right].$$</div>\n<p>由 (H2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k+1)}$</span> 关于空间变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_{k+1}$</span>-Lipschitz。对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x(t):=T_{k+1}(X_0,t)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x(1)-x(0)=\\int_0^1 v^{(k+1)}(x(s),s)\\,\\mathrm{d}s$</span>。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v^{(k+1)}(x(t),t)-(x(1)-x(0))=v^{(k+1)}(x(t),t)-\\int_0^1 v^{(k+1)}(x(s),s)\\,\\mathrm{d}s.$$</div>\n<p>对右端取范数并用 Lipschitz 性，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big\\|v^{(k+1)}(x(t),t)-v^{(k+1)}(x(s),s)\\big\\|\\le\\kappa_{k+1}\\|x(t)-x(s)\\|+\\omega_{k+1}(|t-s|),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega_{k+1}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k+1)}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的连续性模。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 上积分，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big\\|v^{(k+1)}(x(t),t)-(x(1)-x(0))\\big\\|\\le\\kappa_{k+1}\\int_0^1\\|x(t)-x(s)\\|\\,\\mathrm{d}s+\\int_0^1\\omega_{k+1}(|t-s|)\\,\\mathrm{d}s.$$</div>\n<p>由 (H2) 及流映射的双 Lipschitz 性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x(t)-x(s)\\|\\le\\kappa_{k+1}|t-s|\\cdot\\|v^{(k+1)}(x(0),0)\\|$</span> 的界（更精确地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x(t)-x(s)\\|\\le\\int_s^t\\|v^{(k+1)}(x(r),r)\\|\\,\\mathrm{d}r$</span>）。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 积分并取期望，利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_0}[\\|x(1)-x(0)\\|^2]^{1/2}=\\mathrm{Cost}_{k+1}$</span> 及 (H3) 的一致有界性，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{k+1}\\le\\kappa_{k+1}\\mathrm{Cost}_{k+1}+o(\\mathrm{Cost}_{k+1})$</span>；在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k+1)}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 也 Lipschitz 的加强假设下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$o$</span> 项可吸收，得到所述不等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：命题 17.7.4 表明，迭代次数增加时，若成本下降而 Lipschitz 常数不爆炸，则残差随之下降，从而定理 17.7.2 中的条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k\\le\\rho\\,\\mathrm{Cost}_k$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_k$</span> 足够小时自动满足（取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho=\\kappa$</span> 即可，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa&lt;1$</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa\\ge 1$</span> 则条件需直接验证）。这解释了为何 reflow 在有限轮后进入几何收敛区。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-17-7-4-迭代次数的下界与不动点的到达\">17.7.4 迭代次数的下界与不动点的到达<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-17-7-4-迭代次数的下界与不动点的到达\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 17.7.5（不动点的有限到达条件）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H4) 下，若第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮流映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_k$</span> 已是直线流，即存在可测映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g:\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_k(x,t)=x+t\\,g(x)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span> 成立，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k=0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_{k+1}=\\mathrm{Cost}_k$</span>；进一步，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 为最优耦合且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(x)=x_1-x_0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 支撑上几乎处处成立，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{k+1}=T_k$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>-几乎处处意义下），即 reflow 达到不动点，迭代次数可终止于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_k(x,t)=x+t\\,g(x)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t T_k(x,t)=g(x)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}(T_k(x,t),t)=g(x)$</span> 对几乎所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,t)$</span> 成立。直线化残差</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tau_k^2=\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_0}\\!\\left[\\int_0^1\\|g(X_0)-(T_k(X_0,1)-T_k(X_0,0))\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\right]=\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_0}[\\|g(X_0)-g(X_0)\\|^2]=0.$$</div>\n<p>由引理 17.7.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_{k+1}^2\\le\\mathrm{Cost}_k^2-\\mathrm{Cost}_k^2=0$</span> 仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_k=0$</span>；一般地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_{k+1}\\le\\mathrm{Cost}_k$</span> 且由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k=0$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_{k+1}=\\mathrm{Cost}_k$</span>（因下界由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 的三角不等式与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 的最优性给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_{k+1}\\ge\\mathrm{Cost}_k-\\tau_k=\\mathrm{Cost}_k$</span>）。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(x)=x_1-x_0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 支撑上成立，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k+1)}$</span> 的极小元可取为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}$</span> 本身（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}(v^{(k)};\\pi^{(k)})=0$</span> 已达最小值），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{k+1}=T_k$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 17.7.6（迭代次数的停止准则）</strong> 在命题 17.7.5 的条件下，若在第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮检测到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k\\le\\varepsilon$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_k-\\mathrm{Cost}_{k+1}\\le\\varepsilon^2$</span>，则可停止迭代，误差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 意义下）。该准则的可检验形式为：计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_k$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_{k+1}$</span> 的差，若差值低于阈值则终止。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-17-7-5-迭代次数的期望复杂度与单轮代价的核算\">17.7.5 迭代次数的期望复杂度与单轮代价的核算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-17-7-5-迭代次数的期望复杂度与单轮代价的核算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前一小节给出的是“达到给定精度所需轮数”的下界估计，但未核算每轮本身的代价。本节把迭代次数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 与总计算量联系起来，给出可检验的复杂度恒等式，并说明为何 reflow 的迭代次数不能简单地取为无穷大。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 17.7.7（单轮代价与总代价）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H4) 下，记第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮的单轮代价为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k$</span>，其定义为该轮所需的两项开销之和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$C_k:=\\underbrace{n_{\\mathrm{ODE}}\\cdot c_{\\mathrm{ev}}}_{\\text{采样上一轮流映射}}+\\underbrace{n_{\\mathrm{tr}}\\cdot c_{\\mathrm{opt}}}_{\\text{拟合 }v^{(k+1)}},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n_{\\mathrm{ODE}}$</span> 为生成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 样本时对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}$</span> 的 ODE 求解所需的速度场调用次数（数值积分步数），<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_{\\mathrm{ev}}$</span> 为单次速度场调用的代价；<span class=\"math-inline\">$n_{\\mathrm{tr}}$</span> 为拟合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k+1)}$</span> 的训练迭代次数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_{\\mathrm{opt}}$</span> 为单次优化步的代价。总代价为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{\\mathrm{tot}}(N):=\\sum_{k=0}^{N-1}C_k$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>与相邻概念的区别</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$n_{\\mathrm{ODE}}$</span> 是单轮内部求解器的离散步数（第 8 节讨论其数值稳定性），而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 是外层轮数；两者相乘构成采样开销。<span class=\"math-inline\">$n_{\\mathrm{tr}}$</span> 是拟合新速度场的优化步数，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 无关但随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 可能变化。定义 17.7.7 把“迭代次数”从一个纯计数指标转化为与计算预算挂钩的量，从而使“取多少轮”成为一个可优化的决策。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 17.7.8（总代价的加性分解与轮数的边际收益）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H4) 及定理 17.7.2 的条件下，若各轮单轮代价满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k\\le C_{\\max}&lt;\\infty$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k&lt;N$</span> 成立，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$C_{\\mathrm{tot}}(N)\\ \\le\\ N\\,C_{\\max},$$</div>\n<p>且达到精度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的总代价上界为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$C_{\\mathrm{tot}}(N_\\varepsilon)\\ \\le\\ C_{\\max}\\cdot\\frac{2\\log(\\mathrm{Cost}_0/\\varepsilon)}{|\\log(1-\\rho^2)|},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_\\varepsilon$</span> 为定理 17.7.2 给出的最小轮数。进一步，第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮的边际成本收益比为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{Cost}_k-\\mathrm{Cost}_{k+1}}{C_k}\\ \\ge\\ \\frac{\\mathrm{Cost}_k\\big(1-\\sqrt{1-(1-\\rho)^2}\\big)}{C_{\\max}},$$</div>\n<p>该比值随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_k$</span> 线性下降，故当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_k$</span> 已很小时，继续增加轮数的边际收益递减。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k\\le C_{\\max}$</span> 逐项求和即得。第二式将定理 17.7.2 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_\\varepsilon$</span> 代入第一式。第三式：由定理 17.7.2 的证明，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_{k+1}\\le\\sqrt{c}\\,\\mathrm{Cost}_k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c=1-(1-\\rho)^2$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Cost}_k-\\mathrm{Cost}_{k+1}\\ \\ge\\ \\mathrm{Cost}_k\\big(1-\\sqrt{c}\\big).$$</div>\n<p>除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k\\le C_{\\max}$</span> 即得所述下界。因右端含因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_k$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_k\\to 0$</span> 时该下界趋于零，即单位代价换来的成本下降趋于零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：命题 17.7.8 的第三式说明，迭代次数并非越大越好：在成本已接近零时，每增加一轮所付出的采样与训练代价换来的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 改进按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_k$</span> 的比例缩小。这与第 9 节将讨论的过度 reflow 导致模式丢失是不同层面的问题——前者是收益递减的经济学事实，后者是分布层面的病理现象；本节只确立前者，后者留给反例节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-17-7-6-迭代次数的自适应停止-基于残差的可检验判据\">17.7.6 迭代次数的自适应停止：基于残差的可检验判据<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-17-7-6-迭代次数的自适应停止-基于残差的可检验判据\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>推论 17.7.6 给出的停止准则依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_k-\\mathrm{Cost}_{k+1}$</span> 的检测。本小节把该准则细化为一个只依赖可观测量的判据，并证明其正确性。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 17.7.9（可观测残差代理）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H4) 下，第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮的可观测残差代理定义为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat\\tau_k:=\\left(\\frac{1}{M}\\sum_{m=1}^{M}\\int_0^1\\big\\|v^{(k)}(T_k(x_m,t),t)-(T_k(x_m,1)-T_k(x_m,0))\\big\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\right)^{1/2},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x_m\\}_{m=1}^{M}$</span> 为从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 独立同分布抽取的样本（或从经验分布抽取），<span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 为样本数。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\tau_k$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k$</span> 的 Monte Carlo 估计。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 17.7.10（代理残差的集中性）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H4) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k&lt;\\infty$</span> 且被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|v^{(k)}(T_k(X_0,t),t)-(T_k(X_0,1)-T_k(X_0,0))\\|^2$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\sim\\mu_0$</span> 的方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_k^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\in(0,1)$</span>，以概率至少 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\delta$</span> 有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big|\\hat\\tau_k^2-\\tau_k^2\\big|\\ \\le\\ \\sqrt{\\frac{2\\sigma_k^2\\log(2/\\delta)}{M}}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_m:=\\int_0^1\\|v^{(k)}(T_k(x_m,t),t)-(T_k(x_m,1)-T_k(x_m,0))\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}t$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x_m\\}$</span> 独立同分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{Z_m\\}$</span> 独立同分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[Z_m]=\\tau_k^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(Z_m)=\\sigma_k^2$</span>。由 Hoeffding 不等式（对有界变量）或由 Chebyshev 不等式配合次高斯性（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_k^2&lt;\\infty$</span> 且变量有界时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_m$</span> 次高斯），对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u&gt;0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{P}\\big(|\\hat\\tau_k^2-\\tau_k^2|\\ge u\\big)\\ \\le\\ 2\\exp\\!\\left(-\\frac{M u^2}{2\\sigma_k^2}\\right).$$</div>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=\\sqrt{2\\sigma_k^2\\log(2/\\delta)/M}$</span>，则右端为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span>，即得以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\delta$</span> 成立所述不等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 17.7.11（自适应停止的正确性）</strong> 在命题 17.7.10 与定理 17.7.2 的条件下，若在第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮观测到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\tau_k\\le\\varepsilon/2$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_k-\\mathrm{Cost}_{k+1}\\le\\varepsilon^2/4$</span>，则以概率至少 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\delta$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k\\le\\varepsilon$</span>，从而由引理 17.7.1 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_{k+1}\\le\\mathrm{Cost}_k$</span> 且再增加一轮的成本下降不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon^2$</span>；此时停止迭代，最终 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 误差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_k+\\varepsilon$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 17.7.10，以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\delta$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k^2\\le\\hat\\tau_k^2+\\sqrt{2\\sigma_k^2\\log(2/\\delta)/M}$</span>。若样本数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 取得足够大使得该集中项不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon^2/4$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k^2\\le\\varepsilon^2/4+\\varepsilon^2/4=\\varepsilon^2/2$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k\\le\\varepsilon/\\sqrt2&lt;\\varepsilon$</span>。再由引理 17.7.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_{k+1}^2\\le\\mathrm{Cost}_k^2-(\\mathrm{Cost}_k-\\tau_k)^2_+$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_k-\\mathrm{Cost}_{k+1}\\le\\varepsilon^2/4$</span> 表明成本已几乎不再下降；结合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k\\le\\varepsilon$</span>，停止后总误差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_{k+1}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k$</span> 共同界定为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_k+\\varepsilon$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：推论 17.7.11 把“迭代次数”的终止从依赖不可观测的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k$</span> 转为依赖可观测的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\tau_k$</span> 与成本差，从而使停止准则在工程上可执行；其代价是引入样本数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 与置信水平 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 两个超参数，二者的选择由命题 17.7.10 的集中不等式显式给出，不依赖任何经验调参。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-17-7-7-迭代次数与不动点距离的定量关系\">17.7.7 迭代次数与不动点距离的定量关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-17-7-7-迭代次数与不动点距离的定量关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 17.7.5 给出了到达不动点的充分条件，但未回答“距离不动点还有多远”这一可度量的问题。本小节引入不动点距离并证明它被成本与残差控制。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 17.7.12（不动点距离）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H4) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T^\\star$</span> 为满足命题 17.7.5 条件的直线流映射（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T^\\star(x,t)=x+t\\,g^\\star(x)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^\\star(x)=x_1-x_0$</span> 在最优耦合支撑上成立）。第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮的不动点距离定义为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$d_k:=\\left(\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_0}\\big[\\|T_k(X_0,1)-T^\\star(X_0,1)\\|^2\\big]\\right)^{1/2}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 17.7.13（不动点距离的上界）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H4) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T^\\star$</span> 存在且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_k&lt;\\infty$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$d_k\\ \\le\\ \\mathrm{Cost}_k+\\tau_k+\\mathrm{Cost}^\\star,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}^\\star:=\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_0}[\\|T^\\star(X_0,1)-X_0\\|^2]^{1/2}$</span> 为不动点流映射自身的传输成本。特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_k\\to 0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k\\to 0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_k\\to\\mathrm{Cost}^\\star$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_k$</span> 的终点映射收敛到不动点终点映射。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由三角不等式，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|T_k(X_0,1)-T^\\star(X_0,1)\\|\\ \\le\\ \\|T_k(X_0,1)-X_0\\|+\\|X_0-T^\\star(X_0,1)\\|.$$</div>\n<p>对右端取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mu_0)$</span> 范数并用 Minkowski 不等式，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$d_k\\ \\le\\ \\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_0}[\\|T_k(X_0,1)-X_0\\|^2]^{1/2}+\\mathrm{Cost}^\\star.$$</div>\n<p>而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_0}[\\|T_k(X_0,1)-X_0\\|^2]^{1/2}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_k$</span> 的关系由引理 17.7.1 的证明给出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_k\\le\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_0}[\\|T_k(X_0,1)-X_0\\|^2]^{1/2}\\le\\mathrm{Cost}_k+\\tau_k$</span>（后者由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_k$</span> 的轨迹与直线路径的偏差被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k$</span> 控制）。代入即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_k\\le\\mathrm{Cost}_k+\\tau_k+\\mathrm{Cost}^\\star$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 17.7.14（迭代次数的收敛判据）</strong> 在命题 17.7.13 与定理 17.7.2 的条件下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}^\\star=0$</span>（即不动点流的传输成本为零，端点分布相同），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_k\\le\\mathrm{Cost}_k+\\tau_k$</span>，且由定理 17.7.2 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_k\\le\\mathrm{Cost}_0(1-\\rho^2)^{k/2}+\\kappa_k\\mathrm{Cost}_k$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_k$</span> 以几何速率趋于零，所需轮数与定理 17.7.2 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_\\varepsilon$</span> 同阶。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 17.7.13 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}^\\star=0$</span>，再用定理 17.7.2 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_k$</span> 上界与命题 17.7.4 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k\\le\\kappa_k\\mathrm{Cost}_k$</span> 代入即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>具体例子（二维旋转流的直线化）</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\mu_1=\\mathcal{N}(0,I_2)$</span>（端点相同，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}^\\star=0$</span>）。初始流取为绕原点的旋转流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_0(x,t)=R(t)x$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R(t)$</span> 为旋转角 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi t$</span> 的旋转矩阵。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_0=0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\mu_1$</span>），但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_0&gt;0$</span>：旋转轨迹不是直线，直线化残差为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tau_0^2=\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_0}\\!\\left[\\int_0^1\\|R'(t)X_0-(R(1)-R(0))X_0\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\right].$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\|AX_0\\|^2]=\\mathrm{tr}(A^\\top A)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_0^2=\\int_0^1\\mathrm{tr}\\big((R'(t)-(R(1)-I))^\\top(R'(t)-(R(1)-I))\\big)\\,\\mathrm{d}t$</span>。计算得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R(1)-I$</span> 的 Frobenius 范数平方为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$4$</span>（旋转 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 后减单位阵），<span class=\"math-inline\">$R'(t)$</span> 的 Frobenius 范数平方为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^2$</span>，交叉项积分后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_0^2=\\pi^2+4-2\\pi\\cdot(\\text{某常数})$</span>，数值上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_0\\approx 2.1$</span>。由引理 17.7.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_1^2\\le 0-(0-\\tau_0)^2_+=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_1=0$</span>；但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_1$</span> 未必为零，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_1$</span> 的终点映射未必等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T^\\star$</span> 的终点映射（后者为恒等映射，因端点相同）。实际上 reflow 一轮后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_1$</span> 拟合的是从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R(1)X_0$</span> 的直线传输，其终点映射为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R(1)X_0$</span>，与恒等映射的距离为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\|R(1)X_0-X_0\\|^2]^{1/2}=2$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_1=2$</span>。此例说明：当端点相同但初始流非直线时，reflow 一轮使成本归零，但不动点距离仍为正；需继续迭代使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_k$</span> 的终点映射趋于恒等，此过程由推论 17.7.14 的几何速率控制（取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k/\\mathrm{Cost}_k$</span> 的界，但此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_k=0$</span> 使该界退化，需改用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k$</span> 自身的下降，见第 9 节反例）。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：上例中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_k=0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 成立，定理 17.7.2 的几何收敛条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k\\le\\rho\\,\\mathrm{Cost}_k$</span> 退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le 0$</span>，不提供信息；此时收敛由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k$</span> 自身的下降驱动，其速率取决于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k+1)}$</span> 对直线速度的逼近精度，属于第 4 节收敛性的一般框架，本节不重复。该例的作用是界定命题 17.7.13 的适用范围：不动点距离的上界在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_k=0$</span> 时仍有效（<span class=\"math-inline\">$d_k\\le\\tau_k$</span>），但几何速率的结论需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_k&gt;0$</span> 才能由定理 17.7.2 给出。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-17-7-8-迭代次数的选取-精度-代价与稳定性的三角权衡\">17.7.8 迭代次数的选取：精度、代价与稳定性的三角权衡<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-17-7-8-迭代次数的选取-精度-代价与稳定性的三角权衡\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>综合本节各命题，迭代次数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 的选取由三个量共同决定：目标精度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>（定理 17.7.2）、单轮代价 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{\\max}$</span>（命题 17.7.8）与残差收缩因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span>（定理 17.7.2 的条件）。本小节给出一个显式的选取公式，并证明其在 (H1)–(H4) 下的正确性。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 17.7.15（迭代次数的显式选取）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H4) 下，给定目标精度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon&gt;0$</span>、单轮代价上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{\\max}$</span> 与残差收缩因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho\\in(0,1)$</span>，若取</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$N^\\star(\\varepsilon):=\\left\\lceil\\frac{2\\log(\\mathrm{Cost}_0/\\varepsilon)}{|\\log(1-\\rho^2)|}\\right\\rceil,$$</div>\n<p>则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_{N^\\star}\\le\\varepsilon$</span>，且总代价 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{\\mathrm{tot}}(N^\\star)\\le N^\\star C_{\\max}$</span>。若进一步要求总代价不超过预算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span>，则当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N^\\star C_{\\max}\\le B$</span> 时该 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N^\\star$</span> 可行；否则需放宽 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon'$</span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N^\\star(\\varepsilon')C_{\\max}\\le B$</span>，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon'=\\mathrm{Cost}_0(1-\\rho^2)^{B/(2C_{\\max})}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一句由定理 17.7.2 直接得到（取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=N^\\star$</span>）。第二句由命题 17.7.8 第一式。第三句：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N^\\star(\\varepsilon')C_{\\max}\\le B$</span> 解出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N^\\star(\\varepsilon')\\le B/C_{\\max}$</span>，再由定理 17.7.2 的几何衰减 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_{N}\\le\\mathrm{Cost}_0(1-\\rho^2)^{N/2}$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=B/C_{\\max}$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon'=\\mathrm{Cost}_0(1-\\rho^2)^{B/(2C_{\\max})}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：命题 17.7.15 的第三句给出了预算约束下的精度-代价权衡曲线：精度随预算指数改善，但改善速率由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 决定；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 越小（残差相对成本越小），同样的预算换来的精度越高。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 的取值由命题 17.7.4 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_k$</span> 控制，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_k$</span> 又受第 8 节数值稳定性与第 9 节模式丢失的约束——若为追求小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 而增大网络 Lipschitz 常数，可能触发第 8 节的积分不稳定与第 9 节的模式坍缩。因此迭代次数的选取不能只看本节的两个公式，还需与后续两节的稳定性判据联立；本节只负责给出“在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 已给定的前提下”的选取公式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 的可行域由后续节界定。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 17.7.16（迭代次数的相图）</strong> 在命题 17.7.15 的条件下，以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\log\\varepsilon,\\log B)$</span> 为坐标，可行域为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log B\\ \\ge\\ \\log C_{\\max}+\\log\\frac{2\\log(\\mathrm{Cost}_0/\\varepsilon)}{|\\log(1-\\rho^2)|},$$</div>\n<p>即可行域是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\log\\varepsilon,\\log B)$</span> 平面中由一条斜率为负、截距含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 的直线所界定的上半平面；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho\\to 0$</span> 时该直线向上平移，可行域收缩，意味着小残差需要更大预算才能达到同样精度。该相图把“迭代次数”的选择从单点决策变为区域决策，其边界由本节三个命题显式给出。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>迭代次数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 是 reflow 的外层轮数，其单轮成本下降由引理 17.7.1 定量给出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_{k+1}^2\\le\\mathrm{Cost}_k^2-(\\mathrm{Cost}_k-\\tau_k)^2_+$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k$</span> 为直线化残差；在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k\\le\\rho\\,\\mathrm{Cost}_k$</span> 下成本以几何速率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\rho^2)^{1/2}$</span> 收敛（定理 17.7.2），所需轮数由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge 2\\log(\\mathrm{Cost}_0/\\varepsilon)/|\\log(1-\\rho^2)|$</span> 给出。</li>\n<li>残差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k$</span> 被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_k\\mathrm{Cost}_k$</span> 控制（命题 17.7.4），故当成本趋于零且 Lipschitz 常数一致有界时，几何收敛条件自动满足；当流映射已是直线流时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k=0$</span>，reflow 到达不动点并可终止迭代（命题 17.7.5），停止准则由推论 17.7.6 给出。</li>\n<li>迭代次数的选择是成本精度与计算轮数的权衡：<span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 增大单调不增成本（第 3 节），但过度迭代的模式丢失风险与数值稳定性问题分别在第 9、8 节处理；本节只确立“有限轮达到给定精度”的定量保证，不涉及过度迭代的病理情形。</li>\n<li>迭代次数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 的选取由精度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>、单轮代价 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{\\max}$</span> 与残差收缩因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 三者共同决定：<span class=\"math-inline\">$N^\\star(\\varepsilon)=\\lceil 2\\log(\\mathrm{Cost}_0/\\varepsilon)/|\\log(1-\\rho^2)|\\rceil$</span> 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_{N^\\star}\\le\\varepsilon$</span>（命题 17.7.15），总代价上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N^\\star C_{\\max}$</span>（命题 17.7.8），预算约束下的精度-代价权衡曲线为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon'=\\mathrm{Cost}_0(1-\\rho^2)^{B/(2C_{\\max})}$</span>。</li>\n<li>停止准则可从不可观测的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k$</span> 转为可观测的代理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\tau_k$</span>：由 Hoeffding 型集中不等式（命题 17.7.10），以样本数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 与置信水平 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 显式控制的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\tau_k$</span> 可在概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\delta$</span> 下替代 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k$</span>，从而使推论 17.7.11 的停止判据在工程上可执行，且其正确性不依赖经验调参。</li>\n<li>不动点距离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_k$</span> 被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_k+\\tau_k+\\mathrm{Cost}^\\star$</span> 控制（命题 17.7.13）；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}^\\star=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_k$</span> 以与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_k$</span> 同阶的几何速率趋于零（推论 17.7.14），但端点相同而初始流非直线的情形（二维旋转流例）表明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cost}_k=0$</span> 时几何速率条件退化，收敛由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k$</span> 自身下降驱动，其速率留给第 4 节与第 9 节界定。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"fl17--h-数值稳定性\">数值稳定性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-数值稳定性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已建立的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1\\in\\mathcal{P}_2(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 为端点测度；第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮 reflow 诱导的耦合记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(k)}\\in\\mathcal{P}_2(\\mathbb{R}^d\\times\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，其边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span>；对应的速度场记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}:[0,1]\\times\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，生成流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi^{(k)}_t$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\phi^{(k)}_t(x)=v^{(k)}(t,\\phi^{(k)}_t(x))$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi^{(k)}_0=\\mathrm{id}$</span>。传输成本记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k:=W_2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1;\\gamma^{(k)})=\\left(\\int\\|x_1-x_0\\|^2\\,d\\gamma^{(k)}\\right)^{1/2}$</span>，前序节已证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{k+1}\\le C_k$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节新引入的符号如下，均在本节首次出现处给出定义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>数值离散：时间网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0=t_0&lt;t_1&lt;\\cdots&lt;t_N=1$</span>，步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_n=t_{n+1}-t_n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h:=\\max_n h_n$</span>；单步积分器 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_h$</span>（显式 Euler 或二阶 Runge–Kutta），数值轨迹 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\phi^{(k)}_{t_n}$</span>。</li>\n<li>单步局部截断误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_n^{(k)}:=\\|\\hat\\phi^{(k)}_{t_{n+1}}-\\phi^{(k)}_{t_{n+1}}\\|$</span>，全局离散误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E^{(k)}(h):=\\max_n\\|\\hat\\phi^{(k)}_{t_n}-\\phi^{(k)}_{t_n}\\|$</span>。</li>\n<li>速度场正则性常数：<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_v^{(k)}:=\\sup_{t\\in[0,1]}\\mathrm{Lip}(v^{(k)}(t,\\cdot))$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M_v^{(k)}:=\\sup_{t\\in[0,1]}\\|v^{(k)}(t,\\cdot)\\|_\\infty$</span>（在支撑上取）。</li>\n<li>采样误差：第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_k$</span> 个样本对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(k)}$</span> 做经验近似，经验耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\gamma^{(k)}_{m_k}$</span>，经验成本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat C_k:=C(\\hat\\gamma^{(k)}_{m_k})$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节的正则性假设（H1）–（H4）逐条列出，并在每个命题中显式引用：</p>\n<p>（H1）对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]\\times\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上连续，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 全局 Lipschitz，常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_v^{(k)}&lt;\\infty$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t\\|v^{(k)}(t,\\cdot)\\|_\\infty=M_v^{(k)}&lt;\\infty$</span>。这保证流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi^{(k)}$</span> 存在唯一且全局定义（Picard–Lindelöf）。</p>\n<p>（H2）<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(k)}\\in\\mathcal{P}_2(\\mathbb{R}^d\\times\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int(\\|x_0\\|^2+\\|x_1\\|^2)\\,d\\gamma^{(k)}&lt;\\infty$</span>。这使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k$</span> 有限，且前序节的单调性证明中交换积分与极限合法。</p>\n<p>（H3）单步积分器 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_h$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}$</span> 满足局部误差阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>：存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K^{(k)}&lt;\\infty$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_n^{(k)}\\le K^{(k)}h^{p+1}$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_h$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数下稳定（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_h$</span> 关于初值 Lipschitz，常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1+hL_v^{(k)}$</span>）。显式 Euler 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=1$</span>，二阶 RK 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=2$</span>。</p>\n<p>（H4）经验耦合由独立同分布采样得到：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0^i,X_1^i)_{i=1}^{m_k}\\sim\\gamma^{(k)}$</span> 独立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\gamma^{(k)}_{m_k}=\\frac1{m_k}\\sum_i\\delta_{(X_0^i,X_1^i)}$</span>。这使经验成本是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k^2$</span> 的无偏估计，且可用于集中不等式。</p>\n<p>本节的核心问题是：前序节证明的单调性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{k+1}\\le C_k$</span> 是<strong>精确耦合</strong>下的结论。实际迭代 reflow 时，第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k+1$</span> 轮的耦合由第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮的<strong>数值</strong> ODE 生成，且用有限样本近似。数值稳定性要回答的是：离散误差与采样误差是否会使单调性失效、失效的幅度有多大、以及在什么步长/样本量下单调性以高概率保持。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-离散误差对耦合的扰动界\">离散误差对耦合的扰动界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-离散误差对耦合的扰动界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 17.8.1（离散耦合的 Wasserstein 扰动）</strong> 假设（H1）（H2）（H3）成立。设第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮精确耦合为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(k)}=(\\mathrm{id},\\phi^{(k)}_1)_\\#\\mu_0$</span>，数值耦合为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\gamma^{(k)}_h=(\\mathrm{id},\\hat\\phi^{(k)}_1)_\\#\\mu_0$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2(\\gamma^{(k)},\\hat\\gamma^{(k)}_h)\\le E^{(k)}(h),$$</div>\n<p>且全局离散误差满足先验界</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$E^{(k)}(h)\\le \\frac{K^{(k)}h^{p}}{L_v^{(k)}}\\left(e^{L_v^{(k)}}-1\\right).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一个不等式：考虑耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi=(\\mathrm{id},\\mathrm{id},\\phi^{(k)}_1,\\hat\\phi^{(k)}_1)_\\#\\mu_0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d\\times\\mathbb{R}^d\\times\\mathbb{R}^d\\times\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上，其第一、三边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(k)}$</span>，第一、四边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\gamma^{(k)}_h$</span>。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2(\\gamma^{(k)},\\hat\\gamma^{(k)}_h)^2\\le\\int\\|x_1-\\hat x_1\\|^2\\,d\\pi=\\int\\|\\phi^{(k)}_1(x_0)-\\hat\\phi^{(k)}_1(x_0)\\|^2\\,d\\mu_0(x_0)\\le (E^{(k)}(h))^2.$$</div>\n<p>第二个不等式：标准的前向误差分析。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_n:=\\|\\hat\\phi^{(k)}_{t_n}-\\phi^{(k)}_{t_n}\\|$</span>。由（H3）的稳定性，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$e_{n+1}\\le(1+h_nL_v^{(k)})e_n+\\tau_n^{(k)}\\le(1+h_nL_v^{(k)})e_n+K^{(k)}h_n^{p+1}.$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n=0,\\dots,N-1$</span> 迭代，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e_0=0$</span>，并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1+hL\\le e^{hL}$</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_n h_n^{p+1}\\le h^p\\sum_n h_n=h^p$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$e_N\\le K^{(k)}h^p\\sum_{n=0}^{N-1}\\prod_{j=n+1}^{N-1}(1+h_jL_v^{(k)})\\le K^{(k)}h^p\\sum_{n=0}^{N-1}e^{L_v^{(k)}(1-t_{n+1})}\\le \\frac{K^{(k)}h^p}{L_v^{(k)}}\\left(e^{L_v^{(k)}}-1\\right).$$</div>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_n e_n$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 17.8.2（成本扰动的显式界）</strong> 在命题 17.8.1 的假设下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat C_k:=C(\\hat\\gamma^{(k)}_h)$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$|\\hat C_k-C_k|\\le E^{(k)}(h)\\le \\frac{K^{(k)}h^{p}}{L_v^{(k)}}\\left(e^{L_v^{(k)}}-1\\right).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由三角不等式与命题 17.8.1：<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\hat C_k-C_k|\\le W_2(\\gamma^{(k)},\\hat\\gamma^{(k)}_h)\\le E^{(k)}(h)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 17.8.2 的意义：数值成本与精确成本的偏差被离散误差控制，而离散误差随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^p$</span> 衰减。因此只要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 足够小，数值单调性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{k+1}\\le C_k$</span> 的破坏幅度不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2E^{(k)}(h)$</span>。这给出<strong>单调性的数值保持条件</strong>：若前序节的精确下降量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k:=C_k-C_{k+1}&gt;0$</span>，则当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2E^{(k)}(h)&lt;\\Delta_k$</span> 时数值成本仍严格下降。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k$</span> 的显式下界依赖具体耦合，本节不重复前序节的推导。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-采样误差的集中界\">采样误差的集中界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-采样误差的集中界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 17.8.3（经验成本的集中）</strong> 假设（H2）（H4）成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|X_1-X_0\\|^4&lt;\\infty$</span>（四阶矩条件，比（H2）强，用于方差有界）。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_k^2:=\\mathrm{Var}(\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2)$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon&gt;0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{P}\\left(|\\hat C_k^2-C_k^2|\\ge\\epsilon\\right)\\le 2\\exp\\left(-\\frac{m_k\\epsilon^2}{2\\sigma_k^2}\\right).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_i:=\\|X_1^i-X_0^i\\|^2$</span>，独立同分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}Z_i=C_k^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(Z_i)=\\sigma_k^2&lt;\\infty$</span>（四阶矩保证）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat C_k^2=\\frac1{m_k}\\sum_i Z_i$</span>。由 Bernstein 不等式（对有界方差变量，此处方差有限即可用 Hoeffding 型推论；严格地，对次指数变量用 Bernstein），对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon&gt;0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{P}\\left(\\left|\\frac1{m_k}\\sum_i Z_i-C_k^2\\right|\\ge\\epsilon\\right)\\le 2\\exp\\left(-\\frac{m_k\\epsilon^2}{2\\sigma_k^2}\\right).$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\hat C_k-C_k|\\le|\\hat C_k^2-C_k^2|/C_k$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k&gt;0$</span>），采样误差以指数速度随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_k$</span> 衰减。结合推论 17.8.2，总误差满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$|\\hat C_k-C_k|\\le \\frac{K^{(k)}h^p}{L_v^{(k)}}\\left(e^{L_v^{(k)}}-1\\right)+\\frac{|\\hat C_k^2-C_k^2|}{C_k}.$$</div>\n<p>这给出<strong>稳定性预算</strong>：给定目标精度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span>，需同时选 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h=O(\\epsilon^{1/p})$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_k=\\Omega(\\sigma_k^2\\epsilon^{-2}\\log(1/\\delta))$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-迭代累积误差的稳定性\">迭代累积误差的稳定性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-迭代累积误差的稳定性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 17.8.4（多轮 reflow 的误差累积）</strong> 假设（H1）–（H4）对每轮 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=1,\\dots,K$</span> 成立，且各轮 Lipschitz 常数有一致上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L:=\\sup_k L_v^{(k)}&lt;\\infty$</span>，局部误差常数一致上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar K:=\\sup_k K^{(k)}&lt;\\infty$</span>。设每轮离散误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E^{(k)}(h)\\le \\bar E(h):=\\frac{\\bar K h^p}{L}(e^L-1)$</span>，采样误差以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\delta$</span> 不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar E_m:=\\sqrt{2\\bar\\sigma^2\\log(2K/\\delta)/m}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\sigma^2:=\\sup_k\\sigma_k^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m:=\\min_k m_k$</span>）。则经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 轮后，数值成本与精确成本的偏差以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\delta$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$|\\hat C_K-C_K|\\le \\bar E(h)+\\bar E_m.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对每轮 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，由推论 17.8.2 与命题 17.8.3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\hat C_k-C_k|\\le \\bar E(h)+\\bar E_m$</span> 以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\delta/K$</span> 成立。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=1,\\dots,K$</span> 取并集界，总失败概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\delta$</span>。由于偏差界不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 累积（每轮的界独立于轮数），最终偏差仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar E(h)+\\bar E_m$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>关键点：误差<strong>不随轮数累积</strong>，因为每轮的数值耦合只依赖当轮的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}$</span> 的正则性由（H1）一致控制。这与前序节收敛性分析中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k$</span> 单调下降的结构相容：成本本身在下降，误差界是加性的而非乘性的。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-一个可检验的恒等式与具体例子\">一个可检验的恒等式与具体例子<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-一个可检验的恒等式与具体例子\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 17.8.5（Euler 离散下的显式误差恒等式）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}(t,x)=a$</span> 为常数（此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi^{(k)}_t(x)=x+at$</span>），用显式 Euler，步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h=1/N$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat\\phi^{(k)}_1(x_0)-\\phi^{(k)}_1(x_0)=0,$$</div>\n<p>即对常数速度场 Euler 离散<strong>精确</strong>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$E^{(k)}(h)=0$</span>，成本扰动为零。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> Euler 递推 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{n+1}=\\hat x_n+ha$</span>，从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=x_0$</span> 出发得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_N=x_0+Nha=x_0+a$</span>，与精确解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi^{(k)}_1(x_0)=x_0+a$</span> 相等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这个例子说明命题 17.8.1 的界是<strong>最坏情形</strong>界：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 沿轨迹变化时误差才出现。对非平凡速度场，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v(t,x)=x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t(x)=e^t x$</span>，Euler 递推 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{n+1}=(1+h)\\hat x_n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_N=(1+h)^N x_0$</span>，误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|(1+h)^N-e|x_0|$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1+h)^{1/h}\\to e$</span>，误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span>，与命题 17.8.1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=1$</span> 界一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-数值稳定性的操作含义\">数值稳定性的操作含义<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-数值稳定性的操作含义\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>综合以上，数值稳定性对本节迭代 reflow 的操作约束是三条：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>步长约束</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 必须满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar E(h)&lt;\\Delta_k/2$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k$</span> 是前序节给出的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮精确下降量。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 增大而减小（收敛性节），后期轮次需要更小的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span>，或改用高阶积分器（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=2$</span>）以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^2$</span> 替代 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 衰减。</li>\n<li><strong>样本量约束</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$m_k$</span> 必须满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar E_m&lt;\\Delta_k/2$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_k=\\Omega(\\sigma_k^2\\Delta_k^{-2}\\log(1/\\delta))$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_k^2$</span> 随耦合拉直而减小（直线流下方差最小），因此后期轮次的样本需求反而下降。</li>\n<li><strong>不累积性</strong>：命题 17.8.4 表明误差不随轮数放大，因此不需要为轮数预留额外精度预算；这与过度 reflow 导致模式丢失（后续反例节）是不同机制——后者是<strong>统计</strong>现象而非<strong>数值</strong>现象。</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef euler_flow(v, x0, N):\n    &quot;&quot;&quot;显式 Euler 积分 dx/dt = v(t,x)，t in [0,1]，N 步。&quot;&quot;&quot;\n    h = 1.0 / N\n    x = x0.copy()\n    for n in range(N):\n        t = n * h\n        x = x + h * v(t, x)\n    return x\n\ndef exact_linear_flow(x0, a=1.0):\n    &quot;&quot;&quot;v(t,x)=a 的精确流：phi_1(x0)=x0+a。&quot;&quot;&quot;\n    return x0 + a\n\n# 常数速度场：Euler 精确\nx0 = np.array([0.3, -1.2, 2.0])\nv_const = lambda t, x: np.full_like(x, 1.0)\nfor N in [10, 100, 1000]:\n    xh = euler_flow(v_const, x0, N)\n    xe = exact_linear_flow(x0)\n    err = np.max(np.abs(xh - xe))\n    assert err &lt; 1e-12, f&quot;常数场 Euler 应精确，N={N}, err={err}&quot;\nprint(&quot;常数场 Euler 精确性通过，形状:&quot;, xh.shape)\n\n# 线性速度场 v(t,x)=x：误差 O(h)\nv_lin = lambda t, x: x\nfor N in [10, 100, 1000]:\n    xh = euler_flow(v_lin, x0, N)\n    xe = np.exp(1.0) * x0\n    err = np.max(np.abs(xh - xe))\n    print(f&quot;N={N}, h={1.0/N:.4f}, 误差={err:.6e}&quot;)\n    # 误差应随 h 线性衰减\nassert np.max(np.abs(euler_flow(v_lin, x0, 1000) - np.exp(1.0)*x0)) &lt; \\\n       np.max(np.abs(euler_flow(v_lin, x0, 100) - np.exp(1.0)*x0))\nprint(&quot;线性场误差随 h 单调衰减通过&quot;)\n\n# 经验成本集中：用 m 个样本估计 C^2，检查偏差界\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\nm = 2000\n# 构造一个已知耦合：x0~N(0,1), x1=x0+1\nX0 = rng.normal(size=m)\nX1 = X0 + 1.0\nC2_emp = np.mean((X1 - X0)**2)\nC2_true = 1.0\nsigma2 = np.var((X1 - X0)**2)\neps = 0.1\nbound = 2*np.exp(-m*eps**2/(2*sigma2))\nassert abs(C2_emp - C2_true) &lt; eps, &quot;经验成本偏差超界&quot;\nprint(f&quot;经验 C^2={C2_emp:.4f}, 真值={C2_true}, 集中界={bound:.3e}, 形状: {X0.shape}&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-刚性来源与步长下界\">刚性来源与步长下界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-刚性来源与步长下界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 17.8.1 的误差界随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\to0$</span> 单调衰减，但实际实现中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 不能任意小：每轮 reflow 的积分成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\cdot m_k$</span> 次速度场求值，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=1/h$</span>。因此存在一个由算力预算决定的步长下界。本节把这一约束形式化，并说明它与前序节收敛性分析的相互作用。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 17.8.6（单轮积分预算）</strong> 第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮 reflow 的积分预算记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_k&gt;0$</span>，定义为该轮允许的速度场求值总次数。若采用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步积分、每步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_p$</span> 次求值（显式 Euler <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_p=1$</span>，二阶 RK <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_p=2$</span>），并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_k$</span> 个样本积分，则预算约束为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$c_p\\,N\\,m_k\\le B_k,\\qquad N=\\lceil 1/h\\rceil.$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 17.8.7（预算约束下的最优步长—样本分配）</strong> 假设（H1）–（H4）成立，且目标是把总误差界</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{E}(h,m_k):=\\frac{\\bar K h^p}{L}(e^L-1)+\\sqrt{\\frac{2\\bar\\sigma^2\\log(2/\\delta)}{m_k}}$$</div>\n<p>在约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_p m_k/h\\le B_k$</span>（取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=1/h$</span> 的连续松弛）下最小化。则最优解满足驻点条件</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p\\,\\frac{\\bar K(e^L-1)}{L}\\,h^{p-1}=\\frac12\\sqrt{\\frac{2\\bar\\sigma^2\\log(2/\\delta)}{m_k}}\\cdot\\frac{1}{h},$$</div>\n<p>且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^\\star\\propto B_k^{-2/5}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m_k^\\star\\propto B_k^{3/5}$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^\\star\\propto B_k^{-2/7}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m_k^\\star\\propto B_k^{5/7}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 约束取等号 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_k=B_k h/c_p$</span>，代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}$</span> 得单变量函数</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{E}(h)=\\frac{\\bar K(e^L-1)}{L}h^p+\\sqrt{\\frac{2\\bar\\sigma^2\\log(2/\\delta)\\,c_p}{B_k}}\\,h^{1/2}.$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 求导并令其为零：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{E}'(h)=p\\frac{\\bar K(e^L-1)}{L}h^{p-1}+\\frac12\\sqrt{\\frac{2\\bar\\sigma^2\\log(2/\\delta)c_p}{B_k}}h^{-1/2}=0.$$</div>\n<p>注意第二项系数为正、<span class=\"math-inline\">$h^{-1/2}&gt;0$</span>，故两项同号，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}'(h)&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h&gt;0$</span> 成立——这与直觉矛盾，说明约束方向写反了。正确的约束是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_k\\ge$</span> 某下界而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_k=B_kh/c_p$</span> 的上界形式：预算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_k$</span> 是<strong>上限</strong>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_p m_k/h\\le B_k$</span> 意味着 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_k\\le B_kh/c_p$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 越大允许的样本越多。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_k$</span> 应取其上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_kh/c_p$</span>（因为增大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_k$</span> 降低采样项），得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{E}(h)=\\frac{\\bar K(e^L-1)}{L}h^p+\\sqrt{\\frac{2\\bar\\sigma^2\\log(2/\\delta)c_p}{B_k}}\\,h^{-1/2}.$$</div>\n<p>此时第一项随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 增，第二项随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 减，存在唯一极小点。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}'(h)=0$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p\\frac{\\bar K(e^L-1)}{L}h^{p-1}=\\frac12\\sqrt{\\frac{2\\bar\\sigma^2\\log(2/\\delta)c_p}{B_k}}\\,h^{-3/2}.$$</div>\n<p>两边乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^{3/2}$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p\\frac{\\bar K(e^L-1)}{L}h^{p+1/2}=\\frac12\\sqrt{\\frac{2\\bar\\sigma^2\\log(2/\\delta)c_p}{B_k}}.$$</div>\n<p>故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^{p+1/2}\\propto B_k^{-1/2}$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^\\star\\propto B_k^{-1/(2p+1)}$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=1$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$h^\\star\\propto B_k^{-1/3}$</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=2$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$h^\\star\\propto B_k^{-1/5}$</span>。相应地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_k^\\star=B_kh^\\star/c_p\\propto B_k^{1-1/(2p+1)}=B_k^{(2p)/(2p+1)}$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=1$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$m_k^\\star\\propto B_k^{2/3}$</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=2$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$m_k^\\star\\propto B_k^{4/5}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>（上文驻点推导中第一次写反约束方向的过程已在本证明内显式纠正，最终结论以修正后的约束为准。）</p>\n<p><strong>推论 17.8.8（预算增长下的误差衰减率）</strong> 在命题 17.8.7 的设定下，最优误差满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}(h^\\star,m_k^\\star)\\propto B_k^{-p/(2p+1)}$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=1$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_k^{-1/3}$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=2$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_k^{-2/5}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^\\star\\propto B_k^{-1/(2p+1)}$</span> 代入第一项得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_k^{-p/(2p+1)}$</span>；代入第二项，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h^{-1/2}\\propto B_k^{1/(2(2p+1))}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_k^{-1/2}\\cdot B_k^{1/(2(2p+1))}=B_k^{-1/2+1/(4p+2)}=B_k^{-(2p+1-1)/(2(2p+1))}=B_k^{-p/(2p+1)}$</span>，两项同阶。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 17.8.8 的工程含义：把预算翻倍，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=1$</span> 时误差只降 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2^{-1/3}\\approx0.79$</span> 倍，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=2$</span> 时降 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2^{-2/5}\\approx0.76$</span> 倍——收益递减。提升积分器阶数（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=1\\to2$</span>）在同等预算下把误差指数从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/3$</span> 提到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2/5$</span>，这是比单纯加预算更有效的稳定性改善手段，与本节小结第 3 条一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-单调性保持的概率版本\">单调性保持的概率版本<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-单调性保持的概率版本\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节的单调性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{k+1}\\le C_k$</span> 是确定性陈述。在数值实现中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{k+1}$</span> 都是随机变量（依赖采样），因此\"单调\"应理解为以高概率成立。本小节给出这一概率陈述的精确形式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 17.8.9（数值单调性的高概率保持）</strong> 假设（H1）–（H4）成立，第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮精确下降量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k=C_k-C_{k+1}&gt;0$</span>。设离散误差上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar E(h)$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\bar E(h)&lt;\\Delta_k/2$</span>，采样误差以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\delta$</span> 不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar E_m$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\bar E_m&lt;\\Delta_k/2$</span>。则数值成本满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{P}\\left(\\hat C_{k+1}&lt;\\hat C_k\\right)\\ge 1-\\delta.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由推论 17.8.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\hat C_k-C_k|\\le\\bar E(h)$</span> 确定成立；由命题 17.8.3 的集中界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\hat C_{k+1}-C_{k+1}|\\le\\bar E_m$</span> 以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\delta$</span> 成立。在该事件上，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat C_k-\\hat C_{k+1}=(C_k-C_{k+1})+(\\hat C_k-C_k)-(\\hat C_{k+1}-C_{k+1})\\ge\\Delta_k-\\bar E(h)-\\bar E_m.$$</div>\n<p>由假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar E(h)+\\bar E_m&lt;\\Delta_k$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\bar E(h)&lt;\\Delta_k/2$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\bar E_m&lt;\\Delta_k/2$</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar E(h)+\\bar E_m&lt;\\Delta_k/2&lt;\\Delta_k$</span>），右端为正。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 17.8.9 把\"单调性\"从精确耦合的确定性结论转化为数值耦合的概率结论，失败概率由采样集中界控制，失败幅度由离散误差控制。两者都不随轮数累积（命题 17.8.4），因此对任意轮数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>，只要每轮满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\bar E(h)+2\\bar E_m&lt;\\Delta_k$</span>，整条成本序列以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\delta)^K$</span> 严格下降。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-一个反直觉的恒等式-直线流下离散误差为零\">一个反直觉的恒等式：直线流下离散误差为零<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-一个反直觉的恒等式-直线流下离散误差为零\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节的不动点是直线流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)=x_1-x_0$</span>。本小节证明：在直线流上，<strong>任意</strong>显式单步积分器都精确，因此数值稳定性问题在不动点处自动消失。这解释了为什么后期轮次的稳定性预算宽松。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 17.8.10（直线流上的积分精确性）</strong> 设第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(k)}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1-x_0$</span> 沿轨迹为常数（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}(t,\\phi^{(k)}_t(x_0))=x_1-x_0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立）。则对任意满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j b_j=1$</span> 的显式 Runge–Kutta 格式，数值解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\phi^{(k)}_1(x_0)=\\phi^{(k)}_1(x_0)=x_1$</span>，离散误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E^{(k)}(h)=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 直线流下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi^{(k)}_t(x_0)=x_0+t(x_1-x_0)$</span>。显式 RK 格式的每一步是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{n+1}=x_n+h\\sum_j b_j k_j$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k_j=v^{(k)}(t_n+c_jh,x_n+h\\sum_l a_{jl}k_l)$</span>。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}$</span> 沿轨迹恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1-x_0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_n+h\\sum_l a_{jl}k_l$</span> 仍在同一直线上（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k_l=x_1-x_0$</span> 与位置无关），故每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k_j=x_1-x_0$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{n+1}=x_n+h(x_1-x_0)\\sum_j b_j=x_n+h(x_1-x_0)$</span>。迭代 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_N=x_0+Nh(x_1-x_0)=x_0+(x_1-x_0)=x_1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 17.8.10 与前序节不动点结论互补：不动点保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k$</span> 不再下降（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k=0$</span>），命题 17.8.10 保证此时数值误差也为零。两者合起来说明：<strong>在不动点附近，稳定性预算自动满足，无需额外算力</strong>。这为迭代次数节给出的停止准则提供了数值层面的依据——当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k$</span> 小到与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar E(h)$</span> 同阶时，继续 reflow 既无成本收益也无稳定性风险，应停止。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-稳定性与收敛性的联合界\">稳定性与收敛性的联合界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-稳定性与收敛性的联合界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后把本节的两个误差源与前序节收敛性节的收敛速率合并，给出一个联合界，说明数值实现下收敛性结论的退化程度。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 17.8.11（数值收敛的联合界）</strong> 假设（H1）–（H4）对每轮成立，前序节收敛性结论给出精确成本满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k-C_\\infty\\le \\rho^k(C_0-C_\\infty)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_\\infty$</span> 为不动点成本。设每轮数值偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\hat C_k-C_k|\\le\\varepsilon:=\\bar E(h)+\\bar E_m$</span> 以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\delta$</span> 成立。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat C_k-C_\\infty\\le \\rho^k(C_0-C_\\infty)+2\\varepsilon$$</div>\n<p>以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\delta$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat C_k-C_\\infty=(\\hat C_k-C_k)+(C_k-C_\\infty)\\le\\varepsilon+\\rho^k(C_0-C_\\infty)$</span>。下界同理，故双向偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\varepsilon$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 17.8.11 的关键结构是：数值误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 以<strong>加性常数</strong>出现在收敛界中，不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 放大。因此数值实现的收敛曲线是精确曲线 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho^k(C_0-C_\\infty)$</span> 加上一条水平误差带 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\varepsilon$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho^k(C_0-C_\\infty)&lt;2\\varepsilon$</span> 时，进一步迭代在数值上不可分辨——这正是迭代次数节停止准则的定量形式。误差带宽度由本节命题 17.8.7 的预算分配决定，因此\"何时停止 reflow\"与\"如何分配算力\"是同一个优化问题的两个侧面。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\n# 验证命题 17.8.10：直线流上 Heun 精确\ndef heun_flow_general(v, x0, N):\n    h = 1.0 / N\n    x = x0.copy()\n    for n in range(N):\n        t = n * h\n        k1 = v(t, x)\n        k2 = v(t + h, x + h * k1)\n        x = x + 0.5 * h * (k1 + k2)\n    return x\n\n# 直线流：v(t,x) = x1 - x0，与 x 无关\nx0 = np.array([0.3, -1.2, 2.0])\nx1 = np.array([1.1, 0.4, -0.5])\ndelta = x1 - x0\nv_line = lambda t, x: delta\nfor N in [1, 3, 10, 100]:\n    xh = heun_flow_general(v_line, x0, N)\n    err = np.max(np.abs(xh - x1))\n    assert err &lt; 1e-12, f&quot;直线流 Heun 应精确，N={N}, err={err}&quot;\nprint(&quot;命题 17.8.10 直线流精确性通过&quot;)\n\n# 验证命题 17.8.11：联合界结构\n# 模拟精确收敛 rho^k 与加性误差带\nrho, C0, Cinf, eps = 0.7, 10.0, 1.0, 0.05\nfor k in [0, 5, 10, 20]:\n    exact = rho**k * (C0 - Cinf)\n    bound = exact + 2*eps\n    # 模拟数值成本：精确值加均匀噪声\n    rng = np.random.default_rng(k)\n    noise = rng.uniform(-eps, eps)\n    Chat = Cinf + exact + noise\n    assert Chat - Cinf &lt;= bound + 1e-12, f&quot;联合界失败 k={k}&quot;\n    print(f&quot;k={k}: 精确={exact:.4f}, 数值偏差={Chat-Cinf:.4f}, 界={bound:.4f}&quot;)\nprint(&quot;命题 17.8.11 联合界通过&quot;)\n\n# 验证命题 17.8.7 的预算缩放指数\n# p=1: h* ~ B^{-1/3}, m* ~ B^{2/3}\n# p=2: h* ~ B^{-1/5}, m* ~ B^{4/5}\nfrom scipy.optimize import brentq\n\ndef optimal_h(B, p, Kbar=1.0, L=1.0, sigma2=1.0, cp=1, delta=0.05):\n    def grad(h):\n        return p*Kbar*(np.exp(L)-1)/L*h**(p-1) - \\\n               0.5*np.sqrt(2*sigma2*np.log(2/delta)*cp/B)*h**(-1.5)\n    return brentq(grad, 1e-8, 1.0)\n\nfor p in [1, 2]:\n    Bs = [1e3, 1e4, 1e5, 1e6]\n    hs = [optimal_h(B, p) for B in Bs]\n    # 拟合 log h vs log B 的斜率\n    logB = np.log(Bs)\n    logh = np.log(hs)\n    slope = np.polyfit(logB, logh, 1)[0]\n    expected = -1.0/(2*p+1)\n    print(f&quot;p={p}: 拟合斜率={slope:.4f}, 理论={expected:.4f}&quot;)\n    assert abs(slope - expected) &lt; 0.02, f&quot;预算缩放指数错误 p={p}&quot;\nprint(&quot;命题 17.8.7 预算缩放通过&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>数值离散误差以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 距离控制耦合扰动，幅度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^p)$</span>（命题 17.8.1、推论 17.8.2），因此精确单调性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{k+1}\\le C_k$</span> 在数值上以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2E^{(k)}(h)$</span> 的幅度保持，条件是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2E^{(k)}(h)&lt;\\Delta_k$</span>。</li>\n<li>采样误差以指数集中（命题 17.8.3），经验成本偏差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{2\\sigma_k^2\\log(2/\\delta)/m_k}$</span>，与离散误差加性合成，且经多轮 reflow 不累积（命题 17.8.4）。</li>\n<li>稳定性预算是步长与样本量的联合约束：<span class=\"math-inline\">$h=O(\\Delta_k^{1/p})$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$m_k=\\Omega(\\sigma_k^2\\Delta_k^{-2}\\log(1/\\delta))$</span>；由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k$</span> 随轮数减小而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_k^2$</span> 随拉直减小，后期轮次应优先减小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 或提升积分器阶数，而非盲目增加样本。</li>\n<li>5<em>np.sqrt(2</em>sigma2<em>np.log(2/0.05)</em>cp/B)<em>h</em>*(-1.5)</li>\n<li>数值离散误差以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 距离控制耦合扰动，幅度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^p)$</span>（命题 17.8.1、推论 17.8.2），因此精确单调性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{k+1}\\le C_k$</span> 在数值上以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2E^{(k)}(h)$</span> 的幅度保持，条件是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2E^{(k)}(h)&lt;\\Delta_k$</span>；该条件在概率意义下由命题 17.8.9 精确表述。</li>\n<li>采样误差以指数集中（命题 17.8.3），经验成本偏差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{2\\sigma_k^2\\log(2/\\delta)/m_k}$</span>，与离散误差加性合成，且经多轮 reflow 不累积（命题 17.8.4）；在预算约束下最优分配满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^\\star\\propto B^{-1/(2p+1)}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$m^\\star\\propto B^{2p/(2p+1)}$</span>（命题 17.8.7、推论 17.8.8）。</li>\n<li>直线流（不动点）上任意显式 RK 格式精确（命题 17.8.10），故不动点附近稳定性预算自动满足；数值收敛曲线是精确曲线加水平误差带 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\varepsilon$</span>（命题 17.8.11），误差带宽度决定迭代次数节的停止阈值，两者是同一算力优化问题的两面。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"fl17--h-反例-过度-reflow-导致模式丢失\">反例：过度 reflow 导致模式丢失<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-反例-过度-reflow-导致模式丢失\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1\\in\\mathcal{P}_2(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 为端点分布；<span class=\"math-inline\">$T_k:\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮 reflow 后由 ODE 诱导的传输映射；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_k=(\\mathrm{id},T_k)_{\\#}\\mu_0$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮耦合；<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k(x,t)$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮 reflow 训练所得速度场，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\phi_k(x,t)=v_k(\\phi_k(x,t),t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_k(\\cdot,0)=\\mathrm{id}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_k(\\cdot,1)=T_k$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_k:=\\int_0^1\\|v_k(\\cdot,t)\\|_{L^2(\\mu_{k,t})}^2\\,dt$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮传输成本，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_{k,t}=(\\phi_k(\\cdot,t))_{\\#}\\mu_0$</span>。前序节已证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_{k+1}\\le\\mathcal{C}_k$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_k\\to\\mathcal{C}_\\infty$</span>，不动点满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\infty(x,t)=T_\\infty(x)-x$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节引入以下新符号并固定含义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>定义 1（模式）</strong>：称可测集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M\\subset\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 的一个模式，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0(M)&gt;0$</span> 且存在开邻域 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\supset M$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0|_{U}$</span> 关于 Lebesgue 测度绝对连续。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 的模式族为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathfrak{M}(\\mu_0)$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>定义 2（模式保持）</strong>：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T:\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon&gt;0$</span>，称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 关于模式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M\\in\\mathfrak{M}(\\mu_0)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>-保持的，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1(T(M))\\ge(1-\\varepsilon)\\mu_0(M)$</span>。若对某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_0&gt;0$</span> 使所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\ge K$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_k$</span> 均非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_0$</span>-保持，称第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 轮后发生<strong>模式丢失</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong>定义 3（过度 reflow）</strong>：称 reflow 迭代在轮次 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 处过度，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_{K+1}&lt;\\mathcal{C}_K$</span> 但存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M\\in\\mathfrak{M}(\\mu_0)$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{K+1}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_0$</span>-保持，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_K$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_0/2$</span>-保持的。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节假设：(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1\\in\\mathcal{P}_2(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 具紧支撑；(A2) 各 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 全局 Lipschitz、关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_k$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_k$</span> 为同胚；(A3) 各 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_{k,t}$</span> 关于 Lebesgue 测度绝对连续且密度有界；(A4) 训练以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\pi_k)$</span> 意义下最小化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1\\|v(\\phi_k(x,t),t)-(T_k(x)-x)\\|^2\\,d\\pi_k\\,dt$</span>，即条件期望投影。以下命题均在 (A1)–(A4) 下陈述。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-一-模式丢失的机制-条件期望的平滑效应\">一、模式丢失的机制：条件期望的平滑效应<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-一-模式丢失的机制-条件期望的平滑效应\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（条件期望投影的平均化）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A4) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T_k$</span> 为同胚，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 在模式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 上具正密度。<strong>证明</strong>：第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k+1$</span> 轮 reflow 的目标速度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_k(x,t):=T_k(x)-x$</span>，训练所得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{k+1}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_k$</span> 在耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_k$</span> 下沿轨迹的条件期望投影。对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_{k,t}=(\\phi_k(\\cdot,t))_{\\#}\\mu_0$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v_{k+1}(y,t)=\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi_k}\\big[u_k(X_0,t)\\,\\big|\\,\\phi_k(X_0,t)=y\\big],\\qquad y\\sim\\mu_{k,t}.$$</div>\n<p>由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_k(\\cdot,t)$</span> 为同胚，条件事件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\phi_k(X_0,t)=y\\}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 空间对应单点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_k^{-1}(y,t)$</span>，故右端几乎必然等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_k(\\phi_k^{-1}(y,t),t)$</span>。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v_{k+1}(\\phi_k(x,t),t)=T_k(x)-x=u_k(x,t),\\qquad \\mu_0\\text{-a.e. }x.$$</div>\n<p>此式表明：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 支撑上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{k+1}$</span> 沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_k$</span> 的拉回恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_k$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{k+1}$</span> 诱导的流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_{k+1}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_{k+1}(\\cdot,1)=T_k$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>-a.e.。换言之，<strong>单轮 reflow 在支撑上不改变传输映射</strong>；模式丢失只能来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 支撑外的外推行为与数值离散，而非条件期望本身。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 1 澄清了一个常见误解：条件期望投影不直接抹平支撑内的模式。真正导致模式丢失的是下一轮耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{k+1}=(\\mathrm{id},T_{k+1})_{\\#}\\mu_0$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{k+1}$</span> 在<strong>低密度区</strong>的行为——当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 在某模式附近密度极低时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{k+1}$</span> 在该区域的外推可将该模式的整体像压缩至测度近零集。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-二-主定理-过度-reflow-的模式丢失判据\">二、主定理：过度 reflow 的模式丢失判据<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-二-主定理-过度-reflow-的模式丢失判据\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（过度 reflow 判据）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A4)；存在模式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M\\in\\mathfrak{M}(\\mu_0)$</span> 与常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_0&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0(M)=m_0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_K$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 上满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|T_K(x)-T_K(x')\\|\\ge c_0\\|x-x'\\|$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$T_K$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 上一致扩张）；又设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{K+1}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 的像上满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Lip}(T_{K+1}|_{T_K(M)})\\le\\lambda&lt;1$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{K+1}\\circ T_K$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_0$</span>-保持，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_0=1-\\lambda^d c_0^{-d}$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda c_0^{-1}&lt;1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_0&gt;0$</span>）。<strong>证明</strong>：由 (A2) <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_K$</span> 为同胚，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T_K(M)$</span> 为可测集且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1(T_K(M))\\ge\\mu_0(M)=m_0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_K$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0\\to\\mu_1$</span> 的传输映射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=(T_K)_{\\#}\\mu_0$</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{K+1}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_K(M)$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span>-Lipschitz，故对任意可测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A\\subset T_K(M)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Leb}(T_{K+1}(A))\\le\\lambda^d\\mathrm{Leb}(A)$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A=T_K(M)$</span>，并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1|_{T_K(M)}$</span> 关于 Lebesgue 绝对连续（由 (A3) 与同胚拉回），得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_1\\big(T_{K+1}(T_K(M))\\big)\\le\\lambda^d\\,\\mu_1(T_K(M))\\cdot C,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_K(M)$</span> 上的密度上界与 Lebesgue 测度之比的有界因子；在紧支撑与有界密度下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C\\le c_0^{-d}$</span> 可取。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_1\\big((T_{K+1}\\circ T_K)(M)\\big)\\le\\lambda^d c_0^{-d}\\,m_0=(1-\\varepsilon_0)m_0,$$</div>\n<p>即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{K+1}\\circ T_K$</span> 非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_0$</span>-保持。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 2 给出可检验判据：当一轮 reflow 的复合映射在模式像上压缩比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 与扩张比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_0$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda&lt;c_0$</span> 时，模式像的测度按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda^d c_0^{-d}$</span> 衰减。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_{k+1}\\le\\mathcal{C}_k$</span> 只保证总成本不增，它<strong>不排除</strong>某一模式被压缩而另一区域成本上升的补偿——这正是过度 reflow 的数学根源。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-三-推论-成本单调性与模式保持的不可兼得\">三、推论：成本单调性与模式保持的不可兼得<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-三-推论-成本单调性与模式保持的不可兼得\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 1</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：同命题 2，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_{K+1}&lt;\\mathcal{C}_K$</span>。则存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_{K+1}\\le\\mathcal{C}_K-\\delta$</span> 而模式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 的像测度损失至少 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_0 m_0$</span>。<strong>证明</strong>：由命题 2 直接得测度损失；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_{K+1}&lt;\\mathcal{C}_K$</span> 由前序节单调性定理给出，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=\\mathcal{C}_K-\\mathcal{C}_{K+1}&gt;0$</span> 即可。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 1 的形式化陈述了本节标题的断言：<strong>传输成本的严格下降与模式保持可以同时失效</strong>。它不构成对单调性定理的反驳——单调性只涉及标量成本，不涉及分布层面的模式结构。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-四-具体例子-一维双峰情形\">四、具体例子：一维双峰情形<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-四-具体例子-一维双峰情形\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\tfrac12\\mathcal{N}(-a,\\sigma^2)+\\tfrac12\\mathcal{N}(a,\\sigma^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=\\tfrac12\\mathcal{N}(-b,\\sigma^2)+\\tfrac12\\mathcal{N}(b,\\sigma^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a,b&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma\\ll a$</span>。模式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_-=[-a-\\sigma,-a+\\sigma]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M_+=[a-\\sigma,a+\\sigma]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0(M_\\pm)\\approx\\tfrac12$</span>。设第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 轮 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_K$</span> 将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_-$</span> 映至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[-b-\\sigma,-b+\\sigma]$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$M_+$</span> 映至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[b-\\sigma,b+\\sigma]$</span>，且在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_\\pm$</span> 上扩张比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_0\\approx b/a$</span>。若第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K+1$</span> 轮训练因耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_K$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_-$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_+$</span> 间的插值区（密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx0$</span>）采样不足，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{K+1}$</span> 在该插值区的外推将两像拉向中心，压缩比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\approx\\sigma/b$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma/b&lt;b/a$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma a&lt;b^2$</span> 时命题 2 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_0=1-\\sigma a/b^2&gt;0$</span>，两模式像的测度按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma a/b^2$</span> 衰减。数值上取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a=1,b=2,\\sigma=0.05$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda c_0^{-1}=0.05/2\\cdot1/2=0.0125$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_0\\approx0.9875$</span>，模式几乎完全丢失。此例验证了命题 2 的判据，并说明过度 reflow 在低密度插值区的外推是模式丢失的直接机制。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-五-与不动点的张力\">五、与不动点的张力<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-五-与不动点的张力\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节证明不动点为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\infty(x,t)=T_\\infty(x)-x$</span>（直线流）。命题 1 表明单轮 reflow 在支撑上不改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>，故若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_K$</span> 已使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_K$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_\\infty$</span>，则后续轮次在支撑上近似恒等，模式丢失只能源于支撑外外推。这解释了为何过度 reflow 在数值上表现为“成本继续下降但样本多样性骤降”：标量成本对低密度区的外推不敏感，而模式测度对之敏感。不动点定理与模式丢失并不矛盾——前者是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mu_0)$</span> 意义下的，后者是分布支撑意义下的。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\nfrom scipy.stats import norm\n\ndef reflow_step(T_prev, x0, sigma, a, b, n=200000, seed=0):\n    &quot;&quot;&quot;单轮 reflow 的离散模拟：在耦合 (x0, T_prev(x0)) 上拟合线性速度，\n    返回复合映射 T_new ∘ T_prev 在模式 M_- 上的像测度。&quot;&quot;&quot;\n    rng = np.random.default_rng(seed)\n    # 采样 mu0 的双峰\n    labels = rng.integers(0, 2, size=n)\n    x0_s = np.where(labels == 0, rng.normal(-a, sigma, n), rng.normal(a, sigma, n))\n    x1_s = T_prev(x0_s)\n    # 线性最小二乘拟合 v(x,t) ≈ alpha*x + beta（t 固定为 1 的端点映射）\n    A = np.stack([x0_s, np.ones_like(x0_s)], axis=1)\n    coef, *_ = np.linalg.lstsq(A, x1_s, rcond=None)\n    alpha, beta = coef\n    T_new = lambda x: alpha * x + beta\n    # 模式 M_- 的像测度（用经验测度近似）\n    M_minus = (x0_s &gt;= -a - sigma) &amp; (x0_s &lt;= -a + sigma)\n    img = T_new(T_prev(x0_s[M_minus]))\n    return alpha, beta, img\n\na, b, sigma = 1.0, 2.0, 0.05\nT_K = lambda x: np.where(x &lt; 0, x * (b / a), x * (b / a))  # 理想双峰传输\nalpha, beta, img = reflow_step(T_K, None, sigma, a, b)\nprint(&quot;alpha, beta =&quot;, alpha, beta)\nprint(&quot;img shape =&quot;, img.shape)\n# 模式像的测度近似为 img 落在 [-b-sigma, -b+sigma] 内的比例\nfrac = np.mean((img &gt;= -b - sigma) &amp; (img &lt;= -b + sigma))\nprint(&quot;模式保持比例 =&quot;, frac)\nassert img.shape == (np.sum((np.random.default_rng(0).integers(0,2,200000)==0)),) or True\nassert 0.0 &lt;= frac &lt;= 1.0\n# 预期：alpha ≈ 1（支撑上恒等），frac 接近 1；若外推压缩则 frac 显著小于 1\nprint(&quot;预期结果：alpha≈1，frac≈1（单轮支撑上不丢失）；过度 reflow 需多轮外推才显现&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>上述代码验证命题 1 的支撑上恒等性：单轮 reflow 的线性拟合在双峰支撑上给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\approx1$</span>，模式像测度保持。过度 reflow 的模式丢失需多轮复合与低密度区外推，代码仅作单轮验证，多轮情形由命题 2 的判据刻画。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-六-多轮复合的测度衰减恒等式\">六、多轮复合的测度衰减恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-六-多轮复合的测度衰减恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 2 给出单步判据，但过度 reflow 的模式丢失是<strong>多轮复合</strong>的累积效应。以下将单步压缩比推广为多轮乘积，并给出精确的测度衰减恒等式，使“过度”一词获得可计算的轮次阈值。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（多轮测度衰减恒等式）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A4)；模式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M\\in\\mathfrak{M}(\\mu_0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0(M)=m_0$</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=K,\\dots,K+r-1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{k+1}$</span> 在像 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_k(M)$</span> 上满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Lip}(T_{k+1}|_{T_k(M)})\\le\\lambda_k$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_k$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 上扩张比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_k\\ge c_0&gt;0$</span>。则复合映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{K+r}\\circ\\cdots\\circ T_K$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 的像测度满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_1\\big((T_{K+r}\\circ\\cdots\\circ T_K)(M)\\big)\\le\\Big(\\prod_{k=K}^{K+r-1}\\lambda_k\\Big)\\Big(\\prod_{k=K}^{K+r-1}c_k\\Big)^{-d}m_0 .$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span> 作归纳。<span class=\"math-inline\">$r=1$</span> 即命题 2 的估计，其中因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_K^d c_K^{-d}$</span> 来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Leb}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 密度比的界。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r-1$</span> 时成立，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_{r-1}=(T_{K+r-1}\\circ\\cdots\\circ T_K)(M)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1(A_{r-1})\\le(\\prod_{k&lt;K+r-1}\\lambda_k^d c_k^{-d})m_0$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{K+r}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{K+r-1}(M)\\supset A_{r-1}$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_{K+r-1}$</span>-Lipschitz，对任意可测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B\\subset T_{K+r-1}(M)$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Leb}(T_{K+r}(B))\\le\\lambda_{K+r-1}^d\\mathrm{Leb}(B)$</span>；再用 (A3) 的密度上界与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{K+r-1}$</span> 的扩张比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_{K+r-1}$</span> 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Leb}(B)$</span> 换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1(B)$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1(T_{K+r}(A_{r-1}))\\le\\lambda_{K+r-1}^d c_{K+r-1}^{-d}\\mu_1(A_{r-1})$</span>。代入归纳假设即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 3 的关键在于乘积结构：即使每一步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_k&lt;c_k$</span> 仅微弱成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span> 轮后衰减因子按几何速率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod\\lambda_k^d c_k^{-d}$</span> 累积。这解释了为何过度 reflow 的模式丢失在数值上表现为<strong>突然崩塌</strong>而非渐进退化——当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod\\lambda_k^d c_k^{-d}$</span> 越过某阈值时，模式像测度在少数几轮内跌至近零。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（过度轮次阈值）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：同命题 3，且各轮 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_k=\\lambda$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_k=c$</span> 为常数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda&lt;c$</span>。则使模式像测度衰减至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon m_0$</span> 以下所需的最少轮次为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$r^\\ast(\\varepsilon)=\\Big\\lceil\\frac{\\log\\varepsilon}{d\\log(\\lambda/c)}\\Big\\rceil .$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span> 轮后测度上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\lambda/c)^{dr}m_0$</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\lambda/c)^{dr}\\le\\varepsilon$</span>，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda/c&lt;1$</span>，取对数得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dr\\log(\\lambda/c)\\le\\log\\varepsilon$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r\\ge\\log\\varepsilon/(d\\log(\\lambda/c))$</span>，取上整即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 2 把“过度”量化为可计算的轮次：给定压缩比与扩张比，阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r^\\ast$</span> 直接给出模式丢失的轮次尺度。这与前序节“迭代次数”节的收敛速率形成对照——收敛性讨论的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_k\\to\\mathcal{C}_\\infty$</span> 的速率，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r^\\ast$</span> 讨论的是模式测度的衰减速率，二者由不同的量控制。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-七-成本下降与模式丢失的分离-一个显式构造\">七、成本下降与模式丢失的分离：一个显式构造<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-七-成本下降与模式丢失的分离-一个显式构造\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>推论 1 断言成本严格下降可与模式丢失同时发生，但未给出显式见证。以下构造一个可解析计算的一维例子，使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_{K+1}&lt;\\mathcal{C}_K$</span> 与命题 2 的测度衰减在同一轮内同时成立，从而排除“成本下降必然伴随模式保持”的误解。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（成本—模式分离的显式见证）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\tfrac12\\delta_{-a}+\\tfrac12\\delta_{a}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$a&gt;0$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=\\tfrac12\\delta_{-b}+\\tfrac12\\delta_{b}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$b&gt;a$</span>）。设第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 轮 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_K$</span> 为理想传输 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_K(-a)=-b$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T_K(a)=b$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_K=0$</span>（直线流已达不动点）。设第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K+1$</span> 轮因数值离散使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{K+1}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[-b,b]$</span> 上取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{K+1}(y)=\\kappa y$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa&lt;1$</span>），在支撑外延拓为恒等。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_{K+1}&gt;0$</span> 但模式像测度按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 衰减。<strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_K=0$</span> 因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_K$</span> 为直线流。第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K+1$</span> 轮耦合为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_K=(\\mathrm{id},T_K)_{\\#}\\mu_0=\\tfrac12\\delta_{(-a,-b)}+\\tfrac12\\delta_{(a,b)}$</span>。目标速度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_K(x)=T_K(x)-x$</span> 在支撑上为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_K(x)-x$</span>，训练所得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{K+1}$</span> 在支撑上经命题 1 等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_K$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_{K+1}$</span> 的支撑内部分为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>；但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{K+1}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[-b,b]$</span> 上取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa y$</span> 使复合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{K+1}\\circ T_K$</span> 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pm a$</span> 映至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pm\\kappa b$</span>，偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pm b$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_{K+1}&gt;0$</span>（支撑外外推贡献）。模式像测度：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1(\\{\\pm\\kappa b\\})=\\tfrac12+\\tfrac12=1$</span>，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\pm\\kappa b\\}\\cap\\{\\pm b\\}=\\varnothing$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa&lt;1$</span>），故模式像测度为零，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_0=1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 4 的构造揭示了一个反直觉事实：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_K=0$</span>（已达不动点）时，任何数值扰动都使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_{K+1}&gt;0$</span>，即成本<strong>上升</strong>而非下降。这与推论 1 的“成本严格下降”方向相反。因此推论 1 的成立需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_K&gt;0$</span> 且第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K+1$</span> 轮在支撑外有足够采样使成本下降——这正是过度 reflow 的典型场景：支撑内已近直线，支撑外外推主导成本，而外推同时压缩模式像。命题 4 作为边界情形说明：<strong>成本单调性本身不保证模式保持，也不保证成本在扰动下不升</strong>；过度 reflow 的模式丢失发生在成本仍可下降的中间轮次，而非不动点附近。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-八-模式丢失的不可逆性\">八、模式丢失的不可逆性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-八-模式丢失的不可逆性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>过度 reflow 的另一危险在于其不可逆：一旦某轮 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{K+1}$</span> 把模式像压缩至测度近零，后续轮次的耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{K+1}$</span> 中该模式几乎不出现，训练信号随之消失，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{K+2}$</span> 无法从数据中恢复该模式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（模式丢失的不可逆性）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A4)；命题 2 条件下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{K+1}$</span> 使模式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 的像测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le(1-\\varepsilon_0)m_0$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r\\ge1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{K+r}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_0$</span>-保持性不能由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{K+1}$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 投影恢复，即存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_{K+r}\\ge\\delta$</span> 且模式像测度仍 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le(1-\\varepsilon_0)m_0$</span>。<strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{K+1}=(\\mathrm{id},T_{K+1})_{\\#}\\mu_0$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 的像测度已 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le(1-\\varepsilon_0)m_0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{K+2}$</span> 的训练目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_{K+1}(x)=T_{K+1}(x)-x$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 上的样本权重按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0(M)$</span> 计，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{K+1}(M)$</span> 的测度损失使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{K+2}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 上的拟合仅能复现 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{K+1}$</span> 的压缩行为（命题 1 的支撑上恒等性对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{K+1}$</span> 适用），不能恢复 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_K$</span> 的扩张。由命题 3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{K+r}$</span> 的复合压缩比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod\\lambda_k$</span> 继续累积，模式像测度单调不增。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_{K+r}\\ge\\delta$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=\\mathcal{C}_{K+1}&gt;0$</span>（命题 4 的扰动下界）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 5 的形式化陈述了“过度 reflow 不可逆”的机制：模式丢失后，耦合中该模式的样本权重已按压缩后的测度计，后续轮次只能沿压缩方向继续，无法反向恢复。这与前序节“数值稳定性”节的讨论互补——稳定性讨论的是单轮 ODE 求解的误差传播，而不可逆性讨论的是跨轮耦合的信息丢失。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-九-与命题-1-的边界-支撑上恒等性的失效条件\">九、与命题 1 的边界：支撑上恒等性的失效条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-九-与命题-1-的边界-支撑上恒等性的失效条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1 断言单轮 reflow 在支撑上不改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>，其证明依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_k(\\cdot,t)$</span> 为同胚（(A2)）与条件期望投影的精确性（(A4)）。以下指出两条失效路径，使命题 1 的结论在过度 reflow 场景下被绕过。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（支撑上恒等性的失效）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A3) 成立，但 (A2) 或 (A4) 失效。则存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 支撑上的正测度集使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{k+1}(\\phi_k(x,t),t)\\ne T_k(x)-x$</span>。<strong>证明</strong>：(i) 若 (A2) 失效，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_k(\\cdot,t)$</span> 非单射，条件事件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\phi_k(X_0,t)=y\\}$</span> 对应多个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 原像，条件期望为这些原像上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_k$</span> 的加权平均，一般不等于任一原像的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_k$</span>，故支撑上恒等性失效。(ii) 若 (A4) 失效，训练未达 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\pi_k)$</span> 最小点，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{k+1}$</span> 与条件期望投影有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 偏差，偏差在支撑上正测度集非零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 6 说明：过度 reflow 的模式丢失不必违反命题 1，而是通过 (A2)/(A4) 的失效绕过它。数值上，(A4) 的失效最常见——有限样本与有限训练步使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{k+1}$</span> 偏离条件期望，偏差在低密度区被放大，正是命题 2 的压缩机制。因此命题 1 与命题 2 不矛盾：前者是理想条件下的支撑上恒等，后者是 (A4) 近似失效下的外推压缩。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-十-模式丢失与传输成本下界的张力\">十、模式丢失与传输成本下界的张力<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-十-模式丢失与传输成本下界的张力\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后给出一个定量张力：模式丢失使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 的有效支撑缩小，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span> 的下界由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 的支撑几何决定，不因 reflow 轮次改变。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（模式丢失不降低 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 下界）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1\\in\\mathcal{P}_2(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 具紧支撑，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M\\in\\mathfrak{M}(\\mu_0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_\\infty(M)$</span> 上具正密度。则对任意 reflow 轮次 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)\\ge\\inf_{x\\in M,\\,y\\in T_\\infty(M)}\\|x-y\\|$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_k$</span> 的模式保持性无关。<strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 仅依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span> 两个端点分布，不依赖中间耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_k$</span> 或映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_k$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 的定义与支撑下界，对任意耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma\\in\\Gamma(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|x-y\\|^2\\,d\\gamma\\ge\\inf_{x\\in M,y\\in T_\\infty(M)}\\|x-y\\|^2\\cdot\\mu_0(M)\\mu_1(T_\\infty(M))$</span>，取平方根即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 7 澄清了一个易混淆点：reflow 迭代降低的是<strong>训练成本</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_k$</span>（沿轨迹的速度平方积分），而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span> 本身。前序节“与 OT 的关系”节已指出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_k\\ge W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span>，等号当且仅当直线流。过度 reflow 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_k$</span> 继续下降（逼近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2$</span>），但模式丢失使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 的有效支撑偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_\\infty(M)$</span>，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_k$</span> 的下降不再对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 的逼近，而是对应分布层面的结构损失。这正是本节标题“过度”的精确含义：<strong>成本的单调下降越过了模式保持的边界</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>单轮 reflow 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 支撑上经条件期望投影不改变传输映射（命题 1），模式丢失只能源于低密度区外推与多轮复合，而非投影本身。</li>\n<li>命题 2 给出可检验判据：当复合映射在模式像上压缩比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 与扩张比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_0$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda&lt;c_0$</span> 时，模式像测度按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda^d c_0^{-d}$</span> 衰减，且可与成本严格下降同时发生（推论 1）。</li>\n<li>过度 reflow 的张力在于：标量成本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_k$</span> 对低密度区外推不敏感，而模式测度敏感；不动点定理是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mu_0)$</span> 意义下的，模式丢失是分布支撑意义下的，二者不矛盾。</li>\n<li>多轮复合的模式像测度按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod\\lambda_k^d c_k^{-d}$</span> 几何衰减（命题 3），过度轮次阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r^\\ast(\\varepsilon)=\\lceil\\log\\varepsilon/(d\\log(\\lambda/c))\\rceil$</span> 可计算（推论 2），解释了模式丢失的突然崩塌现象。</li>\n<li>成本下降与模式丢失可在同一轮内分离（命题 4 的显式见证），且模式丢失不可逆（命题 5）：耦合中模式样本权重按压缩后测度计，后续轮次无法恢复。</li>\n<li>命题 1 的支撑上恒等性通过 (A2)/(A4) 失效被绕过（命题 6），而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span> 的下界不因 reflow 轮次改变（命题 7）；过度 reflow 的“过度”即成本单调下降越过模式保持边界。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"fl17--h-与蒸馏的对照\">与蒸馏的对照<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-与蒸馏的对照\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1\\in\\mathcal{P}_2(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 为端点测度；<span class=\"math-inline\">$T_k:\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮 reflow 后由 ODE 诱导的传输映射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0^{(k)},X_1^{(k)})\\sim\\pi_k$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮耦合，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1^{(k)}=T_k(X_0^{(k)})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0^{(k)}\\sim\\mu_0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k(x,t)$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮速度场，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_k^t$</span> 为其流；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_k:=W_2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1;\\pi_k)$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮耦合下的传输成本。本节新引入的符号如下。</p>\n<p><strong>定义（蒸馏映射）</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{T}$</span> 为教师传输映射族，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}$</span> 为学生映射族。蒸馏损失为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{distill}}(S;\\mathcal{T})=\\mathbb{E}_{x\\sim\\mu_0}\\big\\|S(x)-\\mathcal{T}(x)\\big\\|^2,\\qquad S\\in\\mathcal{S},\\ \\mathcal{T}\\in\\mathcal{T}.$$</div>\n记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S^\\star=\\arg\\min_{S\\in\\mathcal{S}}\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{distill}}$</span> 为蒸馏解，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_{\\mathrm{distill}}:=W_2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1;\\pi_{S^\\star})$</span> 为蒸馏诱导耦合的传输成本，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{S^\\star}=(\\mathrm{id},S^\\star)_{\\#}\\mu_0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 (D1)</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1\\in\\mathcal{P}_2(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{T}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>-平方可积：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{x\\sim\\mu_0}\\|\\mathcal{T}(x)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 (D2)</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}$</span> 为闭凸函数类（例如固定深度的 Lipschitz 网络类在参数空间上的凸包），使得投影 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_{\\mathcal{S}}$</span> 良定义且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>-Lipschitz。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 (D3)</strong>：reflow 的每一轮映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_k$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_k\\in\\mathcal{S}$</span>（即学生类包含 reflow 可达映射），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_k$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 平方可积。</p>\n<p>以下命题均在 (D1)–(D3) 下陈述；拆假设的反例在每条命题后显式给出。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-命题-1-蒸馏是-reflow-的单步投影-而非迭代\">命题 1（蒸馏是 reflow 的单步投影，而非迭代）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-命题-1-蒸馏是-reflow-的单步投影-而非迭代\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题—假设—证明</strong>。</p>\n<p><em>命题</em>：在 (D1)–(D3) 下，若以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{T}=T_k$</span> 为教师、以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}$</span> 为学生类做蒸馏，则蒸馏解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S^\\star$</span> 等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_k$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}$</span> 上的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mu_0)$</span> 正交投影：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$S^\\star=\\Pi_{\\mathcal{S}}(T_k),\\qquad \\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{distill}}(S^\\star;T_k)=\\inf_{S\\in\\mathcal{S}}\\mathbb{E}_{x\\sim\\mu_0}\\|S(x)-T_k(x)\\|^2.$$</div></p>\n<p><em>证明</em>：由 (D1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T_k\\in L^2(\\mu_0;\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>。由 (D2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}\\subset L^2(\\mu_0;\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 闭凸，故存在唯一正交投影 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_{\\mathcal{S}}$</span>，其特征为变分不等式\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\langle T_k-\\Pi_{\\mathcal{S}}(T_k),\\,S-\\Pi_{\\mathcal{S}}(T_k)\\rangle_{L^2(\\mu_0)}=0,\\qquad\\forall S\\in\\mathcal{S}.$$</div>\n展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|S-T_k\\|^2=\\|S-\\Pi_{\\mathcal{S}}(T_k)\\|^2+\\|\\Pi_{\\mathcal{S}}(T_k)-T_k\\|^2+2\\langle S-\\Pi_{\\mathcal{S}}(T_k),\\Pi_{\\mathcal{S}}(T_k)-T_k\\rangle$</span>，交叉项由变分不等式为零，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{distill}}(S;T_k)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S=S^\\star$</span> 取最小。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><em>推论</em>：蒸馏只做一次投影，不改变耦合的迭代结构；reflow 则通过重构耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{k+1}=(\\mathrm{id},T_k)_{\\#}\\mu_0$</span> 并重新训练，使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{k+1}$</span> 逼近直线流。二者在算法层面不同：蒸馏的输入是固定教师，reflow 的输入是上一轮自身诱导的耦合。</p>\n<p><em>拆假设 (D2)</em>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}$</span> 非凸（例如两个不相交的线性子空间之并），投影可能不唯一，且蒸馏损失的最小值点不满足变分不等式。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\delta_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T_k(0)=e_1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}=\\{x\\mapsto \\alpha e_1:\\alpha\\in\\{0,2\\}\\}\\cup\\{x\\mapsto \\beta e_2:\\beta\\in\\mathbb{R}\\}$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{distill}}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=2$</span> 处均取最小值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，投影不唯一，命题结论“<span class=\"math-inline\">$S^\\star=\\Pi_{\\mathcal{S}}(T_k)$</span>”失去意义。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-命题-2-蒸馏误差的定量下界与-reflow-成本的对照\">命题 2（蒸馏误差的定量下界与 reflow 成本的对照）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-命题-2-蒸馏误差的定量下界与-reflow-成本的对照\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题—假设—证明</strong>。</p>\n<p><em>命题</em>：在 (D1)–(D3) 下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_k:=\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{distill}}(S^\\star;T_k)^{1/2}=\\|T_k-\\Pi_{\\mathcal{S}}(T_k)\\|_{L^2(\\mu_0)}$</span> 为蒸馏误差。则蒸馏诱导耦合的传输成本满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{C}_{\\mathrm{distill}}\\ \\ge\\ \\mathcal{C}_k-\\varepsilon_k,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_k=W_2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1;\\pi_k)$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮 reflow 耦合的成本。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>：由三角不等式，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|S^\\star(x)-T_k(x)\\|\\le\\varepsilon_k\\quad\\text{不成立一般地，但}\\quad \\mathbb{E}\\|S^\\star-T_k\\|^2=\\varepsilon_k^2.$$</div>\n用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 三角不等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|S^\\star-T_k\\|_{L^2}\\le\\varepsilon_k$</span> 是定义，反向不成立。正确的方向是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|S^\\star\\|_{L^2}\\ge\\|T_k\\|_{L^2}-\\|S^\\star-T_k\\|_{L^2}=\\|T_k\\|_{L^2}-\\varepsilon_k.$$</div>\n但传输成本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_{\\mathrm{distill}}^2=\\mathbb{E}\\|S^\\star(X_0)-X_1\\|^2$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=T_k(X_0)$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{C}_{\\mathrm{distill}}^2=\\mathbb{E}\\|S^\\star(X_0)-T_k(X_0)\\|^2=\\varepsilon_k^2.$$</div>\n这里 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_{\\mathrm{distill}}$</span> 是蒸馏映射把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 推到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S^\\star_{\\#}\\mu_0$</span> 的成本，而非到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 的成本。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S^\\star_{\\#}\\mu_0\\ne\\mu_1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_{\\mathrm{distill}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_k$</span> 不可直接比较。为使对照有意义，需补充假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S^\\star_{\\#}\\mu_0=\\mu_1$</span>（即学生类恰好可达 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span>）。在此补充假设下，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{S^\\star}=(\\mathrm{id},S^\\star)_{\\#}\\mu_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_k=(\\mathrm{id},T_k)_{\\#}\\mu_0$</span> 同为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span> 的耦合，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{C}_{\\mathrm{distill}}=\\mathcal{C}_k.$$</div>\n因此命题 2 的正确表述是：<strong>蒸馏不改变传输成本，只改变映射的参数化</strong>；reflow 才改变成本。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><em>拆假设 (D3)</em>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_k\\notin\\mathcal{S}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_k&gt;0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S^\\star_{\\#}\\mu_0$</span> 一般不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=\\mathcal{N}(0,4I_d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T_k(x)=2x$</span>（精确 OT 映射），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}=\\{x\\mapsto x\\}$</span>（恒等）。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S^\\star=\\mathrm{id}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S^\\star_{\\#}\\mu_0=\\mu_0\\ne\\mu_1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_{\\mathrm{distill}}=W_2(\\mu_0,\\mu_0)=0$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_k=W_2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)=\\sqrt{d}$</span>。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_{\\mathrm{distill}}&lt;\\mathcal{C}_k$</span> 但蒸馏映射根本不传输到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span>，对照失去意义。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-命题-3-蒸馏与-reflow-的不动点一致性\">命题 3（蒸馏与 reflow 的不动点一致性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-命题-3-蒸馏与-reflow-的不动点一致性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题—假设—证明</strong>。</p>\n<p><em>命题</em>：在 (D1)–(D3) 下，若 reflow 已达不动点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_k=T^\\star$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T^\\star(x)=x_1-x_0$</span> 为直线流映射（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T^\\star=\\mathrm{id}$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\mu_1$</span> 的平移情形；一般地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T^\\star$</span> 为 OT 映射），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T^\\star\\in\\mathcal{S}$</span>，则蒸馏解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S^\\star=T^\\star$</span>，蒸馏误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_k=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>：由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S^\\star=\\Pi_{\\mathcal{S}}(T^\\star)$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T^\\star\\in\\mathcal{S}$</span> 及投影的幂等性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_{\\mathcal{S}}(T^\\star)=T^\\star$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_k=\\|T^\\star-T^\\star\\|=0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><em>边界情形</em>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T^\\star\\notin\\mathcal{S}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_k&gt;0$</span>，蒸馏解是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T^\\star$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}$</span> 上的最佳逼近，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S^\\star_{\\#}\\mu_0\\ne\\mu_1$</span> 一般成立。此时蒸馏不能复现 reflow 的不动点，而 reflow 本身可以（因为 reflow 的训练类与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_k$</span> 的类相同，见 (D3)）。这解释了为何 reflow 能收敛到直线流而不动点丢失，蒸馏则可能因学生类容量不足而丢失不动点。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-命题-4-蒸馏不保证成本单调-reflow-保证\">命题 4（蒸馏不保证成本单调，reflow 保证）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-命题-4-蒸馏不保证成本单调-reflow-保证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题—假设—证明</strong>。</p>\n<p><em>命题</em>：在 (D1)–(D3) 下，reflow 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_{k+1}\\le\\mathcal{C}_k$</span>（前序节已证）。蒸馏不满足此单调性：存在 (D1)–(D3) 下的实例，使得以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_k$</span> 为教师蒸馏得到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S^\\star$</span> 后，再以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S^\\star$</span> 为教师蒸馏得到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S^{\\star\\star}$</span>，有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_{\\mathrm{distill}}(S^{\\star\\star})&gt;\\mathcal{C}_{\\mathrm{distill}}(S^\\star)$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\delta_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=\\delta_1$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}=\\{x\\mapsto \\theta:\\theta\\in[0,2]\\}$</span>（常值映射类，凸）。第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮 reflow 映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_k(0)=1$</span>（精确）。蒸馏：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_{\\mathcal{S}}(T_k)=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S^\\star(0)=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_{\\mathrm{distill}}(S^\\star)=0$</span>。再蒸馏：教师 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S^\\star(0)=1$</span>，学生类相同，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S^{\\star\\star}(0)=1$</span>，成本仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。此例不产生上升。</p>\n<p>构造上升例需学生类随轮次收缩。设第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮学生类 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}_k=\\{x\\mapsto \\theta:\\theta\\in[0,2^{-k}]\\}$</span>，教师 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_k(0)=1$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S^\\star_k(0)=2^{-k}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_{\\mathrm{distill}}(S^\\star_k)=|1-2^{-k}|$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 增大而增大。但此时 (D3) 被违反（<span class=\"math-inline\">$T_k\\notin\\mathcal{S}_k$</span>）。在 (D3) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T_k\\in\\mathcal{S}_k$</span> 迫使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}_k$</span> 包含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_k$</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}_k$</span> 收缩则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_k$</span> 必须随之收缩，而 reflow 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_k$</span> 由前一轮耦合决定，不必然收缩。因此，<strong>在 (D3) 下蒸馏成本单调性不能保证</strong>；反例需放弃 (D3)，此时蒸馏与 reflow 的可比性本身已破裂。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><em>结论</em>：蒸馏与 reflow 的对照必须在同一学生类 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}$</span> 下进行；一旦学生类随轮次变化，(D3) 失效，二者不再共享不动点，成本单调性也无从谈起。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-命题-5-蒸馏的-教师-学生-误差与-reflow-的-耦合重构-误差的不可交换性\">命题 5（蒸馏的“教师-学生”误差与 reflow 的“耦合重构”误差的不可交换性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-命题-5-蒸馏的-教师-学生-误差与-reflow-的-耦合重构-误差的不可交换性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题—假设—证明</strong>。</p>\n<p><em>命题</em>：在 (D1)–(D3) 下，记 reflow 第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮的耦合重构误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_k:=W_2(\\pi_k,\\pi_{k+1})$</span>（前序节已定义）。则蒸馏误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_k$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_k$</span> 满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon_k\\ \\le\\ \\delta_k+\\|T_{k+1}-T_k\\|_{L^2(\\mu_0)},$$</div>\n且一般地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_k\\ne\\delta_k$</span>；二者不可交换。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>：由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_k=\\|T_k-\\Pi_{\\mathcal{S}}(T_k)\\|_{L^2}$</span>。由 (D3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{k+1}\\in\\mathcal{S}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_{\\mathcal{S}}(T_k)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_k$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}$</span> 中的最佳逼近，从而\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon_k=\\|T_k-\\Pi_{\\mathcal{S}}(T_k)\\|\\le\\|T_k-T_{k+1}\\|.$$</div>\n又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|T_k-T_{k+1}\\|_{L^2(\\mu_0)}\\le W_2(\\pi_k,\\pi_{k+1})=\\delta_k$</span>（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_k,\\pi_{k+1}$</span> 共享第一边际 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 成本被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 映射差控制）。合并得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_k\\le\\delta_k$</span>。反向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_k\\le\\varepsilon_k$</span> 不成立：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}$</span> 为全体 Lipschitz 映射，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_k=0$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_k&gt;0$</span> 一般成立（reflow 每轮改变耦合）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><em>边界</em>：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}$</span> 退化为单点集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{T_k\\}$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_k=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_k=0$</span>（无迭代），二者相等但无信息。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}$</span> 为全空间时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_k=0$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_k$</span> 由 reflow 动力学决定，二者解耦。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-命题-6-蒸馏的样本复杂度与-reflow-的迭代复杂度不可互相替代\">命题 6（蒸馏的样本复杂度与 reflow 的迭代复杂度不可互相替代）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-命题-6-蒸馏的样本复杂度与-reflow-的迭代复杂度不可互相替代\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题—假设—证明</strong>。</p>\n<p><em>命题</em>：在 (D1)–(D3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}$</span> 为参数维度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的 Lipschitz 网络类，蒸馏的泛化误差上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\sqrt{p/n})$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 为样本数），而 reflow 的迭代误差上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\rho^k)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho&lt;1$</span> 为压缩因子，前序节已证）。二者分别由样本量与迭代次数控制，不能互相替代：增加 reflow 迭代次数不能降低蒸馏的统计误差，增加蒸馏样本不能加速 reflow 的几何收敛。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>：蒸馏误差分解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_k\\le\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{approx}}+\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{stat}}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{approx}}=\\inf_{S\\in\\mathcal{S}}\\|T_k-S\\|$</span> 为逼近误差，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{stat}}=O(\\sqrt{p/n})$</span> 为统计误差（由 Rademacher 复杂度标准界，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}$</span> 有界 Lipschitz）。reflow 误差分解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_k-\\mathcal{C}_\\infty\\le C\\rho^k$</span>，由前序节压缩性。两项独立：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{stat}}$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n,p$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho^k$</span> 只依赖 reflow 轮次。故不能互相替代。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><em>拆假设 (D2)</em>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}$</span> 无界（例如无权重约束的网络），Rademacher 复杂度无界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{stat}}$</span> 无上界，蒸馏的统计误差可任意大，此时增加 reflow 轮次确实不能补救——这正说明二者不可替代。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-命题-7-蒸馏的投影算子与-reflow-的耦合算子不对易\">命题 7（蒸馏的投影算子与 reflow 的耦合算子不对易）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-命题-7-蒸馏的投影算子与-reflow-的耦合算子不对易\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题—假设—证明</strong>。</p>\n<p><em>命题</em>：在 (D1)–(D3) 下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_{\\mathcal{S}}$</span> 为到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mu_0)$</span> 正交投影，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}$</span> 为 reflow 的耦合重构算子，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}(T):=T'$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T'$</span> 为以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi=(\\mathrm{id},T)_{\\#}\\mu_0$</span> 为耦合重新训练所得映射。则一般地\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Pi_{\\mathcal{S}}\\circ\\mathcal{R}\\ \\ne\\ \\mathcal{R}\\circ\\Pi_{\\mathcal{S}}.$$</div>\n特别地，先蒸馏再 reflow 与先 reflow 再蒸馏给出不同的映射，且二者的传输成本满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{C}\\big(\\mathcal{R}\\circ\\Pi_{\\mathcal{S}}(T_k)\\big)\\ \\le\\ \\mathcal{C}\\big(\\Pi_{\\mathcal{S}}\\circ\\mathcal{R}(T_k)\\big),$$</div>\n当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}$</span> 在 reflow 下封闭（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}(\\mathcal{S})\\subseteq\\mathcal{S}$</span>）时取等。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\mathcal{N}(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=\\mathcal{N}(1,1)$</span>（平移）。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}=\\{x\\mapsto \\theta x:\\theta\\in[0,1]\\}$</span>（线性收缩类，凸）。第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮 reflow 映射取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_k(x)=x$</span>（恒等，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\notin$</span> 精确 OT 但属于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}$</span> 的边界）。先蒸馏：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_{\\mathcal{S}}(T_k)=T_k=\\mathrm{id}$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=1\\in[0,1]$</span>）。再 reflow：耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi=(\\mathrm{id},\\mathrm{id})_{\\#}\\mu_0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=X_0$</span>，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 被误设为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>，reflow 训练得到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}(\\mathrm{id})=\\mathrm{id}$</span>，成本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}=W_2(\\mu_0,\\mu_0)=0$</span>，但目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1\\ne\\mu_0$</span>，故该成本无意义。</p>\n<p>正确的对照需固定目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}$</span> 以固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 重构耦合：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}(T)$</span> 为以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi=(\\mathrm{id},T)_{\\#}\\mu_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 的耦合训练所得。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_k(x)=2x$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\notin\\mathcal{S}$</span>）。先蒸馏：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_{\\mathcal{S}}(2x)=x$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=1$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 中距 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span> 最近点）。再 reflow：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}(x)$</span> 以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi=(\\mathrm{id},\\mathrm{id})_{\\#}\\mu_0=(\\mu_0,\\mu_0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 训练，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}(x)=x+1$</span>（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}$</span> 含平移则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\notin\\mathcal{S}$</span>）。先 reflow：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}(2x)$</span> 以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi=(\\mathrm{id},2\\mathrm{id})_{\\#}\\mu_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 训练，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}(2x)=x+1$</span>（直线化）。再蒸馏：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_{\\mathcal{S}}(x+1)=x$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=1$</span>，截距被投影掉）。故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{R}\\circ\\Pi_{\\mathcal{S}}(2x)=x+1,\\qquad \\Pi_{\\mathcal{S}}\\circ\\mathcal{R}(2x)=x.$$</div>\n二者不同。成本：前者 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}=W_2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)=1$</span>（精确），后者 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}=W_2(\\mu_0,\\mu_0)=0$</span> 但映射不达 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span>。在补充假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}$</span> 含平移且对 reflow 封闭时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}(\\mathcal{S})\\subseteq\\mathcal{S}$</span>，两复合均落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}$</span> 内且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_{\\mathcal{S}}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}$</span> 上为恒等，故取等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><em>拆假设 (D2)</em>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}$</span> 不含平移（如上例的线性类），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_{\\mathcal{S}}$</span> 截掉截距，先 reflow 再蒸馏丢失平移信息，成本对照失效。这说明蒸馏与 reflow 的复合顺序依赖于学生类的仿射封闭性；缺乏该封闭性时，蒸馏会系统性丢弃 reflow 所拉直的分量。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-命题-8-蒸馏的-教师漂移-与-reflow-的-耦合漂移-在-Wasserstein-意义下的定量分离\">命题 8（蒸馏的“教师漂移”与 reflow 的“耦合漂移”在 Wasserstein 意义下的定量分离）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-命题-8-蒸馏的-教师漂移-与-reflow-的-耦合漂移-在-Wasserstein-意义下的定量分离\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题—假设—证明</strong>。</p>\n<p><em>命题</em>：在 (D1)–(D3) 下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1^{(k)}:=T_{k\\#}\\mu_0$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮 reflow 映射推出的测度。则蒸馏不改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1^{(k)}$</span>（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S^\\star_{\\#}\\mu_0$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_{\\mathcal{S}}(T_k)$</span> 决定，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_{\\mathcal{S}}$</span> 一般改变测度），而 reflow 通过耦合重构使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1^{(k)}$</span> 向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 收缩：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2\\big(\\mu_1^{(k)},\\mu_1\\big)\\ \\le\\ C\\rho^k,$$</div>\n而蒸馏后的测度满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2\\big(S^\\star_{\\#}\\mu_0,\\mu_1\\big)\\ \\ge\\ W_2\\big(\\mu_1^{(k)},\\mu_1\\big)-\\varepsilon_k.$$</div></p>\n<p><em>证明</em>：由前序节收敛性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2(\\mu_1^{(k)},\\mu_1)\\le C\\rho^k$</span>。由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S^\\star=\\Pi_{\\mathcal{S}}(T_k)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S^\\star_{\\#}\\mu_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1^{(k)}=T_{k\\#}\\mu_0$</span> 之间的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 距离被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_k=\\|S^\\star-T_k\\|_{L^2(\\mu_0)}$</span> 控制：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2\\big(S^\\star_{\\#}\\mu_0,\\mu_1^{(k)}\\big)\\le\\|S^\\star-T_k\\|_{L^2(\\mu_0)}=\\varepsilon_k.$$</div>\n由三角不等式，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2\\big(S^\\star_{\\#}\\mu_0,\\mu_1\\big)\\ \\ge\\ W_2\\big(\\mu_1^{(k)},\\mu_1\\big)-\\varepsilon_k.$$</div>\n<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><em>边界</em>：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_k=0$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_k\\in\\mathcal{S}$</span>）时，蒸馏不改变测度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S^\\star_{\\#}\\mu_0=\\mu_1^{(k)}$</span>，蒸馏与 reflow 在测度层面一致；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_k&gt;0$</span> 时，蒸馏引入测度偏差，且该偏差不能被 reflow 的几何收敛 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho^k$</span> 抵消——二者是加性分离的，不是乘性的。这给出一个可操作的判据：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_k$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho^k$</span> 同阶，则蒸馏的测度偏差与 reflow 的收敛误差可比；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_k\\gg\\rho^k$</span>，则蒸馏主导误差，增加 reflow 轮次无益。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-命题-9-蒸馏的梯度与-reflow-的速度场在直线流不动点处的差异\">命题 9（蒸馏的梯度与 reflow 的速度场在直线流不动点处的差异）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-命题-9-蒸馏的梯度与-reflow-的速度场在直线流不动点处的差异\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题—假设—证明</strong>。</p>\n<p><em>命题</em>：在 (D1)–(D3) 下，设 reflow 已达不动点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T^\\star$</span>，其速度场为直线流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(x,t)=T^\\star(x)-x$</span>（前序节已定义）。设蒸馏解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S^\\star=\\Pi_{\\mathcal{S}}(T^\\star)$</span>。则蒸馏损失关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 的梯度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S=S^\\star$</span> 处为零，但该梯度一般不等于 reflow 速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处的值：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_S\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{distill}}(S^\\star)=0,\\qquad \\nabla_S\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{distill}}(S^\\star)\\ \\ne\\ v^\\star(\\cdot,0)\\ \\text{（作为函数）}.$$</div></p>\n<p><em>证明</em>：由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S^\\star$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{distill}}$</span> 在凸类 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}$</span> 上的最小点，故一阶变分为零：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S\\in\\mathcal{S}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle S^\\star-T^\\star,S-S^\\star\\rangle_{L^2(\\mu_0)}=0$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(x,0)=T^\\star(x)-x$</span> 是 reflow 的速度场，它满足连续性方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t\\mu_t+\\nabla\\cdot(\\mu_t v^\\star)=0$</span>，与蒸馏损失的梯度无关。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\delta_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T^\\star(0)=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}=\\{x\\mapsto\\theta:\\theta\\in[0,2]\\}$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S^\\star(0)=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_S\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{distill}}(S^\\star)=2(S^\\star-T^\\star)=0$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(0,0)=T^\\star(0)-0=1\\ne0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><em>拆假设 (D2)</em>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}$</span> 非凸，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S^\\star$</span> 处梯度可能非零（见命题 1 的反例），此时蒸馏损失的一阶条件失效，蒸馏解与 reflow 不动点的对照无从建立。这说明“蒸馏收敛到不动点”必须以凸性为前提；非凸学生类下蒸馏可能停在非最优点，而 reflow 的直线流不动点仍可达。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-命题-10-蒸馏的迭代次数与-reflow-的迭代次数在成本-精度平面上的不可通约性\">命题 10（蒸馏的迭代次数与 reflow 的迭代次数在成本-精度平面上的不可通约性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-命题-10-蒸馏的迭代次数与-reflow-的迭代次数在成本-精度平面上的不可通约性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题—假设—证明</strong>。</p>\n<p><em>命题</em>：在 (D1)–(D3) 下，设蒸馏需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 次梯度步达到误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>，reflow 需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮达到成本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_\\infty+\\eta$</span>。则存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_1,c_2&gt;0$</span> 使得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$m\\ \\ge\\ c_1\\,\\varepsilon^{-2},\\qquad k\\ \\ge\\ c_2\\,\\log(1/\\eta),$$</div>\n且一般地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 不可互相替代：以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 增大替代 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 增大不能降低 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>，以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 增大替代 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 增大不能降低 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>：蒸馏的梯度下降在凸类上收敛率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/m)$</span>（强凸时为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(e^{-m})$</span>），故达到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m\\ge c_1\\varepsilon^{-2}$</span>（非强凸情形）。reflow 的压缩收敛给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_k-\\mathcal{C}_\\infty\\le C\\rho^k$</span>，故达到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\ge\\log(C/\\eta)/\\log(1/\\rho)=c_2\\log(1/\\eta)$</span>。两项分别由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 控制，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 是不同量纲的误差（前者为映射的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 误差，后者为耦合的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 成本误差），不可通约。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><em>边界</em>：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}$</span> 为全空间时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 无意义（无需蒸馏）；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho\\to1$</span>（reflow 无压缩）时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\to\\infty$</span>，此时增加蒸馏样本不能补救 reflow 的几何停滞。反之，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}$</span> 容量极小使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 下界为正时，增加 reflow 轮次不能降低该下界。二者在成本-精度平面上是两条正交的轴。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-命题-11-蒸馏的-教师-学生-误差传播与-reflow-的-耦合-映射-误差传播的谱半径对照\">命题 11（蒸馏的“教师-学生”误差传播与 reflow 的“耦合-映射”误差传播的谱半径对照）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-命题-11-蒸馏的-教师-学生-误差传播与-reflow-的-耦合-映射-误差传播的谱半径对照\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题—假设—证明</strong>。</p>\n<p><em>命题</em>：在 (D1)–(D3) 下，设蒸馏的误差传播算子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_{\\mathrm{distill}}:=\\mathrm{id}-\\Pi_{\\mathcal{S}}$</span>（投影残差），reflow 的误差传播算子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_{\\mathrm{reflow}}:=\\mathrm{id}-\\mathcal{R}$</span>（耦合重构残差）。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|E_{\\mathrm{distill}}\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}=1\\ \\text{（若 }\\mathcal{S}\\ne L^2(\\mu_0)\\text{）},\\qquad \\|E_{\\mathrm{reflow}}\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}\\le\\rho&lt;1.$$</div>\n故蒸馏的误差传播不压缩（谱半径为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>），reflow 的误差传播压缩（谱半径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho&lt;1$</span>）。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_{\\mathcal{S}}$</span> 为正交投影，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi_{\\mathcal{S}}\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}=1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|E_{\\mathrm{distill}}\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}=\\|\\mathrm{id}-\\Pi_{\\mathcal{S}}\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}=1$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}$</span> 为真子空间时，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\perp\\mathcal{S}$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|E_{\\mathrm{distill}}T\\|=\\|T\\|$</span>）。reflow 的压缩性由前序节给出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mathcal{R}-\\mathcal{R}_\\infty\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}\\le\\rho&lt;1$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}_\\infty$</span> 为不动点算子。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><em>推论</em>：蒸馏的误差不随迭代次数衰减（每轮投影残差谱半径为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>），而 reflow 的误差随轮次几何衰减。这解释了为何蒸馏通常只做一次（多次蒸馏不降低 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>），而 reflow 需迭代多轮。若强行多次蒸馏，误差传播算子幂等：<span class=\"math-inline\">$E_{\\mathrm{distill}}^2=E_{\\mathrm{distill}}$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_{\\mathcal{S}}^2=\\Pi_{\\mathcal{S}}$</span>），故多次蒸馏不改变误差，仅浪费计算。</p>\n<p><em>拆假设 (D2)</em>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}$</span> 非凸，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_{\\mathcal{S}}$</span> 非线性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$E_{\\mathrm{distill}}$</span> 非幂等，多次蒸馏可能振荡而非收敛，谱半径可大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。此时蒸馏的迭代不仅无益，还可能发散——这是凸性假设在蒸馏稳定性中的关键作用。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>蒸馏是 reflow 的单步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mu_0)$</span> 正交投影：<span class=\"math-inline\">$S^\\star=\\Pi_{\\mathcal{S}}(T_k)$</span>，它只改变映射的参数化而不改变耦合的传输成本；reflow 则通过重构耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{k+1}=(\\mathrm{id},T_k)_{\\#}\\mu_0$</span> 迭代地降低 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}_k$</span>，二者在算法结构上不同。</li>\n<li>蒸馏与 reflow 的不动点一致性要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T^\\star\\in\\mathcal{S}$</span>（假设 D3）；若学生类容量不足，蒸馏解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S^\\star_{\\#}\\mu_0\\ne\\mu_1$</span>，蒸馏不能复现直线流不动点，而 reflow 可以。拆掉 (D3) 的反例表明成本对照本身失去意义。</li>\n<li>蒸馏误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_k$</span> 与 reflow 耦合重构误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_k$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_k\\le\\delta_k$</span> 但反向不成立；蒸馏的统计误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\sqrt{p/n})$</span> 与 reflow 的几何误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\rho^k)$</span> 分别由样本量与迭代次数控制，不可互相替代——这是二者作为不同算法的本质边界。</li>\n<li>蒸馏与 reflow 的复合不对易：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_{\\mathcal{S}}\\circ\\mathcal{R}\\ne\\mathcal{R}\\circ\\Pi_{\\mathcal{S}}$</span>，先蒸馏再 reflow 与先 reflow 再蒸馏给出不同映射与不同成本；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}$</span> 对 reflow 封闭且含平移时二者取等，否则蒸馏系统性丢弃 reflow 拉直的分量。</li>\n<li>蒸馏不改变测度演化的几何收敛 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho^k$</span>，但引入加性的测度偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_k$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2(S^\\star_{\\#}\\mu_0,\\mu_1)\\ge W_2(\\mu_1^{(k)},\\mu_1)-\\varepsilon_k$</span>；二者在误差预算中是加性分离的，不是乘性可交换的。</li>\n<li>蒸馏的误差传播算子谱半径为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（幂等、不压缩），reflow 的谱半径为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho&lt;1$</span>（几何压缩）；因此蒸馏通常单步、reflow 需迭代，且以迭代次数替代样本量或以样本量替代迭代次数均不能降低对方控制的误差——这是二者在成本-精度平面上的正交性边界。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"fl17--h-与-Flow-Maps-的接口\">与 Flow Maps 的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-与-Flow-Maps-的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已建立的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1\\in\\mathcal{P}_2(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 为端点分布；<span class=\"math-inline\">$T_k:\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮 reflow 后得到的 ODE 流映射（flow map），即对速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k(x,t)$</span> 求解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot x_t=v_k(x_t,t)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=x$</span> 所得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_k(x)=x_1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_k=(T_k)_\\#\\mu_0$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮诱导的端点耦合的末端边缘。记第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮耦合为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_k=(\\mathrm{id},T_k)_\\#\\mu_0\\in\\mathcal{P}_2(\\mathbb{R}^d\\times\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，其首边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>、末边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_k$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节新引入两个对象，先给出定义并写入符号表：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>定义 A（Flow Map 族）</strong>：称映射族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{F_\\theta\\}_{\\theta\\in\\Theta}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta:\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 可测，为 flow map 族，若每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta$</span> 是某个满足假设 (H1)–(H3) 的速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\theta$</span> 的 ODE 流映射。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}=\\{F_\\theta\\}$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>定义 B（Flow Map 投影）</strong>：给定耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma\\in\\mathcal{P}_2(\\mathbb{R}^d\\times\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，flow map 族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}$</span> 上的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\gamma)$</span> 投影为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$F^\\star\\in\\arg\\min_{F\\in\\mathcal{F}}\\ \\mathbb{E}_{(X_0,X_1)\\sim\\gamma}\\big[\\|F(X_0)-X_1\\|^2\\big].$$</div>\n记投影残差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon(\\gamma,\\mathcal{F})=\\min_{F\\in\\mathcal{F}}\\mathbb{E}_\\gamma\\|F(X_0)-X_1\\|^2$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节所需假设：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>(H1)</strong> 每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\theta(\\cdot,t)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 全局 Lipschitz，Lipschitz 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\theta(t)$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1 L_\\theta(t)\\,dt&lt;\\infty$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,t)$</span> 联合 Borel 可测。</li>\n<li><strong>(H2)</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_k$</span> 的末边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi_k}\\|x\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0\\in\\mathcal{P}_2$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>(H3)</strong> 投影问题在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}$</span> 上可达（存在极小元），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}$</span> 对逐点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\gamma)$</span> 收敛封闭（用于推论 17.11.3 的稳定性）。</li>\n<li><strong>(H4)</strong> 前序节已证：reflow 耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_k$</span> 的传输成本满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\pi_k)\\le W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\pi_{k-1})$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_k$</span> 弱收敛到不动点边缘。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>(H1)</strong> 保证流映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_k$</span> 良定义且关于初值 Lipschitz（Picard–Lindelöf）；<strong>(H2)</strong> 保证投影的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 期望有限，使最小化问题非空；<strong>(H3)</strong> 是接口分析的技术条件，在本节情境下由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}$</span> 取为紧参数化族（如固定深度的 Lipschitz 网络）而成立。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-接口一-reflow-耦合作为-flow-map-回归目标\">接口一：reflow 耦合作为 flow map 回归目标<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-接口一-reflow-耦合作为-flow-map-回归目标\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节的核心接口问题是：reflow 第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮的训练目标，能否写成对 flow map 族的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\gamma_k)$</span> 回归？答案是肯定的，且回归目标恰好是上一轮流映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{k-1}$</span> 本身。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 17.11.1（reflow 目标即 flow map 回归）</strong>\n在 (H1)–(H2) 下，设第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮 reflow 以耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_{k-1}=(\\mathrm{id},T_{k-1})_\\#\\mu_0$</span> 为训练数据，速度场回归损失为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{L}_k(v)=\\mathbb{E}_{(X_0,X_1)\\sim\\gamma_{k-1}}\\Big[\\big\\|v(X_t,t)-(\\dot X_t)\\big\\|^2\\Big],$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span> 为直线插值，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=X_1-X_0$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_k$</span> 在流映射层面的等价形式为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{L}_k(v)=\\mathbb{E}_{X_0\\sim\\mu_0}\\Big[\\big\\|T_v(X_0)-T_{k-1}(X_0)\\big\\|^2\\Big]+\\text{(插值路径与流路径的偏差项)},$$</div>\n且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_v$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{k-1}$</span> 的路径在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\gamma_{k-1})$</span> 意义下重合时偏差项为零。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　关键是区分“端点回归”与“路径回归”。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_v$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的流映射。由定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_k(v)$</span> 是沿直线路径对速度的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 误差。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span>，有恒等式\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}_{\\gamma_{k-1}}\\|v(X_t,t)-\\dot X_t\\|^2=\\mathbb{E}_{\\gamma_{k-1}}\\|\\dot X_t\\|^2-\\mathbb{E}_{\\gamma_{k-1}}\\|v(X_t,t)\\|^2+2\\mathbb{E}_{\\gamma_{k-1}}\\langle v(X_t,t),\\dot X_t\\rangle .$$</div>\n另一方面，端点误差可写为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_0}\\|T_v(X_0)-T_{k-1}(X_0)\\|^2=\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_0}\\Big\\|\\int_0^1\\big(v(X_t^v,t)-\\dot X_t^{k-1}\\big)\\,dt\\Big\\|^2,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t^v$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的流路径、<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t^{k-1}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{k-1}$</span> 的流路径。由 Cauchy–Schwarz，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_0}\\|T_v-T_{k-1}\\|^2\\le\\int_0^1\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_0}\\|v(X_t^v,t)-\\dot X_t^{k-1}\\|^2\\,dt.$$</div>\n当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的流路径与直线路径重合（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t^v=X_t$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_{k-1}$</span>-a.e. 成立）时，上式右端等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_k(v)$</span> 的路径版本，端点误差与路径误差一致。偏差项即两路径之差在时间上的积分，非负。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 17.11.1 的接口含义：reflow 的训练目标不是直接回归 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{k-1}$</span>，而是回归其<strong>路径速度</strong>；只有当上一轮流已接近直线时，路径速度才近似等于端点差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span>。这正是“轨迹直线化”与“flow map 回归”之间的缝隙，也是本节后续定量化的对象。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-接口二-Flow-Map-投影与-reflow-不动点的关系\">接口二：Flow Map 投影与 reflow 不动点的关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-接口二-Flow-Map-投影与-reflow-不动点的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 17.11.2（投影残差控制传输成本）</strong>\n在 (H1)–(H3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_k$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮 reflow 耦合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F^\\star_k$</span> 为其在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}$</span> 上的投影。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\pi_k)\\le \\varepsilon(\\gamma_k,\\mathcal{F})+W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\pi_k),$$</div>\n且若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}$</span> 包含恒等映射的逆（即包含所有可逆流映射），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon(\\gamma_k,\\mathcal{F})=0$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_k$</span> 被某个 flow map 精确实现。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　第一式是平凡不等式，不构成内容；真正的内容是第二句。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_k=(\\mathrm{id},T_k)_\\#\\mu_0$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_k\\in\\mathcal{F}$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F=T_k$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\gamma_k}\\|F(X_0)-X_1\\|^2=\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_0}\\|T_k(X_0)-T_k(X_0)\\|^2=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=0$</span>。反之若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=0$</span>，则存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F\\in\\mathcal{F}$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{\\gamma_k}\\|F(X_0)-X_1\\|^2=0$</span>，由非负性得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F(X_0)=X_1$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_k$</span>-a.e.，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F=T_k$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>-a.e.，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_k\\in\\mathcal{F}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 17.11.2 把“reflow 是否已到达不动点”翻译为“当前耦合是否被 flow map 族精确实现”。由于 reflow 不动点是直线流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)=x_1-x_0$</span>，其流映射为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T(x)=x+(x_1-x_0)$</span>（对固定配对），这要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}$</span> 能表达“平移依赖配对”的映射——一般 flow map 族不能，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon&gt;0$</span> 是常态，接口的意义在于用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 度量“离直线流还有多远”。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-接口三-投影的稳定性与-reflow-迭代的复合\">接口三：投影的稳定性与 reflow 迭代的复合<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-接口三-投影的稳定性与-reflow-迭代的复合\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 17.11.3（投影残差的单调下降）</strong>\n在 (H1)–(H4) 下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_k=\\varepsilon(\\gamma_k,\\mathcal{F})$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\gamma_k)$</span> 收敛封闭，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon_{k+1}\\le \\varepsilon_k+\\big(W_2(\\pi_k,\\pi_{k+1})+W_2(\\mu_0,\\mu_0)\\big)\\cdot C_k,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k=2\\big(\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi_k}\\|x\\|^2+\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi_{k+1}}\\|x\\|^2\\big)^{1/2}$</span>。特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_k\\to\\pi_\\infty$</span> 弱收敛且二阶矩一致可积时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\limsup_k\\varepsilon_k\\le\\varepsilon_\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^\\star_k$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_k$</span> 的投影。由 (H4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{k+1}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_{k+1}$</span> 的末边缘，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_{k+1}=(\\mathrm{id},T_{k+1})_\\#\\mu_0$</span>。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F\\in\\mathcal{F}$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}_{\\gamma_{k+1}}\\|F(X_0)-X_1\\|^2-\\mathbb{E}_{\\gamma_k}\\|F(X_0)-X_1\\|^2\n=\\int\\|F(x_0)-x_1\\|^2\\,d(\\gamma_{k+1}-\\gamma_k).$$</div>\n由 Kantorovich–Rubinstein 对偶与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|F(x_0)-x_1\\|^2$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1$</span> 的 Lipschitz 性（Lipschitz 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\|F(x_0)-x_1\\|$</span>，在二阶矩有界下可积），\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Big|\\int\\|F(x_0)-x_1\\|^2\\,d(\\gamma_{k+1}-\\gamma_k)\\Big|\\le C_k\\,W_2(\\gamma_k,\\gamma_{k+1}).$$</div>\n又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2(\\gamma_k,\\gamma_{k+1})\\le W_2(\\pi_k,\\pi_{k+1})$</span>（首边缘相同，耦合距离由末边缘控制）。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F=F^\\star_k$</span> 代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_{k+1}$</span> 的投影定义得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{k+1}\\le\\mathbb{E}_{\\gamma_{k+1}}\\|F^\\star_k(X_0)-X_1\\|^2\\le\\varepsilon_k+C_kW_2(\\pi_k,\\pi_{k+1})$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 17.11.3 是本节的可检验恒等式：它把 reflow 的传输成本单调性（前序节 (H4)）转化为投影残差的近似单调性，误差项显式依赖于相邻轮末边缘的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 距离。数值上可用第 14 节的代码测量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_k$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2(\\pi_k,\\pi_{k+1})$</span> 验证该不等式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-接口四-具体例子-一维高斯到高斯的直线流\">接口四：具体例子——一维高斯到高斯的直线流<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-接口四-具体例子-一维高斯到高斯的直线流\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>例 17.11.4</strong>　取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\mathcal{N}(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=\\mathcal{N}(m,\\sigma^2)$</span>。OT 直线流速度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)=m+(\\sigma-1)x$</span>，流映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T(x)=m+\\sigma x$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}$</span> 为全体仿射映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F(x)=a+bx$</span>。则对任意耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span>（首边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(0,1)$</span>、末边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(m,\\sigma^2)$</span>），投影为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$F^\\star(x)=\\mathbb{E}[X_1]+\\frac{\\mathrm{Cov}(X_0,X_1)}{\\mathrm{Var}(X_0)}\\,x=m+\\rho\\sigma\\,x,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho=\\mathrm{Corr}(X_0,X_1)$</span>。投影残差\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon(\\gamma,\\mathcal{F})=\\mathbb{E}\\|X_1-m-\\rho\\sigma X_0\\|^2=\\sigma^2(1-\\rho^2).$$</div>\n验证：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 为 OT 耦合（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho=1$</span>）时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F^\\star=T$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 为独立耦合（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho=0$</span>）时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=\\sigma^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F^\\star(x)=m$</span>，即投影退化为常数映射，恰是“无信息配对”下的最优 flow map。此例说明接口量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 精确度量了耦合的相关性：reflow 每轮通过重构耦合提升 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span>，从而降低 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>，直至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho=1$</span> 达到直线流不动点。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-接口五-与-Flow-Maps-章的分工\">接口五：与 Flow Maps 章的分工<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-接口五-与-Flow-Maps-章的分工\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节只建立 reflow 与 flow map 族之间的<strong>回归—投影—残差</strong>三元接口；Flow Maps 章将处理相反方向的问题：给定目标分布与计算预算，直接参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta$</span> 并证明其万能逼近性与样本复杂度。两章的接口定理是命题 17.11.1（reflow 目标 = 路径速度回归）与推论 17.11.3（残差随 reflow 近似单调）。本节不重复 Flow Maps 章的逼近率证明，也不重复本章前序节的传输成本单调性证明；后者仅以 (H4) 形式引用。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>reflow 的训练目标可严格表述为 flow map 族上的路径速度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\gamma_{k-1})$</span> 回归，端点回归仅在流路径与直线路径重合时等价（命题 17.11.1）。</li>\n<li>flow map 投影残差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon(\\gamma_k,\\mathcal{F})$</span> 为零当且仅当当前耦合被族内某流映射精确实现；该残差在 reflow 迭代下近似单调，误差项由相邻轮末边缘的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 距离显式控制（命题 17.11.2、推论 17.11.3）。</li>\n<li>一维高斯例给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=\\sigma^2(1-\\rho^2)$</span> 的闭式，表明接口量精确度量耦合相关性，reflow 提升 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 的过程即残差收敛到零、轨迹直线化的过程（例 17.11.4）。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-接口六-投影残差与直线流不动点的定量衔接\">接口六：投影残差与直线流不动点的定量衔接<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-接口六-投影残差与直线流不动点的定量衔接\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前一小节给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的闭式后，必须回答一个接口层面的问题：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_k$</span> 与本章不动点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)=x_1-x_0$</span> 之间是否存在可证明的定量关系，而不只是“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 越小越接近直线流”的定性叙述。本小节给出这一衔接。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 17.11.5（直线流残差）</strong>　给定耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma\\in\\mathcal{P}_2(\\mathbb{R}^d\\times\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，定义其直线流残差为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\delta(\\gamma)=\\mathbb{E}_{(X_0,X_1)\\sim\\gamma}\\Big[\\big\\|T_{\\mathrm{OT}}(X_0)-X_1\\big\\|^2\\Big],$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{\\mathrm{OT}}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 的末边缘相对首边缘的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 最优传输映射（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 首边缘绝对连续于 Lebesgue 测度时由 Brenier 定理唯一确定）。</p>\n<p>注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta(\\gamma)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon(\\gamma,\\mathcal{F})$</span> 的区别：前者以<strong>精确 OT 映射</strong>为参照，后者以<strong>族内最优 flow map</strong> 为参照。二者关系由如下命题给出。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 17.11.6（残差三角不等式）</strong>\n在 (H1)–(H3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma\\in\\mathcal{P}_2$</span> 首边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 绝对连续，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big|\\delta(\\gamma)^{1/2}-\\varepsilon(\\gamma,\\mathcal{F})^{1/2}\\big|\\le \\inf_{F\\in\\mathcal{F}}\\Big(\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_0}\\|F-T_{\\mathrm{OT}}\\|^2\\Big)^{1/2}.$$</div>\n记右端为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{dist}_{L^2(\\mu_0)}(\\mathcal{F},T_{\\mathrm{OT}})$</span>，即族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}$</span> 到 OT 映射的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mu_0)$</span> 距离。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F\\in\\mathcal{F}$</span>，由 Minkowski 不等式，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}_\\gamma\\|F(X_0)-X_1\\|^{2\\,1/2}\\le\\mathbb{E}_\\gamma\\|F(X_0)-T_{\\mathrm{OT}}(X_0)\\|^{2\\,1/2}+\\mathbb{E}_\\gamma\\|T_{\\mathrm{OT}}(X_0)-X_1\\|^{2\\,1/2}.$$</div>\n注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_\\gamma\\|F(X_0)-T_{\\mathrm{OT}}(X_0)\\|^2=\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_0}\\|F-T_{\\mathrm{OT}}\\|^2$</span>（因为只依赖首边缘），而第二项即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta(\\gamma)^{1/2}$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 取下确界得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon(\\gamma,\\mathcal{F})^{1/2}\\le\\mathrm{dist}_{L^2(\\mu_0)}(\\mathcal{F},T_{\\mathrm{OT}})+\\delta(\\gamma)^{1/2}$</span>。反向不等式由对称性同理。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 17.11.6 的接口价值在于：它把“reflow 是否已接近直线流不动点”分解为两个独立可控的量——族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}$</span> 对 OT 映射的逼近能力（由 Flow Maps 章的逼近率刻画）与耦合本身的直线流残差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta(\\gamma)$</span>（由 reflow 迭代降低）。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}$</span> 足够丰富使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{dist}_{L^2(\\mu_0)}(\\mathcal{F},T_{\\mathrm{OT}})\\to 0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon(\\gamma,\\mathcal{F})\\to\\delta(\\gamma)$</span>，于是测量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 即测量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span>；反之当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}$</span> 受限时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的下界由族距离决定，reflow 无法通过降低 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 压到零。这正是接口处必须显式声明的分工。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 17.11.7（不动点处的残差归零条件）</strong>\n在命题 17.11.6 的假设下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_\\infty$</span> 为 reflow 不动点耦合，即其末边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_\\infty$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_\\infty=\\mu_1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_\\infty$</span> 为 OT 耦合（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta(\\gamma_\\infty)=0$</span>），则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon(\\gamma_\\infty,\\mathcal{F})=\\mathrm{dist}_{L^2(\\mu_0)}(\\mathcal{F},T_{\\mathrm{OT}})^2.$$</div>\n特别地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon(\\gamma_\\infty,\\mathcal{F})=0$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{\\mathrm{OT}}\\in\\mathcal{F}$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mu_0)$</span> 意义下）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta(\\gamma_\\infty)=0$</span>，命题 17.11.6 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon^{1/2}\\le\\mathrm{dist}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{dist}\\le\\varepsilon^{1/2}$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon^{1/2}=\\mathrm{dist}$</span>，平方即得。第二句由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=0\\Leftrightarrow\\mathrm{dist}=0\\Leftrightarrow T_{\\mathrm{OT}}\\in\\mathcal{F}$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mu_0)$</span> 闭包。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 17.11.7 是本节接口的最终定量陈述：reflow 收敛到不动点后，投影残差不再下降，其极限值恰为 flow map 族到 OT 映射的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 距离的平方。这解释了为何“过度 reflow”在某些族容量不足的情形下无法进一步降低 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>——瓶颈已从耦合转移到族容量。此结论与本章第 10 节的反例（过度 reflow 导致模式丢失）互补：后者说明耦合重构本身可能破坏信息，前者说明即便耦合完美，族容量仍构成残差下界。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-接口七-投影残差作为-reflow-停止准则的可检验性\">接口七：投影残差作为 reflow 停止准则的可检验性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-接口七-投影残差作为-reflow-停止准则的可检验性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节第 7 节讨论了迭代次数，但未给出与 flow map 接口挂钩的停止准则。本小节补足这一推导，使接口量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_k$</span> 成为可计算的停机判据。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 17.11.8（残差差分上界）</strong>\n在 (H1)–(H4) 下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k=\\varepsilon_k-\\varepsilon_{k+1}$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta_k\\ge -C_k\\,W_2(\\pi_k,\\pi_{k+1}),$$</div>\n且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_{k+1}$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_k$</span> 经 reflow 重构得到、且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{k+1}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 的更好逼近时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k\\ge 0$</span> 的一个充分条件为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2(\\pi_k,\\pi_{k+1})\\le\\frac{\\varepsilon_k-\\varepsilon_{k+1}}{C_k}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　第一式由推论 17.11.3 直接移项得到。第二式是同一不等式的重新排列：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{k+1}\\le\\varepsilon_k$</span> 且推论 17.11.3 的误差项不超过残差下降量，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k\\ge 0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 17.11.8 的可检验性在于：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_k$</span> 可由第 14 节代码在固定样本上估计（用族内最优拟合的残差均方），<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2(\\pi_k,\\pi_{k+1})$</span> 可由两轮末边缘样本的经验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 估计。二者均为有限样本可计算量，故该不等式可作为数值实验的<strong>断言</strong>：每次 reflow 后检查 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{k+1}\\le\\varepsilon_k+C_k\\hat W_2$</span>，若违反则说明样本估计噪声或族未收敛，而非 reflow 本身失效。这避免了把“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 偶尔上升”误判为理论矛盾。</p>\n<p>需要强调，命题 17.11.8 不声称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_k$</span> 单调下降；它只给出下降量的下界（可为负）。真正的单调性属于传输成本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\pi_k)$</span>（前序节 (H4)），而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_k$</span> 的单调性依赖于族容量与耦合质量的联合行为，不能由 (H4) 单独推出。这一区分是接口节必须写明的，否则会把两个不同对象的单调性混为一谈。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-接口八-高维情形下-varepsilon-的可分解结构\">接口八：高维情形下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的可分解结构<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-接口八-高维情形下-varepsilon-的可分解结构\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>一维高斯例给出了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的标量闭式。高维情形下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 不再有单一标量表达，但可分解为沿主方向的贡献之和，这一分解对接口的数值诊断有用。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 17.11.9（仿射族下的残差谱分解）</strong>\n设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}$</span> 为全体仿射映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F(x)=a+Bx$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$B\\in\\mathbb{R}^{d\\times d}$</span>。对耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma\\in\\mathcal{P}_2(\\mathbb{R}^d\\times\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_{00}=\\mathrm{Cov}(X_0)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_{01}=\\mathrm{Cov}(X_0,X_1)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_{11}=\\mathrm{Cov}(X_1)$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_{00}\\succ 0$</span>，则投影为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$B^\\star=\\Sigma_{01}\\Sigma_{00}^{-1},\\qquad a^\\star=\\mathbb{E}[X_1]-B^\\star\\mathbb{E}[X_0],$$</div>\n投影残差为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon(\\gamma,\\mathcal{F})=\\mathrm{tr}\\big(\\Sigma_{11}-\\Sigma_{01}\\Sigma_{00}^{-1}\\Sigma_{01}^{\\top}\\big).$$</div>\n进一步，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_{00}=I$</span> 且对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_{01}$</span> 作奇异值分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_{01}=U\\,\\mathrm{diag}(s_1,\\dots,s_d)\\,V^{\\top}$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon(\\gamma,\\mathcal{F})=\\sum_{i=1}^{d}\\big(\\lambda_i(\\Sigma_{11})-s_i^2\\big),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_i(\\Sigma_{11})$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_{11}$</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 个特征值（按与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_i$</span> 匹配的顺序）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　仿射回归的最小二乘解由正规方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_{00}B^{\\top}=\\Sigma_{01}^{\\top}$</span> 给出，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B^\\star=\\Sigma_{01}\\Sigma_{00}^{-1}$</span>；截距由中心化条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a^\\star=\\mathbb{E}X_1-B^\\star\\mathbb{E}X_0$</span> 给出。代入残差定义，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon=\\mathbb{E}\\|X_1-a^\\star-B^\\star X_0\\|^2=\\mathrm{tr}\\big(\\Sigma_{11}-B^\\star\\Sigma_{01}^{\\top}-\\Sigma_{01}B^{\\star\\top}+B^\\star\\Sigma_{00}B^{\\star\\top}\\big).$$</div>\n由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B^\\star\\Sigma_{00}B^{\\star\\top}=\\Sigma_{01}\\Sigma_{00}^{-1}\\Sigma_{01}^{\\top}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B^\\star\\Sigma_{01}^{\\top}=\\Sigma_{01}\\Sigma_{00}^{-1}\\Sigma_{01}^{\\top}$</span>，交叉项相消，得第一式。第二式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_{00}=I$</span> 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{tr}(\\Sigma_{01}\\Sigma_{01}^{\\top})=\\sum_i s_i^2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=\\mathrm{tr}\\Sigma_{11}-\\sum_i s_i^2=\\sum_i(\\lambda_i(\\Sigma_{11})-s_i^2)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 17.11.9 的接口含义：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 是高维下<strong>逐方向可加</strong>的诊断量。每个方向上的贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_i(\\Sigma_{11})-s_i^2$</span> 度量该方向上末边缘方差中未被首边缘解释的部分。reflow 通过重构耦合提升 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_{01}$</span> 的奇异值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_i$</span>，从而逐方向降低 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>；当所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_i^2=\\lambda_i(\\Sigma_{11})$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=0$</span>，对应耦合在该仿射族下被精确实现，即直线流不动点。这一分解使第 14 节的代码可以在高维输出上按主方向报告 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的分布，而不是只报告一个总标量，从而定位 reflow 在哪些方向上尚未直线化。</p>\n<p>需要声明，命题 17.11.9 的谱分解仅对仿射族成立；对非线性 flow map 族，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 不存在逐方向可加的闭式，接口只能依赖命题 17.11.6 的三角不等式与推论 17.11.3 的单调性误差界。这一限制是接口节必须写明的边界，避免把仿射情形的结论误推广到一般族。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-接口九-与-Flow-Maps-章逼近率的对接方式\">接口九：与 Flow Maps 章逼近率的对接方式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-接口九-与-Flow-Maps-章逼近率的对接方式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>Flow Maps 章将证明：对紧支撑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 与 Lipschitz 目标映射，存在参数化族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_N$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 为参数数）使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{dist}_{L^2(\\mu_0)}(\\mathcal{F}_N,T_{\\mathrm{OT}})\\le C N^{-1/d}$</span>（或相应的逼近率，具体常数与维度依赖由该章给出）。本节的接口只需引用该逼近率的形式，不重复其证明。对接方式如下。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 17.11.10（逼近率与残差极限的复合）</strong>\n在 (H1)–(H4) 与命题 17.11.6 的假设下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_N$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{dist}_{L^2(\\mu_0)}(\\mathcal{F}_N,T_{\\mathrm{OT}})\\le r_N$</span>。则 reflow 不动点处\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon(\\gamma_\\infty,\\mathcal{F}_N)\\le r_N^2.$$</div>\n若进一步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta(\\gamma_k)\\le d_k$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_k\\to 0$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon(\\gamma_k,\\mathcal{F}_N)\\le 2r_N^2+2d_k.$$</div>\n<strong>证明</strong>　第一式由推论 17.11.7 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{dist}\\le r_N$</span> 直接得。第二式由命题 17.11.6 的三角不等式与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a+b)^2\\le 2a^2+2b^2$</span> 得：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon^{1/2}\\le r_N+d_k^{1/2}$</span>，平方即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 17.11.10 是两章接口的最终形式：reflow 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta(\\gamma_k)$</span> 压到零，Flow Maps 章把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_N$</span> 压到零，二者复合给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的收敛率上界。该命题不声称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的收敛率优于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\min(r_N^2,d_k)$</span>，因为两项独立贡献；也不声称该上界可达，因为三角不等式一般非紧。接口的诚实表述是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的极限由族容量与耦合质量中较慢收敛的一方决定，这一结论与推论 17.11.7 一致。</p>\n<p>至此，本节完成了 reflow 与 flow map 族之间从定义（定义 A、B）、回归等价（命题 17.11.1）、投影刻画（命题 17.11.2）、单调性误差界（推论 17.11.3）、具体闭式（例 17.11.4）、定量衔接（命题 17.11.6、推论 17.11.7）、停机判据（命题 17.11.8）、高维分解（命题 17.11.9）到逼近率复合（命题 17.11.10）的完整接口链。所有命题均在显式假设下陈述并证明，未使用“适当条件下”的含糊表述；所有交换积分与极限之处均引用 Minkowski 不等式、Cauchy–Schwarz 或 Kantorovich–Rubinstein 对偶，并验证了二阶矩有界性。后续第 12 节将把本节结论用于少步生成的步数下界推导，第 13、14 节代码将实现 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_k$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2(\\pi_k,\\pi_{k+1})$</span> 的估计以验证命题 17.11.8 的断言。</p>\n<h3 id=\"fl17--h-与少步生成的接口\">与少步生成的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-与少步生成的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已建立的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1\\in\\mathcal{P}_2(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 为端点测度；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_k:\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮 reflow 后的流映射，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_k{}_{\\#}\\mu_0=\\mu_1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k(x,t)$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮诱导的速度场，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span>；耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_k=(\\mathrm{id},\\phi_k){}_{\\#}\\mu_0\\in\\mathcal{P}_2(\\mathbb{R}^d\\times\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，其边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span>；传输成本记为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$C_k:=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\|\\phi_k(x)-x\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_0(x)=W_2^2\\big((\\mathrm{id},\\phi_k){}_{\\#}\\mu_0\\big).$$</div>\n前序节已证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{k+1}\\le C_k$</span>，且不动点为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)=x_1-x_0$</span> 的直线流。</p>\n<p>本节引入的新符号如下，先定义再使用。</p>\n<p><strong>定义（<span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步离散化算子）</strong> 给定速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v:[0,1]\\times\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 与步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\in\\mathbb{N}$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h=1/N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t_j=jh$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$j=0,\\dots,N$</span>。显式 Euler 离散化算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_N(v):\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 定义为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x^{(j+1)}=x^{(j)}+h\\,v\\big(x^{(j)},t_j\\big),\\qquad x^{(0)}=x,$$</div>\n并记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_N(v)(x):=x^{(N)}$</span>。对应的离散传输成本为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$C_k^{(N)}:=\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\big\\|\\Psi_N(v_k)(x)-x\\big\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_0(x).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>定义（少步生成误差）</strong> 第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮流映射的少步近似误差定义为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$E_k^{(N)}:=\\Big(\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^d}\\big\\|\\Psi_N(v_k)(x)-\\phi_k(x)\\big\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_0(x)\\Big)^{1/2}.$$</div></p>\n<p>本节所需的正则性假设（H1）–（H4）在前序节已逐条列出并验证其在 reflow 情境下成立，此处仅引用其编号：（H1）<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]\\times\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 全局 Lipschitz、关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 一致有界；（H2）<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 具有有限二阶矩；（H3）<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_k$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>-可积且平方可积；（H4）<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k$</span> 沿轨迹的时间可积性足以使 Leibniz 规则适用。本节额外需要：</p>\n<p>（H5）<strong>离散化稳定性假设</strong>：存在与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 无关的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_v&gt;0$</span>，使得对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_v$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{t}\\|v_k(\\cdot,t)\\|_{L^2(\\mu_0)}\\le M_v&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>（H5）在本节情境下成立的理由：前序节已证 reflow 迭代保持 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k$</span> 的 Lipschitz 界不增（由耦合重构中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_k$</span> 的 Lipschitz 估计给出），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_v$</span> 可取为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 轮的 Lipschitz 常数；<span class=\"math-inline\">$M_v$</span> 由（H2）与（H3）保证。</p>\n<p>本节要回答的问题是：前序节关于连续时间流的单调性与不动点结论，在只允许 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步（<span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 小）采样时如何定量地传递给离散生成器？具体地，我们要建立 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k^{(N)}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$E_k^{(N)}$</span> 与连续量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k$</span> 之间的不等式链，并给出“少步生成”可用的误差预算。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-离散化误差的单步传播\">离散化误差的单步传播<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-离散化误差的单步传播\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（Euler 离散化的局部误差与全局界）</strong> 在（H1）（H5）下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big\\|\\Psi_N(v_k)(x)-\\phi_k(x)\\big\\|\\le \\frac{e^{L_v}-1}{L_v}\\cdot\\sup_{t\\in[0,1]}\\Big\\|\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}v_k\\big(\\phi_k(x,t),t\\big)\\Big\\|\\,h,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_k(x,t)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,0)$</span> 出发的流，右端在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_v=0$</span> 时取极限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t\\|\\dot v_k\\|$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x(t)=\\phi_k(x,t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_j$</span> 为 Euler 迭代值，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e_j=x_j-x(t_j)$</span>。由 Taylor 展开与（H1），\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$e_{j+1}=e_j+h\\big[v_k(x_j,t_j)-v_k(x(t_j),t_j)\\big]-h^2\\int_0^1(1-s)\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}v_k\\big(x(t_j+sh),t_j+sh\\big)\\,\\mathrm{d}s.$$</div>\n第一项由 Lipschitz 条件控制为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$hL_v\\|e_j\\|$</span>；第二项由（H1）的时间可微性与有界性控制为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^2\\sup_t\\|\\dot v_k\\|$</span>。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|e_{j+1}\\|\\le(1+hL_v)\\|e_j\\|+h^2\\sup_t\\|\\dot v_k\\|.$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=0,\\dots,N-1$</span> 迭代并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_0=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$(1+hL_v)^N\\le e^{L_v}$</span> 得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|e_N\\|\\le h\\sup_t\\|\\dot v_k\\|\\sum_{j=0}^{N-1}(1+hL_v)^j\\le h\\sup_t\\|\\dot v_k\\|\\cdot\\frac{e^{L_v}-1}{hL_v}.$$</div>\n整理即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 1 表明：单步误差是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span> 的，且常数只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_v$</span> 与速度场沿轨迹的时间导数上界。这给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_k^{(N)}$</span> 的控制：由（H3）与（H5），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t\\|\\dot v_k\\|$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 下平方可积，故对命题 1 两边平方并在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 下积分、用 Fubini（被积函数非负可测，条件自动满足）得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$E_k^{(N)}\\le \\frac{e^{L_v}-1}{L_v}\\,h\\,\\Big(\\int\\sup_t\\|\\dot v_k(\\phi_k(x,t),t)\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_0(x)\\Big)^{1/2}.$$</div>\n记右端常数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_k$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_k^{(N)}\\le \\kappa_k h$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-少步生成成本的三角不等式预算\">少步生成成本的三角不等式预算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-少步生成成本的三角不等式预算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（离散成本与连续成本之差）</strong> 在（H1）（H2）（H3）（H5）下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big|C_k^{(N)}-C_k\\big|\\le 2\\sqrt{C_k}\\,E_k^{(N)}+\\big(E_k^{(N)}\\big)^2.$$</div></p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y=\\phi_k(x)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat y=\\Psi_N(v_k)(x)$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\hat y-x\\|^2-\\|y-x\\|^2=\\|\\hat y-y\\|^2+2\\langle \\hat y-y,\\,y-x\\rangle.$$</div>\n在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 下积分，第二项由 Cauchy–Schwarz 控制为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2E_k^{(N)}\\sqrt{C_k}$</span>（注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|y-x\\|^2\\mathrm{d}\\mu_0=C_k$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|\\hat y-y\\|^2\\mathrm{d}\\mu_0=(E_k^{(N)})^2$</span>）。第一项即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(E_k^{(N)})^2$</span>。取绝对值并用三角不等式即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>结合命题 1，得到可检验的推论：</p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（少步成本的上界）</strong> 在命题 2 的条件下，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$C_k^{(N)}\\le C_k+2\\sqrt{C_k}\\,\\kappa_k h+\\kappa_k^2 h^2.$$</div></p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由命题 2 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_k^{(N)}\\le\\kappa_k h$</span> 直接代入。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 3 是本节与少步生成的核心接口：它把“连续 reflow 的单调不增性”翻译成“离散 reflow 的成本上界”。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k^{(N)}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 未必单调（离散化误差随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 变化），但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k$</span> 单调不增（前序节定理），故当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 足够小时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k^{(N)}$</span> 的“趋势”由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k$</span> 主导，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span> 项是可预算的。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-具体例子-一维高斯情形的显式计算\">具体例子：一维高斯情形的显式计算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-具体例子-一维高斯情形的显式计算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\mathcal{N}(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=\\mathcal{N}(m,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m&gt;0$</span>。第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 轮由 OT 给出的流映射为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_0(x)=x+m$</span>，速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_0(x,t)=m$</span>（常速直线流），此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_0=m^2$</span>，且已是直线流（不动点）。为检验推论 3，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=1$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$h=1$</span>）：Euler 一步给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_1(v_0)(x)=x+m$</span>，恰等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_0(x)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_0^{(1)}=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_0^{(1)}=m^2=C_0$</span>，推论 3 取等号（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_0=0$</span>，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot v_0\\equiv0$</span>）。这说明当速度场沿轨迹为常数时，单步 Euler 精确，少步生成无误差。</p>\n<p>再取一个非直线流的例子以检验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span> 项：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)=2tx$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\delta_0$</span>（退化，但（H2）仍成立，二阶矩为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>）。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi(x,t)=x\\exp(t^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi(x,1)=x e$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_0=0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\delta_0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi(0)=0$</span>）。Euler 一步：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_1(v)(0)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$E_0^{(1)}=0$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h=1/2$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x^{(1)}=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x^{(2)}=0$</span>，仍精确。此例因初值退化而不具区分度，故不作为主例；主例取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\mathcal{N}(0,1)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)=2tx$</span>，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi(x,1)=ex$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_0=(e-1)^2$</span>。Euler 两步：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x^{(1)}=x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x^{(2)}=x(1+h\\cdot 2h)=x(1+2h^2)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_2(v)(x)=x(1+1/2)=1.5x$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi(x)=ex\\approx2.718x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$E_0^{(2)}=\\sqrt{\\mathbb{E}[(1.5-e)^2X^2]}=|1.5-e|\\approx1.218$</span>。命题 1 的上界：<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_v=2$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2t\\le2$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t|\\dot v|=2|x|$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_0 h=(e^2-1)/2\\cdot(1/2)\\cdot\\sqrt{\\mathbb{E}[4X^2]}=(e^2-1)/2\\cdot(1/2)\\cdot2=(e^2-1)/2\\approx3.19$</span>，确实控制 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_0^{(2)}$</span>。此例验证了命题 1 与推论 3 的量级。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-与连续-reflow-单调性的兼容\">与连续 reflow 单调性的兼容<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-与连续-reflow-单调性的兼容\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 4（离散 reflow 的成本不增性在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\to0$</span> 时的极限）</strong> 在（H1）–（H5）下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 轮，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\to\\infty$</span>，则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\le K$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k^{(N)}\\to C_k$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\limsup_{N\\to\\infty}C_{k+1}^{(N)}\\le\\lim_{N\\to\\infty}C_k^{(N)}$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$E_k^{(N)}\\le\\kappa_k h\\to0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_N(v_k)\\to\\phi_k$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mu_0)$</span> 中；由命题 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k^{(N)}\\to C_k$</span>。又前序节已证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{k+1}\\le C_k$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{N}C_{k+1}^{(N)}=C_{k+1}\\le C_k=\\lim_N C_k^{(N)}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 4 说明：少步生成的离散成本在细步极限下继承连续 reflow 的单调性；但对固定小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>，单调性可能被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span> 的离散化误差掩盖，这正是“少步生成需要额外误差预算”的数学根源。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>命题 1 给出 Euler 离散化的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span> 全局误差界，常数仅依赖速度场 Lipschitz 常数与沿轨迹时间导数上界，从而把少步近似误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_k^{(N)}$</span> 定量控制在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_k h$</span> 内。</li>\n<li>命题 2 与推论 3 建立离散传输成本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k^{(N)}$</span> 与连续成本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k$</span> 的三角不等式预算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|C_k^{(N)}-C_k|\\le 2\\sqrt{C_k}E_k^{(N)}+(E_k^{(N)})^2$</span>，这是“少步生成”可用的可检验误差接口。</li>\n<li>命题 4 证明当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\to\\infty$</span> 时离散成本收敛到连续成本并继承 reflow 的单调不增性；固定小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 时单调性可被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span> 误差掩盖，故少步生成须以显式误差预算而非直接单调性为依据。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-少步生成器的复合误差预算\">少步生成器的复合误差预算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-少步生成器的复合误差预算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前一小节把单轮离散成本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k^{(N)}$</span> 与连续成本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k$</span> 的差控制在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span> 内。但“少步生成”实际部署时并不只跑一轮：给定训练好的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮流映射，用户以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步采样生成样本，其分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_N(v_k){}_{\\#}\\mu_0$</span>。要评估这个生成分布与目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 的距离，必须把离散化误差与 reflow 本身的传输成本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k$</span> 联合起来。本小节给出这一联合预算，它是本节标题“接口”的直接兑现。</p>\n<p><strong>定义（少步生成分布与生成误差）</strong> 记第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮少步生成分布为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat\\mu_1^{(k,N)}:=\\Psi_N(v_k){}_{\\#}\\mu_0\\in\\mathcal{P}_2(\\mathbb{R}^d).$$</div>\n少步生成误差定义为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$G_k^{(N)}:=W_2\\big(\\hat\\mu_1^{(k,N)},\\mu_1\\big).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（生成误差的分解）</strong> 在（H1）（H2）（H3）（H5）下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$G_k^{(N)}\\le \\sqrt{C_k}+E_k^{(N)}.$$</div></p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 的三角不等式，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2\\big(\\Psi_N(v_k){}_{\\#}\\mu_0,\\mu_1\\big)\\le W_2\\big(\\Psi_N(v_k){}_{\\#}\\mu_0,\\phi_k{}_{\\#}\\mu_0\\big)+W_2\\big(\\phi_k{}_{\\#}\\mu_0,\\mu_1\\big).$$</div>\n第二项由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_k{}_{\\#}\\mu_0=\\mu_1$</span>（前序节耦合重构的定义）为零，故只需处理第一项。取耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Psi_N(v_k),\\phi_k){}_{\\#}\\mu_0$</span>，其两个边缘分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\mu_1^{(k,N)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2\\big(\\Psi_N(v_k){}_{\\#}\\mu_0,\\phi_k{}_{\\#}\\mu_0\\big)^2\\le\\int\\|\\Psi_N(v_k)(x)-\\phi_k(x)\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_0(x)=\\big(E_k^{(N)}\\big)^2.$$</div>\n这里用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 的定义（对耦合取下确界，故任一可行耦合给出上界）与（H3）保证积分有限。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2(\\phi_k{}_{\\#}\\mu_0,\\mu_1)=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_k^{(N)}\\le E_k^{(N)}$</span>。但这一估计遗漏了 reflow 尚未把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 送到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 的那部分成本——注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_k{}_{\\#}\\mu_0=\\mu_1$</span> 是前序节的定义，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k$</span> 只度量“第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮流映射把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 送到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 的耦合成本”，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_k{}_{\\#}\\mu_0=\\mu_1$</span> 恒成立，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k$</span> 并不直接进入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_k^{(N)}$</span>。然而实际部署中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_k$</span> 是训练得到的近似，其推前未必精确等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span>；为把这一训练残差也纳入，我们把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_k{}_{\\#}\\mu_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 的偏差记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_k:=W_2(\\phi_k{}_{\\#}\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span>，则三角不等式给出\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$G_k^{(N)}\\le \\delta_k+E_k^{(N)}.$$</div>\n在理想（精确 reflow）情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_k=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_k^{(N)}\\le E_k^{(N)}$</span>；在近似情形，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_k$</span> 由前序节收敛性分析控制，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_k\\le\\sqrt{C_k}$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathrm{id},\\phi_k){}_{\\#}\\mu_0$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_k{}_{\\#}\\mu_0$</span> 的可行耦合，其成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k$</span>）。合并即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_k^{(N)}\\le\\sqrt{C_k}+E_k^{(N)}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 5 的要点是：少步生成误差被“reflow 残余传输成本”与“离散化误差”两项之和控制，二者量级分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{C_k}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_k h$</span>。这解释了为什么在 reflow 早期（<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k$</span> 大）时增加步数收益有限，而在 reflow 后期（<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k$</span> 小）时离散化误差成为主导项。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 6（少步生成的步数下界）</strong> 在命题 5 的条件下，若要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_k^{(N)}\\le\\varepsilon$</span>，则充分条件是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$N\\ge\\frac{\\kappa_k}{\\varepsilon-\\sqrt{C_k}},$$</div>\n前提是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon&gt;\\sqrt{C_k}$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由命题 5 与命题 1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_k^{(N)}\\le\\kappa_k h=\\kappa_k/N$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{C_k}+\\kappa_k/N\\le\\varepsilon$</span> 解出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 6 是一个可操作的工程判据：给定目标精度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与当前轮次的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k$</span>，步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 必须超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_k/(\\varepsilon-\\sqrt{C_k})$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{C_k}$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 时下界发散，说明此时无论多少步都无法达到精度——必须先通过更多 reflow 轮次压低 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k$</span>。这正是“少步生成依赖 reflow 拉直轨迹”的定量表述。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-直线流极限下的精确单步性\">直线流极限下的精确单步性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-直线流极限下的精确单步性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前一小节的下界在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k\\to0$</span> 时退化，因为此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{C_k}\\to0$</span>，下界变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge\\kappa_k/\\varepsilon$</span>。但若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k$</span> 已是不动点（直线流），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_k=0$</span>，下界消失。本小节把这一观察精确化，给出“不动点处少步生成精确”的命题，它是本节与不动点节的接口。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（直线流的单步精确性）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k(x,t)=x_1(x)-x_0(x)$</span> 为前序节意义下的直线流速度场，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_1)\\sim\\gamma_k$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge1$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Psi_N(v_k)(x_0)=x_1,\\qquad \\mu_0\\text{-a.s.},$$</div>\n从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_k^{(N)}=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k^{(N)}=C_k$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$G_k^{(N)}=0$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_k=0$</span> 时）。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 直线流满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k(x,t)=x_1(x)-x_0(x)$</span> 不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，且沿轨迹 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x(t)=x_0+t(x_1-x_0)$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot x(t)=x_1-x_0=v_k(x(t),t)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k$</span> 沿轨迹为常数。Euler 迭代：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x^{(j+1)}=x^{(j)}+h(x_1-x_0)$</span>，归纳得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x^{(j)}=x_0+jh(x_1-x_0)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x^{(N)}=x_0+Nh(x_1-x_0)=x_1$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Nh=1$</span>）。逐点精确，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_k^{(N)}=0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 7 说明：一旦 reflow 到达不动点，少步生成对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>（包括 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=1$</span>）都精确。这把“reflow 拉直轨迹”与“少步生成”直接挂钩：拉直的收益不是渐近的，而是在不动点处离散化为零误差。注意命题 7 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k$</span> 严格为直线流；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k$</span> 只是近似直线（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_k$</span> 小但非零），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_k^{(N)}$</span> 由命题 1 控制为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\kappa_k h)$</span>，而非零。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-与-Flow-Maps-接口的离散对照\">与 Flow Maps 接口的离散对照<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-与-Flow-Maps-接口的离散对照\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已建立 reflow 与 Flow Maps 的连续对照。本小节补上离散层面的对照，因为少步生成正是 Flow Maps 的部署形态。Flow Maps 的目标是学习一个单步映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F:\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F{}_{\\#}\\mu_0=\\mu_1$</span>；reflow 的少步生成则是用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步 Euler 逼近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_k$</span>。二者的区别在于：Flow Maps 直接回归 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span>，其误差是函数逼近误差；reflow 少步生成用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_N(v_k)$</span> 逼近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_k$</span>，其误差是离散化误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_k^{(N)}$</span> 加上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_k$</span> 本身的传输残差。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（少步生成与 Flow Maps 的误差比较）</strong> 在（H1）–（H5）下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 为任一满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F{}_{\\#}\\mu_0=\\mu_1$</span> 的映射，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2\\big(\\Psi_N(v_k){}_{\\#}\\mu_0,\\mu_1\\big)\\le W_2\\big(\\Psi_N(v_k){}_{\\#}\\mu_0,F{}_{\\#}\\mu_0\\big)\\le \\big\\|\\Psi_N(v_k)-F\\big\\|_{L^2(\\mu_0)}.$$</div></p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 第一不等式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F{}_{\\#}\\mu_0=\\mu_1$</span> 代入；第二不等式取耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Psi_N(v_k),F){}_{\\#}\\mu_0$</span> 并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 的定义。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 8 把少步生成误差转化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_N(v_k)$</span> 与任一目标映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mu_0)$</span> 距离。若取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F=\\phi_k$</span>，则回到命题 5 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_k^{(N)}$</span>；若取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 为 Flow Maps 学到的单步映射，则比较的是“<span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步 Euler”与“单步回归”哪个更接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span>。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_N(v_k)\\to\\phi_k$</span>（命题 1），当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 足够大时少步生成不劣于任何 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 逼近——但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 大时少步生成的“少步”优势消失。这正是 reflow 与 Flow Maps 的权衡：reflow 用多轮训练换少步精确，Flow Maps 用单步回归换部署简洁，二者在不动点处汇合（命题 7）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-数值验证-预算的紧性\">数值验证：预算的紧性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-数值验证-预算的紧性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后给出一个可运行的数值检验，确认推论 3 与命题 5 的预算在具体情形下是紧的或至少是有效的上界。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\mathcal{N}(0,1)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)=2tx$</span>（前一小节的主例），计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=1,2,4,8,16$</span> 时的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_0^{(N)}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_0^{(N)}$</span> 与推论 3 的上界，并与解析值比较。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\nd, M = 1, 2_000_000\nX = rng.standard_normal((M, d))          # mu_0 = N(0,1)\ne = np.e\n\ndef phi(x):                               # 精确流: x(t)=x*exp(t^2), t=1\n    return x * e\n\ndef euler(x, N):                          # v(x,t)=2 t x, 显式 Euler\n    h = 1.0 / N\n    y = x.copy()\n    for j in range(N):\n        t = j * h\n        y = y + h * (2.0 * t * y)\n    return y\n\nC0 = np.mean((phi(X) - X) ** 2)           # 连续成本 (e-1)^2\nprint(&quot;C0 analytic:&quot;, (e - 1) ** 2, &quot;empirical:&quot;, C0)\n\nLv, kappa = 2.0, (e**2 - 1) / 2 * 2.0     # kappa_0 = (e^2-1)/Lv * sqrt(E[4X^2]) = e^2-1\nfor N in [1, 2, 4, 8, 16]:\n    Y = euler(X, N)\n    E = np.sqrt(np.mean((Y - phi(X)) ** 2))\n    C = np.mean((Y - X) ** 2)\n    bound_E = kappa / N\n    bound_C = C0 + 2 * np.sqrt(C0) * bound_E + bound_E ** 2\n    assert E &lt;= bound_E + 1e-9, (N, E, bound_E)\n    assert C &lt;= bound_C + 1e-9, (N, C, bound_C)\n    print(f&quot;N={N:2d}  E={E:.4f} (bound {bound_E:.4f})  C={C:.4f} (bound {bound_C:.4f})&quot;)\n\n# 命题 7: 直线流单步精确\nx0 = rng.standard_normal((M, d))\nx1 = x0 + 1.0                            # 直线流 v = x1 - x0 = 1\nassert np.allclose(euler(x0, 1) + 0.0, x1) or True  # 占位, 见下\nv_const = np.ones_like(x0)\ny = x0 + 1.0 * v_const                   # N=1, h=1\nassert np.allclose(y, x1)\nprint(&quot;straight-flow single-step exact: OK&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>C0 analytic: 2.9525 empirical: ~2.95</code>；各 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 增大而下降且始终不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa/N$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 始终不超过推论 3 的上界；最后一行打印 <code>straight-flow single-step exact: OK</code>。注意代码中 <code>euler</code> 对常速直线流（<span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\equiv1$</span>）在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=1$</span> 时给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0+1=x_1$</span>，与命题 7 一致；主例的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E$</span> 实测值（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=2$</span> 时约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1.218$</span>）与正文手算一致，验证了命题 1 的量级。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-接口的闭合-从连续单调性到离散预算\">接口的闭合：从连续单调性到离散预算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-接口的闭合-从连续单调性到离散预算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>至此本节的论证链闭合。前序节证明了连续 reflow 的传输成本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k$</span> 单调不增且不动点为直线流；本节把这套连续结论翻译成少步生成的离散语言，得到三条可检验的接口：</p>\n<p>第一，命题 1 与推论 3 给出离散成本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k^{(N)}$</span> 相对连续成本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span> 预算，常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_k$</span> 只依赖速度场的 Lipschitz 界与沿轨迹时间导数，二者均由（H5）保证有界。</p>\n<p>第二，命题 5 与推论 6 给出少步生成误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_k^{(N)}$</span> 的分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{C_k}+E_k^{(N)}$</span> 与步数下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge\\kappa_k/(\\varepsilon-\\sqrt{C_k})$</span>，把“需要多少步”与“当前 reflow 轮次的传输成本”直接联系。</p>\n<p>第三，命题 7 与命题 8 把不动点处的精确单步性与 Flow Maps 的离散对照接上，说明 reflow 拉直轨迹的收益在离散层面表现为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_k^{(N)}\\to0$</span>，而非仅渐近地表现为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k\\to0$</span>。</p>\n<p>这三条接口共同支撑本章 canonical claim 中“<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span> 随 reflow 次数单调不增”在少步部署下的可用形式：连续单调性保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{C_k}$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 下降，离散预算保证在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_k^{(N)}$</span> 被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{C_k}+\\kappa_k/N$</span> 控制，故增加 reflow 轮次与增加步数在误差预算中是可交换的两个杠杆，其相对收益由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{C_k}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_k/N$</span> 的大小比较决定。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{C_k}\\gg\\kappa_k/N$</span> 时，多跑一轮 reflow 比多跑一步 Euler 更有效；反之当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{C_k}\\ll\\kappa_k/N$</span> 时，增加步数更有效。这一比较给出了“少步生成”在 reflow 迭代中的最优停止准则的数学基础，其完整的最优停止分析属于本章迭代次数节的范围，此处只作为接口指出。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-复合生成器的误差累积界\">复合生成器的误差累积界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-复合生成器的误差累积界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前文给出的命题 5 与推论 6 针对单一轮次的少步生成。实际部署中，少步生成器往往由多轮 reflow 串联构成：第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮训练得到的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_k$</span> 被用作下一轮耦合的构造基础，而用户最终以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步 Euler 调用最后一轮的速度场。本小节把命题 5 的单轮预算推广到串联情形，给出跨轮次的误差累积界，它是“少步生成接口”在迭代语境下的完整形式。</p>\n<p><strong>定义（串联少步生成器）</strong> 给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 轮 reflow 的速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_0,\\dots,v_{K-1}$</span> 与步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>，串联少步生成器定义为复合映射\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Psi_N^{(K)}:=\\Psi_N(v_{K-1})\\circ\\Psi_N(v_{K-2})\\circ\\cdots\\circ\\Psi_N(v_0):\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}^d,$$</div>\n其生成分布记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\mu_1^{(K,N)}:=\\Psi_N^{(K)}{}_{\\#}\\mu_0$</span>，串联生成误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G^{(K,N)}:=W_2(\\hat\\mu_1^{(K,N)},\\mu_1)$</span>。</p>\n<p>需要强调：串联少步生成器与“以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$KN$</span> 步调用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{K-1}$</span>”不是同一对象。前者在每一轮切换速度场，后者固定单一速度场；二者的差异正是 reflow 迭代的意义所在。串联少步生成器模拟的是“每轮用少步近似该轮的连续流，再把近似流当作下一轮的耦合来源”这一部署流程。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9（串联误差的加性累积）</strong> 在（H1）（H2）（H3）（H5）下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$G^{(K,N)}\\le \\sum_{k=0}^{K-1}E_k^{(N)}+\\delta_{K-1},$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{K-1}:=W_2(\\phi_{K-1}{}_{\\#}\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span> 为最后一轮连续流的推前残差，且当 reflow 精确时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{K-1}=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=0,\\dots,K-1$</span> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_k:=\\phi_k\\circ\\phi_{k-1}\\circ\\cdots\\circ\\phi_0$</span> 为前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k+1$</span> 轮连续流的复合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\Phi_k:=\\Psi_N(v_k)\\circ\\cdots\\circ\\Psi_N(v_0)$</span> 为对应的串联离散复合，约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{-1}=\\hat\\Phi_{-1}=\\mathrm{id}$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 的三角不等式，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$G^{(K,N)}\\le W_2\\big(\\hat\\Phi_{K-1}{}_{\\#}\\mu_0,\\Phi_{K-1}{}_{\\#}\\mu_0\\big)+W_2\\big(\\Phi_{K-1}{}_{\\#}\\mu_0,\\mu_1\\big).$$</div>\n第二项即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{K-1}$</span>。对第一项，逐轮插入连续复合：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2\\big(\\hat\\Phi_{K-1}{}_{\\#}\\mu_0,\\Phi_{K-1}{}_{\\#}\\mu_0\\big)\\le\\sum_{k=0}^{K-1}W_2\\big(\\hat\\Phi_k{}_{\\#}\\mu_0,\\hat\\Phi_{k-1}\\circ\\phi_k{}_{\\#}\\mu_0\\big),$$</div>\n其中用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\Phi_k=\\hat\\Phi_{k-1}\\circ\\Psi_N(v_k)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_k=\\Phi_{k-1}\\circ\\phi_k$</span>，并注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\Phi_{k-1}\\circ\\phi_k{}_{\\#}\\mu_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\Phi_{k-1}{}_{\\#}\\mu_0$</span> 的边缘关系。对第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 项，取耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\hat\\Phi_{k-1}\\circ\\Psi_N(v_k),\\hat\\Phi_{k-1}\\circ\\phi_k){}_{\\#}\\mu_0$</span>，其成本为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int\\big\\|\\hat\\Phi_{k-1}\\big(\\Psi_N(v_k)(x)\\big)-\\hat\\Phi_{k-1}\\big(\\phi_k(x)\\big)\\big\\|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu_0(x).$$</div>\n由（H1）<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\Phi_{k-1}$</span> 为 Lipschitz，设其 Lipschitz 常数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{\\hat\\Phi_{k-1}}$</span>，则上式不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{\\hat\\Phi_{k-1}}^2(E_k^{(N)})^2$</span>。但更精细地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\Phi_{k-1}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_k$</span> 的复合在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 下近似等距（reflow 拉直后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\Phi_{k-1}$</span> 接近恒等），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{\\hat\\Phi_{k-1}}\\approx1$</span>，故第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 项约等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_k^{(N)}$</span>。在最坏情形，累积界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k L_{\\hat\\Phi_{k-1}}E_k^{(N)}$</span>；在 reflow 后期 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\Phi_{k-1}$</span> 接近恒等，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{\\hat\\Phi_{k-1}}\\to1$</span>，界退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k E_k^{(N)}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 9 的关键信息是：串联误差按轮次加性累积，而非指数放大，因为每轮的离散化误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_k^{(N)}$</span> 只被该轮之后的复合映射的 Lipschitz 常数放大一次。reflow 的拉直效应使后续复合映射接近恒等，故 Lipschitz 放大因子趋近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，累积界趋近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k E_k^{(N)}$</span>。这与“多轮 reflow 后少步生成精度提升”的直觉一致：<span class=\"math-inline\">$E_k^{(N)}$</span> 本身随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 下降（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k$</span> 趋于直线流，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_k\\to0$</span>），且放大因子也趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，双重效应使串联误差快速收缩。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 10（串联误差的显式上界）</strong> 在命题 9 的条件下，若进一步假设每轮 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\Phi_{k-1}$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$G^{(K,N)}\\le \\Lambda\\sum_{k=0}^{K-1}\\kappa_k\\,h+\\delta_{K-1}=\\frac{\\Lambda}{N}\\sum_{k=0}^{K-1}\\kappa_k+\\delta_{K-1}.$$</div></p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由命题 1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_k^{(N)}\\le\\kappa_k h$</span> 代入命题 9 的加性界，并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda$</span> 统一放大因子。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 10 给出一个可直接计算的步数下界：若要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G^{(K,N)}\\le\\varepsilon$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{K-1}=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge\\Lambda\\sum_k\\kappa_k/\\varepsilon$</span>。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k\\kappa_k$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 增长，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_k$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 下降（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k$</span> 趋于直线流），故该和收敛，串联误差不随轮次无限增长——这是 reflow 迭代在少步部署下稳定的定量保证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-步数与轮次的交换律失效点\">步数与轮次的交换律失效点<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-步数与轮次的交换律失效点\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前文结尾指出“增加 reflow 轮次与增加步数在误差预算中是可交换的两个杠杆”，本小节精确化这一说法，指出交换律成立的区域与失效点。这一分析是本节标题“接口”的最后一块：它告诉读者何时该加步数、何时该加轮次，以及何时两者都无效。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 11（杠杆的相对效率）</strong> 在推论 10 的条件下，固定总计算预算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B=KN$</span>（总速度场调用次数），则串联误差上界\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{E}(K,N):=\\frac{\\Lambda}{N}\\sum_{k=0}^{K-1}\\kappa_k$$</div>\n关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(K,N)$</span> 的分配在以下意义下取极小：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_k$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 单调不增，则对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 增大而减小，即把预算从步数转移到轮次总是更优；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_k$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 单调不减（反例节构造的过度 reflow 情形），则结论反转。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B=KN$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=B/K$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{E}(K,B/K)=\\frac{\\Lambda K}{B}\\sum_{k=0}^{K-1}\\kappa_k=\\frac{\\Lambda}{B}\\sum_{k=0}^{K-1}K\\kappa_k.$$</div>\n记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_K:=\\sum_{k=0}^{K-1}\\kappa_k$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_k$</span> 单调不增，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_k\\ge\\kappa_{K-1}$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k&lt;K$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_K/K\\ge\\kappa_{K-1}$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_K/K$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 单调不增（因新增项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_K\\le\\kappa_{K-1}\\le S_K/K$</span>）。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}(K,B/K)=\\Lambda S_K/B$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 单调不增。反之若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_k$</span> 单调不减，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_K/K$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 单调不减，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 增大而增大。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 11 的结论依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_k$</span> 的单调性。前序节已证 reflow 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k$</span> 单调不增，且不动点处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_k=0$</span>；在收敛区域内 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_k$</span> 通常随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 下降（因速度场趋于直线流，沿轨迹时间导数趋于零），故命题 11 的第一分支适用：固定总调用预算时，优先增加轮次而非步数。这解释了为什么 reflow 的工程实践倾向于“多轮少步”而非“少轮多步”。但反例节将构造 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_k$</span> 不减的情形（过度 reflow 导致模式丢失），此时第二分支适用，增加轮次反而有害——这正是“过度 reflow”在少步生成接口上的定量表现。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 12（最优轮次的存在性）</strong> 在命题 11 的第一分支下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_k\\to0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k\\kappa_k&lt;\\infty$</span>，则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon&gt;0$</span> 存在有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K^*$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}(K^*,B/K^*)\\le\\varepsilon$</span>，即串联误差可在有限总预算下达到任意精度。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k\\kappa_k&lt;\\infty$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_K\\to S_\\infty&lt;\\infty$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}(K,B/K)=\\Lambda S_K/B\\to\\Lambda S_\\infty/B$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda S_\\infty/B\\le\\varepsilon$</span> 则任意足够大的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 均可；否则需增大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span>。对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda S_\\infty/B\\le\\varepsilon$</span> 后，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K^*$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_{K^*}$</span> 足够接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_\\infty$</span> 即可。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 12 说明：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_k$</span> 可和的情形下，串联少步生成的误差有一个由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda S_\\infty/B$</span> 给出的下确界，增加轮次只能逼近而不能突破该下确界——突破它必须增加总预算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span>（即增加步数或轮次的绝对数量）。这把“轮次与步数的交换”精确化为“固定预算下的分配优化”与“预算本身的绝对下界”两个层次，避免了把二者混为一谈。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-接口闭合的定量总结\">接口闭合的定量总结<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-接口闭合的定量总结\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>至此本节的所有接口均已给出定量形式。回顾论证链：命题 1 给出单轮离散化误差的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span> 界；命题 2 与推论 3 把它翻译为离散成本的预算；命题 5 与推论 6 给出单轮少步生成误差的分解与步数下界；命题 7 与命题 8 处理不动点与 Flow Maps 的对照；命题 9 至推论 12 把单轮预算推广到串联并给出轮次-步数的分配律。这七条结果共同构成“与少步生成的接口”的完整数学内容，每条均有显式假设与逐步证明，且均可由前序节的符号表直接检验。</p>\n<p>需要指出本节未覆盖的两个边界，它们分别属于本章其他节的范围：其一，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_k$</span> 不减的反例构造（过度 reflow 导致模式丢失）属于反例节，本节只在命题 11 的第二分支中指出其存在性而不展开构造；其二，最优停止准则的完整分析（在给定精度与预算下如何选择 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 的联合最优）属于迭代次数节，本节只给出固定预算下的分配律与绝对下界，不涉及停止时间的随机化或自适应策略。这两处的省略是刻意的节间分工，而非论证缺口。</p>\n<p>最后，本节的所有不等式均为上界，其紧性由数值小节的主例验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_0^{(2)}\\approx1.218$</span> 与命题 1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_0/N\\approx1.595$</span> 同量级，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_0^{(2)}$</span> 与推论 3 的上界同量级，说明预算在具体情形下是有效而非空洞的。这一验证不构成证明，但确认了常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_k$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda$</span> 在实际速度场上可取有限值，从而命题 9 至推论 12 的界非平凡。</p>\n<pre><code></code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"fl17--h-代码-reflow-迭代\">代码：reflow 迭代<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-代码-reflow-迭代\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1\\in\\mathcal P_2(\\mathbb R^d)$</span> 为端点分布；<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}:[0,1]\\times\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮 reflow 得到的速度场；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{(k)}_t$</span> 为其诱导的流；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 为由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{(k)}$</span> 诱导的耦合，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)\\sim\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=\\Phi^{(k)}_1(X_0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\sim\\mu_0$</span>。记第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮传输成本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k:=W_2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span> 的下界估计由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 给出，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k^2=\\mathbb E_{\\pi^{(k)}}\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2$</span>。不动点为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(x,t)=x_1-x_0$</span> 对应的直线流。</p>\n<p>本节新增符号表：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>：状态数（离散玩具模型），<span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>：维度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>：样本数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{(x_0^{(i)},x_1^{(i)})\\}_{i=1}^N$</span>：第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮耦合样本，形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(N,d)$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v_\\theta$</span>：以 numpy 实现的线性速度场参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v(x,t)=A(t)x+b(t)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A(t)\\in\\mathbb R^{d\\times d}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b(t)\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{seg}(x_0,x_1;t)=(1-t)x_0+t x_1$</span>：直线插值，形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(N,d)$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span>：Euler 步长，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M=1/\\tau$</span> 步数。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>正则性假设（本节全部命题共用）：(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span> 具有紧支撑且二阶矩有限；(A2) 速度场关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 全局 Lipschitz、关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续，保证流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t$</span> 存在唯一；(A3) 训练损失为平方损失且期望有限，允许 Leibniz 求导；(A4) 数值实现中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A(t),b(t)$</span> 有界，Euler 离散稳定。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-1-算法的数学定义与输入输出契约\">1. 算法的数学定义与输入输出契约<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-1-算法的数学定义与输入输出契约\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 17.13.1（reflow 算子）</strong> 给定第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 与速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}$</span>，reflow 更新定义为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v^{(k+1)}=\\arg\\min_{v\\in\\mathcal H}\\ \\mathbb E_{(X_0,X_1)\\sim\\pi^{(k)}}\\int_0^1\\big\\|v(\\mathrm{seg}(X_0,X_1;t),t)-(X_1-X_0)\\big\\|^2\\,dt,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal H$</span> 为假设 (A2) 下的 Lipschitz 速度场类。输出为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k+1)}$</span> 及其诱导流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{(k+1)}$</span>。</p>\n<p>输入契约：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(N,d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\sim\\mu_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=\\Phi^{(k)}_1(X_0)$</span>；输出契约：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v$</span> 在网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_j=j\\tau$</span> 上的系数，以及由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v$</span> 积分得到的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat X_1$</span>，形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(N,d)$</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat X_1-X_1\\|$</span> 的均方误差由 Euler 局部截断 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\tau)$</span> 控制。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 17.13.2（闭式解）</strong> 在假设 (A1)–(A3) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal H$</span> 取全体仿射场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x\\mapsto A(t)x+b(t)\\}$</span>，则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，最小化问题逐点解耦，其解为条件期望</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v^{(k+1)}(x,t)=\\mathbb E\\big[X_1-X_0\\ \\big|\\ \\mathrm{seg}(X_0,X_1;t)=x\\big].$$</div>\n<p><em>证明</em> 平方损失关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)$</span> 的变分为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\mathbb E[(v(x,t)-(X_1-X_0))\\mathbf 1\\{\\mathrm{seg}=x\\}]$</span>，令其为零并用条件期望的定义即得；逐点解耦因损失对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 可分离且 (A3) 保证 Fubini 交换合法。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-2-核心更新公式与稳定性条件\">2. 核心更新公式与稳定性条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-2-核心更新公式与稳定性条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>离散实现取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 个时间节点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_j=j\\tau$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1/M$</span>。对每个节点，用样本均值估计条件期望：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat v_j=\\frac{\\sum_{i=1}^N (x_1^{(i)}-x_0^{(i)})\\,\\kappa\\!\\left(\\|\\mathrm{seg}_i(t_j)-x\\|/\\sigma\\right)}{\\sum_{i=1}^N \\kappa\\!\\left(\\|\\mathrm{seg}_i(t_j)-x\\|/\\sigma\\right)},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(u)=\\exp(-u^2/2)$</span> 为核，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma&gt;0$</span> 为带宽。数值稳定性条件：(S1) 分母加 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=10^{-12}$</span> 防零除；(S2) 核指数用 <code>np.exp(-0.5*u*u)</code> 并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u^2$</span> 做 <code>np.clip(...,0,50)</code> 防溢出；(S3) Euler 积分步长满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\le 1/(\\|\\hat A\\|_\\infty+1)$</span> 以保证离散流稳定（由 (A4) 的 Lipschitz 常数给出）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 17.13.3（Euler 误差界）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span>，则 Euler 流与真流的偏差满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\hat\\Phi_1(x)-\\Phi_1(x)\\|\\le \\frac{e^{L}-1}{L}\\cdot\\frac{\\tau}{2}\\sup_{t}\\|\\partial_t\\hat v\\|.$$</div>\n<p><em>证明</em> 标准 Gronwall 论证：局部截断误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le \\frac{\\tau^2}{2}\\sup\\|\\partial_t v\\|$</span>，累积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 步并用离散 Gronwall，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0$</span> 得常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(e^L-1)/L$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-3-可运行实现与断言\">3. 可运行实现与断言<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-3-可运行实现与断言\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=400$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$M=8$</span> 的玩具模型上验证：(i) 形状契约；(ii) 一轮 reflow 后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2$</span> 不增（命题 17.13.2 的推论，单调性节已证）；(iii) 退化情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=X_0$</span> 时速度场为零向量。解析期望值用 <code>sympy</code> 计算。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\nimport sympy as sp\n\n# 2x2 解析例子：mu0={(0,0),(1,0)}, mu1={(0,1),(1,1)}\n# 初始交叉耦合成本平方均值=2，reflow 后直配=1\nx0 = sp.Matrix([[0,0],[1,0]])\nx1 = sp.Matrix([[0,1],[1,1]])\nx1_cross = sp.Matrix([[0,1],[1,1]])[[1,0],:]  # 交叉\n\ndef cost_sq(a, b):\n    return sum((b[i,j]-a[i,j])**2 for i in range(2) for j in range(2)) / 2\n\nc_init_sym = cost_sq(x0, x1_cross)\nc_str_sym  = cost_sq(x0, x1)\nprint(&quot;sympy c_init:&quot;, c_init_sym, &quot;c_str:&quot;, c_str_sym)\nassert sp.simplify(c_init_sym - sp.Integer(2)) == 0\nassert sp.simplify(c_str_sym  - sp.Integer(1)) == 0\n\n# 数值路径\nX0 = np.array([[0.,0.],[1.,0.]])\nX1 = np.array([[0.,1.],[1.,1.]])\nX1_cross = X1[[1,0],:]\nc_init = ((X1_cross - X0)**2).sum(axis=1).mean()\nc_str  = ((X1 - X0)**2).sum(axis=1).mean()\nprint(&quot;num c_init:&quot;, c_init, &quot;c_str:&quot;, c_str)\nassert abs(c_init - float(c_init_sym)) &lt; 1e-6\nassert abs(c_str  - float(c_str_sym))  &lt; 1e-6\nassert c_str &lt; c_init\n\n# 概率归一化检查\nw = np.array([0.5, 0.5])\nassert abs(w.sum() - 1.0) &lt; 1e-12 and np.all(w &gt;= 0)\nprint(&quot;OK: reflow 降低传输成本 2 -&gt; 1&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>A_hat shape: (9, 2, 2) b_hat shape: (9, 2)</code>，<code>X1_hat shape: (400, 2)</code>，<code>v_mean ≈ [1, 0]</code>，<code>C2_num ≈ 1.0</code>，<code>degenerate b0 max ≈ 0</code>。误差量级：Euler 截断 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\tau)=O(0.125)$</span> 在仿射场上精确为零（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 无关），核回归偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\sigma^2)$</span> 被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的平移量掩盖，数值误差由浮点累加给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 10^{-10}$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-4-数值误差来源与量级\">4. 数值误差来源与量级<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-4-数值误差来源与量级\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>三类误差：(E1) 核回归的偏差—方差权衡，偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\sigma^2)$</span>、方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/(N\\sigma^d))$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=2,N=400,\\sigma=0.5$</span> 时方差项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sim 10^{-2}$</span>，故断言容差取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span> 仅对均值成立；(E2) Euler 截断 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\tau)$</span>，在仿射场上精确为零，故断言 2 的容差可紧至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span>；(E3) 线性求解的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-10}$</span> 正则化引入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(10^{-10})$</span> 偏差。若去掉 (S1) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>，当某网格点样本权重全为零时分母为零，产生 <code>nan</code>；若去掉 (S2) 的 <code>clip</code>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u^2&gt;50$</span> 时 <code>exp</code> 下溢为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 尚可，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u^2$</span> 过大时 <code>exp(-u^2)</code> 直接为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 导致权重全零，故 <code>clip</code> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 缺一不可。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>reflow 迭代的数学定义是条件期望投影：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k+1)}(x,t)=\\mathbb E[X_1-X_0\\mid \\mathrm{seg}(X_0,X_1;t)=x]$</span>，在仿射场类下有闭式解，代码以核加权最小二乘实现该投影。</li>\n<li>数值实现必须携带稳定性条件：分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>、核指数 <code>clip</code>、Euler 步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\le 1/(L+1)$</span>；三者缺失分别导致零除、下溢、发散，误差量级由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\sigma^2)+O(1/(N\\sigma^d))+O(\\tau)$</span> 给出。</li>\n<li>断言只能对解析可算的量做严格检验（平移耦合的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_2=1$</span>、退化耦合的零速度场），随机初始化后的收敛结果只做统计断言；本节代码在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=2,N=400$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$30$</span> 秒内完成，形状与数值等价断言全部通过。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-5-迭代不动点的数值验证\">5. 迭代不动点的数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-5-迭代不动点的数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已证：reflow 的不动点是直线流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\star(x,t)=x_1-x_0$</span>，即当耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 的样本对满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{seg}(X_0,X_1;t)$</span> 无关时，条件期望退化为常数向量。本节用代码验证这一判据：对平移耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=X_0+c$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span> 常数），速度场应与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x,t$</span> 无关且等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>，此时一轮 reflow 后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k+1)}=v^{(k)}$</span>，迭代停止。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 17.13.4（平移耦合的不动点判据）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=X_0+c$</span> 几乎必然，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span> 为常数。则在假设 (A1)–(A3) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k+1)}(x,t)=c$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0=c$</span> 几乎必然，条件期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[c\\mid \\mathrm{seg}=x]=c$</span> 对任意事件成立，故由命题 17.13.2 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k+1)}(x,t)=c$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题的数值含义是：仿射拟合的斜率矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_j$</span> 应为零矩阵，截距 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_j$</span> 应为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>。代码中 <code>fit_velocity</code> 对平移耦合返回的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_j$</span> 由加权最小二乘给出，理论上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_j=0$</span> 因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D=X_1-X_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 的偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S-c$</span> 不相关；数值上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_j$</span> 的量级由有限样本的相关性残余 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(N^{-1/2})$</span> 控制。断言应针对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_j$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_j$</span>，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_j$</span> 的解析值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 且不受样本相关性影响（加权均值是无偏的）。</p>\n<p>进一步，若第二轮 reflow 用第一轮诱导的耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,\\Phi^{(1)}_1(X_0))$</span> 重新训练，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{(1)}_1(X_0)=X_0+c$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(1)}=c$</span> 为常向量场，其流为平移），则第二轮耦合仍是平移耦合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(2)}=c=v^{(1)}$</span>。这正是“不动点：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)=x_1-x_0$</span>（直线流）”在平移情形下的实例：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1-x_0=c$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 无关，故条件期望等于该常数。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 17.13.5（两轮 reflow 的等价性）</strong> 在命题 17.13.4 的假设下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{(2)}_1=\\Phi^{(1)}_1$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 的映射。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 第一轮速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(1)}\\equiv c$</span>，其流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{(1)}_t(x)=x+tc$</span>，特别地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{(1)}_1(x)=x+c$</span>。第二轮耦合为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_0+c)$</span>，由命题 17.13.4 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(2)}\\equiv c$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{(2)}_1(x)=x+c=\\Phi^{(1)}_1(x)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题说明：在平移耦合下 reflow 迭代一步即达不动点，后续迭代不改变流映射。这与“收敛性”节的结论一致——reflow 的收敛速率由耦合的非直线性度量，直线耦合的收敛速率为零（一步收敛）。数值上，若代码对平移耦合跑两轮 reflow，第二轮拟合的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_j$</span> 与第一轮的差应为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(N^{-1/2})$</span> 的统计涨落，而非系统性偏差。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-6-传输成本单调性的数值检验\">6. 传输成本单调性的数值检验<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-6-传输成本单调性的数值检验\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序“传输成本的单调性”节已证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span> 随 reflow 次数单调不增。本节给出该单调性的可数值检验版本：对任意耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span>，其传输成本平方 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k^2=\\mathbb E_{\\pi^{(k)}}\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2$</span> 的上界；reflow 后新耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k+1)}$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{(k+1)}$</span> 诱导，需验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{k+1}^2\\le C_k^2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 17.13.6（成本单调性的可检验形式）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮耦合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k+1)}$</span> 为命题 17.13.2 的解，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{(k+1)}$</span> 为其流。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{\\mu_0}\\|\\Phi^{(k+1)}_1(X_0)-X_0\\|^2\\le \\mathbb E_{\\pi^{(k)}}\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由命题 17.13.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k+1)}$</span> 最小化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{\\pi^{(k)}}\\int_0^1\\|v(\\mathrm{seg};t)-(X_1-X_0)\\|^2dt$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 为沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 的直线速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_{\\mathrm{lin}}(x,t)=X_1-X_0$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{seg}$</span> 上取值），则损失为零。故最优 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k+1)}$</span> 的损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{\\pi^{(k)}}\\|v^{(k+1)}(\\mathrm{seg};t)-(X_1-X_0)\\|^2=0$</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k+1)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{seg}$</span> 上几乎必然相等时成立。对一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k+1)}$</span>，损失非负，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{\\pi^{(k)}}\\|v^{(k+1)}(\\mathrm{seg};t)\\|^2\\le \\mathbb E_{\\pi^{(k)}}\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2$</span>（由平方损失展开与交叉项控制）。沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k+1)}$</span> 积分得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{(k+1)}_1$</span>，其位移范数平方的期望不超过原耦合位移范数平方的期望。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题的数值检验需注意：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{(k+1)}_1(X_0)$</span> 由 Euler 积分得到，其位移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{(k+1)}_1(X_0)-X_0$</span> 的期望平方应与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k^2$</span> 比较。在平移耦合下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k^2=\\|c\\|^2$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{(k+1)}_1(X_0)-X_0=c$</span>（精确），故等号成立。在非平移耦合下，等号一般不成立，需用样本均值估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{k+1}^2$</span> 并与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k^2$</span> 比较，容差由 Monte Carlo 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 给出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=\\sqrt{\\mathrm{Var}(\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2)/N}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 17.13.7（单调性的统计断言）</strong> 在假设 (A1)–(A3) 下，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 个样本，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{k+1}^2$</span> 的样本均值与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k^2$</span> 的样本均值之差满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat C_{k+1}^2-\\hat C_k^2\\le 3\\hat\\sigma$</span> 以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge 0.997$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\sigma$</span> 为差值的样本标准差除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt N$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由命题 17.13.6 的期望不等式与中心极限定理，差值均值的抽样分布均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 0$</span>，标准差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\sigma$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 上界以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.997$</span> 概率成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>数值实现中，该断言只对非退化耦合（<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1\\neq X_0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 变化）有意义；对平移耦合，差值为零，断言退化为平凡。代码中若对随机旋转耦合（<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=R X_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$R$</span> 为旋转矩阵）跑两轮 reflow，第一轮后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1^2$</span> 应严格小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_0^2$</span>（因旋转耦合的直线插值不沿旋转方向），第二轮后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_2^2$</span> 进一步减小，直至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R=I$</span> 时达不动点。该过程的收敛速率由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span> 的谱距离控制，与“收敛性”节的线性收敛速率一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-7-数值稳定性的边界情形\">7. 数值稳定性的边界情形<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-7-数值稳定性的边界情形\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 17.13.8（带宽退化的极限行为）</strong> 设核带宽 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma\\to0^+$</span>，则对每个网格点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_j$</span> 与查询点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，核加权回归退化为最近邻平均：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v_j(x)\\to$</span> 距离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 最近的样本的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 值（若最近邻唯一）。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma\\to0$</span>，核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(u^2/\\sigma^2)\\to\\mathbf 1\\{u=0\\}$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=0$</span> 处为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，其余为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>），加权平均退化为最近邻的算术平均。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该极限的数值含义：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 过小导致每个网格点只有少数样本有非零权重，方差爆炸；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 过大导致所有样本权重相近，偏差增大（回归退化为全局均值）。稳定性条件 (S2) 的 <code>clip</code> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 过小时防止 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u^2/\\sigma^2$</span> 溢出，但无法防止权重全零——此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 保证分母非零，但分子也为零，输出为零向量，产生系统性偏差。故代码中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 的选取需满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\sigma^d\\gg 1$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=2,N=400$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma\\ge 0.3$</span> 可保证每个网格点有效样本数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge 10$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 17.13.9（Euler 步长的稳定性阈值）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat A_j$</span> 的谱半径上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span>，则 Euler 积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat X_{j+1}=\\hat X_j+\\tau(\\hat A_j\\hat X_j+\\hat b_j)$</span> 的稳定性条件为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\rho&lt;2$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 齐次部分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat X_{j+1}=(I+\\tau\\hat A_j)\\hat X_j$</span>，其谱半径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 1+\\tau\\rho$</span>；稳定要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|1+\\tau\\rho|&lt;1$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\rho&lt;2$</span>（对实负特征值）或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\rho&lt;1$</span>（对实正特征值，此时增长但可控）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>在平移耦合下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat A_j\\approx0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho\\approx0$</span>，任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 稳定；在旋转耦合下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat A_j$</span> 的特征值为纯虚数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\rho&lt;2$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&lt;2/\\rho$</span>，代码中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=0.125$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho\\le1$</span> 满足。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 过大，Euler 积分振荡发散，断言 2 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_2$</span> 将偏离解析值，此时应减小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 而非放宽容差。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-8-与少步生成接口的数值含义\">8. 与少步生成接口的数值含义<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-8-与少步生成接口的数值含义\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序“与少步生成的接口”节指出：reflow 拉直轨迹后，少步 Euler 采样即可达到高精度。本节给出该接口的可数值验证判据：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮速度场，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 步 Euler 采样的端点误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\tau\\sup\\|\\partial_t v\\|)$</span>；reflow 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t v\\to0$</span>（直线流），故误差随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 单调减小。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 17.13.10（少步误差的 reflow 单调性）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的偏导上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_k:=\\sup_{t,x}\\|\\partial_t v^{(k)}(x,t)\\|$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 步 Euler 的端点误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le \\frac{e^{L}-1}{L}\\cdot\\frac{\\tau}{2}L_k$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_k$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 单调不增（在命题 17.13.6 的假设下）。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 误差界由命题 17.13.3 给出；<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_k$</span> 的单调性由 reflow 的条件期望投影：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k+1)}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{seg}$</span> 上的条件期望，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{seg}$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 依赖被投影消除，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t v^{(k+1)}$</span> 的范数不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t v^{(k)}$</span> 的范数。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>数值上，对旋转耦合跑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮 reflow，测量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_k$</span> 的样本估计（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat A_j$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 的变化率），应观察到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_k$</span> 递减。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_k\\to0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M=1$</span> 的单步 Euler 即精确，这正是少步生成的数学基础。代码中若用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=8$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=1$</span> 两种步数比较端点误差，reflow 后两者之差应随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 减小，直至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=1$</span> 的误差低于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span>（直线流下 Euler 精确）。</p>\n<p>综上，本节代码验证了 reflow 迭代的三个核心性质：条件期望投影的闭式解（命题 17.13.2）、平移耦合的一步不动点（命题 17.13.4–17.13.5）、传输成本的单调性（命题 17.13.6–17.13.7），并给出了数值稳定性的边界条件（命题 17.13.8–17.13.9）与少步生成接口的误差单调性（命题 17.13.10）。所有断言均针对解析可算的量，随机量只做 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 统计断言，容差由误差阶推出。</p>\n<h3 id=\"fl17--h-代码-传输成本的测量\">代码：传输成本的测量<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-代码-传输成本的测量\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1\\in\\mathcal{P}_2(\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span> 为端点分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}:[0,1]\\times\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮 reflow 后的速度场，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi^{(k)}_t$</span> 为其诱导流，耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}=(X_0,X_1)$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi^{(k)}$</span> 诱导，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\sim\\mu_0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=\\phi^{(k)}_1(X_0)$</span>。传输成本记为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{C}^{(k)}:=W_2^2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1;\\pi^{(k)})=\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi^{(k)}}\\big[\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2\\big].$$</div>\n<p>本节只做一件事：给定上述对象，构造一个可运行的测量器，输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}^{(k)}$</span> 及其相对上一轮的下降量，并给出误差量级。为此引入两个新符号并写入符号表：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat{\\mathcal{C}}^{(k)}_N$</span>：用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 个样本对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}^{(k)}$</span> 的 Monte Carlo 估计，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat{\\mathcal{C}}^{(k)}_N=\\frac1N\\sum_{i=1}^N\\|x^{(i)}_1-x^{(i)}_0\\|^2$</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{(k)}_N:=\\widehat{\\mathcal{C}}^{(k-1)}_N-\\widehat{\\mathcal{C}}^{(k)}_N$</span>：相邻两轮估计的下降量。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>假设：(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 有紧支撑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_0\\subset\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>；(A2) 每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]\\times K_0$</span> 上 Lipschitz 且关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi^{(k)}_1$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_0$</span> 上连续；(A3) 样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x^{(i)}_0\\}_{i=1}^N$</span> 独立同分布于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x^{(i)}_1=\\phi^{(k)}_1(x^{(i)}_0)$</span> 为确定性推送（无额外噪声）。由 (A1)(A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2\\le (2\\,\\mathrm{diam}(K_0))^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}^{(k)}&lt;\\infty$</span> 且方差有限，Monte Carlo 误差可由中心极限定理控制。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-测量器的输入输出契约\">测量器的输入输出契约<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-测量器的输入输出契约\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>输入：端点样本矩阵 <code>X0</code>，形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(N,d)$</span>，数值范围由 (A1) 限定；第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮流映射的离散表示 <code>push</code>，即一个把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(N,d)$</span> 数组映到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(N,d)$</span> 数组的可调用对象（在代码节中用一个显式的仿射推送代替，以便解析核对）。输出：标量 <code>C_hat</code>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat{\\mathcal{C}}^{(k)}_N$</span>）、标量 <code>delta</code>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{(k)}_N$</span>）、以及形状为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(N,)$</span> 的逐样本平方位移 <code>sq</code>。</p>\n<p>契约要求：<code>sq[i] = ||X1[i]-X0[i]||^2</code>，<code>C_hat = sq.mean()</code>，且当 <code>push</code> 为恒等时 <code>C_hat</code> 必须严格为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>（退化情形断言）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-估计量的偏差与误差量级\">估计量的偏差与误差量级<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-估计量的偏差与误差量级\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（无偏性与误差阶）</strong>—假设 (A1)(A3) 成立。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\widehat{\\mathcal{C}}^{(k)}_N]=\\mathcal{C}^{(k)}$</span>，且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Var}\\big(\\widehat{\\mathcal{C}}^{(k)}_N\\big)=\\frac{\\sigma_k^2}{N},\\qquad \\sigma_k^2=\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mu_0}\\big(\\|\\phi^{(k)}_1(X_0)-X_0\\|^2\\big).$$</div>\n<p>证明：由 (A3) 样本独立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat{\\mathcal{C}}^{(k)}_N$</span> 是 i.i.d. 变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|X^{(i)}_1-X^{(i)}_0\\|^2$</span> 的算术平均，线性性给出无偏性；独立性给出方差为单样本方差除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>。有限性由 (A1)(A2) 的紧支撑与连续性保证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\widehat{\\mathcal{C}}^{(k)}_N-\\mathcal{C}^{(k)}|$</span> 的标准差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_k/\\sqrt{N}$</span>。代码中不假设已知 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_k$</span>，改用样本标准差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_k$</span> 代入，并以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\,s_k/\\sqrt{N}$</span> 作为统计断言的容差（<span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 原则），这正是 Monte Carlo 误差阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(N^{-1/2})$</span> 的直接体现。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-单调性的可测版本\">单调性的可测版本<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-单调性的可测版本\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（估计下降量的符号可靠性）</strong>—假设 (A1)–(A3)，且真实下降量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}^{(k-1)}-\\mathcal{C}^{(k)}&gt;0$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$N&gt;\\Big(\\frac{3(\\sigma_{k-1}+\\sigma_k)}{\\mathcal{C}^{(k-1)}-\\mathcal{C}^{(k)}}\\Big)^2,$$</div>\n<p>则以概率至少 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.99$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{(k)}_N&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<p>证明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{(k)}_N-(\\mathcal{C}^{(k-1)}-\\mathcal{C}^{(k)})$</span> 是两独立样本均值之差减去其期望，标准差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{(\\sigma_{k-1}^2+\\sigma_k^2)/N}\\le(\\sigma_{k-1}+\\sigma_k)/\\sqrt{N}$</span>。由 Chebyshev 不等式，偏差超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3$</span> 倍标准差（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3(\\sigma_{k-1}+\\sigma_k)/\\sqrt{N}$</span>）的概率不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/9&lt;0.01$</span>；在该事件外，偏差小于真实下降量，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{(k)}_N&gt;0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这条命题说明：测量器不能仅凭 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{(k)}_N&gt;0$</span> 宣称单调性，必须同时报告 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_k$</span>；代码中的断言正是按此构造。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-可运行实现与断言\">可运行实现与断言<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-可运行实现与断言\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=2000$</span>、两个显式仿射推送（第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 轮为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\mapsto 2x$</span>，第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 轮为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\mapsto x$</span> 的直线化极限）验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat{\\mathcal{C}}^{(0)}$</span> 的解析值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|X_0\\|^2$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_2)$</span> 时等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat{\\mathcal{C}}^{(1)}$</span> 恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{(1)}_N$</span> 的解析值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>。所有断言值均手算可得。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\nN, d = 2000, 2\n\n# 端点样本：X0 ~ N(0, I_d)，形状 (N, d)\nX0 = rng.standard_normal((N, d))\nassert X0.shape == (N, d)\n\ndef measure(X0, push):\n    &quot;&quot;&quot;返回 (C_hat, sq, s) ：sq 形状 (N,)，C_hat 标量，s 为样本标准差。&quot;&quot;&quot;\n    X1 = push(X0)\n    assert X1.shape == X0.shape, &quot;推送必须保持形状&quot;\n    diff = X1 - X0                      # (N, d)\n    sq = np.sum(diff * diff, axis=1)    # (N,)\n    assert sq.shape == (N,)\n    C_hat = float(sq.mean())\n    s = float(sq.std(ddof=1))\n    return C_hat, sq, s\n\n# 第 0 轮：push0(x) = 2x，解析值 E||2X0 - X0||^2 = E||X0||^2 = d = 2\npush0 = lambda X: 2.0 * X\nC0, sq0, s0 = measure(X0, push0)\nassert abs(C0 - d) &lt; 3 * s0 / np.sqrt(N), &quot;C0 应落在 2 的 3sigma 邻域&quot;\n\n# 第 1 轮：push1(x) = x，直线流极限，解析值恒为 0\npush1 = lambda X: X.copy()\nC1, sq1, s1 = measure(X0, push1)\nassert C1 == 0.0, &quot;恒等推送的传输成本必须严格为 0&quot;\nassert np.all(sq1 == 0.0)\n\n# 下降量：解析值 C0 - C1 = 2 - 0 = 2\ndelta = C0 - C1\nassert delta &gt; 0.0\nassert abs(delta - d) &lt; 3 * np.sqrt(s0**2 + s1**2) / np.sqrt(N)\n\nprint(&quot;shape X0:&quot;, X0.shape, &quot;| shape sq:&quot;, sq0.shape)\nprint(&quot;C0_hat =&quot;, round(C0, 4), &quot; (解析值 2)&quot;)\nprint(&quot;C1_hat =&quot;, C1, &quot; (解析值 0)&quot;)\nprint(&quot;delta  =&quot;, round(delta, 4), &quot; (解析值 2)&quot;)\nprint(&quot;3sigma(C0) =&quot;, round(3 * s0 / np.sqrt(N), 4))\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>shape X0: (2000, 2) | shape sq: (2000,)</code>，<code>C0_hat</code> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span> 附近、偏差量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3s_0/\\sqrt{N}\\approx 3\\cdot\\sqrt{2}/\\sqrt{2000}\\approx 0.095$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}\\|X_0\\|^2=2d=4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_0\\approx 2$</span>），<code>C1_hat = 0.0</code>，<code>delta</code> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span> 附近、容差约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.095$</span>。所有断言容差均由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(N^{-1/2})$</span> 误差阶推出，未使用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 级别的硬容差。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-数值误差来源\">数值误差来源<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-数值误差来源\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>误差有三类：(i) Monte Carlo 抽样误差，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_k/\\sqrt{N}$</span>，由命题 1 给出，可通过增大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 或方差缩减降低；(ii) 推送映射的离散化误差，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi^{(k)}_1$</span> 由数值 ODE 积分得到，则存在时间步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 的局部截断误差，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^p)$</span>，本节代码用解析仿射推送将其置零，只隔离 (i)；(iii) 浮点舍入，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\cdot N\\cdot\\mathrm{diam}^2)$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\le 2000$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\le 5$</span> 时可忽略。测量器报告 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_k$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>，使读者能自行复算 (i) 的量级；这是把“单调不增”这一定性结论转成可检验数值陈述的唯一诚实方式。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>传输成本的测量器以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat{\\mathcal{C}}^{(k)}_N=\\frac1N\\sum_i\\|x^{(i)}_1-x^{(i)}_0\\|^2$</span> 为唯一输出，其无偏性与方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_k^2/N$</span> 由命题 1 给出，误差阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(N^{-1/2})$</span>。</li>\n<li>相邻轮下降量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{(k)}_N$</span> 的符号只有在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 超过命题 2 所给阈值时才可靠，故测量器必须同时报告 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 与样本标准差，不得仅凭正号宣称单调性。</li>\n<li>代码以仿射推送隔离 Monte Carlo 误差，三个断言分别覆盖形状契约、恒等退化的严格零值、以及解析值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 邻域，容差全部由误差阶推出。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-下降量的配对估计与方差缩减\">下降量的配对估计与方差缩减<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-下降量的配对估计与方差缩减\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 2 给出的阈值判据基于两轮独立样本的均值之差，其方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{k-1}^2/N+\\sigma_k^2/N$</span>。然而在 reflow 的实际测量中，第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮的耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi^{(k)}$</span> 与第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k-1$</span> 轮的耦合共享同一个端点样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span>：第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮的推送由第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k-1$</span> 轮流映射复合得到，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{(i)}_1=\\phi^{(k)}_1(X^{(i)}_0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{(i)}_0$</span> 逐样本对应。这一结构允许我们改用配对估计，把两轮的平方位移在同一批样本上相减，从而消去由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 抽样引入的共同波动。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（配对估计量的方差）</strong>—假设 (A1)–(A3)，且两轮测量使用同一组 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{(i)}_0$</span>。定义配对下降量</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\widetilde{\\Delta}^{(k)}_N:=\\frac1N\\sum_{i=1}^N\\Big(\\|\\phi^{(k-1)}_1(X^{(i)}_0)-X^{(i)}_0\\|^2-\\|\\phi^{(k)}_1(X^{(i)}_0)-X^{(i)}_0\\|^2\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\widetilde{\\Delta}^{(k)}_N]=\\mathcal{C}^{(k-1)}-\\mathcal{C}^{(k)}$</span>，且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Var}\\big(\\widetilde{\\Delta}^{(k)}_N\\big)=\\frac{\\tau_k^2}{N},\\qquad \\tau_k^2=\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mu_0}\\Big(\\|\\phi^{(k-1)}_1(X_0)-X_0\\|^2-\\|\\phi^{(k)}_1(X_0)-X_0\\|^2\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>证明：被求和的每一项是同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{(i)}_0$</span> 的两个确定性函数的差，故其期望等于两轮成本之差，线性性给出无偏性。样本独立，方差为单样本方差除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>关键在于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{k-1}^2+\\sigma_k^2$</span> 的大小关系。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_i=\\|\\phi^{(k-1)}_1(X^{(i)}_0)-X^{(i)}_0\\|^2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$B_i=\\|\\phi^{(k)}_1(X^{(i)}_0)-X^{(i)}_0\\|^2$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tau_k^2=\\mathrm{Var}(A-B)=\\sigma_{k-1}^2+\\sigma_k^2-2\\,\\mathrm{Cov}(A,B).$$</div>\n<p>当两轮推送在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 上高度相关时（reflow 的典型情形：第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮只是对第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k-1$</span> 轮的微调），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(A,B)&gt;0$</span>，配对估计的方差严格小于独立估计。极端情形是第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮推送为恒等：此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_i\\equiv 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(A,B)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k^2=\\sigma_{k-1}^2$</span>，配对估计退化为对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}^{(k-1)}$</span> 的单轮估计，仍优于两轮独立估计的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{k-1}^2+\\sigma_k^2$</span>。因此配对估计在 reflow 测量中应作为默认选择，独立估计只在两轮样本无法对齐时使用。</p>\n<p>这一结论对命题 2 的阈值有直接影响：把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{k-1}+\\sigma_k$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k$</span>，阈值变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N&gt;(3\\tau_k/(\\mathcal{C}^{(k-1)}-\\mathcal{C}^{(k)}))^2$</span>。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k\\le\\sqrt{\\sigma_{k-1}^2+\\sigma_k^2}$</span>，配对估计在相同置信水平下所需样本量更小，或在相同样本量下给出更紧的置信区间。代码中的 <code>delta</code> 正是配对估计：<code>sq0</code> 与 <code>sq1</code> 在同一 <code>X0</code> 上计算，逐元素相减后取均值，而非两个独立均值相减。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-单调性的统计检验而非点估计\">单调性的统计检验而非点估计<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-单调性的统计检验而非点估计\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 2 只保证在真实下降量足够大时点估计的符号可靠，但当真实下降量趋于零（reflow 接近不动点），任何有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 都无法从点估计的符号判断单调性。此时需要把“单调不增”转成一个单侧假设检验。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（单侧检验的构造）</strong>—假设 (A1)–(A3)，配对样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{D_i\\}_{i=1}^N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_i=A_i-B_i$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[D_i]=\\delta_k:=\\mathcal{C}^{(k-1)}-\\mathcal{C}^{(k)}$</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar D=\\widetilde{\\Delta}^{(k)}_N$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_D$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_i$</span> 的样本标准差。则统计量</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$T:=\\frac{\\bar D}{s_D/\\sqrt{N}}$$</div>\n<p>在原假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_k\\le 0$</span> 下依分布收敛于标准正态，由中心极限定理（Lindeberg–Lévy，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_i$</span> i.i.d. 且方差有限，有限性由 (A1)(A2) 保证）。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T&gt;z_{1-\\alpha}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$z_{1-\\alpha}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 分位数）时拒绝原假设，接受 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_k&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<p>证明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_i$</span> i.i.d.、方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{N}(\\bar D-\\delta_k)/\\tau_k\\Rightarrow\\mathcal{N}(0,1)$</span>。Slutsky 定理给出用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_D$</span> 替换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k$</span> 后统计量仍收敛于标准正态。在原假设边界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_k=0$</span> 处，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 的极限分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(0,1)$</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_k&lt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 的极限分布向左平移，拒绝域概率不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这条检验的意义在于：它把“<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 随 reflow 次数单调不增”这一定理级结论，在有限样本下转成可证伪的统计陈述。若某轮 reflow 后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 未超过阈值，我们不能宣称该轮降低了成本；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 显著为负，则与单调性定理矛盾，提示实现有误（例如推送映射的数值积分发散，或耦合重构时样本错配）。代码节中未实现完整检验，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=2000$</span> 与解析推送使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_k$</span> 远离零，点估计已足够；但测量器的输出契约（同时返回 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar D$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_D$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>）正是为这一检验预留接口。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-成本测量的维度与坐标无关性\">成本测量的维度与坐标无关性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-成本测量的维度与坐标无关性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上述测量在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 的标准欧氏坐标下进行，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}^{(k)}=\\mathbb{E}\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2$</span> 依赖坐标选择。若在流形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 上做 reflow，需把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|^2$</span> 替换为测地距离平方 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{dist}_M(\\cdot,\\cdot)^2$</span>，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2$</span> 的定义与 Benamou–Brenier 公式中的动能一致，测量器需调用测地线求解器。本节限定在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，故坐标无关性问题不出现；但需指出，即便在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，若对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 做线性变换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\mapsto AX_0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 可逆），成本会变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|A(X_1-X_0)\\|^2$</span>，不再是原成本。因此测量器必须固定坐标，不得在测量前后对样本做归一化或白化，否则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat{\\mathcal{C}}^{(k)}_N$</span> 与定理中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2$</span> 不再对应。代码中 <code>X0</code> 直接取自 <code>rng.standard_normal</code>，未做任何缩放，正是为保持这一对应。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-测量器的失效边界\">测量器的失效边界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-测量器的失效边界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1–4 依赖 (A1)–(A3)。若 (A1) 失效（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 无紧支撑，如高斯分布），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2$</span> 的期望仍有限（因推送为仿射时二阶矩有限），但方差可能依赖尾部；此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 容差需改用亚高斯或重尾修正。若 (A2) 失效（推送不连续），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi^{(k)}_1(X_0)$</span> 可能不可测，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat{\\mathcal{C}}^{(k)}_N$</span> 的定义本身失效。若 (A3) 失效（样本相关，如 MCMC 采样），方差需乘以有效样本量的修正因子。这三种失效在代码节中均未触发：<code>X0</code> 独立同分布、推送为解析仿射、支撑虽非紧但二阶矩有限。测量器对这些边界的处理方式是显式报告假设，而非隐式假设其成立——这正是本节把“测量”与“定理”分开陈述的理由：定理给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{C}^{(k)}$</span> 的单调性，测量器只给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat{\\mathcal{C}}^{(k)}_N$</span> 及其误差界，两者的连接由命题 1–4 显式建立。</p>\n<h3 id=\"fl17--h-与-Flow-Maps-章的接口\">与 Flow Maps 章的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-与-Flow-Maps-章的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已固定的记号，不重新定义 reflow 的迭代机制，只处理“Flow Maps 章的对象如何嵌入 reflow 迭代”这一接口问题。为避免歧义，先把本节用到的符号集中列出；凡前序节已定义者，此处只重申其含义与所属空间。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal{X},\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上的欧氏空间，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\cdot|$</span> 为诱导范数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge 1$</span> 固定。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{P}_2(\\mathcal{X})$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}$</span> 上具有有限二阶矩的概率测度全体，配 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 度量。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1\\in\\mathcal{P}_2(\\mathcal{X})$</span> 为给定的端点测度。第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮 reflow 诱导的耦合记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_k\\in\\mathcal{P}_2(\\mathcal{X}\\times\\mathcal{X})$</span>，其边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span>；第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮 ODE 的速度场记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k:[0,1]\\times\\mathcal{X}\\to\\mathcal{X}$</span>，对应流映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_k^t:\\mathcal{X}\\to\\mathcal{X}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span>。</li>\n<li>Flow Maps 章的核心对象是<strong>流映射族</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{F_\\theta:\\mathcal{X}\\to\\mathcal{X}\\}_{\\theta\\in\\Theta}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta$</span> 为参数空间（有限维或函数空间，本节只需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta$</span> 为可分度量空间）。每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta$</span> 是 Borel 可测映射，且满足平方可积：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int |F_\\theta(x)-x|^2\\,\\mu_0(dx)&lt;\\infty$</span>。Flow Maps 章研究的是“用单个映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta$</span> 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 推前到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span>”的逼近问题，即最小化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int |F_\\theta(x)-y|^2\\,\\gamma(dx,dy)$</span> 在某个耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 下的值，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 的边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span>。</li>\n<li>本节引入的<strong>新符号</strong>仅有：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}$</span> 表示由第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮流映射在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 处取值构成的映射集合，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_k:=\\{\\Phi_k^1\\}$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_{\\mathcal{F}}$</span> 表示到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mu_0)$</span> 投影算子（定义见下文）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}(F):=\\int |F(x)-x|^2\\,\\mu_0(dx)$</span> 为映射的位移能量。这三个符号仅在本节使用，且在下文首次出现处给出定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节的正则性假设统一如下，后续每个命题只引用与其证明直接相关的条目，不重复罗列：</p>\n<p>(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1\\in\\mathcal{P}_2(\\mathcal{X})$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>(A2) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]\\times\\mathcal{X}$</span> 上 Borel 可测、对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 局部 Lipschitz、对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续，且满足线性增长界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|v_k(t,x)|\\le C_k(1+|x|)$</span>。此条件保证 ODE <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot x=v_k(t,x)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>-a.e. 初值存在唯一全局解，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_k^t$</span> 为 Borel 可测（参见前序“数值稳定性”节已建立的流映射可测性）。</p>\n<p>(A3) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_k^1$</span> 平方可积：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int|\\Phi_k^1(x)|^2\\,\\mu_0(dx)&lt;\\infty$</span>。由 (A2) 的线性增长与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0\\in\\mathcal{P}_2$</span> 可推出此条，故它是 (A2) 的推论而非独立假设，列出仅为引用方便。</p>\n<p>(A4) 耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_k$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_k=(\\mathrm{id},\\Phi_k^1)_\\#\\mu_0$</span> 给出，即把初值与第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮流映射的终点配对。这是本章“耦合的重构”节已固定的构造，本节不重新论证其边缘性质，只引用：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_k$</span> 的第一边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>，第二边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Phi_k^1)_\\#\\mu_0$</span>，后者按构造逼近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span>。</p>\n<p>下面进入接口的实质内容。Flow Maps 章关心的是“单映射逼近”，而 reflow 章关心的是“迭代拉直”。接口问题可精确表述为：<strong>第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮流映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_k^1$</span> 在何种意义下是 Flow Maps 章所研究的映射族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{F_\\theta\\}$</span> 的一个元素，以及 reflow 迭代对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_k$</span> 的更新如何与 Flow Maps 章的目标函数相容。</strong> 本节给出三个层次的结果：嵌入命题、投影恒等式、以及接口处的梯度一致性推论。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-接口一-流映射作为-Flow-Maps-族的可行点\">接口一：流映射作为 Flow Maps 族的可行点<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-接口一-流映射作为-Flow-Maps-族的可行点\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 17.15.1（嵌入）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_k^1\\in L^2(\\mu_0;\\mathcal{X})$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_k^1$</span> 是 Flow Maps 章目标函数</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{L}(F;\\gamma_k):=\\int_{\\mathcal{X}\\times\\mathcal{X}}|F(x)-y|^2\\,\\gamma_k(dx,dy)$$</div>\n<p>的一个可行点，其目标值为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{L}(\\Phi_k^1;\\gamma_k)=\\int_{\\mathcal{X}}|\\Phi_k^1(x)-\\Phi_k^1(x)|^2\\,\\mu_0(dx)=0.$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：仅需 (A1)、(A4) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_k^1$</span> 的可测性（由 (A2) 保证）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 (A4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_k$</span> 集中在图像 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{(x,\\Phi_k^1(x)):x\\in\\mathcal{X}\\}$</span> 上，即对任意 Borel 集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B\\subset\\mathcal{X}\\times\\mathcal{X}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_k(B)=\\mu_0(\\{x:(x,\\Phi_k^1(x))\\in B\\})$</span>。于是对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_k$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,y)$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y=\\Phi_k^1(x)$</span>。被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|F(x)-y|^2$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F=\\Phi_k^1$</span> 时化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\Phi_k^1(x)-\\Phi_k^1(x)|^2=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_k$</span>-a.e. 成立。由非负性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_k$</span> 为概率测度，积分值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。平方可积性由 (A3) 给出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的意义是：<strong>每一轮流映射都是 Flow Maps 章目标函数在“自耦合”下的零损失可行点</strong>。这看似平凡，但它精确说明了 reflow 与 Flow Maps 的分工——Flow Maps 章在固定耦合下寻找最优单映射，而 reflow 章在固定映射下重构耦合，再在新耦合下重新寻找映射。两者交替进行，构成一个坐标下降式的结构。接口的第一个结论是：reflow 的每一轮都把 Flow Maps 问题的耦合从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_{k-1}$</span> 更新为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_k$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_k^1$</span> 恰是新耦合下的零损失点，故 reflow 可视为 Flow Maps 目标函数在耦合坐标上的一个下降步。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-接口二-投影算子与位移能量的关系\">接口二：投影算子与位移能量的关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-接口二-投影算子与位移能量的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>Flow Maps 章的最优映射在给定耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 下由条件期望给出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$F^\\star(x)=\\mathbb{E}_\\gamma[Y\\mid X=x]$</span>。这一事实在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{P}_2$</span> 框架下是标准的，本节不重复证明，只把它作为 Flow Maps 章的已建立结论引用。接口处需要的是：reflow 的流映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_k^1$</span> 与该条件期望之间的关系。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 17.15.2（位移能量与投影）</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F\\in L^2(\\mu_0;\\mathcal{X})$</span>，定义位移能量</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{E}(F):=\\int_{\\mathcal{X}}|F(x)-x|^2\\,\\mu_0(dx).$$</div>\n<p>对闭凸集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}\\subset L^2(\\mu_0;\\mathcal{X})$</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mu_0)$</span> 投影 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_{\\mathcal{F}}:L^2(\\mu_0;\\mathcal{X})\\to\\mathcal{F}$</span> 为唯一满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|G-\\Pi_{\\mathcal{F}}G\\|_{L^2(\\mu_0)}\\le\\|G-F\\|_{L^2(\\mu_0)}$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F\\in\\mathcal{F}$</span> 成立的元素。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}$</span> 的闭凸性保证投影存在唯一（Hilbert 空间投影定理）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 17.15.3（投影恒等式）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}\\subset L^2(\\mu_0;\\mathcal{X})$</span> 为闭凸集且包含恒等映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{id}$</span>。在 (A1)–(A4) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G\\in L^2(\\mu_0;\\mathcal{X})$</span>，有恒等式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{E}(\\Pi_{\\mathcal{F}}G)=\\mathcal{E}(G)-\\|G-\\Pi_{\\mathcal{F}}G\\|_{L^2(\\mu_0)}^2+2\\langle G-\\Pi_{\\mathcal{F}}G,\\ \\Pi_{\\mathcal{F}}G-\\mathrm{id}\\rangle_{L^2(\\mu_0)}.$$</div>\n<p>特别地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}$</span> 是以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{id}$</span> 为原点的线性子空间（即对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F\\in\\mathcal{F}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\in\\mathbb{R}$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$aF\\in\\mathcal{F}$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{id}\\in\\mathcal{F}$</span> 仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}=\\{0\\}$</span> 时成立——此情形下恒等映射不属于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}$</span>，故本命题不适用），则交叉项消失，得到勾股恒等式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{E}(\\Pi_{\\mathcal{F}}G)=\\mathcal{E}(G)-\\|G-\\Pi_{\\mathcal{F}}G\\|_{L^2(\\mu_0)}^2.$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1) 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 为概率测度使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mu_0)$</span> 为 Hilbert 空间；(A4) 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G=\\Phi_k^1$</span> 平方可积。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}$</span> 闭凸保证投影存在唯一。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P=\\Pi_{\\mathcal{F}}G$</span>。由投影的变分刻画，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F\\in\\mathcal{F}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span>，凸性给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-t)P+tF\\in\\mathcal{F}$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|G-P\\|_{L^2}^2\\le\\|G-((1-t)P+tF)\\|_{L^2}^2=\\|(G-P)-t(F-P)\\|_{L^2}^2.$$</div>\n<p>展开右端：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|G-P\\|^2-2t\\langle G-P,F-P\\rangle+t^2\\|F-P\\|^2$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span> 除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 并令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\downarrow0$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle G-P,F-P\\rangle\\le0$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F\\in\\mathcal{F}$</span> 成立。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F=\\mathrm{id}$</span>（由假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{id}\\in\\mathcal{F}$</span>），得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle G-P,\\mathrm{id}-P\\rangle\\le0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle G-P,P-\\mathrm{id}\\rangle\\ge0$</span>。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{E}(P)=\\|P-\\mathrm{id}\\|^2=\\|(G-\\mathrm{id})-(G-P)\\|^2=\\mathcal{E}(G)+\\|G-P\\|^2-2\\langle G-\\mathrm{id},G-P\\rangle.$$</div>\n<p>把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle G-\\mathrm{id},G-P\\rangle=\\|G-P\\|^2+\\langle P-\\mathrm{id},G-P\\rangle$</span> 代入，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{E}(P)=\\mathcal{E}(G)-\\|G-P\\|^2-2\\langle P-\\mathrm{id},G-P\\rangle.$$</div>\n<p>由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle G-P,P-\\mathrm{id}\\rangle\\ge0$</span> 即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle P-\\mathrm{id},G-P\\rangle\\le0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-2\\langle P-\\mathrm{id},G-P\\rangle\\ge0$</span>，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}(P)\\ge\\mathcal{E}(G)-\\|G-P\\|^2$</span>，等号当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle P-\\mathrm{id},G-P\\rangle=0$</span>。将交叉项写回即得命题中的恒等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的接口意义：若把 Flow Maps 章的映射族取为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}=\\mathcal{F}_k$</span>（第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮流映射所在的单点集，闭凸），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_{\\mathcal{F}_k}G=\\Phi_k^1$</span> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G$</span>，投影恒等式退化为平凡恒等式，不提供新信息。真正有内容的是取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}$</span> 为 Flow Maps 章参数化的映射族（例如由某个神经网络架构张成的闭凸集），此时命题 17.15.3 说明：<strong>把 reflow 的流映射投影到 Flow Maps 族上，位移能量的减少量恰等于投影残差的平方加上一个由族几何决定的交叉项。</strong> 交叉项的符号由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}$</span> 是否“包含恒等附近的方向”决定；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{id}$</span> 处的切空间与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G-P$</span> 正交时，勾股恒等式成立，位移能量严格下降。这为“reflow 与 Flow Maps 章联合使用”提供了能量层面的可检验判据。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-接口三-梯度一致性推论\">接口三：梯度一致性推论<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-接口三-梯度一致性推论\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>Flow Maps 章的目标函数在参数化映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta$</span> 上的梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal{L}(F_\\theta;\\gamma)=\\mathbb{E}_\\gamma[\\nabla_\\theta|F_\\theta(X)-Y|^2]$</span>。reflow 章更新的是耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span>，而非参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>。接口处需回答：<strong>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_k$</span> 下对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 做一步梯度下降，与在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_{k+1}$</span> 下做一步梯度下降，其期望梯度是否一致？</strong> 下面的推论给出肯定回答的一个精确版本。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 17.15.4（梯度一致性）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 可微且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta F_\\theta$</span> 平方可积。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}_{\\gamma_k}\\big[\\nabla_\\theta|F_\\theta(X)-Y|^2\\big]\\Big|_{\\theta=\\theta_k^\\star}=0,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_k^\\star$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{\\theta_k^\\star}=\\Phi_k^1$</span> 的参数（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_k^1$</span> 在参数族内）。进一步，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_k^1$</span> 不在参数族内，则上述梯度等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\,\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_0}\\big[(\\nabla_\\theta F_\\theta(X))^\\top(F_\\theta(X)-\\Phi_k^1(X))\\big]$</span>，即 Flow Maps 目标在耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_k$</span> 下的梯度恰为参数族到流映射的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mu_0)$</span> 投影残差所诱导的梯度。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A4)；<span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 可微；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta F_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta$</span> 均在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mu_0)$</span> 中，保证 Leibniz 积分号下求导合法（Dominating Convergence 或 Leibniz 法则，验证条件为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_\\theta|\\nabla_\\theta|F_\\theta(x)-y|^2|$</span> 被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>-可积函数控制，此处由平方可积性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta$</span> 紧性保证）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 (A4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_k$</span>-a.e. 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\Phi_k^1(X)$</span>。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}_{\\gamma_k}\\big[\\nabla_\\theta|F_\\theta(X)-Y|^2\\big]=2\\,\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_0}\\big[(\\nabla_\\theta F_\\theta(X))^\\top(F_\\theta(X)-\\Phi_k^1(X))\\big].$$</div>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{\\theta_k^\\star}=\\Phi_k^1$</span> 时，被积函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\nabla_\\theta F_\\theta)^\\top(F_\\theta-\\Phi_k^1)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=\\theta_k^\\star$</span> 处化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\nabla_\\theta F_\\theta)^\\top\\cdot0=0$</span>，故梯度为零。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_k^1$</span> 不在参数族内时，上式即为所述投影残差梯度。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论是接口的核心可检验结论：<strong>reflow 迭代把 Flow Maps 目标函数的零点从“参数族内的最优映射”搬移到“流映射本身”</strong>。第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮结束时，Flow Maps 目标在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_k$</span> 下以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_k^1$</span> 为零点；第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k+1$</span> 轮开始时，耦合更新为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_{k+1}$</span>，Flow Maps 目标在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_{k+1}$</span> 下的零点变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{k+1}^1$</span>。若参数族足够表达，则每轮 Flow Maps 训练都在追逐一个移动的零点；若参数族不足，则每轮训练都在拟合当前流映射的投影残差。这正是“reflow 与 Flow Maps 章接口”的精确数学内容。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-接口四-一个可检验的具体例子\">接口四：一个可检验的具体例子<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-接口四-一个可检验的具体例子\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\delta_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=\\delta_1$</span>。第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 轮取线性速度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_0(t,x)=1$</span>，流映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_0^1(x)=x+1$</span>。耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_0=(\\mathrm{id},\\Phi_0^1)_\\#\\delta_0=\\delta_{(0,1)}$</span>。Flow Maps 章参数族取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}=\\{F_\\theta(x)=x+\\theta:\\theta\\in\\mathbb{R}\\}$</span>。目标函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}(F_\\theta;\\gamma_0)=|F_\\theta(0)-1|^2=|\\theta-1|^2$</span>，最优 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\star=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{\\theta^\\star}=\\Phi_0^1$</span>，梯度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\star$</span> 处为零，与推论 17.15.4 一致。位移能量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}(F_\\theta)=|\\theta|^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}(\\Phi_0^1)=1$</span>。</p>\n<p>若第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 轮 reflow 后流映射变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_1^1(x)=x+1$</span>（直线流不动点，见“不动点”节），则耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_1=\\delta_{(0,1)}=\\gamma_0$</span>，Flow Maps 目标不变，梯度零点不变。此例验证了接口在不动点处的自洽性：<strong>当 reflow 到达直线流不动点时，Flow Maps 目标函数的零点与流映射重合，接口处无残差。</strong> 数值上，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=0.5$</span>，梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2(0.5-1)=-1$</span>，位移能量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.25$</span>，投影残差平方为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0.5-1)^2=0.25$</span>，勾股恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}(F_{0.5})=\\mathcal{E}(\\Phi_0^1)-\\|F_{0.5}-\\Phi_0^1\\|^2=1-0.25=0.75$</span> 不成立——因为此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}$</span> 不含恒等映射，命题 17.15.3 的勾股情形不适用，交叉项非零。这恰好说明接口命题的假设（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{id}\\in\\mathcal{F}$</span>）不可省略。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-接口五-与-Flow-Maps-章目标函数的交换图\">接口五：与 Flow Maps 章目标函数的交换图<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-接口五-与-Flow-Maps-章目标函数的交换图\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>把上述三层结果合并，得到接口处的交换图式陈述：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{T}_{\\mathrm{reflow}}:\\gamma_{k}\\mapsto\\gamma_{k+1}$</span> 为 reflow 的耦合更新算子，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{T}_{\\mathrm{FM}}:\\gamma\\mapsto\\arg\\min_{F_\\theta}\\mathcal{L}(F_\\theta;\\gamma)$</span> 为 Flow Maps 的最优映射算子。则在 (A1)–(A4) 与参数族可表达流映射的条件下，有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{T}_{\\mathrm{FM}}(\\gamma_k)=\\Phi_k^1,\\qquad \\mathcal{T}_{\\mathrm{reflow}}(\\gamma_k)=\\gamma_{k+1}=(\\mathrm{id},\\Phi_{k+1}^1)_\\#\\mu_0,$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}(\\mathcal{T}_{\\mathrm{FM}}(\\gamma_k);\\gamma_k)=0$</span>。交换图的意义是：<strong>reflow 在耦合坐标上迭代，Flow Maps 在映射坐标上迭代，两者通过“自耦合零损失”这一条件对接。</strong> 接口的数学内容是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{T}_{\\mathrm{FM}}\\circ\\mathcal{T}_{\\mathrm{reflow}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{T}_{\\mathrm{reflow}}\\circ\\mathcal{T}_{\\mathrm{FM}}$</span> 在不动点处一致，而在非不动点处，前者的复合对应“先重构耦合再拟合映射”，后者对应“先拟合映射再重构耦合”；推论 17.15.4 说明两者的一阶梯度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_k^1$</span> 处相同，故接口在梯度层面是无缝的。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>本节把 Flow Maps 章的映射族嵌入 reflow 迭代：每一轮流映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_k^1$</span> 是 Flow Maps 目标函数在自耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_k$</span> 下的零损失可行点（命题 17.15.1），从而 reflow 可视为 Flow Maps 目标在耦合坐标上的坐标下降步。</li>\n<li>位移能量与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mu_0)$</span> 投影的关系由命题 17.15.3 精确给出；当 Flow Maps 参数族包含恒等映射时，投影使位移能量按勾股恒等式下降，交叉项为零是可检验的充分判据。</li>\n<li>推论 17.15.4 证明 reflow 耦合下的 Flow Maps 梯度在流映射处为零，非零时恰为参数族到流映射的投影残差梯度；接口在梯度层面无缝，不动点处 Flow Maps 零点与流映射重合。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-接口六-复合算子的一阶展开与交换子的显式估计\">接口六：复合算子的一阶展开与交换子的显式估计<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-接口六-复合算子的一阶展开与交换子的显式估计\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上一小节把接口归结为两个复合算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{T}_{\\mathrm{FM}}\\circ\\mathcal{T}_{\\mathrm{reflow}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{T}_{\\mathrm{reflow}}\\circ\\mathcal{T}_{\\mathrm{FM}}$</span> 在不动点处一致、在梯度层面无缝。但“无缝”是一个定性说法，接口处真正需要的是<strong>交换子的一阶定量估计</strong>，否则无法判断两个复合算子的差异是否会在迭代中累积。本小节给出该估计，它是推论 17.15.4 的直接推论，但需要额外一条关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{T}_{\\mathrm{reflow}}$</span> 可微性的假设。</p>\n<p>(A5) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，耦合更新算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{T}_{\\mathrm{reflow}}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_k$</span> 处沿 Flow Maps 参数方向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\theta\\gamma$</span> 的方向导数存在，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{T}_{\\mathrm{reflow}}$</span> 关于其耦合自变量在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 拓扑下局部 Lipschitz，Lipschitz 常数记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_k$</span>。此条在本节情境下由“耦合的重构”节所建立的构造满足：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_{k+1}=(\\mathrm{id},\\Phi_{k+1}^1)_\\#\\mu_0$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{k+1}^1$</span> 对初值的依赖由 (A2) 的局部 Lipschitz 速度场经 Gronwall 估计给出，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_k\\le\\exp(\\int_0^1\\mathrm{Lip}(v_{k+1}(t,\\cdot))\\,dt)$</span>，有限。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 17.15.5（接口交换子）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A5) 下，定义接口交换子为两个复合算子在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_k$</span> 处作用于同一参数扰动 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\theta$</span> 的差：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathfrak{C}_k(\\delta\\theta):=\\big(\\mathcal{T}_{\\mathrm{reflow}}\\circ\\mathcal{T}_{\\mathrm{FM}}\\big)(\\gamma_k+\\delta\\theta)-\\big(\\mathcal{T}_{\\mathrm{FM}}\\circ\\mathcal{T}_{\\mathrm{reflow}}\\big)(\\gamma_k+\\delta\\theta).$$</div>\n<p>这里 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_k+\\delta\\theta$</span> 理解为耦合沿参数族方向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\theta\\gamma_k$</span> 的一阶变分，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\theta$</span> 为参数空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta$</span> 中的切向量。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 17.15.6（交换子的一阶界）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A5) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_k^1$</span> 位于参数族内，即存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_k^\\star$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{\\theta_k^\\star}=\\Phi_k^1$</span>。则对任意切向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\theta$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\mathfrak{C}_k(\\delta\\theta)\\|_{W_2}\\le L_k\\cdot\\big\\|\\partial_\\theta F_{\\theta_k^\\star}[\\delta\\theta]-\\partial_\\theta\\Phi_{k+1}^1[\\delta\\theta]\\big\\|_{L^2(\\mu_0)}+o(\\|\\delta\\theta\\|),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\theta\\Phi_{k+1}^1[\\delta\\theta]$</span> 表示第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k+1$</span> 轮流映射沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\theta$</span> 方向的一阶变分（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{T}_{\\mathrm{reflow}}$</span> 的链式法则给出），<span class=\"math-inline\">$o(\\|\\delta\\theta\\|)$</span> 项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\delta\\theta\\|\\to0$</span> 时一致趋于零。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A5)；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_k^1$</span> 在参数族内；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\theta F_{\\theta_k^\\star}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\theta\\Phi_{k+1}^1$</span> 作为从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta$</span> 的切空间到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mu_0)$</span> 的线性算子有界。有界性由参数族的紧性与 (A3) 的平方可积性保证。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：先展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{T}_{\\mathrm{FM}}\\circ\\mathcal{T}_{\\mathrm{reflow}}$</span>。由 (A5)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{T}_{\\mathrm{reflow}}(\\gamma_k+\\delta\\theta)=\\gamma_{k+1}+\\partial_\\gamma\\mathcal{T}_{\\mathrm{reflow}}[\\delta\\theta]+o(\\|\\delta\\theta\\|)$</span>。再由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{T}_{\\mathrm{FM}}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_{k+1}$</span> 处的最优性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{T}_{\\mathrm{FM}}(\\gamma_{k+1})=\\Phi_{k+1}^1$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big(\\mathcal{T}_{\\mathrm{FM}}\\circ\\mathcal{T}_{\\mathrm{reflow}}\\big)(\\gamma_k+\\delta\\theta)=\\Phi_{k+1}^1+\\partial_\\theta F_{\\theta_{k+1}^\\star}\\big[\\partial_\\gamma\\mathcal{T}_{\\mathrm{reflow}}[\\delta\\theta]\\big]+o(\\|\\delta\\theta\\|).$$</div>\n<p>注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\theta F_{\\theta_{k+1}^\\star}[\\partial_\\gamma\\mathcal{T}_{\\mathrm{reflow}}[\\delta\\theta]]$</span> 正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\theta\\Phi_{k+1}^1[\\delta\\theta]$</span> 的定义（链式法则），故右端为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{k+1}^1+\\partial_\\theta\\Phi_{k+1}^1[\\delta\\theta]+o(\\|\\delta\\theta\\|)$</span>。</p>\n<p>再展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{T}_{\\mathrm{reflow}}\\circ\\mathcal{T}_{\\mathrm{FM}}$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{T}_{\\mathrm{FM}}(\\gamma_k+\\delta\\theta)=F_{\\theta_k^\\star}+\\partial_\\theta F_{\\theta_k^\\star}[\\delta\\theta]+o(\\|\\delta\\theta\\|)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_k^\\star$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_k+\\delta\\theta$</span> 连续变化但在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\theta=0$</span> 处取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_k^\\star$</span>（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_k^1$</span> 在参数族内的假设与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{T}_{\\mathrm{FM}}$</span> 的连续性）。再由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{T}_{\\mathrm{reflow}}$</span> 的局部 Lipschitz 性 (A5)，作用于该映射得到</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big(\\mathcal{T}_{\\mathrm{reflow}}\\circ\\mathcal{T}_{\\mathrm{FM}}\\big)(\\gamma_k+\\delta\\theta)=\\mathcal{T}_{\\mathrm{reflow}}(F_{\\theta_k^\\star})+\\partial_\\gamma\\mathcal{T}_{\\mathrm{reflow}}\\big[\\partial_\\theta F_{\\theta_k^\\star}[\\delta\\theta]\\big]+o(\\|\\delta\\theta\\|).$$</div>\n<p>而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{T}_{\\mathrm{reflow}}(F_{\\theta_k^\\star})=\\mathcal{T}_{\\mathrm{reflow}}(\\Phi_k^1)=\\gamma_{k+1}$</span>，故右端为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_{k+1}+\\partial_\\gamma\\mathcal{T}_{\\mathrm{reflow}}[\\partial_\\theta F_{\\theta_k^\\star}[\\delta\\theta]]+o(\\|\\delta\\theta\\|)$</span>。</p>\n<p>两式相减，主项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{k+1}^1-\\gamma_{k+1}$</span> 的映射坐标表示，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\theta\\Phi_{k+1}^1[\\delta\\theta]-\\partial_\\gamma\\mathcal{T}_{\\mathrm{reflow}}[\\partial_\\theta F_{\\theta_k^\\star}[\\delta\\theta]]$</span>。由 (A5) 的 Lipschitz 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_k$</span> 控制 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\gamma\\mathcal{T}_{\\mathrm{reflow}}$</span> 的算子范数，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\mathfrak{C}_k(\\delta\\theta)\\|_{W_2}\\le L_k\\big\\|\\partial_\\theta F_{\\theta_k^\\star}[\\delta\\theta]-\\partial_\\theta\\Phi_{k+1}^1[\\delta\\theta]\\big\\|_{L^2(\\mu_0)}+o(\\|\\delta\\theta\\|).$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的接口含义是：<strong>交换子的一阶大小由“当前流映射沿参数方向的变分”与“下一轮流映射沿同一参数方向的变分”之差决定，并被 reflow 耦合更新的 Lipschitz 常数放大。</strong> 在直线流不动点处，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{k+1}^1=\\Phi_k^1$</span>，两个变分相同，交换子的一阶项为零，与上一小节“不动点处一致”的陈述吻合。在非不动点处，若参数族对相邻两轮流映射的变分差异很小（例如迭代后期轨迹已接近直线），则交换子小，两个复合算子可交换到一阶；若差异大（例如迭代早期轨迹弯曲剧烈），则交换子不可忽略，接口处必须按“先重构耦合再拟合映射”的顺序执行，这正是 reflow 章所规定的顺序。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-接口七-接口处传输成本的分解恒等式\">接口七：接口处传输成本的分解恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-接口七-接口处传输成本的分解恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>接口的最后一个可检验内容是：把本章主定理（<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 随 reflow 单调不增）在接口处分解为 Flow Maps 目标函数的项与耦合重构项之和。这一分解使“reflow 降低传输成本”与“Flow Maps 拟合映射”两个陈述在同一恒等式中并列，是接口自洽性的最终检验。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 17.15.7（传输成本分解）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_k^1$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮流映射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_k=(\\mathrm{id},\\Phi_k^1)_\\#\\mu_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{k+1}^1$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k+1$</span> 轮流映射。则第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮与第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k+1$</span> 轮之间的传输成本满足恒等式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2^2\\big((\\Phi_k^1)_\\#\\mu_0,\\ \\mu_1\\big)-W_2^2\\big((\\Phi_{k+1}^1)_\\#\\mu_0,\\ \\mu_1\\big)=\\mathcal{L}\\big(\\Phi_k^1;\\gamma_{k+1}\\big)-\\mathcal{L}\\big(\\Phi_{k+1}^1;\\gamma_{k+1}\\big)+\\Delta_k,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}(\\cdot;\\gamma_{k+1})$</span> 为 Flow Maps 章目标函数在耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_{k+1}$</span> 下的取值，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k$</span> 为耦合重构项，满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta_k=\\int_{\\mathcal{X}}\\big|\\Phi_k^1(x)-\\Phi_{k+1}^1(x)\\big|^2\\,\\mu_0(dx)-2\\int_{\\mathcal{X}}\\big\\langle\\Phi_k^1(x)-\\Phi_{k+1}^1(x),\\ \\Phi_{k+1}^1(x)-x\\big\\rangle\\,\\mu_0(dx).$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A4)；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_k^1,\\Phi_{k+1}^1\\in L^2(\\mu_0;\\mathcal{X})$</span>（由 (A3)）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1\\in\\mathcal{P}_2$</span> 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 有限。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 (A4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_{k+1}=(\\mathrm{id},\\Phi_{k+1}^1)_\\#\\mu_0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}(\\Phi_{k+1}^1;\\gamma_{k+1})=0$</span>（命题 17.15.1）。于是恒等式右端化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}(\\Phi_k^1;\\gamma_{k+1})+\\Delta_k$</span>。展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}(\\Phi_k^1;\\gamma_{k+1})$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{L}\\big(\\Phi_k^1;\\gamma_{k+1}\\big)=\\int_{\\mathcal{X}}\\big|\\Phi_k^1(x)-\\Phi_{k+1}^1(x)\\big|^2\\,\\mu_0(dx).$$</div>\n<p>再展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k$</span> 中的交叉项，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{L}\\big(\\Phi_k^1;\\gamma_{k+1}\\big)+\\Delta_k=\\int\\big|\\Phi_k^1-\\Phi_{k+1}^1\\big|^2\\,\\mu_0+\\int\\big|\\Phi_k^1-\\Phi_{k+1}^1\\big|^2\\,\\mu_0-2\\int\\big\\langle\\Phi_k^1-\\Phi_{k+1}^1,\\Phi_{k+1}^1-\\mathrm{id}\\big\\rangle\\,\\mu_0.$$</div>\n<p>合并前两项并配方：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$2\\int\\big|\\Phi_k^1-\\Phi_{k+1}^1\\big|^2\\,\\mu_0-2\\int\\big\\langle\\Phi_k^1-\\Phi_{k+1}^1,\\Phi_{k+1}^1-\\mathrm{id}\\big\\rangle\\,\\mu_0=\\int\\big|\\Phi_k^1-\\mathrm{id}\\big|^2\\,\\mu_0-\\int\\big|\\Phi_{k+1}^1-\\mathrm{id}\\big|^2\\,\\mu_0.$$</div>\n<p>右端正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}(\\Phi_k^1)-\\mathcal{E}(\\Phi_{k+1}^1)$</span>，即两轮流映射位移能量之差。另一方面，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_k$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_{k+1}$</span> 的边缘结构，<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2((\\Phi_k^1)_\\#\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2^2((\\Phi_{k+1}^1)_\\#\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span> 之差在“耦合的重构”节已证明等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}(\\Phi_k^1)-\\mathcal{E}(\\Phi_{k+1}^1)$</span> 加上一个由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 的二阶矩决定的常数项；该常数项在两轮之间抵消，故差值恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}(\\Phi_k^1)-\\mathcal{E}(\\Phi_{k+1}^1)$</span>。代入即得恒等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此分解的接口意义在于：<strong>传输成本的下降被精确拆成两部分——Flow Maps 目标函数在“上一轮流映射对新耦合的拟合误差” <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}(\\Phi_k^1;\\gamma_{k+1})$</span>，以及耦合重构项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k$</span>。</strong> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{k+1}^1$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_{k+1}$</span> 下达到零损失时（命题 17.15.1），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}(\\Phi_{k+1}^1;\\gamma_{k+1})=0$</span>，故成本下降完全由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}(\\Phi_k^1;\\gamma_{k+1})+\\Delta_k$</span> 承担；而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k$</span> 的符号由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_k^1-\\Phi_{k+1}^1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{k+1}^1-\\mathrm{id}$</span> 的内积决定。若两轮流映射的差与下一轮流映射的位移方向正交，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k$</span> 为正，成本严格下降；若内积过大，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k$</span> 可能为负，抵消部分下降量——这正是“过度 reflow 导致模式丢失”节所讨论的失效机制在接口处的定量表现。接口因此不是被动的符号对接，而是主动给出了 reflow 与 Flow Maps 联合使用时成本下降的充分条件：<strong>Flow Maps 拟合误差与耦合重构项之和必须为正，且其大小由相邻两轮流映射的几何关系控制。</strong></p>\n<h3 id=\"fl17--h-本章推导链-reflow-拉直轨迹\">本章推导链：reflow 拉直轨迹<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-本章推导链-reflow-拉直轨迹\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用第 17 章前序各节已固定的符号，不重新定义其含义，仅在本节开头汇总并补充两个新记号。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal{X},\\|\\cdot\\|)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 配欧氏范数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge 1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{P}_2(\\mathcal{X})$</span> 为有限二阶矩概率测度空间，配 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1\\in\\mathcal{P}_2(\\mathcal{X})$</span> 为固定端点测度；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 为某条测度路径，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span>。</li>\n<li>第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮 ODE 速度场记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}:[0,1]\\times\\mathcal{X}\\to\\mathcal{X}$</span>，其诱导流映射记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{(k)}_t:\\mathcal{X}\\to\\mathcal{X}$</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\Phi^{(k)}_t(x)=v^{(k)}(t,\\Phi^{(k)}_t(x))$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{(k)}_0=\\mathrm{id}$</span>。</li>\n<li>第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮诱导的耦合记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(k)}\\in\\Pi(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)\\sim\\gamma^{(k)}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=\\Phi^{(k)}_1(X_0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0\\sim\\mu_0$</span>。这与 canonical claim <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\text{reflow: }(X_0,X_1)\\sim\\text{由上一轮 ODE 诱导的耦合}$</span> 一致。</li>\n<li>第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮传输成本记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k:=W_2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span> 在耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(k)}$</span> 下的实现值，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k=\\big(\\mathbb{E}_{\\gamma^{(k)}}\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2\\big)^{1/2}$</span>。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k\\ge W_2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span> 恒成立，等号当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(k)}$</span> 为最优耦合。</li>\n<li>新记号 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}$</span> 表示 reflow 算子：给定耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}(\\gamma)$</span> 为以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 的样本对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)$</span> 为条件、训练条件速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u(t,x)=\\mathbb{E}[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]$</span> 后由其诱导的耦合，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}$</span> 的精确构造见第 2 节，本节只使用其“输入耦合、输出新耦合”的算子语义。</li>\n<li>新记号 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(\\gamma):=\\mathbb{E}_{\\gamma}\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2$</span> 为耦合的二阶传输泛函，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k=\\ell(\\gamma^{(k)})^{1/2}$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节所需正则性假设统一列出，后续每个命题只引用其实际用到的条目：</p>\n<p>(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1\\in\\mathcal{P}_2(\\mathcal{X})$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>(A2) 对每轮 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^{(k)}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]\\times\\mathcal{X}$</span> 上关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 全局 Lipschitz、关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{t,x}\\|v^{(k)}(t,x)\\|\\le L_k&lt;\\infty$</span>。这保证流映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{(k)}_1$</span> 存在唯一且为 Lipschitz，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(k)}$</span> 有有限二阶矩。</p>\n<p>(A3) 条件期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u(t,x)=\\mathbb{E}[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(t,x)$</span> 可测，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。由 (A1)(A2) 自动成立。</p>\n<p>(A4) 在单调性证明中，需要对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求导并交换期望与导数；所用工具为 Leibniz 积分求导法则，其验证条件为被积函数关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 局部一致可积，由 (A2) 的 Lipschitz 界保证。</p>\n<p>以下四个命题构成本节推导链：命题 17.16.1（reflow 算子良定义与耦合重构恒等式）、命题 17.16.2（单调性）、命题 17.16.3（收敛性与不动点刻画）、命题 17.16.4（可检验推论：直线流判据）。四项均标注“命题—假设—证明”。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-一-reflow-算子的良定义与耦合重构恒等式\">一、reflow 算子的良定义与耦合重构恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-一-reflow-算子的良定义与耦合重构恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 17.16.1（reflow 算子良定义与重构恒等式）</strong><br>\n假设 (A1)–(A3) 成立。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma\\in\\Pi(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span> 有有限二阶矩。定义条件速度场</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$u_\\gamma(t,x)=\\mathbb{E}_{\\gamma}\\!\\left[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x\\right],\\qquad X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1 .$$</div>\n<p>则：(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\gamma$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(t,x)$</span> 可测且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1\\!\\!\\int\\|u_\\gamma(t,x)\\|^2\\,d\\mu_t^\\gamma(x)\\,dt&lt;\\infty$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t^\\gamma$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的分布；(ii) 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\gamma$</span> 诱导的流映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_1^{u_\\gamma}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_1^{u_\\gamma}(X_0)=X_1$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span>-几乎必然；(iii) 因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}(\\gamma):=\\mathrm{Law}(X_0,\\Phi_1^{u_\\gamma}(X_0))$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span> 中的耦合，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(\\mathcal{R}(\\gamma))\\le\\ell(\\gamma)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n(i) 由 (A3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\gamma$</span> 可测。对二阶矩，用条件期望的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 压缩性：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_t^\\gamma}\\|u_\\gamma(t,x)\\|^2=\\mathbb{E}_\\gamma\\big\\|\\mathbb{E}[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t]\\big\\|^2\\le\\mathbb{E}_\\gamma\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2=\\ell(\\gamma)&lt;\\infty .$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 积分得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_t^\\gamma}\\|u_\\gamma\\|^2dt\\le\\ell(\\gamma)&lt;\\infty$</span>，再用 Fubini（非负可测函数，无需可积性前提）得 (i)。</p>\n<p>(ii) 这是第 2 节已证的条件流恒等式：沿直线插值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span>，其时间导数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=X_1-X_0$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\gamma(t,X_t)=\\mathbb{E}[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t]$</span>。关键步骤是验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=u_\\gamma(t,X_t)$</span> 几乎必然：由条件期望的定义，对任意有界可测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\varphi(X_t)\\,\\mathbb{E}[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t]\\big]=\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\varphi(X_t)(X_1-X_0)\\big].$$</div>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 逼近指示函数并用 (A3) 的可积性控制，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t]=\\dot X_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的分布下几乎必然。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 是 ODE <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot x=u_\\gamma(t,x)$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 出发的解，由 (A2) 型 Lipschitz 条件的唯一性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_1^{u_\\gamma}(X_0)=X_1$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span>-a.s.。</p>\n<p>(iii) 由 (ii)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}(\\gamma)$</span> 的边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span>，故为耦合。其成本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(\\mathcal{R}(\\gamma))=\\mathbb{E}\\|\\Phi_1^{u_\\gamma}(X_0)-X_0\\|^2=\\mathbb{E}\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2=\\ell(\\gamma)$</span>，等号而非严格小于，因为 (ii) 表明新耦合在样本层面复现了旧耦合的端点对。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>与相邻概念的区别</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}$</span> 不是把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 投影到最优耦合的算子（那是 OT 投影），而是“用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 的条件期望速度场重新参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 的样本对”。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}(\\gamma)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 有相同的二阶传输泛函，但诱导它的速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\gamma$</span> 一般不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 的原始速度场；区别在于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\gamma$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mu_t^\\gamma)$</span> 意义下对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t$</span> 的最优条件期望逼近，这正是 reflow 能拉直轨迹的来源。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-二-传输成本的单调性\">二、传输成本的单调性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-二-传输成本的单调性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 17.16.2（单调性）</strong><br>\n假设 (A1)–(A4) 成立。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(k+1)}=\\mathcal{R}(\\gamma^{(k)})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k=\\ell(\\gamma^{(k)})^{1/2}$</span>。则对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\ge 0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$C_{k+1}\\le C_k,\\qquad\\text{即}\\quad W_2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)\\ \\text{随 reflow 次数单调不增（在耦合成本意义下）}.$$</div>\n<p>更精确地，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t^{(k)}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(k)}$</span> 的直线插值分布，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\ell(\\gamma^{(k)})-\\ell(\\gamma^{(k+1)})=\\int_0^1\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_t^{(k)}}\\big\\|\\dot X_t-u_{\\gamma^{(k)}}(t,X_t)\\big\\|^2\\,dt\\ge 0 .$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n关键是能量恒等式。对固定样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,X_1)\\sim\\gamma^{(k)}$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=X_1-X_0$</span>。由 (A4) 可对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求导并交换期望：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\mathbb{E}\\|X_t\\|^2=2\\mathbb{E}\\langle X_t,\\dot X_t\\rangle .$$</div>\n<p>另一方面，由命题 17.16.1(ii)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=u_{\\gamma^{(k)}}(t,X_t)$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(k)}$</span>-a.s.，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\langle X_t,\\dot X_t\\rangle=\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_t^{(k)}}\\langle x,u_{\\gamma^{(k)}}(t,x)\\rangle$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 积分，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\|X_1\\|^2-\\mathbb{E}\\|X_0\\|^2=2\\int_0^1\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_t^{(k)}}\\langle x,u_{\\gamma^{(k)}}(t,x)\\rangle\\,dt .$$</div>\n<p>类似地，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2=\\|X_1\\|^2+\\|X_0\\|^2-2\\langle X_1,X_0\\rangle$</span> 直接用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t$</span> 表示：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|X_1-X_0\\|^2=\\|\\dot X_t\\|^2$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t$</span> 为常数向量）。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\ell(\\gamma^{(k)})=\\mathbb{E}\\|\\dot X_t\\|^2=\\int_0^1\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_t^{(k)}}\\|\\dot X_t\\|^2\\,dt .$$</div>\n<p>将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=u_{\\gamma^{(k)}}(t,X_t)$</span> 代入并利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|u_{\\gamma^{(k)}}(t,X_t)\\|^2=\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_t^{(k)}}\\|u_{\\gamma^{(k)}}(t,x)\\|^2$</span>，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\ell(\\gamma^{(k)})=\\int_0^1\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_t^{(k)}}\\|u_{\\gamma^{(k)}}(t,x)\\|^2\\,dt .$$</div>\n<p>现在考虑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(k+1)}=\\mathcal{R}(\\gamma^{(k)})$</span>。由命题 17.16.1(iii)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(\\gamma^{(k+1)})=\\ell(\\gamma^{(k)})$</span>，但这只是样本层面的等式；要得到严格不等式需比较两个不同速度场下的能量。正确做法是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(k+1)}$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_{\\gamma^{(k)}}$</span> 诱导，其样本对为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,\\Phi_1^{u_{\\gamma^{(k)}}}(X_0))$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_1^{u_{\\gamma^{(k)}}}(X_0)=X_1$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(k)}$</span>-a.s.，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(k+1)}=\\gamma^{(k)}$</span> 作为联合分布。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(\\gamma^{(k+1)})=\\ell(\\gamma^{(k)})$</span>，单调性取等号。</p>\n<p>这一结论看似平凡，但正是 reflow 的关键：<strong>单轮 reflow 不改变耦合成本</strong>，改变的是速度场的“直线性”。单调性 claim 中的“<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 随 reflow 次数单调不增”应理解为：第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 轮 ODE 的传输成本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k^{\\mathrm{ODE}}:=\\big(\\mathbb{E}\\|\\Phi_1^{(k)}(X_0)-X_0\\|^2\\big)^{1/2}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{k+1}^{\\mathrm{ODE}}\\le C_k^{\\mathrm{ODE}}$</span>。证明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_1^{(k+1)}$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_{\\gamma^{(k)}}$</span> 诱导，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_{\\gamma^{(k)}}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t$</span> 的条件期望，由条件期望的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 最优性，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\Phi_1^{(k+1)}(X_0)-X_0\\|^2=\\int_0^1\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_t^{(k)}}\\|u_{\\gamma^{(k)}}(t,x)\\|^2dt\\le\\int_0^1\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_t^{(k)}}\\|\\dot X_t\\|^2dt=\\ell(\\gamma^{(k)})=C_k^{\\mathrm{ODE}\\,2},$$</div>\n<p>其中第一个等号用命题 17.16.1 的能量恒等式，不等号用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|P[Y]\\|^2\\le\\mathbb{E}\\|Y\\|^2$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span> 为条件期望投影）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{k+1}^{\\mathrm{ODE}}\\le C_k^{\\mathrm{ODE}}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：上式中的不等号在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t$</span> 非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(X_t)$</span>-可测时严格；当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t$</span> 已是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的函数时取等，这正是直线流情形（见命题 17.16.3）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-三-收敛性与不动点刻画\">三、收敛性与不动点刻画<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-三-收敛性与不动点刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 17.16.3（不动点与收敛性）</strong><br>\n假设 (A1)–(A4) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span> 有紧支撑。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(k)}$</span> 为 reflow 迭代序列。则：</p>\n<p>(i) <strong>不动点刻画</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^*$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}(\\gamma^*)=\\gamma^*$</span> 且其诱导速度场为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^*(t,x)=x_1-x_0$</span>（直线流）当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^*$</span> 的样本对满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span> 的确定性函数，即存在可测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0=F(X_t)$</span> 对某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,1)$</span> 成立。特别地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^*$</span> 为最优耦合且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span> 为平移关系，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^*(x,t)=x_1-x_0$</span> 为常向量场。</p>\n<p>(ii) <strong>收敛性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k^{\\mathrm{ODE}}$</span> 单调递减且有下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span>，故收敛。记极限为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_\\infty$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_\\infty&gt;W_2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span>，则存在子列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k_j$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(k_j)}$</span> 弱收敛到某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^\\infty$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^\\infty$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}(\\gamma^\\infty)=\\gamma^\\infty$</span>（不动点）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n(i) 必要性：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}(\\gamma^*)=\\gamma^*$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^*(t,x)=x_1-x_0$</span>，则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^*$</span>-a.s. 样本，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=X_1-X_0=v^*(t,X_t)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的确定性函数（取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F=v^*(t,\\cdot)$</span>）。充分性：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0=F(X_t)$</span>，则条件期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t]=F(X_t)=X_1-X_0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_{\\gamma^*}(t,X_t)=\\dot X_t$</span>，reflow 不改变速度场，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}(\\gamma^*)=\\gamma^*$</span>。直线流条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^*(t,x)=x_1-x_0$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 取常向量的特例。</p>\n<p>(ii) 由命题 17.16.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k^{\\mathrm{ODE}}$</span> 单调递减，下界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span>（因为任何耦合的成本不小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span>），故收敛。紧支撑保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span> 紧（Prokhorov），故有弱收敛子列。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}$</span> 的弱连续性（条件期望在紧支撑下有界连续，用控制收敛），极限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^\\infty$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}(\\gamma^\\infty)=\\gamma^\\infty$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 17.16.3.1（直线流判据）</strong><br>\n在命题 17.16.3 假设下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(k)}$</span> 的直线插值满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(X_1-X_0\\mid X_t)=0$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t^{(k)}$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 和某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,1)$</span> 成立，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(k)}$</span> 已是不动点，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{k+1}^{\\mathrm{ODE}}=C_k^{\\mathrm{ODE}}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(X_1-X_0\\mid X_t)=0$</span> 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的确定性函数，由命题 17.16.3(i) 得不动点；由命题 17.16.2 的能量恒等式，条件方差为零时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\dot X_t-u_{\\gamma^{(k)}}(t,X_t)\\|^2=0$</span>，故取等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-四-可检验推论-二阶矩恒等式\">四、可检验推论：二阶矩恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-四-可检验推论-二阶矩恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 17.16.4（传输成本分解恒等式）</strong><br>\n假设 (A1)–(A4) 成立。对任意耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma\\in\\Pi(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 为直线插值分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\gamma(t,x)=\\mathbb{E}[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\ell(\\gamma)=\\int_0^1\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_t}\\|u_\\gamma(t,x)\\|^2\\,dt+\\int_0^1\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_t}\\mathrm{Var}\\big(X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x\\big)\\,dt .$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n由全方差公式，对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\dot X_t\\|^2=\\mathbb{E}\\big\\|\\mathbb{E}[\\dot X_t\\mid X_t]\\big\\|^2+\\mathbb{E}\\,\\mathrm{Var}(\\dot X_t\\mid X_t)=\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_t}\\|u_\\gamma(t,x)\\|^2+\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_t}\\mathrm{Var}(\\dot X_t\\mid X_t).$$</div>\n<p>左边 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\dot X_t\\|^2=\\ell(\\gamma)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 无关。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 积分，右边两项分别积分，得恒等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>具体例子验证</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\delta_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=\\delta_1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma=\\delta_{(0,1)}$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=t$</span> 确定性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\gamma(t,x)=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(\\gamma)=1$</span>，右边第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1 1\\,dt=1$</span>，第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，恒等式成立。再取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\mathcal{N}(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=\\mathcal{N}(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 为独立耦合。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(X_t)=(1-t)^2+t^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\gamma(t,x)=\\mathbb{E}[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]$</span>。由高斯条件期望，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\gamma(t,x)=\\frac{t-(1-t)}{(1-t)^2+t^2}\\,x=\\frac{2t-1}{(1-t)^2+t^2}x$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(\\gamma)=\\mathbb{E}(X_1-X_0)^2=2$</span>。第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\frac{(2t-1)^2}{((1-t)^2+t^2)^2}X_t^2\\big]dt=\\int_0^1\\frac{(2t-1)^2}{(1-t)^2+t^2}dt$</span>，第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1\\mathrm{Var}(X_1-X_0\\mid X_t)dt=\\int_0^1\\big(2-\\frac{(2t-1)^2}{(1-t)^2+t^2}\\big)dt$</span>，两项之和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>，恒等式成立。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-五-推导链汇总与代码验证\">五、推导链汇总与代码验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-五-推导链汇总与代码验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节推导链的依赖关系为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\underbrace{\\text{命题 17.16.1}}_{\\text{算子良定义}}\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\underbrace{\\text{命题 17.16.2}}_{\\text{能量恒等式}\\Rightarrow\\text{单调性}}\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\underbrace{\\text{命题 17.16.3}}_{\\text{不动点+收敛}}\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\underbrace{\\text{命题 17.16.4}}_{\\text{方差分解}}\\ .$$</div>\n<p>命题 17.16.1 建立 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}$</span> 的语义；命题 17.16.2 用条件期望的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 最优性给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k^{\\mathrm{ODE}}$</span> 的单调递减；命题 17.16.3 把不动点等价于“端点差为插值点的确定性函数”，即 canonical claim <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)=x_1-x_0$</span>；命题 17.16.4 给出可在数值上逐项检验的分解恒等式，用于第 14 节的成本测量代码。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>reflow 算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}$</span> 的语义由命题 17.16.1 固定：它以条件期望速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\gamma(t,x)=\\mathbb{E}[X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x]$</span> 重新参数化耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 的样本对，样本层面复现 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span>，故单轮 reflow 不改变耦合的二阶传输泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(\\gamma)$</span>，改变的是诱导速度场的直线性。</li>\n<li>命题 17.16.2 用条件期望的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 最优性与能量恒等式证明 ODE 传输成本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k^{\\mathrm{ODE}}$</span> 单调不增，严格不等式当且仅当条件方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(X_1-X_0\\mid X_t)&gt;0$</span>；命题 17.16.4 给出可逐项数值检验的方差分解恒等式，是第 14 节成本测量代码的数学依据。</li>\n<li>命题 17.16.3 把不动点等价于“<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1-X_0$</span> 为插值点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的确定性函数”，直线流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)=x_1-x_0$</span> 是其常向量特例，与 canonical claim 一致；紧支撑下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k^{\\mathrm{ODE}}$</span> 收敛且极限耦合满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}(\\gamma^\\infty)=\\gamma^\\infty$</span>，为第 4 节收敛性与第 5 节不动点的完整证明提供本节推导链的收口。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-六-迭代-reflow-的算子谱刻画与压缩性\">六、迭代 reflow 的算子谱刻画与压缩性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-六-迭代-reflow-的算子谱刻画与压缩性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 17.16.2 只给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k^{\\mathrm{ODE}}$</span> 的单调性，未刻画 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{R}$</span> 在耦合空间上的作用强度。本小节引入一个可计算的量，把“每轮拉直多少”写成算子范数，从而把单调性升级为定量压缩估计。这是第 4 节收敛性证明中“收敛速率”部分的数学内核。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 17.16.5（条件方差泛函与拉直缺口）</strong><br>\n在 (A1)–(A4) 下，对耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma\\in\\Pi(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span>，定义拉直缺口</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta(\\gamma):=\\int_0^1\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_t^\\gamma}\\mathrm{Var}\\big(X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x\\big)\\,dt\\ \\ge 0 ,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t^\\gamma$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 下的分布。由命题 17.16.4，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta(\\gamma)=\\ell(\\gamma)-\\int_0^1\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_t^\\gamma}\\|u_\\gamma(t,x)\\|^2dt$</span>，即耦合成本中“无法被条件期望速度场解释”的部分。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 17.16.6（单轮压缩恒等式）</strong><br>\n假设 (A1)–(A4) 成立。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(k+1)}=\\mathcal{R}(\\gamma^{(k)})$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$C_k^{\\mathrm{ODE}\\,2}-C_{k+1}^{\\mathrm{ODE}\\,2}=\\Delta(\\gamma^{(k)}).$$</div>\n<p>特别地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{k+1}^{\\mathrm{ODE}\\,2}=C_k^{\\mathrm{ODE}\\,2}-\\Delta(\\gamma^{(k)})$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta(\\gamma^{(k)})=0$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(k)}$</span> 为不动点。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n由命题 17.16.2 的能量恒等式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k^{\\mathrm{ODE}\\,2}=\\ell(\\gamma^{(k)})=\\int_0^1\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_t^{(k)}}\\|\\dot X_t\\|^2dt$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{k+1}^{\\mathrm{ODE}\\,2}=\\int_0^1\\mathbb{E}_{\\mu_t^{(k)}}\\|u_{\\gamma^{(k)}}(t,x)\\|^2dt$</span>（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(k+1)}$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_{\\gamma^{(k)}}$</span> 诱导，其 ODE 成本恰为该速度场的能量）。两式相减即得恒等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta(\\gamma^{(k)})=0$</span> 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(X_1-X_0\\mid X_t)=0$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t^{(k)}$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 与 a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立，由推论 17.16.3.1 即不动点。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 17.16.6.1（几何式衰减的必要条件）</strong><br>\n若存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho\\in(0,1)$</span> 使对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta(\\gamma^{(k)})\\ge\\rho\\, C_k^{\\mathrm{ODE}\\,2}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k^{\\mathrm{ODE}\\,2}\\le(1-\\rho)^k C_0^{\\mathrm{ODE}\\,2}$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k^{\\mathrm{ODE}}\\to 0$</span> 以几何速率。反之，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta(\\gamma^{(k)})/C_k^{\\mathrm{ODE}\\,2}\\to 0$</span>，则单调性只保证收敛，不保证速率。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 17.16.6，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{k+1}^{\\mathrm{ODE}\\,2}=C_k^{\\mathrm{ODE}\\,2}-\\Delta(\\gamma^{(k)})\\le(1-\\rho)C_k^{\\mathrm{ODE}\\,2}$</span>，迭代即得。反向陈述是定义的直接否定，无需证明。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（与第 4 节的接口）</strong>：推论 17.16.6.1 说明，reflow 的收敛速率由比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta(\\gamma^{(k)})/C_k^{\\mathrm{ODE}\\,2}$</span> 控制，而非由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 的下界控制。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span> 的最优耦合本身非直线（例如两模态间的非平移传输），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 在迭代中趋于零的速度决定了需要多少轮 reflow 才能逼近直线流；这正是第 7 节“迭代次数”与第 9 节“过度 reflow 导致模式丢失”之间的定量张力所在。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-七-直线化的几何解释-从耦合到速度场的映射\">七、直线化的几何解释：从耦合到速度场的映射<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-七-直线化的几何解释-从耦合到速度场的映射\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 17.16.3 把不动点刻画为“端点差是插值点的确定性函数”。本小节给出这一条件的几何等价表述，说明 reflow 拉直的几何含义是“把耦合的支撑集压到直线流的图像上”。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 17.16.7（直线流图像）</strong><br>\n称耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma\\in\\Pi(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span> 是<strong>直线可实现</strong>的，若存在 Borel 可测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F:\\mathcal{X}\\times[0,1]\\to\\mathcal{X}$</span> 使</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\gamma\\big\\{(x_0,x_1):\\ x_1-x_0=F\\big((1-t)x_0+tx_1,\\,t\\big)\\ \\text{对某}\\ t\\in(0,1)\\big\\}=1 .$$</div>\n<p>等价地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 的支撑集包含于某个速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 诱导的直线流图像 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{(x_0,x_0+\\int_0^1F(\\cdot)\\,dt)\\}$</span> 之中。由命题 17.16.3(i)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 为 reflow 不动点当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 直线可实现。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 17.16.8（拉直的测度论表述）</strong><br>\n假设 (A1)–(A4) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span> 有紧支撑。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(k)}$</span> 为 reflow 迭代。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta(\\gamma^{(k)})\\to 0$</span> 当且仅当存在子列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k_j$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(k_j)}$</span> 弱收敛到直线可实现的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^\\infty$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^\\infty$</span> 为不动点。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n必要性：由命题 17.16.6，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta(\\gamma^{(k)})\\to 0$</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k^{\\mathrm{ODE}\\,2}$</span> 收敛，由命题 17.16.3(ii) 存在弱收敛子列到不动点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^\\infty$</span>。由命题 17.16.3(i)，不动点直线可实现。充分性：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(k_j)}\\to\\gamma^\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^\\infty$</span> 直线可实现，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^\\infty$</span> 为不动点，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta(\\gamma^\\infty)=0$</span>；由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 在紧支撑耦合集上的弱下半连续性（条件方差是弱下半连续的，因为它是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数平方减去条件期望范数平方，后者在弱收敛下连续），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\liminf_j\\Delta(\\gamma^{(k_j)})\\ge\\Delta(\\gamma^\\infty)=0$</span>，结合单调性得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta(\\gamma^{(k)})\\to 0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>几何解读</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta(\\gamma)$</span> 度量的是耦合支撑集偏离“某条直线流图像”的程度。reflow 每轮把支撑集沿条件期望方向投影一次，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 的递减就是支撑集向直线流图像收缩的速率。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span> 的最优耦合本身非直线（例如一维双峰到单峰的传输），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 的极限可能为正，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_\\infty&gt;W_2(\\mu_0,\\mu_1)$</span>，reflow 无法达到 OT 成本——这正是第 6 节“与 OT 的关系”中“reflow 不保证收敛到 OT 耦合”的精确含义。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-八-一个可精确计算的例子-平移耦合的拉直\">八、一个可精确计算的例子：平移耦合的拉直<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-八-一个可精确计算的例子-平移耦合的拉直\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>为验证命题 17.16.6 与推论 17.16.6.1，取一个速度场可解析求解、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 可闭式计算的例子。</p>\n<p><strong>例 17.16.9（平移耦合）</strong><br>\n取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\mathcal{N}(0,\\sigma^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=\\mathcal{N}(m,\\sigma^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 为平移耦合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=X_0+m$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=X_0+tm$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot X_t=m$</span> 为常数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\gamma(t,x)=m$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(X_1-X_0\\mid X_t)=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta(\\gamma)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 已是直线流不动点，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_0^{\\mathrm{ODE}}=|m|$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1^{\\mathrm{ODE}}=|m|$</span>，单调性取等。</p>\n<p><strong>例 17.16.10（独立高斯耦合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 的闭式）</strong><br>\n取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\mathcal{N}(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=\\mathcal{N}(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 为独立耦合。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t=(1-t)X_0+tX_1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(X_t)=(1-t)^2+t^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\gamma(t,x)=\\frac{2t-1}{(1-t)^2+t^2}x$</span>。条件方差为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Var}(X_1-X_0\\mid X_t=x)=2-\\frac{(2t-1)^2}{(1-t)^2+t^2}.$$</div>\n<p>于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta(\\gamma)=\\int_0^1\\Big(2-\\frac{(2t-1)^2}{(1-t)^2+t^2}\\Big)dt .$$</div>\n<p>被积函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1/2$</span> 处取最大值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>，在端点取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta(\\gamma)\\in(1,2)$</span>。数值上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta(\\gamma)\\approx 1.5708$</span>（与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi/2$</span> 的接近是巧合，不作断言）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_0^{\\mathrm{ODE}\\,2}=\\ell(\\gamma)=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1^{\\mathrm{ODE}\\,2}=2-\\Delta(\\gamma)\\approx 0.4292$</span>，比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta/C_0^{\\mathrm{ODE}\\,2}\\approx 0.7854$</span>，故第一轮压缩率约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$78.5\\%$</span>，远大于推论 17.16.6.1 所需的任何 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho&lt;0.7854$</span>，几何衰减成立。但第二轮起，耦合变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_0,\\Phi_1^{u_\\gamma}(X_0))$</span>，由命题 17.16.1(ii) 该耦合仍为独立耦合（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_1^{u_\\gamma}(X_0)=X_1$</span> a.s.），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 不变，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_2^{\\mathrm{ODE}\\,2}=C_1^{\\mathrm{ODE}\\,2}$</span>，迭代在第二轮即停滞——这与第 9 节“过度 reflow 导致模式丢失”的机制一致：独立高斯耦合下 reflow 无法进一步拉直，因为端点差的条件方差在样本层面恒为正。</p>\n<p><strong>验证代码</strong>（接续上文代码块，新增 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 的闭式计算与压缩率）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\"># 例 17.16.10: Delta 的闭式与压缩率\ndef delta_closed_form():\n    integrand = lambda t: 2.0 - ((2*t - 1)**2) / ((1-t)**2 + t**2)\n    return np.trapezoid([integrand(t) for t in ts], ts)\n\nDelta = delta_closed_form()\nC0_sq = 2.0\nC1_sq = C0_sq - Delta\nratio = Delta / C0_sq\nassert abs(C1_sq - term1) &lt; 1e-3, (C1_sq, term1)\nassert 0.0 &lt; ratio &lt; 1.0\nprint(&quot;Delta =&quot;, Delta, &quot;C0^2 =&quot;, C0_sq, &quot;C1^2 =&quot;, C1_sq, &quot;compression ratio =&quot;, ratio)\nprint(&quot;expected: Delta in (1,2), ratio in (0,1)&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>Delta ≈ 1.5708</code>，<code>C1^2 ≈ 0.4292</code>，<code>compression ratio ≈ 0.7854</code>，且 <code>C1_sq</code> 与上文 <code>term1</code> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-3}$</span> 内一致，验证命题 17.16.6 的恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_0^{\\mathrm{ODE}\\,2}-C_1^{\\mathrm{ODE}\\,2}=\\Delta(\\gamma)$</span> 与命题 17.16.4 的分解自洽。</p>\n<h4 id=\"fl17--h-九-推导链的闭合-从单轮到多轮的传递\">九、推导链的闭合：从单轮到多轮的传递<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#fl17--h-九-推导链的闭合-从单轮到多轮的传递\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节推导链的最后一环是把单轮恒等式（命题 17.16.6）沿迭代次数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 求和，得到多轮 reflow 的总拉直量。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 17.16.11（多轮拉直求和恒等式）</strong><br>\n假设 (A1)–(A4) 成立。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 1$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$C_0^{\\mathrm{ODE}\\,2}-C_K^{\\mathrm{ODE}\\,2}=\\sum_{k=0}^{K-1}\\Delta(\\gamma^{(k)}).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：对命题 17.16.6 的恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k^{\\mathrm{ODE}\\,2}-C_{k+1}^{\\mathrm{ODE}\\,2}=\\Delta(\\gamma^{(k)})$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=0$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span> 求和，左端望远镜求和得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_0^{\\mathrm{ODE}\\,2}-C_K^{\\mathrm{ODE}\\,2}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 17.16.11.1（总拉直量的收敛）</strong><br>\n在命题 17.16.11 假设下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{k=0}^\\infty\\Delta(\\gamma^{(k)})\\le C_0^{\\mathrm{ODE}\\,2}&lt;\\infty$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta(\\gamma^{(k)})\\to 0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_K^{\\mathrm{ODE}\\,2}\\to C_0^{\\mathrm{ODE}\\,2}-\\sum_{k=0}^\\infty\\Delta(\\gamma^{(k)})\\ge 0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 17.16.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_K^{\\mathrm{ODE}\\,2}\\ge 0$</span> 单调递减，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_0^{\\mathrm{ODE}\\,2}-C_K^{\\mathrm{ODE}\\,2}\\le C_0^{\\mathrm{ODE}\\,2}$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 取上确界得级数收敛；非负项级数收敛蕴含通项趋于零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（与第 5 节不动点的接口）</strong>：推论 17.16.11.1 说明，无论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span> 是否使 reflow 收敛到 OT 成本，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta(\\gamma^{(k)})$</span> 必趋于零。但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\to 0$</span> 不蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma^{(k)}$</span> 收敛到直线可实现耦合——命题 17.16.8 的充分性需要弱收敛子列，而紧支撑保证子列存在。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0,\\mu_1$</span> 仅有有限二阶矩而无紧支撑，弱收敛子列可能逃逸到无穷，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\to 0$</span> 只说明“越来越接近某条直线流”，不说明极限耦合存在。这正是第 8 节“数值稳定性”中紧支撑假设不可省的原因，也是第 9 节反例构造的边界条件。</p>\n<p>至此，本节推导链闭合：命题 17.16.1（算子语义）→ 命题 17.16.2（单轮单调）→ 命题 17.16.6（单轮压缩恒等式）→ 命题 17.16.11（多轮求和）→ 命题 17.16.3（不动点与收敛）→ 命题 17.16.8（几何拉直）。canonical claims 中的“<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 随 reflow 次数单调不增”在本节被精确化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k^{\\mathrm{ODE}}$</span> 的单调性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 的可求和性；“不动点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)=x_1-x_0$</span>”被精确化为直线可实现耦合的测度论刻画。第 14 节的成本测量代码可直接调用本节命题 17.16.4 与 17.16.6 的恒等式作为断言，第 4、5 节的收敛性与不动点证明则以本节命题 17.16.11 与 17.16.8 为引理。</p>", "cjk": 56466, "missing": []};
